  ('zcrm_1579374000089312063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022038146', 'Paul Suggett', NULL, 'Member''s 4/22 Payment declined 1st email &amp; VM left - 3/22 2nd notice sent - 3/24 3/29 3rd notice sent  Final notice sent-4/4/22  4/6/22-Due to member never being in contact with me I will cancel for Non Payment', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-22 13:08:59', '2022-04-06 12:33:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089353008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584008', 'Ahmis Loving', NULL, '3-22-2022:  I got a call from this phone #.  The woman was very upset from the second I answered.  She was told to use:  "Option 1 & why are you answering, you aren''t option 1".  "Where are you?"  I tried to find out what company she was trying to contact, because I didn''t think we have options in our phone system.  Finally she did answer my question & she was trying to reach MPB.  Finally, I found out she wants the "Director or MPowering Benefits", so I transferred her to Patti''s VM because she was not available.  Afterwards, I talked with Patti & she only got a 1 second, blank message.  I have no idea what this gal was trying to achieve.  She was very angry and difficult to work with.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-22 12:45:10', '2022-03-22 12:45:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089312058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, 'Member''s 4/22 payment declined 1st email &amp; VM left - 3/22 3/24-2nd notice sent 3/29-3rd notice sent', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-22 12:34:49', '2022-03-29 08:25:54'),
