  ('zcrm_1579374000089353003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083466001', 'Melissa Knight', NULL, '3-22-2022:  Melissa is at the bank setting-up her HSA.  They wanted to know her deductible.  Orig I thought we''d be looking at the IUA (afterwards I tt Jennifer Thorin-Savard and she brought-up it might be based off a ded on the MEC plan.  But, neither of us knew what that deductible would be either.)  I transferred Melissa directly to Patti Baron because I thought she would be able to answer this question.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-22 11:18:49', '2022-03-22 11:18:49'),
