  ('zcrm_1579374000089276021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073297065', 'Lance Logsdon', NULL, 'After hearing from member that he was charged in error.  I checked if payment cleared.  I then refunded.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-22 07:53:03', '2022-03-22 07:53:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089276016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091836', 'Amber Donnell', NULL, 'Member called in as she had inadvertently deleted her 1095C I will resend to her', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-22 07:48:07', '2022-03-22 07:48:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089218015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074214097', 'Cheryl Hendrickson', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 1493 Question : I need to change the ACH bank information on my MPowering Benefits Group Plan. We have changed banks. How do I do that?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-03-22 07:39:08', '2022-03-22 07:39:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089277008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081634027', 'Julia Bolz', NULL, 'Julie is VERY confused on how her plan works. She called 30 minutes PRIOR to her naturopath appointment to see what was covered by her Planstin/Zion cards. I explained that naturopathic care is something that she needs to get approval for from Zion. Julie asked if this is something that can be approved in 30 minutes, and I advised her that I was not sure of how long the approval process takes. I also advised Julie to always call the concierge team for guidance for situations such as this BEFORE scheduling her appointment. I transferred Julie to Zion to see if she could get pre-approval for her appointment today. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-22 07:29:24', '2022-03-22 07:29:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089276011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037008015', 'Kellie Whitney', NULL, 'Apparently member has been in contact w/Sedera about cancelling and is now wonderin why we are charging her for 4/22.  I will send member Cancellation request.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-22 07:24:54', '2022-03-22 07:24:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089277003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082319002', 'Steven Smith', NULL, 'See ticket ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-22 07:05:44', '2022-03-22 07:05:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089276003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056653025', 'Sara Bollmann', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form I will update in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-22 07:05:10', '2022-03-22 07:05:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089216023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060856022', 'Keri Schroeder', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1491 Question : Hello - I was a member in 2021 and I''m wondering if you issue any kind of tax document for coverage? Thank you!', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-03-21 21:45:08', '2022-03-21 21:45:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089261041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067828010', 'Luke Seamans', NULL, '3-21-2022:  Luke sub RX pricing req on 3 drugs, but it''s missing the name of one of the drugs and a few details.  E-mailed him for more info so I can complete.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-21 18:06:25', '2022-03-21 18:06:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089261033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085687002', 'Danielle Howley', NULL, '3-21-2022:  Marty sub req for RX info on: Eliquis, 5mg tabs, #60 (2x/day).  Eliquis is super expensive, so I called # on RX req: 843-437-2614 to see if:  1) Needs right away or can wait for WorldWide Shipment?  2) Tried & true?  WWshipment = larger qty.  Prev Reid has said must go larger amt on this one #112 was the number he gave me at that time.  But that was 1/4 the price of local back in 9/2021. 

    Went ahead and asked Reid what he could do, so if Marty can wait I''ll have the information.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-21 16:54:10', '2022-03-21 17:59:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089261028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885009', 'Julie Hauser', NULL, '3-21-2022:  Julie needed another RX coupon:  WellRX.com gave us:  Citalopram 10mg #30 for $5.40 (it req''d knowing which KS she''d be going to = S Hover in Longmont, CO).  Walmart was just $4, but KS was preferable to the member.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-21 16:37:24', '2022-03-21 16:37:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089261023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636609', 'Kurt Kincel', NULL, '3-21-2022:  Per Wendy''s e-mail req, I sent Kurt the link to sched a ''Welcome Call'' &amp; cc''d her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-21 16:24:27', '2022-03-21 16:24:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089231030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636609', 'Kurt Kincel', NULL, '3-21-22 He called in reference to an old email I sent about reviewing options. He''s on PSDHC which is $278/$1500 now or $296/$1000 if changed IUA. If moves to SECURE it''s $300/$1000. BUT, if/when we get the reference based pricing 150% Medicare for out of network areas, it would benefit him to move to SECURE bc lives in Edwards, CO.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-21 15:26:46', '2022-03-21 15:26:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089231025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763104', 'Bryan Lonergan', NULL, '3-21-22 Bryan is calling back now to find out how to get reimbursed for stem cell procedure. In spite of Jennifer and I telling him to get it pre-approved, he didn''t believe it would be shared, so he didn''t go through that process. But, now he wants to get reimbursed. He''s thrilled it''s a possibility. They are asking for the CPT code which he will get from the doctor. It was very successful and he''s possibly wanting it for his left knee next bc it worked so well. He''s super happy and will follow through on his end.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-21 15:17:50', '2022-03-21 15:17:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089231020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331068', 'Brian Guarneros', NULL, '3-21-22 Brian called to understand if his membership qualifies for HSA. Yes, and I sent him the instructions. He''s also still trying to understand the difference between his membership and Joy''s with Nextera. Joy has a heart murmur that they are moderating with echo cardiogram every 2 years. He doesn''t think she uses Nextera much or at all. But, I was of the understanding she really wanted the security of this with her pre-x. He wants the HSA benefits and to have their membership be the same to better understand it all. He''s just getting his head wrapped around it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-21 15:03:07', '2022-03-21 15:03:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089230028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085687002', 'Danielle Howley', NULL, 'Welcome call completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-21 15:00:51', '2022-03-21 15:00:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089261018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038445150', 'Kenneth Van Horn', NULL, '3-21-2022:  tt Amy &amp; went thru the process w/her for her helping Kenneth get a Sedera ''need'' started, that a 2nd.MD appt will be important, what to upload now since they only have a receipt, etc.  She knows the ''Need Coordinator'' can walk them thru this process!  She''ll call if they need more help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-21 14:35:33', '2022-03-21 14:35:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089236098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048228219', 'Phil Saalborn', NULL, 'Member''s 4/22 Payment was declined. 1st email &amp; VM sent 3/21 Member submitted Pmt Update - 3/22 I will re-run CC submitted was invalid  3/28- member updated CC I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-21 14:30:03', '2022-03-28 10:52:17'),
