  ('zcrm_1579374000089236079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082589020', 'Ginean Royal', NULL, 'Member''s 4/22 Payment declined.  1st email &amp; vm left - 3/21 3/24-2nd notice sent 3rd notice sent-3/29 Final notice sent - 4/4/22', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-21 13:46:12', '2022-04-04 10:36:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089262008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746002', 'Ross Scatchard', NULL, '3-21-22 Ross called and I realized that he is given 1 annual wellness visit and 1 additional free visit per year with the CONNECTED Worksite membership. It took me a moment to remember. This goes through Zion and allows for PHCS network and out of network benefits. His visit only cost $198 which is within the $250 range. He still gets one more visit this year. He''s young and health with no issues.  Ross was a LHS Conversion client.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-21 13:37:52', '2022-03-21 13:43:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089230023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081697010', 'Yolanda Morales', NULL, 'Welcome call completed! Yolanda is wonderful and willing to learn! She was excited to speak with me and ask her questions. I advised Yolanda to reach out to the concierge team (or me personally by email) whenever she has any questions. She was just diagnosed with Leukemia in Jan. 2022.~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-21 13:24:23', '2022-03-21 13:24:23'),
