  ('zcrm_1579374000089261008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003785031', 'Susan Wojciechowski', NULL, '3-21-2022:  Mark called, Susan has been in the hospital w/diverticulitis (it sounded like for quite some time).  He wondered how they handle things.  It sounds like they opened a ''Need'' w/Sedera (although he called it a portal), so I made sure he has Sedera''s ph# &amp; trans him there directly, explaining their ''Need'' Coordinator will be able to work with them &amp; help them know how to proceed.  He was appreciative.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-21 12:23:00', '2022-03-21 12:23:00'),
