  ('zcrm_1579374000089261003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746002', 'Ross Scatchard', NULL, '3-21-2022:  Ross called.  He thought he had 1 annual prev visit.  This is the ''Connected'' option so I let him know about screening colonoscopy (once every 10 yrs), but no annual visit [No MEC] on this plan.  He decided he''s like to tt his advisor: Wendy Scipione, so I made sure he has her # in case he needs to call her again, then transferred him dir.  It looks like she may be on the ph though, so I told him to LM &amp; Wendy''s good at getting back to people.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-21 11:42:10', '2022-03-21 11:42:10'),
