  ('zcrm_1579374000089236018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065477453', 'Yuphin Buaphan', NULL, 'Member''s 4/22 payment declined.  Per notes he called into to cancel on 3/16, 2 emails were sent out via A123.  No response from either member or advisor.   I called and left VM with advisor re: status.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-21 10:30:25', '2022-03-21 10:30:25'),
