  ('zcrm_1579374000089230018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937273', 'Amy Ruggeri', NULL, 'Amy''s husband called regarding the MAP program for her. I sent the information over via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-21 10:06:56', '2022-03-21 10:06:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089236013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062877001', 'Kyle Butler', NULL, 'Member''s 4/22 payment declined. 1st email &amp; VM left - 3/21 3/21-Member submitted payment update I will re-run', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-21 09:58:31', '2022-03-21 14:01:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089236008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670004', 'Holly Hill', NULL, '3-21-22 Greg called in to find out the process to see a doctor for an injured knee. I explained the process and to call Concierge if needs MRI, surgery or anything like that for highest quality care at best price. He gets it and will do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-21 09:43:20', '2022-03-21 09:43:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089230013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740011', 'Kathleen VanGoethem', NULL, 'Kathleen called in frustrated because she received a bill for her Dexascan that she had cleared with Planstin. She received an explanation from the billing department that it was returned as "patient not found". I reached out to Planstin and warm transferred Kathleen so that she could discuss this issue with them. I also did a PHCS network search for her colonoscopy and Dr. Michaletz-Onody was in the PHCS network. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-21 09:39:30', '2022-03-21 09:39:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089236003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692101', 'Kari Myroniuk', NULL, 'Member''s 4/22 payment declined.  1st notice &amp; VM - 3/21 3/22-member submitted pmt update I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-21 09:27:41', '2022-03-22 07:09:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089230008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078122077', 'Angela Smith', NULL, 'Angel Smith called in because her husband, Christopher, was jumping on the trampoline this weekend with their children and he severely hurt his knee. They did not present themselves as self-pay patients in the ER and the ER doctor suggested that Christopher follow up with an orthopedic surgeon. I advised Angela to open a need to get the ball rolling ASAP and I warm transferred her to Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-21 09:07:56', '2022-03-21 09:07:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089230003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060460087', 'Adrea Rice', NULL, 'Adrea Rice called with questions pertaining to the cards she had on hand and prescriptions. I explained how prescription quotes work, unfortunately Adrea had already given the CirrusMD doctor the CVS/Target pharmacy info to have her script filled there. I did suggest to Adrea that she see if CVS will transfer the prescription to Publix since there is a $70+ dollar price difference. I also advised Adrea to keep her MPB.Health membership card and her Zion Health card. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-21 09:03:31', '2022-03-21 09:03:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089196003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086621002', 'Christy Cox', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-21 07:57:15', '2022-03-21 07:57:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089168013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032070', 'Danielle Hatch', NULL, 'Danielle Hatch called to find out how to submit her bills to Zion for a recent urgent care trip for her son. She did present as a self-pay patient and has bills from imaging to submit. I sent Danielle the instructions on how to submit her bills to Zion and went over her IUA amount. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-21 07:44:39', '2022-03-21 07:44:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089168008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080021001', 'Amy Fowler', NULL, 'Script quote completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-21 07:21:40', '2022-03-21 07:21:40'),
