  ('zcrm_1579374000089140013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899089', 'Mateusz (Mat) Piasta', NULL, '3-18-2022:  Mat called re: his knee injury.  He did see the doc & had his MRI (I think it was).  So, I sent him the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion & he''ll upload his pymt and the detailed inv & knows to monitor his e-mail for the form(s) he''ll need to sign, etc.  They want him to do some phys therapy & see a specialist to see if this will req surgery.  He''ll cont as a ''cash-pay'' patient to the 1k IUA & ask them to bill anything past that so it can be shared once approved.  This is not pre-x, he injured it last week per Mat.  If they decide surg is nec, he will give us time to work w/Care Conn if >5k.  He liked that idea & fully bought-into the win, win situation.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-18 11:55:39', '2022-03-18 11:55:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089139008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001060051', 'Matthew Ross', NULL, 'Matt called in to verify the self-pay process for his knee appointment today. I also sent Matt instructions on how to submit his bills to Zion and to make sure to call the concierge team prior to any imaging his provider may request so that we can find him the fair price in his area. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-18 11:52:43', '2022-03-18 11:52:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089140008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038445150', 'Kenneth Van Horn', NULL, '3-18-2022:  Kenneth did go see the doctor and got xrays.  He apparently did not start a ''need'' yet - not sure why.  Resent him the temp for sub a ''need'' to Sedera.  He''ll ck his e-mail/spam when he gets home.  He''s been trying to do price negotiations on his own instead?  Again, let him know this whole process will be easier once he starts the need & is assigned a ''Need Coordinator'' who can do a lot of the work for/with him.  Also let him know he definitely needs to have his 2nd.MD appt so they will share more (otherwise, they''d only share 50%).  We left it, he will look for the e-mail & get back to me if he hasn''t rec''d it.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-18 11:15:30', '2022-03-18 11:15:30'),
