  ('zcrm_1579374000089140003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741557', 'Ethan Pajak', NULL, '3-18-2022:  Ethan called.  He left a mess for Jane on the 16th &amp; hasn''t heard back.  They can get healthcare thru an employer now, so he''s wanting to make sure they get this cancelled and don''t have the automatic draw come out this mo.  Since Jane hasn''t gotten back to him, I trans him directly to Patti &amp; sent her a chat in case she''s on the phone so she knows the back story here.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-18 10:09:55', '2022-03-18 10:09:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089112038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741557', 'Ethan Pajak', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that he called in to cancel and was transferred to Jane who never contacted him back.  He has other coverage and is sorry to go.  I will send him cancellation form and cancel him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-18 10:07:55', '2022-03-18 10:07:55'),
