  ('zcrm_1579374000089066008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667149', 'Tonya Cauduro', NULL, '3-17-2022:  Tonya called.  She was super frustrated w/her "insurance" ''cuz it doesn''t pay for anything.  I worked w/her to understand this is diff than ins.  She says the only reason she bought this was to help w/her prev, because that all she ever uses.  We went over her prog incl some prev:  screening colonoscopy & mamm w/in their guidelines can be provided thru Zion.  She says she used her ''Zion'' card last year and they said her mamm in 7/21 was not covered.  I''m calling to see what I can find out.
     - She asked if we had a plan that would give her prev - I let her know her advisor Wendy Scipione could go over that w/her, but she did not want me to transfer her.  She may look into that later.  She seemed better & less angry when we got off the ph.        - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-17 21:23:36', '2022-03-17 21:23:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089066003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081704002', 'Carmen Davis', NULL, '3-17-2022:   Carmen is getting ready to have a mammogram and wondered about in Network providers, does she need a referral, etc.  We went over everything re: Planstin (per Melissa @ Planstin they do not req a referral although some facilities will req it to make the appt.  So it''s up to them.  Planstin will pay either way.).
     - I e-mailed her more bullet points on Planstin along w/the 4 in Network Mammogram providers in her area.     She was super sweet & couldn''t thank me enough for all the great cust srvc I''ve provided. in this call & prev.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-17 17:47:20', '2022-03-17 17:47:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088999047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088716033', 'Bradley Watts', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1480 Question : I need to continue the training. How do I get there?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-03-17 17:17:27', '2022-03-17 17:17:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089055018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089144002', 'Sarita Yeldandi', NULL, '3-17-22 Sarita asked more good questions to get comfortable with it. We discussed advocating for wellness only and coded correctly when at doctors for mammos and colonoscopies and all wellness. She will start looking for new PCP drs. bc they''ve been with Kaiser. She wants the SECURE and HMA for dental, IUA and possibly vision if they don''t choose VSP in a year. They just got their eyes checked  recently.  Husband also just did his colonoscopy recently as well. She does mammo every year bc of family history even though in 40''s. We will have her enroll tomorrow for April 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-17 16:07:31', '2022-03-17 16:07:31'),
