  ('zcrm_1579374000089052008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081697010', 'Yolanda Morales', NULL, 'Yolanda called about her "insurance" Welcome Call. She seems very confused since she did not have a Welcome Call and insists that she was told this was just like traditional insurance. I explained what medical cost sharing is and how it differs from traditional insurance. She seemed to somewhat understand the concept. She asked if she could do her Welcome Call with me now but I did have another call scheduled for 4:30. I sent Yolanda instructions on how to submit a need and a new Welcome Call scheduler. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-17 14:27:23', '2022-03-17 14:27:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089012063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076535942', 'Luanne Werstler', NULL, 'Per Zach member get Employer coverage so will be cancelling.  I received Cancellation I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-17 13:55:34', '2022-03-17 13:55:34'),
