  ('zcrm_1579374000089012053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763189', 'Karen Levine', NULL, 'I have not received the cancellation for this member as she will be turning 65 eff 4/1/22.  I will cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-17 12:53:07', '2022-03-17 12:53:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089055008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084237', 'Mark DeRespinis', NULL, '3-17-22 Spoke with Mark to review his membership benefits. He understands they are responsible to pay for wellness visits on own and no reimbursement. They haven''t used the membership once yet and want to. I reminded him of CirrusMD and he will work on logging in or calling Concierge with troubles. I told him about WholeHealth Living Choices which he''s excited about. I told him about Life Care which he says he''ll use! I gave him Concierge # and he will look for his card as well. He''s psyched about it all and re-learning. He also has a skin and possible gut issue he may want to explore. He asked about naturopathic doctor and I let him know alternative care must be pre-approved which includes naturopathic. He gets it. He''ll also share with his wife that they can go to any MD for daughter. He asked about HSA and I let him know he''d have to change memberships to add HSA and cost will be $525/$1000 SECURE. He''s not eager to make the move and wants to take care of his health issues first before making a switch which is wise so no pre-x gets in the way.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-17 12:48:02', '2022-03-17 12:48:02'),
