  ('zcrm_1579374000089055003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257594', 'Emily Taylor', NULL, '3-17-22 I sent email and left vm for Emily with instructions to add her baby. If within 30 days it will be effective immediately, if over 30 days it will be effective April 1st.  New price is $783/$500 IUA PSDHC. Can''t move them bc of pre-x.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-17 12:14:22', '2022-03-17 12:14:22'),
