  ('zcrm_1579374000088911076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411196', 'Jeremy Stollings', NULL, 'Jennifer called regarding her daughter''s labs she recently had done and LabCorp states that they cannot get in contact with the insurance company. I explained to Jennifer that there are only 2 panels included in the bloodwork. I explained what those panels were and that for the rest her daughter would have presented herself as self-paying. Jennifer then explained that the LabCorp receptionist told her that it is illegal to have "insurance" and not run the bills through it. I explained to Jennifer that she does not have insurance, that she is a part of a medical cost sharing community, and that she should be able to call and negotiate the pricing on the non-preventative lab work on her bill and to ask LabCorp to send the bill for the preventative labs to Planstin. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-17 09:29:01', '2022-03-17 09:29:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088975033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489118', 'Darrin Levy', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-17 09:10:47', '2022-03-17 09:10:47'),
