  ('zcrm_1579374000088946028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086707002', 'Linda Pringle', NULL, '3-16-2022:   Linda called & was angry from ''hello''.   She wanted me to search the PHCS Network for her nurs prac.  Together we pulled-up the search tool, but nothing comes up under Khoury.   This made her even less patient and more angry - she "shouldn''t have bought this product".  She was very difficult. 
     She says she never sees docs & wants to see her Nurs Prac w/in the Banner Health system in AZ.  I looked up ''Banner'' & that listing has tons of facilities showing in network.  I let her know that their billing office might be able to provide the answer to whether her Nurs Prac is in network & would be covered by her Planstin.  I also told her PHCS might be able to help, but she calls them the hang-up company. 
 When I asked her why, she said:  "they say all operators are busy & it disconnects.  They just hang-up on you."  
     I really tried to work w/her & tell her what I can and cannot help with.  She was super rude and kept stressing how it should be, how her insurance has always done things, and how I needed to know if her Nurs Prac was covered.  
     After we got off the phone I was able to find a Nurs Prac List for her area w/1231 providers listed near her - some that show they are at a ''Banner'' facility, but I still do not see her Nurs Prac, Khoury on that list.    Hopefully, this will help her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-16 17:27:56', '2022-03-16 17:27:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088946023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, '3-16-2022:   Several items:
     - Heather''s son had to go to Urgent Care, then the ER (Monday I think she said).  She wanted to know what to do next.  She has the link for submitting a ''need'' w/Zion, so she''ll do that & upload the detailed invoices, receipts, etc.   She''ll monitor her e-mail to sign the req''d forms and may call in a day or two to make sure they''ve rec''d everything.
     - She wanted to know how pre-x worked on her plan w/the bridge, although she says the Urg Care issue is new, this question is around something else.  I told her, her advisor Jane Kassel, would be the best person for those specifics, but I thought the 1st & 2nd years there''s 25k, 3rd year is 50k, and 4th year & beyond were 125k, but again, Jane would know the details as this was prior to my being w/the company.  I sent Jennifer Thorin-Savard a Teams chat to see if she can help me learn the details, esp if the above is incorrect!
     - Heather wants to find a new doc.  I sent her in network search results for:  Fam Prac, Int Med, Nurs Prac, & ObGyn because she wasn''t sure what type of doc she was looking for.
     - I sent her the prev care/netwk search temp as well so she can search on her own & has access to the gvmt MEC link.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-16 17:18:41', '2022-03-16 17:18:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088958011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890002', 'Bonita Keith', NULL, '03.16.22:  Called Bonita - left message to call me back. Also texted to let her know Patti sent the cancellation form.  Thanked them for joining MPB.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-03-16 15:10:35', '2022-03-16 15:22:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088946018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364233', 'Chelsea Bibb', NULL, '3-16-2022:  Chelsea called.  Her employer is giving her healthcare benefits starting 4/1/2022 so she wants to cancel.  I transferred her directly to her advisor:  Jane Kassel''s #: 602-279-5263 &amp; let her know to leave Jane a message that this is time sensitive due to the coming draw date.  I also sent Patti a Teams chat so she''s aware that Chelsea''s cancellation request &amp; she has already reached out to Jane.  NO cancellation form link was provided to the member yet.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-16 14:59:01', '2022-03-16 14:59:01'),
