  ('zcrm_1579374000088952011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079737009', 'Kari Riley', NULL, '3-16-22 Kari got a new job with benefits and needs to cancel for April 1st. I''m sending her the instructions to do so now. She was super nice and no problems.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-16 12:32:09', '2022-03-16 12:32:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088952003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104457002', 'Normandie Rainwater', NULL, '3-15-22 Normandie 51, husband 53 and daughter 17 are on LHS now for $675 a month with price increasing to $729-$1239 depending on what they want. They are ready to be done with LHS but they are owed about $20K and have decided to stay put until paid back. Husband is healthy, daughter had a ski accident last year and had ACL and MCL surgery and is 90+% healed. Normandie has a chronic lung disease and sees pulmonologist 2-3x per year. She may need more care in the distant future with super rare chance of lung transplant. I recommended she stays with LHS and possibly just move her husband. After conversation now they will stay with LHS for few more months and possibly move everyone later. I''m still concerned about her lung disease. She understands the pre-x clause and no sharing in first year with increased each year and cap of $125K. I will reiterate this when she calls me again in a few months. Husband is self-employed. Discussed SECURE and just sent her the email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-16 12:21:23', '2022-03-16 12:21:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088911008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692197', 'Scott Ritterbuck', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-16 12:20:11', '2022-03-16 12:20:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088946003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079422002', 'Aaron Handler', NULL, '3-16-2022:  Shari called for 2 things:
     - She never heard from Zion re: their advocating for her w/her GI, but has heard nothing from Desiree that was working on this.  I tt Jennifer Thorin-Savard &  Desiree has had no luck in getting past the gate keeper!  However, she has not notified Shari.  So, Jennifer sent Desiree a request to reach out to Shari & Desiree responded she will call her.
     - They are traveling & in Steamboat Springs, CO.  Her minor daughter Alexandra woke-up with a rash/blisters on her cheek.  She wanted to call using the telehealth, but hadn''t set that up yet.  I got her in, but we couldn''t get the doctor side to see Alexandra even though it was acknowledging her as she signed in.  I sent a support ticket to CirrusMD & asked them to call her asap.
        Per Shari''s request I also tried sending invites to the other family members so they can get registered.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-16 12:03:00', '2022-03-16 12:03:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088921013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084087009', 'Christopher Guthrie', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Added secondary email as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-16 11:31:02', '2022-03-16 11:31:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088939003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091021', 'Yadira Butkovich', NULL, 'Bill and Yadira called today to let me know their experience with presenting Yadira as a cash-pay patient in the ER. They allowed Yadira to be seen by the ER doc and was admitted into Renown Hospital in Reno, NV last week due to a horrible migraine which they thought may be caused by a pre-existing condition, but it ended being a new condition. Bill and Yadira were told, upon Yadira receiving treatment and staying 1 night in the hospital, that Yadira was ready to be discharged. The hospital had originally scheduled several different appointments with specialists while she was in the hospital, but once anyone found out that Yadira was a cash paying patient, they cancelled all of the specialist appointments and discharged Yadira that day. Bill had already paid the hospital $1,000 (to meet Yadira''s IUA) and Yadira was still sent home without being completely pain free from her migraine. Yadira is still struggling with her migraine and is going to see her PCP today for a follow up. Bill''s concern is that her PCP won''t even see her if they present her as a self-pay patient. I explained to Bill that if they give him a difficult time at the PCP''s office to give us a call and we can explain that Yadira is part of a medical cost sharing community. Bill had to jump off the phone to take another call but was very appreciative for the service he receives from the MPB.Health concierge team. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-16 11:00:07', '2022-03-16 11:00:07'),
