  ('zcrm_1579374000088807023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088734001', 'Matthew Larson', NULL, '3-15-2022:  Matt called asking to sched his ''Welcome Call''.  I helped him find the link in his ''Welcome E-mail'' and helped him understand why he needs to make it after the eff date of his plan.  That was super hard for him to comprehend, but I think we got there.
     - He also needed help getting into his MPB.Health member portal because the user name &amp; pw were not in his initial e-mail.  I helped him get signed-in so he can upload his proof of self-emp.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-15 23:29:54', '2022-03-15 23:29:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088807018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086946002', 'William Alemaghides', NULL, '3-15-2022:  Sub req for RX pricing.  Escitalopram 5mg tabs, #30 was on GoodRx at Costco for $6.10 &amp; WellRX for $8.62 at Stop &amp; Shop.  / Methylphen 10mg tabs, #30  on GoodRx for $6.25 at both Costco and Stop &amp; Shop.  / Methylphen ER 30mg caps, #30 on RXSaver at Stop &amp; Shop for $39.60 [made assumption on this because the ER is not listed on his req, but that''s where I see the form = caps &amp; the proper strength].     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-15 23:24:36', '2022-03-15 23:24:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088769131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '3-15-22 Kristen received her 1095-C form but it sounds like it''s only showing coverage for Jan and Feb which is not correct. She had it Feb 2021 onward. She says there''s a 1A for Jan and Feb. I don''t know what this means. I asked Patti to look into it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-15 16:48:07', '2022-03-16 12:29:56'),
