  ('zcrm_1579374000088769076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918205', 'Richard Wilkinson', NULL, '3-15-22 Richard called bc he''s being offered a health ins plan through his company now. It''s a big company who just bought or merged with a smaller one. So, their benefits are really good. He will only have to pay$48 2x per month for $1000 ded and $3500 mop with $30 co-pay PCP, $60 specialists. He''s 63 now and paying $215/$1000 CARE+.   I can''t beat that price. I also suggested he asks his company how much they are paying towards his ins and see if they''ll give him that amount to pay for his own or just pay his whole cost since they are likely pay 3x more than that for his ins if he chooses it. It''s doubtful but worth a shot.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-15 11:38:21', '2022-03-15 11:38:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088807008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086942001', 'James Evans, Jr.', NULL, '3-15-2022:   Monica called.  She has an appt w/her PCP &amp; wondered if it would be covered.  After discussing it, we decided it''s in a gray area.  We went over everything Planstin.  Her Dr is in network, so she''ll talk w/them when she gets there.  She''s having her BP monitored, so it may not fall in the preventative category.  She seems to have a pretty good grasp on the situation.  Both she &amp; Jimmy really seem willing to learn our system.  It''s great!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-15 11:14:51', '2022-03-15 11:14:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088807003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574061', 'Shawna Sands', NULL, '3-15-2022:  Shawna needs to have her mammogram.  We discussed making sure it''s been the 2 years req''d for them to pay for it, to present her APEX/RCI info (she doesn''t have a card.  Since she didn''t have a card, we decided to transfer her to them so she can request one.  I gave her their # in case she has to call them again too.)  Then we went over prev details:  in network, MD must bill, etc.  She seems appreciative of the help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-15 11:11:36', '2022-03-15 11:11:36'),
