  ('zcrm_1579374000088763003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082589012', 'Bryan Moore', NULL, 'Prescription quote completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-15 07:12:26', '2022-03-15 07:12:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088718058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723009', 'Daniela Papi', NULL, '3-14-22 Daniela and Andy and 2 kids joined. Andy is British with a fun accent. He thinks our healthcare system is crazy. He''s happy to get out of the mess of insurance. They are currently paying $800+ vs SECURE at $715/$1000 and HSA compliant, yes to wellness, psyched about virtual healthcare and open to cash pay for everything except wellness. Daniela was able to describe the membership well to Andy with me listening. I answered a few more questions and they enrolled for an April 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-14 18:14:18', '2022-03-14 18:14:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088722054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081704002', 'Carmen Davis', NULL, '3-14-2022:  Carmen called because she''s having her annual well-woman visit.  We went over everything Planstin:  everything must be in network (&amp; how to ck that - labs, etc. too); must present Planstin card &amp; have MD bill; how to see what''s cov on gvmt site; etc...  Also went over if colonoscopy, etc., turns diagnostic, qualified ''needs'' have her 1k IUA &amp; call us so we can help you start a need w/in a few days. She seems to have a good grasp of it, but will call if has further questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-14 17:44:54', '2022-03-14 17:45:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088722046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939370', 'Dave Sutton', NULL, '3-14-2022:  Dave was trying to figure out how to use his CirrusMD.  He knows he has an acct from using it a few months ago, but couldn''t remember how to get in.  I got him to CirrusMD &amp; he''s going to use the "forgot PW" link.  He knows I''m here for about another hour, so he''ll call if he can''t get in &amp; I can submit a support e-mail for him.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-14 17:20:55', '2022-03-14 17:23:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088722041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088662331', 'Adam Krachman', NULL, '3-14-2022:  Adam just submitted a quote request (QR) and called into the concierge line to see if his having a heart attack & being on lifelong medications would be problematic.  I first tried to figure out if this was assigned to an advisor, but he says he just sent the QR, so we went over pre-x.  This really isn''t a good fit and could leave him wide open for issues.  I sent Julia Avalon notice that he doesn''t qualify, trying to keep any other advisor from wasting their time on quoting this one.  Hopefully I caught her, if not at least the record is here.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-14 17:18:27', '2022-03-14 17:18:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088722036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055112303', 'Scott Yarian', NULL, '3-14-2022:  Scott called looking for his proof-of-ins for his taxes.  (I don''t think it''s req''d because I live in CO too, but I can tell he will be more comfortable if he has it).  It''s later in the day, so I trans him directly into Patti''s VM since she''s processing the tax forms.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-14 16:29:48', '2022-03-14 16:29:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088722031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041953095', 'Susan Farrar', NULL, '3-14-2022:  Susan called looking for some missing 2021 pymt receipts.  I was able to find the pymt receipts in Admin123 back to Aug 2021.  But, she also needs June 2021 &amp; I could not find that in the new or old Admin123 records.  Trans her to Patti''s VM (&amp; let her know it could be someone in our accts dept she needs), but Patti sb able to get her to the correct person.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-14 16:28:40', '2022-03-14 16:28:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088675077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086939009', 'Joseph Schrowang', NULL, 'Script quote complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-14 14:54:17', '2022-03-14 14:54:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088675072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086624002', 'Bluma Kazen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-14 14:44:56', '2022-03-14 14:44:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088725023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723009', 'Daniela Papi', NULL, '3-11-22 Daniela came to me through Rafe Furst from BSU. I haven''t met him yet. But, he came and heard my presentation and gave Daniela my contact information. He''s not a member himself. Daniela is 43 and oldest of family of 4, Andy is husband and little younger at 39. Kids are 5 1/2 and 2 1/2. No tobacco, healthy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-14 14:42:44', '2022-03-14 14:42:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088675067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, 'Welcome call complete~ JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-14 13:53:47', '2022-03-14 13:53:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088718053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723002', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-14 13:34:28', '2022-03-14 13:34:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088718048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088720002', 'Lisa Parkins', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-14 13:32:50', '2022-03-14 13:32:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088718043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088688002', 'Perry Thomas', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-14 13:30:28', '2022-03-14 13:30:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088718038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088593002', 'Marija Nadel', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-14 13:23:10', '2022-03-14 13:23:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088718033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088647001', 'Lee Geiger', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-14 13:22:15', '2022-03-14 13:22:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088725018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031420287', 'Payson McElveen', NULL, '3-14-22 Payson''s fiance Nicole Baker called and Payson was on the line as well to understand how his membership works. Sedera does not have limitations on pro sports, only on motorized vehicles when covered by insurance. Page 35 discusses the only limitations that are not relevant to Payson. So, I instructed them to create a Need which Cari sent the instructions. He''s had one virtual consult already and going in for surgery on Wed. I recommended they speak or email with their Needs Coordinator about next steps right away for assistance in the process. Nicole will create the Need right away. They came to me via Gretchen. The event he was in was unsanctioned and mostly amateurs as well. No formal other insurance involved to their knowledge through the event.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-14 13:18:09', '2022-03-14 13:18:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088722026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, '3-14-2022:  Brian called, his son Charles is needing to tt a doc on CirrusMD, but they couldn''t get an acct setup.  I was able to send them an invite &amp; explain how to get registered.  He''ll call back if they have further issues.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-14 13:13:33', '2022-03-14 13:13:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088718028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046884055', 'Tracy Roye', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update Address I will update in A123 &amp; notify Zion', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-14 13:01:39', '2022-03-14 13:01:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088722021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031420287', 'Payson McElveen', NULL, '3-14-2022:  Payson called.  He broke his collar bone & wrist in a Mtn Bike Competition.  Someone told him he only has care for imaging, etc, no surgical (it turns out it was the hospital calling his PHCS plan).  So I let him know that surgical items would go thru his healthsharing comp Sedera w/a $500 IUA for ''qualified needs''.  Because of the professional competition status of this issue, I suggested he tt his advisor Wendy Scipione first (she''s very in tune w/athletes).  Gave them Sedera''s ph # & sent the temp for submitting a ''need''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-14 12:59:44', '2022-03-14 12:59:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088706013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058906061', 'Patrick Boyum', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 1454 Question : I will have a new credit card account that I would like to start charging my monthly fee. How will I do that when I receive the new card?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-03-14 12:45:42', '2022-03-14 12:45:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088718023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011261', 'Jodi Ayers', 'Redirect Term:', 'Tracking #13103448
Sent by Patti Baron on 3/14/2022.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-14 12:33:34', '2022-03-14 12:33:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088718018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011261', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, 'Member has submitted cancellation request for this plan and has enrolled in Secure.  I will cancel Redirect &amp; Sedera and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-14 12:31:50', '2022-03-14 12:31:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088718013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, 'I spoke with Planstin and straightened out the fact that this member had 2 memberships.  Apparently Planstin did not open my email cancelling former Bridge Plan.  They have cancelled original membership and bridged members time.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-14 12:28:23', '2022-03-14 12:28:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088722013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085759046', 'James Brown', NULL, '3-14-2022:  James called & needs to change his name on his account to the more formal ''James'', wants to confirm he only has one valid e-mail address (not 2):  jbrown196500@gmail.com,  & he wants to confirm we have the correct NC address.  I sent him the ''Change Form'' temp.  It doesn''t sound like there is a general comment box.
     - He is going to call us after April 1st to get his RX coup because he has plenty of medication to get him thru.  It sounds like Walmart & Publix are closest to where he''s curr located (they do have 2 homes though so that could chg).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-14 12:24:25', '2022-03-14 12:38:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088722008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086939009', 'Joseph Schrowang', NULL, '3-14-2022:   11:40am  Karen just finished her ''Welcome Call'' and needs help signing up for CirrusMD.  She''s getting the message that she already has an account.  When I try it, it tells me they have ''No Records Found''.  I sent a support e-mail to CirrusMD for her & all her family members.     - CA

5:40pm  Luis from CirrusMD e-mailed to keep me in the loop.  He LM for Karen, but hasn''t heard back yet.  The issue is that because Joseph is listed as primary, her e-mail address is linked to him.  Luis can help her fix the situation.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-14 11:55:47', '2022-03-14 17:58:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088725008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011261', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, '3-14-22 Combine with her current account. She''s healthy, no pre-x, just waiting on getting radiology bill paid for by Redirect bc she used pre-paid debit card which was for 1x use only and then she got the separate bill. So, she has a vm from Redirect to finalize that. No issues. Her price is going from $335 to $507/$1500 Provider Directed Healthcare in April due to turning 60. She is happy to change to SECURE for $1000/$325. I waived the $100 fee as well. She has an appt on April 4th for her wellness visit with Dr. Jason Sims at New West Physicians. She may only have a digital card by that time which she''s aware of and may need to ask to get it sent to her in time for her appt. Psyched about HSA compliance and will want the instructions to help her set it up.  She''s never been to a chiro so not concerned about losing that and really only does wellness bc super healthy. She just enrolled for April 1st, 2022 start date and cancelled PDHC. Also updated her email address bc it auto populated her work email which was the wrong email. All set! She will also mention the possible switch for Autumn which will lower her IUA to $1000 from $1500 and save her $20 a month on PSDHC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-14 11:46:40', '2022-03-14 11:46:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088725003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723002', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, '3-14-22 Combine with her current account. She''s healthy, no pre-x, just waiting on getting radiology bill paid for by Redirect bc she used pre-paid debit card which was for 1x use only and then she got the separate bill. So, she has a vm from Redirect to finalize that. No issues. Her price is going from $335 to $507/$1500 Provider Directed Healthcare in April due to turning 60. She is happy to change to SECURE for $1000/$325. I waived the $100 fee as well. She has an appt on April 4th for her wellness visit with Dr. Jason Sims at New West Physicians. She may only have a digital card by that time which she''s aware of and may need to ask to get it sent to her in time for her appt. Psyched about HSA compliance and will want the instructions to help her set it up.  She''s never been to a chiro so not concerned about losing that and really only does wellness bc super healthy. She just enrolled for April 1st, 2022 start date and cancelled PDHC. Also updated her email address bc it auto populated her work email which was the wrong email. All set! She will also mention the possible switch for Autumn which will lower her IUA to $1000 from $1500 and save her $20 a month on PSDHC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-14 11:46:04', '2022-03-14 11:46:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088718008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088078001', 'Nathaniel Grabau', NULL, 'Re ran with new bank info that was sent by member', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-14 11:39:04', '2022-03-14 11:39:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088675062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086956124', 'Brandon Pham', NULL, 'No response. Not able to leave message. Mailbox not set up. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-14 11:19:07', '2022-03-14 11:19:07'),
