  ('zcrm_1579374000088722003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086926029', 'Debbi Butterfield', NULL, '3-14-2022:  Debbi called about cancelling her plan.  She says she sent an e-mail via the ''Contact Us'' link so I called Patti Baron to see where we are in the process.  Then transferred her directly to Christine Corsini.   No link for the cancellation for has been sent yet.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-14 10:50:44', '2022-03-14 10:50:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088675052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086939009', 'Joseph Schrowang', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-14 10:33:29', '2022-03-14 10:33:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088675044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087509002', 'Mark Carman', NULL, 'Mark called to reschedule his welcome call with me, we scheduled for 4/20/22 @ 3 PM ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-14 10:27:32', '2022-03-14 10:27:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088675036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084956002', 'Paul Notartomaso Jr', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Changed email address on file. Put in request to Kelly F to resend out QR life code cards to member and wife. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-14 10:19:37', '2022-03-14 10:28:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088718003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088589002', 'Kerry Craig', NULL, 'Member re-enrolled after me cancelling her initial application.  She called in and I explained to her that we could not enroll her at this time due to the state of WA not allowing it.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-14 10:11:20', '2022-03-14 10:11:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088675031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086229001', 'Lesley Sullivan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-14 09:44:45', '2022-03-14 09:44:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088675026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035116005', 'Carol Smith', NULL, 'Carol called inquiring about her new QR code cards she received in the mail. I do not know much about the QR codes, so I sent her to Kelly F. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-14 09:36:33', '2022-03-14 09:36:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088675018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521614', 'Eleonora Steinberg', NULL, 'Eleonora called regarding her plan. She has no idea what she is doing and is very confused about her plan. She kept stating that she does not want this plan and that she needs traditional insurance because this is so confusing. She did not know that she had preventative services and has been paying out of pocket for all of her preventative services. She stated that Jane suggested that she added preventative services to her plan, so she did but never received any Planstin card or any instructions on how to proceed with her preventative services. Eleonora has been paying out of her own pocket for preventative care instead of presenting her Planstin card for payment. I explained what each component of her plan is and she doesn''t understand why she has MPB.Health, Zion Health, or Planstin even after I explained it to her. I advised Eleonora to speak with Jane regarding her plan and any changes that were made. Eleonora just wants something simple (she was really stuck on traditional insurance) so she does not have to go through any of this again. I did transfer Eleonora to Jane Kassel. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-14 09:29:32', '2022-03-14 09:33:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088675013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085042002', 'Alexa Fetta', NULL, 'Started the welcome call and got half way through but then got disconnected tried to reach her back multiple times with no response then had to go on next scheduled calls. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-14 09:24:09', '2022-03-14 09:24:09'),
