  ('zcrm_1579374000088512018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086453010', 'Robert Girard', NULL, 'Welcome call completed. Member was confused because he thought he had preventative services included with his plan. I reached out to Christine to contact Robert about his plan and to answer any questions about his sign up. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-11 12:58:46', '2022-03-11 12:58:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088504018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670268', 'Andrew Braudis', NULL, '3-11-2022:  Rachel called - they have been offered really good, cheap healthcare thru an employer.  Her concern was they have some open ''Need(s)'' and she wondered how they needed to handle that.  I admitted I''ve never had to deal with that before and need to find out.  However, to cancel (which is why she called), she needs to tt her advisor, Wendy Scipione, anyway.   I let her know Wendy''s been doing this for so long, she may be able to answer that question as well.  She seemed fine with that & I transferred her directly to Wendy.  (I''m now looking into the answer so I''ll know for next time.)     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-11 11:31:59', '2022-03-11 11:32:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088512013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061255207', 'Rachel Martin', NULL, 'Rachel called the day OF her mammogram and wondered how payment for out-of-network mammogram facilities go. I explained to Rachel that if she chose an out-of-network facility, it would be an out-of-pocket expense. Rachel was not very happy with this and stated that a mammogram should be covered no matter what the issue may be. I told Rachel that I would be happy to warm transfer her to Planstin to see if they had any advice for this circumstance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-11 10:38:15', '2022-03-11 10:38:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088465061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084946002', 'Tracie Reithmann', NULL, 'Member submitted pmt update form.  I will update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-11 10:08:02', '2022-03-11 10:08:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088512008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947150', 'Gretchen Reeves', NULL, 'Gretchen called with questions regarding opening a need and an EOB she received from Planstin with a $41 balance. I went over opening a need with Zion and sent the instructions via email. I also transferred Gretchen to Planstin so she can inquire about the $41 balance from her preventative mammogram. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-11 08:47:04', '2022-03-11 08:47:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088465056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088509002', 'Jason Frederick', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-11 08:07:27', '2022-03-11 08:07:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088465051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084946002', 'Tracie Reithmann', NULL, 'Member emailed in asking how to update pmt method.  I will email her link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-11 07:03:40', '2022-03-11 07:03:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088512003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087509002', 'Mark Carman', NULL, 'Asked member to reschedule his welcome call for after his 4/1/22 start date. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-11 06:54:22', '2022-03-11 06:54:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088501028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974189', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, '3-9-2022:  Jeni called frustrated w/the program - it''s just too difficult.  I think by the end of the call, she felt better.
     - She''s having an issue they are trying to diagnose (possibly mold?).  She''s already put $1200 into seeing a Nurse Practitioner (NP) and getting the first round of kits/tests.  She said "Jessica Muniz" happens to have our plan (the Nurse Prac?) & was trying to help her understand what is & is not covered.  The prev vs diag was confusing the issue (from what I could tell).  I did my 3 sheets of paper example & that helped. 
     - The NP suggested seeing PA, Erin Pirkle (if she''s in the PHCS network) thinking then some of the test would be pd for.  I explained the prev vs diag, which labs are cov on prev, ran a PHCS search & did not find this PA.  Let Jeni know the lab work and tests must be done by an in network lab, BUT the orders do not have to come from an in network doc.  We went over having all the test run & billed to Planstin & worst case = when they kickback as not cov''d, they should have the network discounted rate for her to pay.
     - She asked about a papsmear.  They ran one in trying to diagnose her (she''s been bleeding off & on). We discussed it depends on how it''s coded (prev vs diag).  Even if it''s diagnostic, it''s something to turn in for the ''Need'' and may help towards her 1k IUA.
     - Sent the temp for sub a ''Need'' to Zion.  She''s going to submit everything (det inv w/cod, pymts, etc) & monitor her e-mail closely so they can get this going.
     - Having to type this next day as we talked late in the day yesterday.  I think I trans her to Zion so she can get her memb #, but on this I''m not 100% sure.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-10 16:01:39', '2022-03-10 16:01:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088504008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088729001', 'Bonnie Eckert', NULL, '3-10-22 Bonnie found some PPO through someone else that has no caps, $0 ded, small co-pays, underwriting for about the same price as SECURE. It sounds great. I''ve asked her to share it with me so I can learn. I''ve never seen anything like this for individuals in CO. She will email it to me when she gets the information. Totally nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-10 15:52:28', '2022-03-10 15:52:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088504003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088729001', 'Bonnie Eckert', NULL, '3-10-22 Bonnie is ready to enroll in SECURE and calling me back in 5 minutes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-10 15:35:24', '2022-03-10 15:35:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088501023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480124', 'Wendy Summerfield', NULL, '3-9-2022:  (I typed up everything, then came back in, all my notes were gone. Forgot to his save?)
     - Her son had a lump in his breast/chest.  He went to the doctor and they are working to diagnosis it.  They''ve done a mammogram type image and are working on labs.  They don''t know yet if it will require surgical removal.
     - If surgery is involved, I told her to call us before they sched anything and we''ll bring in our HCBB Care Connect team to work on a high quality/fair priced pkg (assuming the surg is not an emergency) = possible reduced IUA, no bills, much easier for the members, & saves the comm $ too.
     - She''s going to start a ''Need'' w/Zion.  I sent her the temp for submitting a ''Need''.  
     - She needs her memb #, so I gave her Zion''s ph # & was going to transfer her at the end of the call, but we were suddently disconnected.  I tried calling back several times to no avail.
     - Her son(s) are turning 26 on 4/17/2022.  She wanted to know why they were being rem''d 4/1/2022 instead of at the end of the mo.   I let her know our Benefit Admin would be the one who could ans that, but we didn''t take that part of the conv any further.  She''s also going to ask Zion how it will work if this ''Need'' continues past his 26th b-day?  We did discuss he may be able to move to his own plan that would start on 4/1/2022, but Zion would be best answering the ''Need'' & b-day questions since they make the determinations.  Since she''s calling them immed, timing is hopefully not an issue.      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-10 15:29:13', '2022-03-10 15:29:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088501018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904304', 'Katherine Waller', NULL, '3-10-2022:  Katie called re: her appt tomorrow &amp; the debit card we sent her.  I see she''s w/Redirect and let her know the card prob came from them.  She says I''m so confused on who I''m supposed to call.  I let her know it''s no issue, I can get her to them.  Made sure she has their # in case she needs it later &amp; trans her directly to the number I see on their website:  (888) 701-6120.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-10 14:49:49', '2022-03-10 14:49:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088473033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086855002', 'Vikram Kumar', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. If this member complains that they do not know their plan it is because Vikram was not interested in doing the Welcome Call at all. I explained to Vikram that if he was too busy to take this call regarding his plan, that I could send him a new welcome call scheduler and he could reschedule for a more convenient time. Vikram insisted that he would not reschedule and to hurry up and get this call finished. Vikram seemed very busy and uninterested so I reiterated that he could reschedule if this was an inconvenient time because we are discussing important information about his plan.  He advised me to hurry up and finish and if he had any questions he would reach out. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-10 14:47:07', '2022-03-10 14:47:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088465046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082845002', 'Mark Freeman', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation form.  Darius contacted me to cancel member.  I will notify Zion and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-10 14:40:46', '2022-03-10 14:40:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088473028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086942001', 'James Evans, Jr.', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! James and Monica are wonderful! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-10 14:05:28', '2022-03-10 14:05:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088473023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064027088', 'Jonathan Dulany', NULL, 'Called to cancel benefits, I transferred member to Patti ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-10 14:02:21', '2022-03-10 14:02:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088501013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050550098', 'Sarah Price', NULL, '3-10-2022:  I pulled up Sarah via ph #.  She called thinking she was calling Sedera.  I trans her directly to them (she says she has their # in her phone).  The cc they gave her to pay for her mammogram  (?) appt isn''t working, so she''s calling to try to fix.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-10 13:09:44', '2022-03-10 13:09:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088501008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082845002', 'Mark Freeman', NULL, '3-10-2022:  Mark called to cancel.  His employer is now going to provide health ins.  I transferred him directly to his advisor:  Darius Kohanim''s phone line &amp; sent him the form.  Also, sent Patti a Teams chat so she knew what I''d done.  Hopefully, Darius can let Patti know it''s fine to process the cancellation one he &amp; Mark speak &amp; she rec''s the cancel req form (I e-mailed the member the link).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-10 13:03:23', '2022-03-10 13:03:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088465041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007186031', 'Michael Martone Jr', NULL, 'Member called in asking about the $50 charge.  I explained to him what it was for.  He also asked why he wasn''t informed about the Liberty Changes I explained that he was notified and that the email was opened.  Member wanted to cancel I will send him the cancellation form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-10 12:31:41', '2022-03-10 12:31:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088473018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899089', 'Mateusz (Mat) Piasta', NULL, 'Mat called with questions on how to present himself for knee injury. I explained that in this instance of injury he would just present himself as a self-pay patient and explained the process. I then sent Mat the HCBB fair price for an MRI w/ and w/o contrast. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-10 12:11:04', '2022-03-10 12:11:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088501003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085146002', 'Rebecca Snyder', NULL, '3/10/2022:  Rebecca called re: her Thyroid lab work.  She wondered if this new "extra" plan would help w/that.  (It almost sounds like she may have some other plan, that would be primary?)  
     - Re:  Labwork.  We discussed prev care & Planstin, but having her thyroid labs is diagnostic.  I did tell her she could use an in network lab (sugg curr LabCorp & Quest are wking well), bill it thru them, knowing it will kickback as not covered at a network discount rate.   She seemed to understand & like that idea.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-10 12:05:55', '2022-03-10 12:05:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088465036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088498002', 'Alicia Winegar', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-10 09:17:59', '2022-03-10 09:17:59'),
