  ('zcrm_1579374000088355018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018019042', 'Alexandria (Lexie) Hall', NULL, 'I received a forwarded letter fro Karina from member asking about her Coverage Information, Group number and that she didn''t have her card.  I sent her a copy of her RCI ID card and let her know that the card was only for Preventative.  I also ordered a new ID card to be sent to her.   I also had to update address w/RCI so I will order another card tomorrow when system updates', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-09 10:18:47', '2022-03-09 10:18:47'),
