  ('zcrm_1579374000088396003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085042002', 'Alexa Fetta', NULL, 'Alexa chatted on the SalesIQ chat this morning with me and she asked me about where she can find her discount dental program through MPB.Health. I answered her and explained that she can contact her Advisor Jeremih Fetta and he might have a discount dental plan that he can set her up with and if he doesn''t she can certainly go through the Whole Health Living Choices portal that offers discounts on all sorts of items including Dental, if available in her area. I explained how she can get to her member portal to go through WHLC and search, and if she would like someone to walk her through that she can also call the 800 # and speak with one of our Concierge ladies to help her get to the right place. I pulled up WHLC and searched for Dental discounts in her area and found 1 discount of 15%. I took a screen shot of the discount and sent it to her through the chat. She responded saying: "I''m just trying to find info on my existing dental plan or discount plan. I don''t need to talk to my advisor about a new plan. Can you please tell me where I can find that?" I explained again about the WHLC Discount Program she has in her plan and sent her the discount. She didn''t respond back to any of what I had to say and left the chat. Alexa doesn''t seem to understand that there is no Dental Plan per-say included with her plan and MPB.Health. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-03-09 08:47:33', '2022-03-09 08:47:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088381008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032273', 'Kari Reed', NULL, 'Kari called with questions on how to present herself to her provider and where to go for labs. I asked Kari if she had verified that this doctor is in the PHCS network and she had not, so I did a search and found that Jay Brown was not in the PHCS network. I sent Kari a list of in-network labs and providers. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-09 08:29:14', '2022-03-09 08:29:14'),
