  ('zcrm_1579374000088331047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084814001', 'James Rosenow', NULL, '3-8-2022:  Sent a Teams chat to Kelly F:  James'' replacement MPB. Health card she sent still didn''t get to him.  He asked if we could send his Welcome Pkt & MPB.Health card to his parents'' address just down the street  from him since he hasn''t rec''d either prev packets ( I double checked & we did send it to the corr add listed on 2/21/22).  
     His address c/o of his parents = James Rosenow,  c/o Suzy Rosenow,  2464 E Donato Dr,  Gilbert, AZ  85298.  He will call again at the end of March if he still doesn''t have it.  
     - I let him know the imp card is the Planstin card he rec''d the pdf on.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-08 18:22:01', '2022-03-08 18:22:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088335008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067291089', 'Heidi Beachley', NULL, '3-8-22 Got a new job with employer benefits. So, she''s cancelling for 4/1/22. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-08 16:22:38', '2022-03-08 16:22:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088335003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065453001', 'Greg Strokes', NULL, '3-8-22 Greg has been moved to W2 employment from contractor status with his current employer and they will pay for a significant portion of his benefits now and he pays only $100+ per paycheck, ie. 2 x per month for his health, dental, etc. He was happy with his membership but will pay less going on employer ins now. He was nice and appreciative for the help the past few years.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-08 16:21:40', '2022-03-08 16:21:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088331039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085042002', 'Alexa Fetta', NULL, '3-8-2022:  Alexa called wondering if she has dental cov (PS her husb is the advisor).  She was driving, but I tried to explain how to find and access WHLC to see if there was a discount that could work for her dental needs.  We also talked about sched her ''Welcome Call'' &amp; she''ll ck her spam because she doesn''t remember seeing any of the e-mails to sched.  Then call if she needs help with either item again.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-08 16:14:54', '2022-03-08 16:14:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088331034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081707002', 'Christina Johnson', NULL, '3-8-2022:  Christina called re:  broken finger & an eye issue:
     - Her eye doc wants to do a second procedure on her eyes (she''s seeing something and wants to clarify what it is) that is not cov''d by her eyecare ins.  I let her know that only if it moves to a ''medical'' need, vs opth, would they posibly cons it for sharing.
     - She also thinks she may have broken her little finger & wanted to know what to do.  We discussed the proc, ''cash-pay'' to 1k IUA, sub (& deadline) if it looks like it will continue or be above her IUA.
     - On both, she knows to keep track of her receipts, proof-of-pymt and to call to start a need before time limit if it looks like we need to.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-08 16:06:48', '2022-03-08 16:06:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088328021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089435002', 'Kangie Dawber', NULL, 'No answer. Left VM.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-03-08 15:55:24', '2022-03-08 15:55:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088331029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939155', 'Shawn Bisaillon', NULL, '3-8-2022:  Anna called re: husband''s ER visit again.   She rec''d the info Jennifer sent, but wanted to confirm she was doing it corr.  She also wanted her Zion Memb #.  I gave her Zion''s ph # &amp; trans her directly so they can get that for her as well as confirm the information she''s supply is what they need.  She will also really monitor their e-mail during this process to make she she doesn''t miss anything they need from her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-08 15:51:27', '2022-03-08 15:51:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088331024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084611010', 'Margo Hrabak', NULL, '3-8-2022:  Margo called in quite upset.  She took the day-off and went to her doctor''s appt today.  When she got there, she found out they sched her w/a Nurse Prac, instead of the doctor she had sugg.  The doctor is a part of the PHCS Network, the Nurse Prac is not.  So, she resched for Fri w/the doc.
     - In talking, we realized this is NOT a prev appt.  She found a lump and wants to make sure everything is ok.  Went over does not req in network IF she wants a diff doc, she''s a ''cash-pay'' pt to $2500 IUA (to which she says she was told by a clinic to ''never'' say cash pay because then they treat you like you are indigent, require an interview, etc.  I let her know that was spec to that office.  Most offices offer a disc to cash pay, but some do not like cash pay pts & I could not speak to that, but if needed, we can ask Zion to advocate for her, etc.), & we can start a ''need'' if nec.
     -  By the time we got off the phone, we had an acceptable plan of action for her.  If she needs prev care later she will call to get help.  She knows that''s the only time she needs to use the Planstin card.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-08 15:30:01', '2022-03-08 15:30:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088331019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084818001', 'Daniel McManus', NULL, '3-8-2022:  Danny called looking to sched a therapy appt again.  We pulled up the MPB.Health portals together &amp; I showed him how to sign-in to the MAP site, where their ph # was, &amp; then I trans him to them directly.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-08 15:21:36', '2022-03-08 15:21:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088300066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939155', 'Shawn Bisaillon', NULL, 'Anna Bisaillon called in regard to her husband’s ER visit and what her next steps should be; I explained to Anna that she will need to start uploading all the bills and receipts she has in her possession to Zion’s website to open a Need. Once she has opened the Need with Zion, any questions she has for the status of the Need should be directed to Zion. But I also informed Anna that if she needs anything else pertaining to her plan to either give us a call or shoot me an email. Anna was very happy with the service she received today. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-08 14:45:28', '2022-03-08 14:45:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088303048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072038127', 'Tamara Granada', NULL, 'Per Karina member cancelled eff 3/1/22.  Already cancelled in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-08 14:35:24', '2022-03-08 14:35:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088300061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086951001', 'Stephanie Baltz', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! Stephanie and her family are going to be amazing members! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-08 13:50:42', '2022-03-08 13:50:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088331008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496002', 'Ryan Murphy', NULL, '3-8-2022:  Ryan called due to a sinus/chest congestion issue.  We discussed options.  I sugg CirrusMD, but he says he needs to see someone for a shot.  Then I sugg his PCP & he said, well I don''t know how quickly I can get in*.   Curr his PCP is showing in the PHCS Search (so when he needs prev care, it''ll be easier:  Szczepanski, Devan G, M.D.  70433).
     - So, we talked about Urgent Care, but he''s a ''cash-pay'' pt up to the 1k IUA (unless pre-x).  He claims it won''t be pre-x because "he only went to the Urgent Care last year, got his steroid shot, and was fine...".  We discussed what a pre-x might look like (I gave auto policy example).  But, I told him prob not an issue because from what he''s telling me it will be under his 1k IUA anyway.
     - * Later, he tells me he pays an annual fee to his PCP to get in faster.   He''s going to call them & will get back to us if he needs anything.  He''ll keep track of the invoices & receipts in case.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-08 12:55:25', '2022-03-08 12:56:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088300056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088259002', 'Ian McGiffen', NULL, 'Ian called with questions regarding if he was still eligible for the Secure plan if he has his own business and works for a company. He also called about his MPB portal info and some HSA information. He said that Leslie could not answer his questions and was told to reach out to the MPB concierge team for these answers. Ian''s advisor should have been able to answer these questions for him, instead I had to reach out to MANY different resources for the answers to all but his HSA question in which I referred him to the bank he has his HSA with. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-08 12:43:40', '2022-03-08 12:43:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088328016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093277002', 'Grant Meeker', NULL, 'He called back in and got Angle. He let angle know he was already working with me and that he was looking to sign up for May.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-03-08 12:36:03', '2022-03-08 12:36:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088300048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080613002', 'Michael Van Horn', NULL, 'Michael (and his wife Patty) called in with questions regarding his ENT appointment he is on his way to right now. I let both know that whenever Mike has a specialists visit to call the concierge team because we can find him the best price in his area. We also went over his Planstin card, Zion card, and MPB card. I am also sending out a Welcome Call scheduler so that Mike and Patty can schedule a call. I also added Patty''s email address per Mike''s request via phone. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-08 12:31:57', '2022-03-08 12:39:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088300043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086838017', 'Brooke Dillow', NULL, 'Brooke called in asking about her different cards she received in the mail and their purposes. I explained her cards and how to present herself as a self-pay patient. I also sent Brooke another welcome call scheduler so that she can schedule a new call. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-08 12:08:25', '2022-03-08 12:08:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088300038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085759046', 'James Brown', NULL, 'James Brown called inquiring about getting pricing for his prescriptions prior to his plan beginning in April. I tried to explain to Jamie that we do prefer he waits until has plan has officially started before pricing out scripts for him. He then stated that it was an awful rule for how much money he has spent to get this plan. I did end up sending James a script quote form and it has been completed by me. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-08 11:47:11', '2022-03-08 11:47:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088331003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088241002', 'Matthew Osborn', NULL, '3-8-2022:  Matt called.  He''s trying to upload his proof of self employment, but the Username &amp; PW are blank in the e-mail he rec''d.  I helped him get into the member portal &amp; provided the information he needed for signing-in.  
     - He will schedule his ''Welcome Call'' for after 4/1/22 (he didn''t understand why he needed to wait until we spoke).  I think he &amp; his wife will both try to be present after the 1st.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-08 11:08:55', '2022-03-08 11:08:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088300033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087125001', 'Robert West', NULL, 'Robert called in because he was at a doctor''s appointment and did not have any of his cards, he actually stated that he never received any cards via mail. I asked Robert for the purpose of his appointment, and he said it was for his preventative wellness visit but that his doctor may refer him to the endocrinologist. I also verified that Robert checked if his provider is in the PHCS network, and he said that his advisor verified that for him. Robert then stated that he was told that his Endocrinologist was covered at 100%. I explained to Robert that he would have to pay his IUA and then the rest would be shareable with Zion if it was not a pre-existing condition. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-08 10:56:21', '2022-03-08 10:56:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088300028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081381002', 'Bren Frisch', NULL, 'Bren called inquiring about what each of her cards were for, so I went through each of her cards and their purposes with Bren. I also explained how to present her Planstin card and verified that her providers were in network. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-08 10:46:27', '2022-03-08 10:46:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088300023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084818009', 'Troy Conrad', NULL, 'Troy called inquiring about mental health services, so I directed him to the MAP program. I also sent him a new welcome call scheduler so that he can get a new welcome call scheduled for himself and his wife. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-08 09:56:39', '2022-03-08 09:56:39'),
