  ('zcrm_1579374000088300018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, 'Amy called with questions regarding her annual wellness visit with her OBGYN. I explained how to present her Planstin card, and she had stated that she verified the doctor was in-network. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-08 08:50:11', '2022-03-08 08:50:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088303028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006239', 'Kim Lucey', NULL, 'Just received Cancellation request from member.  I will cancel and ask Planstin to cancel her as of 3/1.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-08 08:31:40', '2022-03-08 08:31:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088300013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091021', 'Yadira Butkovich', NULL, 'Bill and Yadira called in with questions regarding Bill possibly having to take Yadira to the ER this morning for a pre-existing condition issue. I explained to Bill about the pre-ex clause because he seemed rather confused about it. He had thought that sharing for the pre-ex condition would begin a year after her initial diagnosis but I explained (and read the guidelines to Bill and Yadira) that it is one year from Yadira''s initial enrollment date. I did also explain how to present themselves as self-pay patients so that they are able to get the best price if he does take her into the ER. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-08 08:22:38', '2022-03-08 08:22:38'),
