  ('zcrm_1579374000088300003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, 'Brian Mirsky called with questions regarding a doctor he found in the PHCS network but when he provided his Zion card they stated that they were not a part of the plan. I explained to Brian that he presented the incorrect card to the office and then I explained how he should present his Planstin card. I verified with Brian that Dr. Gjorgj Trnovski, M.D. is in the PHCS network and let him know that if he has any issues to just give us a call back and we will see what we can do for him when it comes to finding a provider for his annual wellness visit. Brian was very receptive and understood my instructions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-08 07:24:10', '2022-03-08 07:24:10'),
