  ('zcrm_1579374000088214043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086715002', 'Nancy Krampetz', NULL, '3-7-2022:  Dave called to see if we had pricing on his Lantus Solostar Insulin Pens.  Jennifer was gone for the day, but let me know in a text she had not heard back from Reid for today''s work shift.  I was able to let Dave know that she will get w/him tomorrow.  He is in CA.

