  ('zcrm_1579374000088120018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692101', 'Kari Myroniuk', NULL, 'Member Kari called in today with questions regarding her MPB.Health portal and her preventative care services. I sent Kari her MPB.Health member portal log-in information in an email. Kari then inquired about her preventative mammogram and coloscopy. She states she was told by Diane Border that she would receive a complimentary wellness visit, colonoscopy, and mammogram with her Care+ plan. I unfortunately had to inform Kari that she did not have any of those services due to her having a plan that does not have preventative care along with it. Kari then told her that she was ASSURED that she had preventative services with her plan. Upon reading the previous notes from Vanessa and Kelly Anne, it appears that Kari is very confused about her plan details. Kari will be reaching out to Diane Border for clarification. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-07 09:13:29', '2022-03-07 09:13:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088175003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089435002', 'Kangie Dawber', NULL, 'Couldn''t talk now, asked to call her back at 4 PM Mountain time.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-03-07 09:08:01', '2022-03-07 09:08:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088173003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '3-7-22 Eric is calling to find out options to switch. But, in Carbondale it''s best for now to leave him on his current membership bc of the network issues otherwise. I let him know we might have a solution to the problem and therefore have new options to offer in a month or two. Told him to call me in 2 months to check in on that. His wife may also be able to get their son onto her plan for a better price but they aren''t sure.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-07 09:01:07', '2022-03-07 09:01:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088120013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, 'Eric called in stating that he had made a change in his plan (removing someone) in January and it has not been done. I transferred Eric to Patti so he could speak with her about this change. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-07 08:59:43', '2022-03-07 08:59:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088164003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451009', 'Kay Sasser', NULL, 'Per Wendy this member now qualifies for Medicaid.  She has submitted the cancellation request and I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-07 08:44:38', '2022-03-07 08:44:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088120008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081511002', 'Lindsey Smith', NULL, 'Lindsey Smith called in inquiring about payment for her therapist through the MAP program. I explained to Lindsey that she would have to speak to the MAP program directly and I transferred her/gave her the MAP program phone number. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-07 07:54:25', '2022-03-07 07:54:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088120003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085646002', 'Karen Lapchinsky', NULL, '3/4/2022 - •	Karen Torsoe/Joan Phelps asked that I reach out to Karen Lapchinsky regarding her husband’s physical therapy. I did reach out to Karen and sent a list of PT’s in her area from HCBB. Karen’s husband actually injured himself PRIOR to the family joining MPB.Health so he will actually be staying with Liberty Health. He will be taken off on 4/1/2022 and we will no long be able to do research for him until he is able to join the plan with Karen. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-07 07:09:44', '2022-03-07 07:09:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088073016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086853002', 'Carol Ann Kowalski', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1403 Question : What are your private health share plan options for residents in the state of Washington. Specifically for a family of four with head of household 55? I like your websites Care+ IUA $2,500 for family with HH 55 years old pricing. Do you offer that as a high deductible with HSA in the State of Washington? Thanks in advance!', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-03-05 13:41:59', '2022-03-05 13:41:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088096018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086951001', 'Stephanie Baltz', NULL, '3-4-2022:  Wendy e-mailed in a response to Stephanie (cc''ing me) to get a ''Welcome Call'' scheduled for Stephanie.  But, it looks like I talked to Stephanie 2-days ago and worked with her to make sure her orig call was resch.  See notes above for times.  I replied to Wendy''s new e-mail confirming she should be set unless she''d like to change the time.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-04 18:01:10', '2022-03-04 18:01:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088079023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, '3-4-22 Hi Wendy,

So I finally spoke to them on the phone and it seemed they are closer to understanding what I''m asking for. Basically, I told them the best case is that they consider my IUA reached and reimburse me for anything about $1000 and pay going forward. Second scenario is that they consider the IUA reached but don''t reimburse for the past, but also don''t make us spend another $600+ to get to our IUA. They said they''d "consider it for a special needs request". I still don''t understand why this is required, or that they have a 6-month submission applicable to even the IUA and are so strict that they don''t count expenses born by us up to this amount, but at least it is progress. 

On a different note, since it''s been a year since the visit that they billed as a wellness visit that wasn''t, I was looking into doctor appointments. We now live in Golden, CO (where do I update my address) and I remember a discussion about a provider search, but I can''t find the link to the tool to use. Can you send me this?

Tyler', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-04 17:11:16', '2022-03-04 17:11:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088079018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826048', 'Trent Mullikin', NULL, '3-4-22 Left vm for Trent about late payment and final notice. Let him know it will lapse soon or there will be a reinstatement fee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-04 16:39:08', '2022-03-04 16:39:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088096013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081707002', 'Christina Johnson', NULL, '3-4-2022:  Christina called re: her counseling.  She said she had her 1st 4 appts &amp; was told they would extend it by 4 more.  After we talked, she found the e-mail from Mazzitti &amp; Sullivan regarding this and she''ll contact them.  She was grateful I could help her realize what she was looking for.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-04 15:48:21', '2022-03-04 15:48:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088096008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086967002', 'Kris DiNucci', NULL, '3-4-2022:  Kris wrote his advisor confused re: our conversation &amp; coverage on his Healthsharing/IUAs.  I called him but, our conv was super rushed because he was hopping onto a plane.  I think his misunderstand is okay?  As we were getting off the phone (&amp; he had to go), he said something that could be taken 2 ways...  He seemed relieved though, so hopefully we are all set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-04 14:58:07', '2022-03-04 14:58:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088096003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496017', 'Asiye Erdilek', NULL, '3-4-2022:  Asiye called re: heart palpitations a week ago.  
     - She thinks she uploaded & started a ''Need'' w/Zion after tt Jennifer on the 1st.  She wanted to know if I could see them.  I explained that Zion is her healthsharing & they can help her.  I made sure she has their # & directly trans her @ the end of the call.
     - She''s already pd way over her 1k IUA, so hopefully they can get this approved for her quickly as the various coming appts are quite expensive & they want $ up front.  [She has not even signed the HIPPA form yet though, so I let her know they''ll need that to get things started too.]
     - According to her, she''s never experienced anything like this, had any symptoms, been treated, etc., so it hopefully won''t be pre-x since she just joined 1/1/22.     She''s very sweet and appreciative.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-04 14:56:36', '2022-03-04 14:56:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088028042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084611010', 'Margo Hrabak', NULL, 'Margo called in looking for a list of PHCS in-network OBGYN''s in her area. I emailed that list to Margo and advised her that when she is closer to getting her preventative mammogram done to give the concierge team a call and we will be happy to do that search for her. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-04 14:31:30', '2022-03-04 14:31:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088028037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029266240', 'Diane Kelly-Lokocz', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! I will be following up with Diane on 3/7/2022 with answers to some great questions she had asked. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-04 14:17:49', '2022-03-04 14:17:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088079013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088729001', 'Bonnie Eckert', NULL, '3-4-22 I think this must be a different Bonnie Eckert. My original Bonnie Eckert client lives in Denver and is a realtor. This one lives in Boulder and has been on Cobra for 18 months and has been in high level Administration jobs, so not worried about paper work involved in self-pay process. She also has own small biz called Tres Bon something. She is also a yoga instructor for kuait yoga which helps people reverse osteoporosis!  She told me a story of Quest Labs cancelling all of their appointments for the final 10 days of the year due to a "computer glitch." This is when many people have already reached their deductibles and trying to get their final appts in before the end of the year. So, Quest didn''t want to honor these visits nationwide! Then at the first of the year it was magically fixed and they wouldn''t honor the fact that ded had been met. Patients had to start over with ded and Quest suddenly had amnesia about cancelling those appointments. So, she had to pay another $500 for an MRI that would have cost her nothing days earlier. She understands pre-x in relation to an old arm issue and post menopause meds. I forgot to mention Concierge for Meds. Must share that next time. She takes 100MG of progesterone and takes prolia. SECURE at $325/$1000 for April 1st start. Her Cobra runs out March 22, 2022. She knows she''ll have a lapse. Yes, to wellness every year and will fund the HSA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-04 13:12:21', '2022-03-04 13:12:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088079008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, '3-4-22 Maya called to understand the pre-x clause better and to understand how medical records work. I encouraged her to request her medical records from all doctors to make sure they look accurate and true to reality. She has something new going on and just wants to make sure it''s not considered pre-x. She feels confident now to check her records and make sure all is well moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-04 13:04:08', '2022-03-04 13:04:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088028032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084301001', 'Brittney Lary', NULL, 'Brittney called asking for a list of in-network ENT specialists in her area. I explained to Brittney that with her Care+ plan, she does not need to worry about seen an ENT specialist that is in the PHCS network. Brittaney then stated that she had called an ENT in her area and that they had never heard of her MPB.Health insurance plan. I explained to Brittney that her plan is not insurance and, in any instance, when she goes to a provider, ER, urgent care, etc. she only presents herself as a self-pay patient, collects the superbills, and if it goes above her $2,500 IUA amount she will submit the bills to Zion for sharing for anything above her IUA amount. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-04 12:54:56', '2022-03-04 12:54:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088028027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068022001', 'Justin Breaux', NULL, 'Justin called asking for instructions on how his ex-wife is to present his daughters for their wellness appointments that are coming up soon.  I explained that they need to verify that the pediatrician (Benjamin Valdez) is in the PHCS network (which I verified that he currently is) and present his Planstin card at the time of their wellness visits. Justin was very happy with the information I relayed to him. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-04 12:35:49', '2022-03-04 12:35:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088075038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077566050', 'Michael Baker', NULL, 'Michael called into me to let me know that he received another member''s 1095 in error.  I let him know that I would send him his when I received.  Sent out 3/4', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-04 11:21:32', '2022-03-04 11:21:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088075033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014598059', 'Maureen Connell', NULL, 'Sent out 1095C to member after Michael Baker called in and told me that he received hers by mistake', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-04 11:19:45', '2022-03-04 11:19:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088040031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001653225', 'Isabelle Peyrichoux', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-04 11:12:44', '2022-03-04 11:12:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088075028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Notified Planstin that dependent Nathaniel need to be removed eff 4/1.  Also asked for his Pre-ex time to be bridged.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-04 10:47:36', '2022-03-04 10:47:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088040026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086124001', 'Cyndi Freeman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-04 10:46:04', '2022-03-04 10:46:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088075023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088078001', 'Nathaniel Grabau', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-04 10:20:07', '2022-03-04 10:20:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088075018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088066002', 'Susan Feickert', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-04 10:16:33', '2022-03-04 10:16:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088075013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088055002', 'Deborah Sonnentag', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-04 10:14:20', '2022-03-04 10:14:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088079003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, '3-4-22 Nathan just enrolled in CARE+ for April 1st bc he''s turning 26 $215/$1000. He doesn''t do his annual wellness visits. He has multiple employment sources with their Grabau family business and with self-employment income for multi-family property. But, doesn''t need SECURE since no wellness. Healthy, no pre-x and no open needs. I''ve asked Patti to inform Zion of original effective date of Aug. 2020. She will. He''s getting married this summer and will want to add his wife who''s 20. I have him the $395/$1000 for CARE+ ES price to prepare for. The enrollment platform didn''t allow for any other payment except List Bill! So, he completed the Change Payment Form and I waived the $100 since he was already a member, just moving from the family to his own membership due to age.  All set now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-04 10:07:39', '2022-03-04 10:07:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088075008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153273', 'Marcel Tuerlings', NULL, 'Member''s address update with Sedera', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-04 09:50:03', '2022-03-04 09:50:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088075003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153215', 'Marcel Tuerlings', NULL, 'Address update with Sedera &amp; RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-04 09:46:17', '2022-03-04 09:46:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088040021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086961002', 'Brandon Blake', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-04 09:31:26', '2022-03-04 09:31:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088040016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086953017', 'Norma Sura', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-04 08:55:32', '2022-03-04 08:55:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088040008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081866002', 'David Weiner', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly F for replacement QR Life Code cards. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-04 08:19:45', '2022-03-04 08:28:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088047003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090686002', 'Brandee Poland', NULL, 'Emailed me with a long list of questions, got them all answered and will follow up later today if I dont hear back.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-03-04 08:18:35', '2022-03-04 08:18:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088040003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083353002', 'Maribeth Liska', NULL, 'No response. Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-04 07:45:15', '2022-03-04 07:45:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088028022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, 'Brian called regarding finding a new General Practioner in his area. Brian does not seem like a great candidate for this plan. He gets very frustrated when he is not given the answer that he wants and continues the conversation being belligerent and asking what my purpose is if I can''t do the leg work for him. I have currently taken verbal abuse from Mr. Mirsky twice this week, and he has given other concierge team members the same verbal abuse in the past. If this continues with Mr. Mirsky, I will be reaching out to Joan Phelps and Paul Cholak regarding this members attitude towards the concierge team. I did send Mr. Mirsky a list of in-network providers for General Practitioners in his area. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-04 07:38:26', '2022-03-04 07:38:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088028011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153215', 'Marcel Tuerlings', NULL, '3/3/2022 - Luis &amp; Marcel requested new MPB.Health membership cards. Upon verifying the mailing address we currently have on file, they let me know that they have a new address. I did change their addresses in the CRM &amp; Admin123, but I also sent address change forms to both members for our records. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-04 07:11:39', '2022-03-04 07:12:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088028003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153273', 'Marcel Tuerlings', NULL, '3/3/2022 - Luis &amp; Marcel requested new MPB.Health membership cards. Upon verifying the mailing address we currently have on file, they let me know that they have a new address. I did change their addresses in the CRM &amp; Admin123, but I also sent address change forms to both members for our records. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-04 07:11:04', '2022-03-04 07:12:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088012019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067540138', 'Leslie Frazier', NULL, '3-3-2022:  Started a need about 3 weeks ago w/Zion for her husb who hurt himself.  She signed the HIPPA form, but is having trouble getting a straight answer when she''s called Zion several times & ea time it''s a diff story.
     - I called & tt CC at Zion.  She''s going to ask a team memb to call Leslie tomorrow to see if they can get this going.  The delay is causing issues for her husb & his pain because payment has not yet been made for him to look at further treatment.  I''ve asked to be kept in the loop (we''ll see).
     - Other facts per Leslie:
                She was told they would this one time accept the MD records from her as the patient since the MD office said they would not release them to anyone else (but Zion''s records show they have not rec''d them and they are waiting for these per CC at Zion.)
                 Leslie says they have already paid their 1k IUA & have submitted to Zion the detailed invoices and proof of pymts on all of these things.

I think Leslie''s biggest frustration is she feels like she keeps getting bounced around and different stories, yet her husband is needing to continue treatment & they cannot get any answers & with pymt not made they are challenged to continue the treatment.  

Leslie knows Zion sb calling tomorrow.  Hopefully, this will get this moving for her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-03 17:50:12', '2022-03-03 17:50:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088014008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, '3-3-22 Jackie has a number of different health issues going on with possible family breast issues, stomach issues and plantar fascitis. She submitted one of the needs and is still waiting since Oct to be reimbursed! She will call them tomorrow. They were waiting on more information from some provider and to decide about acupuncture. I will send her the Needs Tracker spreadsheet now too. She knows of the 6 month time frame to submit a need.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-03 17:23:19', '2022-03-03 17:23:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088014003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331067', 'Tessa Manton', NULL, '3-3-22 Tessa called bc her doctor''s office said her plan was cancelled in Aug. of 2020. But, that was her old membership that included the MEC. She''s going in for non-wellness visit and just needs to pay cash. That''s what she thought but the provider was panicked for her. She will pay cash and I let her know she needs to track the cost and has max of 6 months to submit the need if any chance it will exceed $1000. She''s confident and no problem.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-03 16:51:45', '2022-03-03 16:51:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088012008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086967002', 'Kris DiNucci', NULL, '3-3-2022:  Kris called (he''s a doctor).  First, in reference to Kelly F''s last note on bounced e-mail, I confirmed he did receive it, so we''re good there.
     - He''s was completely unclear on the 5k IUA he''s selected.  Thought it was annual, like a deductible, and did not realize he was resp for up to 3 IUAs per year.  We talked options & he''s going to call his advisor to see if w/1 ''need'' would it pay for itself w/the 4k in savings?
     - He asked about cards he rec''d.  MPB.Health x 5 & 1 Planstin.  He hasn''t sched his ''Welcome Call'' yet, but I showed him the link & sugg all (or as many family memb as poss be present) since I find everyone hears and retains diff details.  He will get that sched.  
                    He will get the QRCodes setup & we talked about one per memb, & how they work
                               briefly.
                    Talked about Planstin = prev only.  Should also have pdf they can use. Must be in
                               network, but again, he''ll get more details during ''Welcome Call''.

Very nice guy, but had not understood exactly how it worked.  He did understand it''s not insurance, but foggy on details (IUA vs ded, etc.)     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-03 16:14:58', '2022-03-03 16:16:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088002023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086715002', 'Nancy Krampetz', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-03 14:02:22', '2022-03-03 14:02:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088012003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048347128', 'T. Michele Armstrong', NULL, '3-3-2022:  Michele called - she''s totally frustrated.  She''s not understanding the different entites: Redirect vs Sedera, etc.  She sent Redirect everything on her app for her miniscus surgery 12/2021, but she hasn''t heard anything from them, or Sedera, and when she calls them they don''t return her call...  When I asked her who she''d been calling, she was honest "at this point I''m so confused I don''t even know."
     I called Sedera to see if they have anything.  The last information they have on her is from Redirect 2/1/22 saying they are waiting on Michele to submit the bills and pymts info.  So, it sounds like the information she uploaded did not get into the system.  Kristen at Sedera is going to call Michele directly & sched a call w/her Sedera ''Need'' Coordinator: Mikey (male) so they can help Michele with the ''Need''.
     - Michele has already paid > than her $2500 IUA.  We went over how Sedera with handle pymts once they have everything they need.
     - Redirect was coordinating the ''Need'' w/Sedera, but since Michele is have so much trouble, Kristen is going to ask Mikey to offer to work direct w/her.
     - I went over the diff aspects of her plan & that I''m glad she called us so we can help her.     - CA

I tried Michele back to see if she''d sched the appt w/Mikey & they had missed the call from Kristen at Sedera.  I gave them Sedera''s ph #, sugg they listen to her message in case she has a direct #, and see if Mikey can help them get this going.  We got through most of our conv & had warned me they would be out of serv area shortly & we did get cut off.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-03 13:52:49', '2022-03-03 17:54:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087956011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087741002', 'Richard Feickert', NULL, 'Advisor called into me and asked about the fact that he enrolled older member as primary.  I told him that always in the case of members that are both over 50, primary is always the younger to avoid the younger spouse having to re-enroll.  Member submitted cancellation and will re-enroll correctly.  I will notify Planstin and have refunded $125.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-03 13:39:41', '2022-03-03 13:39:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088002018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083471002', 'Randall Mass', NULL, 'Randall did not show for his Welcome Call, I left him a detailed vm and sent him a new Welcome Call scheduling link. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-03 13:26:18', '2022-03-03 13:26:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088002013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076535957', 'Ryan Koehler', NULL, 'Megan called regarding her daughter having to see a Pulmonologist twice a year and asked if this is something that is covered. I explained that it was not a preventative service, the self-pay process, and how to upload a Need to Zion in the case that this goes above her IUA. She was also inquiring about her 1095-B so I transferred Megan to Patti. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-03 11:25:14', '2022-03-03 11:25:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088000032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082061002', 'Wendy Eidman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-03 11:18:22', '2022-03-03 11:18:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088000024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086225001', 'John Donovan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Yes many questions was on call over the 20 mins. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-03 10:37:19', '2022-03-03 10:40:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088002008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, 'Elizabeth called again regarding how to present herself as a self-pay patient. I explained the process and then we discussed the pre-existing conditions clause. She was very unsure of how to understand that clause, so I explained it to her, she still seems unsure. She was not sure of her IUA amount and accused me of throwing "random" numbers out when explaining how opening a Need with Zion works after she met her $1,000 IUA amount. I explained that when it comes to IUA amounts, I do not just throw random numbers out to members. Wendy may want to reach out to Maya to speak with her about her plan. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-03 10:35:40', '2022-03-03 10:35:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088000018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086707002', 'Linda Pringle', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-03 09:57:19', '2022-03-03 09:57:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088000013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086939002', 'Ashraf Said', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-03 09:23:40', '2022-03-03 09:23:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088002003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656075', 'Erin Sortino', NULL, 'Erin and Paul are VERY clueless about what their plan entails. They did not realize that they did not have preventative services and assumed that CirrusMD could take care of ALL of their medical issues. I explained to both Erin and Paul that CirrusMD is a great place to start when you have a minor illness or injury, but that it might not always be the end game. Erin was then asking specific questions about nutritionists and if I knew who the nutritionists were that were employed by CirrusMD. I explained that I did not know who CirrusMD employed for nutritionists and that CirrusMD is not a program that we run, rather that it''s a third-party program that we provide to our members. Mike may want to contact this member to remind them of what their Care+ plan entails. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-03 09:19:48', '2022-03-03 09:19:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088000008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086926010', 'Theresa Staiano', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-03 08:14:13', '2022-03-03 08:14:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000088000003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086948001', 'Bradford Winship', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-03 07:55:44', '2022-03-03 07:55:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087956003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083296002', 'Jeffrey Keim', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request when I spoke to him yesterday he advised that he spoke to Christine.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-03 07:00:09', '2022-03-03 07:00:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087920005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107134002', 'Thomas Beaudin', NULL, 'Called Thomas no answer, sent email in mass.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2022-03-02 15:11:57', '2022-03-02 15:11:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087918011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086951001', 'Stephanie Baltz', NULL, '3/2/2022:   Stephanie called.  She rescheduled her ''Welcome Call'' from tomorrow, 3/3/22 at 12:30pm Eastern/10:30am Mtn w/Vanessa, to next Tues 3/8/22 at 3:30pm Eastern/1:30pm Mtn w/Jennifer, but she couldn''t figure out how to cancel the first appt.  I let her know I would notify Vanessa andI sent Vanessa a chat with the info.  The system will not allow me to delete saying I need authorization to do so.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-02 14:58:17', '2022-03-02 14:58:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087898036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087844002', 'Steven Tyler', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-02 14:31:21', '2022-03-02 14:31:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087918003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059150079', 'Heather Palentchar', NULL, '3-2-2022:  Heather called.  They are considering getting pregnant again and she wanted to know how maternity is handled.  She has an unusual 2k IUA, so I told her generally, there is a sngl IUA (unless they need to care for the baby due to issues, where a 2nd IUA would come into play).  She was hoping to use her current Obgyn, so I let her know there is no network.  Sugg she call her advisor to get help finding Zion''s current Member Guidelines & Maternity Guidelines (which can chg as often as qtrly) so she knows exactly what they expect.  She will call if she needs anything further.    
     - Sent her temp for starting a ''Need'' w/Zion & went over maternity plans, or uploading bills, proof-of-pymts, etc. 
     - We also talked about the baby being born into the membership, <30-days to confirm baby automatically added, so no gaps in coverage for baby & no waiting periods.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-02 13:56:19', '2022-03-02 13:57:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087898031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104296', 'Roland Jefferson Jr', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-02 13:40:07', '2022-03-02 13:40:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087898026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104296', 'Roland Jefferson Jr', NULL, 'Former members from 4/1/2021 to 12/31/21', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-02 13:37:51', '2022-03-02 13:37:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087898021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083296002', 'Jeffrey Keim', NULL, 'Member called in a told me that he now has Employer Coverage and needs to cancel our membership.  I told him I would send out the Link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-02 13:33:51', '2022-03-02 13:33:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087914003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104296', 'Roland Jefferson Jr', NULL, 'QR Life Code for Isaiah: H02EB. There is no spots for more than 4 QR Life Codes in the Qr Life Code Card section. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-03-02 13:20:06', '2022-03-02 13:20:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087898013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758269', 'Michael Pennavaria', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add spouse to their plan.  I will add in admin 123 and email Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-02 12:09:29', '2022-03-02 12:09:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087898008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064873042', 'Matthew Shostek', NULL, 'Spouse will be aging into Medicare eff 4/4.  Member notified 2/28.  Received Change form 3/1 I will notify Planstin &amp; adjust billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-02 11:49:14', '2022-03-02 11:49:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087884008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084812002', 'Hermilo Cavazos', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1388 Question : I was trying to register for CirrusMD but when I input the information required it would not let me create an account.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-03-02 11:28:02', '2022-03-02 11:28:02');
