  ('zcrm_1579374000087867005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084812002', 'Hermilo Cavazos', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1387 Question : I was trying to register for CirrusMD but when I input the information required it would not let me create an account.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-03-02 11:26:01', '2022-03-02 11:26:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087898003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064767127', 'Timothy Smith', NULL, 'Member''s 3/22 declined was only notified of this 3/2/22.  1st notice sent- 3/2 Member called in and advised me to rerun pmt as there was $ in the account', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-02 11:10:27', '2022-03-02 13:20:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087879003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '03.02.22:  Emailed Jim to inform him of my further communications w/Melissa, resulting in her notifyng me she has sent a memo to her entire team directing them to talk only about the preventive care of our members'' MEC, not other services and deductibles, etc. and if the member has a questions about other services, for the Planstin team to direct them to the MPB Concierge team.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-03-02 10:43:53', '2022-03-02 10:43:53'),
