  ('zcrm_1579374000087815048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081509011', 'Tammy Goen', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to change plans to the Care + because of the spotty network providers.  I will notify Planstin &amp; change plan in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-02 09:49:15', '2022-03-02 09:49:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087847003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090686002', 'Brandee Poland', NULL, 'First call went great. She explained how her current plan with her employer is unaffordable (1000+ for the whole family of 4) and that the coverage is inadequate. She recently had a child and had to pay out 6500 on the delivery. Sending her over some information and will follow up tomorrow.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-03-02 09:48:36', '2022-03-02 09:48:36'),
