  ('zcrm_1579374000087801003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081882009', 'Raymond Diaz', NULL, 'No response. Mailbox full. Not able to leave message. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-02 07:32:46', '2022-03-02 07:32:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087763011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080015002', 'Betsy Muller', NULL, '3-1-2022:  Betsy called.  We looked up HCBB together for her Thyroid Ultrasound.  She can now get in to look things up as she needs them.  
     - I also sent her the 2 PHCS MultiPlan Mammography facilities nearest her.  She says these are not very convenient.  We decided she''s going to make sure the doctor will be ordering a ''preventative sceening mammogram''. so Planstin will pay & it needs to be in network.   If it will be anything else, she knows the network will not matter, but her 1k IUA will kick-in.  Per her:  years ago they did a biopsy.  But, her last mammogram about 3 yrs ago was completely clear.  Therefore, she thinks it is a screening, but will double check.  Plus with the issues being >24 months since any treatment, etc., she doesn''t think it will be pre-x (although, we went over how that works in case).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-01 16:34:41', '2022-03-01 16:34:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087712033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, 'Brian called in requesting a proof of coverage for his son''s college. I explained that this is called a "Proof of Coverage" letter that Zion Health provides to our members who have school aged children. Brian immediately began to get irritated because with all of the emails and cards he has received he should already have this information. I attempted to explain to Brian that this is not something that every member requires, and it is something that he would have to request from Zion Health. Brian continued to get irritated and insisted that this is something that should already be provided to him, he shouldn''t have to speak with anyone but the concierge team. I again tried explaining to Brian that this is not something that every MPB.Health member needs, so it is something that needs to be requested by the member. I offered to transfer Brian to Zion, he got huffy with me but agreed. Upon releasing him for the transfer, I tried to tell Brian to have a lovely evening, but he scoffed, so I transferred him to Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-01 15:11:14', '2022-03-01 15:11:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087763003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238233', 'Michelle McCaster', NULL, '3-1-2022:  Michelle McCaster called to cancel.   She was very upset that I needed her to make the request to Zach & very short and angry.  I tried to transfer her to Zach & my entire GoTo system froze!  I couldn''t transfer her, couldn''t get back to her, couldn''t hang-up the call, nothing!  I called Zach from my cell & asked him to call her since he needs to tt her first.  Just as I was hanging up w/Zach, I finally could see her GoTo call end.  He''s going to apologize, talk with her about the cancellation, send her the cancellation link, and notify Patti once it''s okay to process her cancellation.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-01 15:07:12', '2022-03-01 15:23:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087743066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830254', 'Robert Brown', NULL, 'Member will be turning 65 during month of 4/22 I will notify member &amp; adviosr', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-01 13:27:29', '2022-03-01 13:27:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087761008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, 'Nathan called in and stated that next month he will be turning 26 years old and that is when a child that is under their parents plan has to drop off and be on their own plan, by law anywhere. So, he was asked who he needs to talk with to go over his options. I let Nathan know that he would have to go back to the Advisor that sold the plan to his mother Melinda which is Wendy. I told Nathan that she will be able to answer any questions he might have to Wendy will be the one to enroll him once or if he has chosen a plan, etc. I gave him Wendy''s phone number for Nathan to give her a call, if she doesn''t answer to please leave a voicemail and just briefly say his reason for calling and she always gets back to everyone. That''s is all he needed for the moment and is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-03-01 13:22:24', '2022-03-01 13:22:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087743061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624001', 'Rachel Holden', NULL, 'Member sent in email about HSA docs for the tax year.  It was very unclear as to what she needed.  I left her a VM letting her know that she will be getting a 1095 from Planstin and that she didn''t need to wait to file her Taxes.  Told her to call me back if she had any further questions.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-01 13:18:58', '2022-03-01 13:18:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087743056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023370023', 'Heather Seasonwein', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 50-64 age band I will notify member &amp; advisor &amp; update billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-01 12:54:16', '2022-03-01 12:54:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087761003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496017', 'Asiye Erdilek', NULL, 'Asiye called in and needed some help with a few prescription coupons. She was THRILLED at the pricing I was able to find her. She initially only called in for the 1 prescription she has and is going to pick up. After hearing the pricing for that one she then asked if I could possibly look up these other 3 for her. I said of course no issue at all. Asiye was so so happy with the findings and I emailed all 4 of the coupons over to her to use when she picks up the prescriptions. The lowest price was also at Costco which she said made things so much easier for her then where they were called into, also upon looking at the pharmacy she was going to go to it was a lot more expensive. So, everything worked out for her perfectly and Asiye was astounded by the help and effort that I put in to help her out on short notice. Asiye couldn''t be more happy and satisfied with her plan and the Concierge help that is provided. She asked for my name personally to thank me and MPB.Health for the amazing job we do, she stated. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-03-01 12:52:38', '2022-03-01 12:52:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087743051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656193', 'Char Moe', NULL, 'Member will be turning 50 4/22 I will notify member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-01 12:32:40', '2022-03-01 12:32:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087743043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082589012', 'Bryan Moore', NULL, 'Per Vanessa at the time of the Welcome call with this member she was told that the Primary on this membership was the member''s son. It should be Bryan Moore. I think it was autofilled at the time of the enrollment.  I spoke to Melissa at Planstin and she told me that she would change it on her end and that I could change it on our end and it would be ok.  They will also be sending out new cards.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-01 12:18:15', '2022-03-01 12:19:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087712028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080233002', 'Rebecca Renner', NULL, 'Rebecca called requesting lists for PHCS in-network providers for a mammogram and colonoscopy. I did send both lists, but I also advised Rebecca to reach out to Planstin directly if the mammography center that I found almost 90 miles away does not work for her.  ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-01 11:40:20', '2022-03-01 11:40:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087732028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082589012', 'Bryan Moore', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-01 11:28:41', '2022-03-01 11:28:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087712023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447348', 'Iris Frieling', NULL, 'Iris called with questions regarding her IUA that she has paid on and wondering if Zion applied the $200 that she sent to meet her $1,000 IUA amount so that she can proceed with a procedure. I transferred Iris to Zion for her answer. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-01 10:56:56', '2022-03-01 10:56:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087758003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167692', 'Andrew (Andy) Ioele', NULL, '3-1-22 Andy chose an Anthem plan through a long time friend who''s a  broker. He''s getting a subsidy too. I let him know that might be significantly less in 2023 and the problems he experienced with the PHCS network will hopefully be resolved by then.  He wound up paying about $3K for his colonoscopy since so many parts were out of network. He now realizes he should have called me for help. I told him the most he should have paid is $1000 IUA. Ugh. He did it in July 2021, so it''s too far past to try to go back and get reimbursed. He just didn''t have the capacity to fit it at the time since he bought a new condo. He was super nice and appreciative. He just wants something to be easy. He''ll call me if things change.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-01 10:46:00', '2022-03-01 10:46:00'),
