  ('zcrm_1579374000087712003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086528002', 'Cynthia Colandrea', NULL, 'Cynthia called inquiring about her husband''s CirrusMD services. Cynthia and Frank both have unique email addresses but share the same cell phone number. I have reached out to CirrusMD support because this is the first time I have experienced this type of situation when a member is signing up for their CirrusMD services. I also CC''d Cynthia on the email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-01 07:25:26', '2022-03-01 07:25:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087646034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084311002', 'Cynthia Delgado', NULL, '2-28-2022:  Looked up online prices for her.  GoodRXs contact:  GeniusRX.com had the best pricing for what I could find.  the Levothyroxine 88mcg tabs is only about $4 more for 180 = $19.80 (free s&h);  Estradiol 0.5mg #90 is about $1 more online at $7.20.  Her Progesterone ''Micro'' 100mg #90 was hard to find (unless the regular is an option) -  however, the regular was 4 to 8 times as expensive online!  The prices do not hold when I copy the links & I let her know that in the e-mail.  I also let her know because these are cheap generics, our worldwide shopper is not a good option (per Ried).  Nor do we use these online company(s) so I cannot speak to their service. 
     - Never did hear back from her re: SalesIQ question.  LM for her on Friday.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-28 18:09:51', '2022-02-28 18:09:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087646029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022809040', 'Pamela Finch', NULL, '2-28-2022:  Pamela e-mailed saying she hasn''t rec''d her Planstin cards yet.  Jennifer Thorin-Savard helped me  because I didn''t have access &amp; she req''d the cards.  She contacted them again today &amp; they said they are sending them out today (again?).  I let Pam know via  e-mail they said they sent the pdf &amp; hardcopy cards (either for first time or again) &amp; pdf should be there by tomorrow if reqirement processing overnight &amp; hardcopy in ~ 4 weeks.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-28 17:59:01', '2022-02-28 17:59:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087678008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005454035', 'William Valentine', NULL, '2-28-22 Missing commission for Sharon and William on Jan. 2022 statement. Plan ID is 63312CO0600053-01. Sending email to Broker Support.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-28 17:38:19', '2022-02-28 17:38:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087646024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070248114', 'John Spalvins', NULL, '2-28-2022:  John''s hand got hurt (smashed or tweaked or something w/a suitcase) and it swelling a lot.  He''s thinking he may have broken it, but Planstin told him he had a huge ded...  I went over this will be thru Zion, his healthsharing comp.  That his Planstin card was purely for Preventative Care.  Orig his partner (Jill Bryant) w/him beside her, was discussing Urgent Care, then they asked about telehealth.  I told them they could easily contact CirrusMD & went over he has an account, download to smartphone?, etc., because it would be no charge, but that they may require he see a doc in person.  I sent the temp for submitting a ''Need'' to Zion & went over detailed inv w/coding, proof of pymts, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-28 16:44:57', '2022-02-28 16:44:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087646013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, '2-28-2022:  Kimberly e-mailed info@mympb.com wanting to know:
     "From: Kimberly Baldwin <kimberlybaldwin@boulderco.com>
     Sent: Friday, February 25, 2022 5:30:23 PM
     To: Julia Avalon <info@mympb.com>
     Subject: Re: Your MPB.Health Plan 
          Hi Kelly,
          Who can I contact to get an order for a diagnostic mammogram versus a 3d imaging?  I just spoke to 
          Boulder Community Health about scheduling that and they told me I would need an order faxed in.  
          Thank you very much. "

I responded w/e-mail:  Diagnostic (Not prev) goes thru Zion healthshare w/IUA of 1k.  PCP can order (we do not order tests here).  Sent temp for starting a ''Need'' w/Zion separately.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-28 15:14:00', '2022-02-28 15:14:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087646008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746009', 'Jill Bryant', NULL, '2-28-2022:  Jill''s been working to find a cardiologist for an issue.  We were discussing healthsharing, so I encouraged her to start a ''Need'' w/Zion w/all the bills she''s had asap - sent her the temp for submitting bills to Zion.  Went over the 6 mos deadline, etc.  She''s at &gt;$400 right now, but in the early stages.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-28 14:48:41', '2022-02-28 14:48:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087642033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088976024', 'Miss Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, 'Emailed Jocelyn on the 25th. Called Jocelyn today no answer will call and email again later in the week.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2022-02-28 14:43:55', '2022-02-28 14:43:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087652023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084311010', 'Marcella Friel', NULL, 'Left detailed message and sent another welcome call scheduler. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-28 14:37:47', '2022-02-28 14:37:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087652018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073437039', 'Karyn Griffin', NULL, 'Karyn called needed lists for in-network providers for mammography/ultrasound. I advised Karyn that she can use the same list of mammography providers for her ultrasound but to keep in mind that ultrasounds are not included in her preventative mammogram. She understood. I sent her a list of in-network mammography centers along with requesting new Planstin cards for her. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-28 13:56:40', '2022-02-28 13:56:40'),
