  ('zcrm_1579374000087646003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, '2-28-2022:  Debbie called from Mexico.  They needed to update their physical &amp; e-mail addresses, so I sent them Patti''s Plan Change temp.  They are also wanting to move payment to a different account.  I also sent Patti''s Pymt Chg temp for that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-28 13:09:15', '2022-02-28 13:09:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087629013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763189', 'Karen Levine', NULL, 'Member will be turning 65 eff 4/22.  I will notify Member &amp; Wendy about this.  I have reached out to Wendy to let her know that Karen''s dependent Solina Kennedy per the notes below is currently sick w/Malaria.  Since her coverage will end when mother''s plan ends, Wendy should get with them to enroll Solina for a 4/1 start so as not to interrupt coverage.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-28 13:01:52', '2022-02-28 13:01:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087618008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890002', 'Bonita Keith', NULL, '2-28-2022:  Bonita called in because she hadn''t heard back from her above chat.  She''s high risk for breast cancer & the doctor has her doing annual mammograms.  Solis came up as in network when I ran the search for her prev, but they are not coming up in the search now.  However, Solis is telling her they are still a part of the network.  She''s going to do 2 things: 1) tt Planstin, to find out what she needs to do since she''s high risk & in the 40-49 age group  - what does she need to do to make sure her annual mammogram is paid for.  2)  Call PHCS to confirm Solis.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-28 12:45:17', '2022-02-28 12:45:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087629008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011261', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, 'Member aging into the 60 age band.  I will notify member &amp; Wendy &amp; change billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-28 12:42:58', '2022-02-28 12:42:58'),
