  ('zcrm_1579374000087618003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016721056', 'Susan Crocker', NULL, '2-28-2022:  Susan called, trying to figure out who she saw for her mammogram.  We decided it was prob back in 6/2019 when she would have been on ASI.  I tt Patti though, &amp; she didn''t think having her call them was a good idea.  So, Susan &amp; I worked on calling her Medicare comp (Anthem BCBS) to see how mammograms will work on her new plan instead.  She seemed happy with that resolution.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-28 12:24:46', '2022-02-28 12:24:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087614002', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890002', 'Bonita Keith', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 1372 Question : Hi, there!! I have a mammogram appt coming up this week and I just want to confirm that Solis Mammography is still in the PHCS network. And what do I need to present to them to ensure that the visit (included in our Secure plan) is covered?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-02-28 12:21:00', '2022-02-28 12:21:00'),
