  ('zcrm_1579374000087603008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '02.28.22:  Called and spoke w/Melissa Lilley, Assist. Manager of Customer Service for Planstin, re: James Lee''s conversation with Celeste/Planstin.  Learned that Jim''s provider coded his wellness appt. as an office out-patient visit, not a preventive care visit.  James also had 3 labs done that are not considered or coded as preventive.  Texted Jim to ask if he is free for a call w/me today to discuss my conversation with Melissa at Planstin. He responded he can talk at either 1 pm or 3 pm.  I told him to call at his convenience, either time.
Jim called and explained his conversation w/Celeste.  He said he''s friends w/his doctor and will straighten out this issue with him.  Jim said he had a lipid panel done (which is preventive) and then requested 2 more labs that he knows are not considered preventive and is willing to pay for.  I told him to let me know how it goes and if he needs further assistance.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-02-28 11:57:31', '2022-02-28 12:21:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087590046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480124', 'Wendy Summerfield', NULL, 'Member''s dependents Logan &amp; Keegan will be aging out 4/1/2022 I will notify member &amp; advisor and adjust billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-28 11:56:32', '2022-02-28 11:56:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087552028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016721056', 'Susan Crocker', NULL, 'Susan called in because she had a mammogram done in 2020 and was wondering if that was information we held onto. I explained that we would not have that information, but that Planstin may have it since that was her MEC when she had a plan. I transferred Susan to Planstin. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-28 11:50:30', '2022-02-28 11:50:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087590041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, 'Member called in and thought he had been double billed back in August/2021.  I looked into it and his CC had declined si he submitted new bank info and payment was reran.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-28 11:43:12', '2022-02-28 11:43:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087603003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '02.27.22:  Emailed Jim I''d be contacting Planstin to discuss his issue with Celeste, Planstin customer service rep.,  and I would also like to schedule a call with him to discuss resolution of his preventive care visit.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-02-28 11:39:46', '2022-02-28 11:39:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087598013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, '2-28-2022:  Whitney called.  He realized he was dbl billed for his mo contribution one month last year.  Trans him directly to Patti - he''ll LM if she isn''t able to pick-up.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-28 11:36:39', '2022-02-28 11:36:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087590036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086942001', 'James Evans, Jr.', NULL, 'Jimmy called in to verify that his K1 would be ok as proof of Ind Cont status.  Looks ok.  I called to let him know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-28 11:34:20', '2022-02-28 11:34:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087590031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008844025', 'Kay Mayer', NULL, 'Member called in saying she had fraud on her card and wanting to update I sent her the email and left her a VM.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-28 11:31:12', '2022-02-28 11:31:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087600008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380257', 'Rachel Brisson', NULL, '2-28-22 Rachel Brisson called bc she''s been getting the runaround from Zion''s Customer Service Team.  Rachel had an aortic aneurysm on Jan. 7th and took Flight for Life and almost died!  She has 100''s of thousands of dollars in bills. She''s paid her $2500 plus an extra $1000 to get the doctors off of her back. She''s a bit panicked, needless to say. Zion sent her an email recently saying the review is complete and has been approved for sharing but the payments haven''t been made inspite of being told they will be made in that given week. That''s been happening for 3 weeks now. I asked her to send me a timeline of what''s happened and what''s been submitted. I will reach out to my contacts at Zion to get this moving forward. I will also send her the Needs Tracker to use if she chooses.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-28 11:26:22', '2022-02-28 11:26:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087598008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070370104', 'Douglas Dester', NULL, '2-28-2022:  Denise is seeing a holistic doc who is having her get some labwork done.  She''s wondering if a non-network doc orders the prev labs, will Planstin pay for that side.  I told her if it''s coded as prev, and one of the few items that is cov they might.  Also, even other items that are not covered, if run thru an in network lab, those items often kick back at a discounted network rate.  But, I trans her directly to Planstin for confirmation since they determine those items.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-28 11:20:15', '2022-02-28 11:20:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087587013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082410002', 'Nicholas Burdick', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-28 11:18:09', '2022-02-28 11:18:09'),
