  ('zcrm_1579374000087552023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048143018', 'AJ Chamberlin', NULL, 'AJ called because she needed to know how to download the Spruce app for her Redirect plan. I have never worked with the Spruce app personally, but I did let her know where to download it and then I asked if she would like some assistance from Redirect as well and she said yes. I transferred AJ to Redirect for further assistance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-28 10:41:28', '2022-02-28 10:41:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087600003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048143018', 'AJ Chamberlin', NULL, '2-28-22 Alex called bc she has an appt in 1 hour at the chiropractor''s office. She''s 20 and I told her she needs to communicate with Redirect for that portion of her membership bc they are the company that will approve and pay for that. She doesn''t have the app on her phone yet either. I gave her the Concierge # to call them for further assistance to get the app and contact Redirect.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-28 10:38:57', '2022-02-28 10:38:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087598003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086942001', 'James Evans, Jr.', NULL, '2-28-2022:  Jimmy called to let me know he uploaded proof of self-employment.  It doesn''t look like it''s one of the items req''d, so I trans him to Patti so she can verify if they need something different.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-28 10:21:11', '2022-02-28 10:21:11'),
