  ('zcrm_1579374000087552018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072471064', 'Rosalyn McHenry', NULL, 'Rosalyn called in inquiring about cataract surgery. I explained that unless it was deemed medically necessary that it is an out-of-pocket expense. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-28 09:23:50', '2022-02-28 09:23:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087587003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-28 08:20:26', '2022-02-28 08:20:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087552013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081059002', 'Vikas Kumar', NULL, 'The Kumar''s called in this AM because their son hurt his ankle and they were wondering where to begin. I let them know that they can always start with CirrusMD, but in instances such as injuries they can choose where they would like to go and present themselves as self-paying and to be sure to collect all superbills associated with this injury in case it goes above their selected $1,000 IUA. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-28 07:32:33', '2022-02-28 07:32:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087552008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, 'Note from 2/26/2022: James called into the concierge team because he had some concerns regarding a bill (it was an EOB from Planstin) he received from his annual wellness visit and a conversation he had with Seleste at Planstin. He received an EOB from Planstin stating that the balance from his annual wellness visit that is supposed to be included with his preventative MEC coverage from Planstin will be put towards his $3,000 DEDUCTIBLE??? that he has to meet with Planstin. James then asked Seleste to explain what she meant further because he had no idea that he had a deductible to meet with Planstin. Seleste said that not only does James have to meet his 3 $1,000 IUA''s with Zion, but that he also had to meet a $3,000 deductible with Planstin as well. James relayed to Seleste that he did not think this was accurate as this was not stated when he signed up for his plan. Seleste then told James that she did not care what MPB.Health was telling him, that MPB.Health is completely wrong in explaining the plan to James and that she didn''t care what the owner of MPB.Health had to say, she was right and MPB.Health was wrong. James, being as well informed as he is on his plan, decided to call in to the MPB.Health concierge team to inform us of what Planstin was telling him regarding a deductible. I have escalated this issue to James'' advisor, Joan Phelps, and she will be making the necessary calls to Planstins administration to resolve this issue. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-28 07:22:42', '2022-02-28 07:22:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087552003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083981002', 'Steve Laube', NULL, 'Welcome call completed on 2/26/2022 ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-28 07:08:38', '2022-02-28 07:08:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087523008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '02.25.22:  Emailed Denise in response to her question asking if Redirect provides membership cards.  They provide a digital card found on the Spruce app.  They will also provide a hard copy if the member requests it.  Denise emailed back, they did recently provide one to her.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-02-27 14:27:11', '2022-02-27 14:31:41'),
