  ('zcrm_1579374000087473031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069918001', 'Joseph Hatch', NULL, '2-25-2022:  Sent all new RX coupons.  Costco is least exp on most items.  One item I sent coupons at both Smith''s RX &amp; Int Mtn Pharmacy.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-25 19:26:41', '2022-02-25 19:26:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087473026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084311002', 'Cynthia Delgado', NULL, '2-25-2022:  Cynthia couldn''t get into her MPB.Health portal.  It looks like the e-mail address (which she knew was input inaccurately in the beginning, but she thought was fixed) is still wrong.  I found it in Admin123 & that got her in.
     - She''s wanting to see if we can price the RXs from 2/3/2022 as mail order, rather than local.  
     - She sent thru a chat on SalesIQ that was fwd''d to me re: find a doc (she''s looking at the DPC Map on Zion, is that the same?  I  LM for her, plez call, those are doctors for a diff program.  I will help her.  Did not hear back this Fri pm...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-25 19:24:30', '2022-02-25 19:24:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087473021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086225001', 'John Donovan', NULL, '2-25-2022:  John called -- phew.  A lot of questions.  I asked if they sched their ''Welcome Call''...
     - He has a cycst on his should her wants to get taken care of, how would he do that.  First, his memb is not eff until 3/1/22.  The we went over cash pay to the 5k IUA, call us if he thinks this will be something that expensive so we can start a ''need''.
     - Wants to have his counseling started -- went over MAP, again his plan is eff: 3/1/22.  Showed him MAP assistance ph # so he can call to see if counselor''s in his area.  They live in expensive area though, so he''s sure they won''t have any.  I sugg virtual maybe?  We went over how counseling structured, but can pay during waiting periods.
     - Wanted to go over prev.  I sugg & showed him how to sched his ''Welcome Call'' so he could get all these questions ans, but reminded him his memb needs to be effective, so they can help him setup some of the items on his plan.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-25 18:07:18', '2022-02-25 18:07:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087473016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, '2-25-2022:   Michelle called w/questions around seeing a podiatrist.  She thought she has access to HCBB but can''t get in.  I can''t get her in either.  I''ve tried Jennifer, Patti, Joan, and now have a Teams chat into John.  Told Michelle I''ll try to have an answer Mon.     - CA

