  ('zcrm_1579374000087473008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '2-25-2022:  Jim called back regarding some issues w/Planstin.  I took a mess & sent the following message from him to both Joan & Jennifer to keep them in the loop.     - CA:
 "[3:43 PM] Cari A.
Hi Joan (I''m sending to Jennifer too),  Re: Jim Lee - he called back.  He spoke to Seleste at Planstin (he thinks that''s how she spelled it).  Seleste told him she knows she is right & the owner of MPB can call & she''ll tell him (this was around the deductibles, etc., as I understand it).  From their discussion, Jim is thinking It may be a coding issue & tried to have that conversation with Seleste, to no avail.  At his appointment, he discussed w/his doc''s office that everything needs to be coded as ''prev'', but the doc''s office said they just code everything as office visit.  He tried to continue the conversation around coding must be preventative but they totally blew him off as if he had no idea what he was talking about.  He''s going in on Monday to discuss with the doctor''s office again.  Hopefully, this make sense...  Thanks, Cari"

"PS Forgot to add: Seleste actually told Jim something to the extent that she didn''t care what our company told her, we didn''t know what we were talking about. That we were completely wrong. Nice, huh?"     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-25 15:49:08', '2022-02-25 16:03:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087473003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077233034', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, '2-25-2022:  Ashley is having her prev appt.  She found her doc in network & we went over everything Planstin.
