  ('zcrm_1579374000087409018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082060001', 'Shannon Cleary', NULL, 'Shannon emailed in regarding how to use the MSEAP/MAP program. My response to her email is below:
Good morning Shannon,

Thank you so much for reaching out to your MPB.Health concierge team this morning ? There are 3 ways in which you can get started with the MSEAP/MAP program once you have logged into their site https://mseap.personaladvantage.com/goodbye.jsp:
The Live Chat feature on the right side of the page once you have logged in.
You may call 1-800-543-5080
You may email info@mseap.com
Once you have started a conversation with a representative from the MSEAP/MAP program using any of the above options, inform them that you are a member with MPB.Health and they will be happy to assist you in finding a therapist.

Please let me know if there is anything else I can assist you with, I am always happy to help!

I hope you have a wonderful weekend!

Best Wishes,
Jennifer Thorin-Savard
MPB.Health Concierge Team
1-800-519-2969', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-25 08:40:32', '2022-02-25 08:40:32'),
