  ('zcrm_1579374000087381033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032206031', 'Bryan Tew', NULL, '2-24-2022:  I talked w/Bryan re: a ton of stuff on 2/22/22(?) & they were switching over my e-mail & I lost all my notes on him.  
     - One thing I was following-up w/him re: was his PCP wants to become a PHCS network doc & he can''t seem to get that to happen even w/3 requests over several years, verifying w/PHCS he''s inputting the requests properly, w/PHCS saying they are inviting his PCP & it''s in process, yet his doctor has never been contacted.  I asked Joan what to do.  She said that maybe his MEC comp could help light a fire under PHCS?  So, I called & let him know that is maybe an avenue he hasn''t yet tried.  He said he hadn''t, so he''ll call them (he''s got their # on his card).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-24 16:50:09', '2022-02-24 16:50:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087381028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070370104', 'Douglas Dester', NULL, '2-24-2022:  Denise called w/questions on using her prev care.  She was able to find her pdf card & she will give to her doc for submitting w/her lab work order (her doc mentioned LabCorp & Quest which happen to be in network).  Disc what is cov on labs & having them bill everything so if not cov, kicks back at network disc price.  Her doc is holistic, so she''s thinking she may not be in network.  We talked about what is & is not cov & gvmt ACA MEC site - I sent her the prev/network temp.  Went over calling Planstin ahead if quest on what will be paid if she''s unsure.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-24 16:48:37', '2022-02-24 16:48:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087381023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006239', 'Kim Lucey', NULL, '2-24-2022:   Kim called,  she says she didn''t rec Patti''s e-mail from yesterday.  Cut &amp; paste it into another e-mail today &amp; resent.  She''ll ck her spam too if she does not see anything.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-24 16:18:35', '2022-02-24 16:18:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087381018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078533002', 'Candy Rogers', NULL, '2-24-2022:  Candy called &amp; has no idea what she has purchased.  
