  ('zcrm_1579374000087381008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772001', 'Michael Radlovic', NULL, '2-24-2022:  tt Michael, he''s trying to get setup w/a doc in the Planstin network.  He''s very confused on the diff aspects of his plan, but it sounds like he spoke to Planstin to find an in network doc for his prev/annaul appt.
