  ('zcrm_1579374000087314026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084818001', 'Daniel McManus', NULL, 'Daniel called and he was looking to book a therapy appointment. I explained the MAP program to him, and he was so happy to hear that he has access to this program. He asked for MAPs direct phone number, I transferred him directly to the MAP program, and I also provided emailed instructions on how to access the MAP program via their website. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-24 13:49:34', '2022-02-24 13:49:34'),
