  ('zcrm_1579374000087314003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080702012', 'Jonathan Bill', NULL, 'Jonathan called from his providers office because he was getting ready to have a wellness check-up and was unsure what to present to the office. I asked if he had verified that the provider was in the PHCS network, and he stated that the provider was in-network. I explained how to present his Planstin card and also advised Jonathan to remind his provider that everything in this visit should be coded as a wellness visit. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-24 07:09:04', '2022-02-24 07:09:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087240137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089240642', 'Rick Sanders', NULL, 'Rick emailed back asking if prices was within his age group. is an employer so asked if he can take sometime to research the product and will email back when has found time.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2022-02-23 18:22:18', '2022-02-23 18:22:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087290013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084651019', 'Nicole Sylvestre', NULL, '2-23-22:  Sent 4 of 5 coupons on RX quote req.  But, had to make a ton of assumptions.  One doesn''t list a strength, so I just asked for that strength &amp; let them know I can adjust anything needed.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-23 18:02:15', '2022-02-23 18:02:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087280054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056557001', 'Anders Rasker', NULL, '2-23-22 Roseann called to get help with Anders Need. She submitted the Need around 11/19/21 and paid the $1000 IUA on 11/19/21. She received a HIPPA form from Zion allowing her to help with Anders. So, they are making progress but not fast enough bc she''s getting a bill from hospital and doctor to hurry up and pay the rest. I told her to call Zion directly and I sent her the Needs Tracker to document what she''s done moving forward to get them to pay ASAP before it goes to collections. She received an Explanation of Benefits from Planstin and Zion. One stated that they hadn''t reached the IUA and the other stated that  a Need needed to be created even though she created it way back. So, she will call them and nudge them to move forward ASAP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-23 16:33:30', '2022-02-23 16:33:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087290008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964202', 'Tracy Goodemote', NULL, '2-23-2022:  Tracy called.  He needs to start a ''need'' w/Zion.  Sent him template &amp; gave instruction on paying his 1k IUA &amp; attaching proof of pymt along w/detailed inv w/med codes. 
     - Helped him into the MPB.Health portals for other items as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-23 16:28:52', '2022-02-23 16:28:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087280049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165317', 'Melody Fairchild', NULL, '2-23-22 Glen wants to understand what Melody needs to do to go to a new doctor. I''m not sure if it''s for wellness or otherwise. I left vm and told him to call me or Concierge for help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-23 16:15:20', '2022-02-23 16:15:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087290003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, '2/23/2022:  Nanci called - Sedera was telling her mamm are now only every-other-year &amp; she wanted to confirm.  I helped her find the curr info on that &amp; colonoscopies in their curr guidelines so she could see it &amp; knew where to find it.  I also let her know the guidelines can change as much a quarterly, so it''s always good to look ahead like she did this time.  She may try to get on a sched where she uses a local center out-of-pkt in the off years.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-23 15:40:05', '2022-02-23 15:40:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087280033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061255020', 'Timothy Cobbett', NULL, '2-23-22 I spoke with Alison about her mammogram that Zion isn''t sharing the cost which was $225. Alison works in health care and sees women with breast cancer all the time and prefers to get this done every year since she turned 40. After talking it through she will see if she can show proof of high risk since so many other types of issues can lead to breast cancer. Otherwise, I recommended she talk with her DPC and ask for discounted rate on mammogram next time. She uses Pure Family Practice with Dr. Bubb (?). She also was bummed not to get acupuncture and chiro visits shared. I explained the pre-approval process is necessary and she needs to decide if it''s worth submitting as a new need or if it''s more as preventative measure. She will ponder what makes sense in her case. She has been treating swollen feet and join pain going every week or more. I let her know there will need a to a diagnosis, treatment plan, cost and end date of therapy. She gets it and will call Jennifer back to get process and to get phone number for Life Care and that process.  She will benefit from Life Care bc she and son are on ADHD meds which are controlled substances and will love the counseling portion of the membership. I let her know pre-x for the mental health is not relevant since it''s not through Zion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-23 14:46:35', '2022-02-23 14:46:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087277008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', NULL, 'Hillary called regarding her email below. It was in fact a billing issue between Planstin and the laboratory. I explained to Hillary that the concierge team cannot step in when it comes to billing due to not having HIPAA certification and that she would have to speak with Planstin directly. Hillary then said that Diane promised her that this would be taken care of and that it should be done and over with. I explained again why the concierge team could not talk to Planstin or the laboratory regarding her billing situation due to HIPAA privacy laws. She was not happy with that answer but did ask that I transfer her to Planstin. I have also made Diane aware of the fact that we here on the concierge team are limited when it comes to billing issues and that we do not do any negotiations for our members due to HIPAA. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-23 14:36:09', '2022-02-23 14:36:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087240084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062037239', 'Patricia Milazzo', NULL, 'Member never ended up submitting Cancellation, so she never got cancelled.  I will refund February &amp; March Share Amounts', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-23 12:47:54', '2022-02-23 12:47:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087240079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082614002', 'AMY TANTAU', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to cancel.  I asked if she had spoken to Leslie and she said that she had.  I will send her out the link to the Cancellation Form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-23 12:13:10', '2022-02-23 12:13:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087240074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006239', 'Kim Lucey', NULL, 'Member called in and let me know that she has had BCBS since 1/1/22 and saw the invoice come in and needs to cancel our membership.  I advised that I could refund the share amount that was just billed.  She is ok with that.  I will copy Paul on the cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-23 11:41:28', '2022-02-23 11:41:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087269004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084640027', 'Malinda Russo', NULL, '02.23.22:  On 2/21/22 enrolled Emily Hubbard , daughter of Cindy Hubbard who was referred by Malinda,  for a 3/1/22 start date.  Emailed Malinda informing her I enrolled Emily and she will be receiving a referral fee once Emily is a member for 2 mos.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-02-23 11:41:21', '2022-02-23 11:41:21'),
