  ('zcrm_1579374000087280003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064410489', 'Michael DePaso', NULL, '2-23-22 I left vm for Mike to help his son per an online chat that Julia shared with me. Likely wants CARE+ since son is 24 and not likely to do annual wellness visits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-23 10:08:58', '2022-02-23 10:08:58'),
