  ('zcrm_1579374000087240039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692364', 'Brandi Weaver', NULL, 'Member has submitted cancellation request citing the fact that she never requested our service after we discontinued our partnership with Liberty.   She believes we are fraudulently billing her.  She wants a refund of her payment back to 2018 by end of month 2/22.  I have left a VM for both Nancy &amp; Traci on this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-23 09:55:53', '2022-02-23 09:55:53'),
