  ('zcrm_1579374000087214003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084651019', 'Nicole Sylvestre', NULL, '2-22-2022:  Shannon called for several items:
     - She wants to update their pymt form.  I sent her Patti''s temp, remindered her to dbl ck the # because often people invert or add extra digits, & went over cc vs EFT.
