  ('zcrm_1579374000087137033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081205002', 'Tessa Tarr', NULL, 'Tessa called with questions regarding her recent ER visit. She presented herself perfectly at the ER and paid $50, and she also collected the detailed billing. I sent Tessa the information on how to upload her needs to Zion and she is going to begin uploading any bills she currently has for this ER visit in case it goes above her $1000 IUA. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-22 14:26:52', '2022-02-22 14:26:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087196019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059474061', 'James Pendleton', NULL, '2-22-22 Linda Johnston and James Pendeleton called to sort out his wellness visit from 5/24/21. The doctor made some errors on the original bill tying a TSH lab to atrial fib which then kicked the entire visit out of wellness and into diagnostic with a $2046 bill! The doctor has since recognized his own error and removed the TSH lab from the bill since it was never requested or desired. The bill should reflect only well adult exam and well adult labs. Jim paid $500 to Good Samaritans / SCL Billing and somehow has a $300 credit with the hospital. But, he shouldn''t be paying anything for his wellness exam. He even had the visit pre-approved on 12/20/20 (?). I suggested they contact Planstin since they are the ones who will be paying and resolving this issue. They will do so and let me know if they have any further problems.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-22 14:15:13', '2022-02-22 14:15:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087202018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079839002', 'Richard Goecke', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 1352 Question : I''m trying to get my healthcare reimbursement account to refund my monthly contributions. They denied the request as they need "The supporting documentation submitted is missing the premium coverage type. Submit a letter from your insurance carrier that includes the premium type." I sent the enrollment letter from you along with the last 3 months months of $685 contributions. This was not enough. Can you help me with the letter they are requesting?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-02-22 14:10:22', '2022-02-22 14:10:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087146083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086707002', 'Linda Pringle', NULL, '2-22-2022:   Linda called to get some direction -- she''s fully aware her membership starts 3/1/2022.  We went over the following:
     - She has a ''Welcome Call'' sched after 3/1/2022 (I referred to what she will learn multiple times)
     - She''s wanting to make a derm appt for after 3/1/2022.  We went over not prev, so not Planstin, so no network, but also may or may not be a qualified item for her healthshare & how to handle.  Sent her the temp for submitting a need to Zion in case it does need to be

- they were changing my e-mail & I lost the balance of my notes on this one.  As an after the moment thought... I cannot remember what else we went over.  However, it was a lot...    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-22 13:58:05', '2022-02-24 17:09:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087137028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084651012', 'Sheila deAnda', NULL, 'Sheila called regarding regenerative therapy and if Zion will cover it. I advised Sheila that she may want to speak with Zion Health directly to explain what the regenerative therapy entails. I warm transferred Sheila to Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-22 13:39:21', '2022-02-22 13:39:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087146078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038445150', 'Kenneth Van Horn', NULL, '2-22-2022:  Kenneth is having issues with his hip &amp; wanted to know where to start.  He''s going to go see his specialist, start a ''need'' with Sedera (sent him the temp on uploading to Sedera), and will call if has other questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-22 13:27:44', '2022-02-22 13:27:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087137023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689144', 'Lori Altman', NULL, 'Lori called with questions regarding the provider she was currently seeing for her preventative services. When she scheduled her appointment with this doctor, he was in the PHCS network, but when Lori called from his office (in the exam room) she stated that he said he was no long in the PHCS network. The provider had just joined a group practice which changed his tax ID number, which also made him no long a part of the PHCS network as of the morning of 2/22/2022. I explained to Lori that if she wanted her Planstin card to cover her preventative services she would have to find an in-network doctor, otherwise everything for this visit today will be an out-of-pocket expense. Lori was going to speak with the provider to see what they could work out, if she needs further assistance, she will call the concierge line. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-22 13:12:55', '2022-02-22 13:12:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087146073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476126', 'Robin Korosec', NULL, '2-22-2022:  Robin called in to find out what her rate will be when her husb ages into Medicare.  I did a direct transfer to Patti''s line &amp; let Robin know to LM if Patti could not pickup.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-22 12:55:25', '2022-02-22 12:55:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087188011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740011', 'Kathleen VanGoethem', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 1351 Question : where do I find the MAP portal link?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-02-22 12:52:26', '2022-02-22 12:52:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087195018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088976024', 'Miss Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, 'Called jocelyn to confirm is she was still prepared to move forward claimed was really busy this week and will reach back ASAP. looks like a close.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2022-02-22 12:28:41', '2022-02-22 12:28:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087137018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069080024', 'Jennifer Vasquez', NULL, 'Jennifer called with questions regarding a new OPD card and receiving one via PDF and also needed the MAP programs phone number. I reached out to Kelly F. who is going to print a new physical card for Jennifer and Kelly is also going to see if she is able to scan the new card and send it to Jennifer in a PDF email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-22 12:00:54', '2022-02-22 12:00:54'),
