  ('zcrm_1579374000087196003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087189037', 'Sue Wallace', NULL, '2-22-22 Sue is now 58 and Pat is 63. They are preparing for when Pat retires in 2 years to plan financially. Sue watched the video and seems to understand after I explained aspects of it again. She has had injuries and orthopedic needs in the past. But, it will be most important as to what happens in the next 2 years for her pre-x. She does her annual wellness visits every year. She will continue to do some contract work and make about $20K. Her husband will draw from his retirement accounts and make about $70K for a total of $90K as her best guess. It''s not worth running ins numbers at this point since it will likely change drastically in two years yet again as the APTC will likely be less post covid.  She is super nice and will keep my information on file to reach out to me in two years when they are ready to move forward with this. I quoted her SECURE $1000/$325 but she knows it will change by then.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-22 10:28:57', '2022-02-22 10:28:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087146053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083353010', 'Lauren Martty', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-22 10:17:20', '2022-02-22 10:17:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087139009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064410489', 'Michael DePaso', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 1350 Question : I’m already a member but want to check on rates for our son. I’m looking at medical sharing plan', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-02-22 09:59:03', '2022-02-22 09:59:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087146048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081693001', 'Jill Roberts', NULL, 'Left a detailed on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-22 09:32:02', '2022-02-22 09:32:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087146043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081693009', 'Steven Roberts', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-22 09:28:23', '2022-02-22 09:28:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087137013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890002', 'Bonita Keith', NULL, 'Bonita reached out to Kelly F. this AM regarding her MPB.Health Member Portal log-in information. Kelly F. asked if I would reach out to Bonita, which I did via phone and email. I had to leave a vm and I sent Bonita her log-in information after I verified that it is correct. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-22 09:20:50', '2022-02-22 09:20:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087146038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081866002', 'David Weiner', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-22 09:16:02', '2022-02-22 09:16:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087146033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081871002', 'Scott Newell', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-22 08:55:41', '2022-02-22 08:55:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087146028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081872001', 'Doreen Restucci', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-22 08:52:35', '2022-02-22 08:52:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087137008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081511002', 'Lindsey Smith', NULL, 'Lindsey was transferred to MPB.Health from Zion Health because she was very confused at which program to use for mental health services. Zion told her about their product and stated that she would have to call MPB.Health to add that program to her plan for $5-$10 more a month. I explained to Lindsey that MPB.Health has a different mental health service we provide to our members and then I explained the MAP program. I sent Lindsey the instructions on how to log-in to the MAP program and also advised her that if she has any questions about her plan to please contact the MPB.Health concierge team. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-22 08:52:30', '2022-02-22 08:52:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087146023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081875002', 'Franklin Zhuzhingo', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-22 08:47:31', '2022-02-22 08:47:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087146018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081878002', 'Rachel Osterland', NULL, 'Left a message with husband. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-22 08:44:46', '2022-02-22 08:44:46'),
