  ('zcrm_1579374000087151003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087125001', 'Robert West', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-22 07:41:45', '2022-02-22 07:41:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087146003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083475009', 'Mark Stevens', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Wife Michelle put another number when she booked welcome call but phone number had 11 digits instead of 10. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-22 07:39:14', '2022-02-22 07:39:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087137003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086946002', 'William Alemaghides', NULL, 'Asked member to reschedule his Welcome Call for some time after his March 1, 2022 start date. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-22 07:06:05', '2022-02-22 07:06:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087113046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084814001', 'James Rosenow', NULL, '2-21-2022:  James called, his address was inaccurate in the beginning and he never rec''d the cards he was told about in his ''Welcome Call''.  I verified both his e-mail : james.rosenow27@gmail.com  & mailing address:  James Rosenow 1361 South Greenfield Rd Apt#2028 Mesa, AZ 85206.  I asked Jennifer Thorin-Savard  to req both pdf & hard copy of his Planstin cards.  Then asked Kelly F to send him new MPB.Health w/QRCodes for him.  Both requests went via Teams chat because they were after their normal bus hours.  In case he has further issues, he will call me  3/4/22 or later if they have not arrived.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-21 18:17:32', '2022-03-08 17:55:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087113041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890002', 'Bonita Keith', NULL, '2-21-2022:   I LM for Bonita, I can tell her user name &amp; pw are still working.  Sent totally non-descript e-mail with her pw in it, but not identified as such.  Specified her user name in the VM.  Let her know our hours and to let us know if we can be of further assistance.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-21 17:29:58', '2022-02-21 17:29:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087113033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081634027', 'Julia Bolz', NULL, '2-21-2022:   Julia is totally confused.  We went over a ton.  I showed her the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail as a resource:
     - She''s frustrated the area she lives in doesn''t offer enough doctors in the PHCS Network (mostly male).  We got onto the search tool together & there are a few more than she thought, but even 10-miles was ''another community'' and she thought that was too far.  We discussed preventative options (out-of-pkt, HSA funds), what would normally be cov by Planstin, when she would present this card, the gvmt website to look at covered MEC items, purely prev, etc.  Once she realized the covered prev items would be paid & no chg to her, she seemed to feel better & may reconsider how she''s structuring her care.
     - Went over ACA MEC gvmt site for what''s covered & verifying w/Planstin if any questions.
     - Next, she wants to create a relationship w/a Univ doc for more critical items (broken leg, etc.).  She understands this is not a prev item, so would move to her healthshare coverage.  We discussed what to say: "cash pay patient"and she''d pay up to her $1000 IUA.  She felt better knowing she can pay for the intro appt herself, create the relationship, then  if/when something serious comes up (broken leg, etc), she''ll have a pre-existing relationship with a doctor in her area for qualified ''needs'' on her healthshare.
     - Sent her the HSA temp w/attachments so she can look into getting one setup.  She seemed to like this idea.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-21 17:04:16', '2022-02-21 17:06:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087113028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081509011', 'Tammy Goen', NULL, '2-21-22:  Joan heard back from Planstin &amp; they do not have any option for Tammy, except for the center 76-miles away.  They are "not in the business" of helping people find providers closer to them.  Last Friday, Planstin said they would notify Tammy that day.  Joan said she let her advisor Steve Remmel know as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-21 17:02:26', '2022-02-21 17:02:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087113023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342154', 'Samantha Jansky', NULL, '2-21-2022:  Samantha called tonight to cancel her membership.  Her husband got a new permanent position with benefits.  I transferred her directly to Wendy''s line so she could let Wendy know, then sent her the cancellation form since she''ll need it "after the talk".  I let Patti know via Teams chat that I''d already put her thru to Wendy too, so she''d know where we are in the process.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-21 17:01:08', '2022-02-21 17:01:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087121028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342154', 'Samantha Jansky', NULL, '2-21-22 Samantha''s husband got full benefits from their employer and it includes family at little cost to them. So, they are cancelling for March 1st, 2022. They are already covered by employer. She was sweet and excited at the prospect of referring new members and earning $100.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-21 16:52:08', '2022-02-21 16:52:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087113018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659360', 'Rachel Brenneman', NULL, '2-21-2022:
     - Chg of address:  she''s moved so I sent her Patti''s temp w/the chg form link.
     - We discussed a mammogram center in network near her.  Kelly F sent her a list about 1-1/2 ago, but she''s having trouble searching & getting the same results.  I''m not finding anything near her either (maybe Kelly F knows a better search method than I''ve been taught?).  
     She''s going to call & confirm the cntr she''s wanting (Aspen something) is in network thru Planstin.  Wendy Scipione let us know "need to make 100% certain they call in advance and make sure ALL aspects of the mammo remain in network. Up there they often send it to a non-network radiologist."  I read this to her & we discussed it to make sure she understood.
     - She wanted to tt Planstin before she calls the cntr.  I confirmed she has their corr ph # & then trans her directly.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-21 15:58:51', '2022-02-21 15:58:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087121023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967035', 'Margaret Randolph', NULL, '2-21-22 Left vm for Margaret to update her cc via the email sent by Patti.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-21 15:51:24', '2022-02-21 15:51:24');
