  ('zcrm_1579374000087051035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890002', 'Bonita Keith', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1348 Question : Hi! I am trying to log in to my MPB Health account. The password I thought I used is not working. And I can use the "forgot password" function because it asks for our Member ID, and I can''t seem to locate that information. It''s not on our MPB health cards. Can you help me?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-02-21 15:12:46', '2022-02-21 15:12:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087121018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '2-21-22 Someone from Dr. Patel''s office called Quentin. He didn''t know her name but she''s new. She helped him but he''s leaving town and wasn''t able to make the appt yet. He now understands he needs to use the Our Primary Doc card when he goes and that will solve the confusion. He very appreciative and understands he showed the wrong card creating the confusion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-21 15:01:32', '2022-02-21 15:01:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087121013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '2-21-22 I left Quentin a vm to let him know it''s getting sorted out with Dr. Varesh Patel and I should have a final thumbs up soon. I will call or email him when I have the final answer as to how to proceed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-21 14:56:03', '2022-02-21 14:56:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087121008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '2-21-22 Laurie Anthony spoke with Mitesh and wants to keep him as a member with Dr. Varesh Patel. I''d like to leave it alone as well. I will call Quentin and apologize for all of the confusion. I sent Mitesh proof of my communication with Laurie and our appointment on Nov. 11th confirming his membership and giving them access to the portal. I am not awaiting Mitesh''s response. Sounds like he will give Laurie the thumbs up to call Quentin to get him in for his appt.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-21 14:51:16', '2022-02-21 14:51:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087062141', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087060131', 'Emily Hubbard', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-21 14:44:34', '2022-02-21 14:44:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087052106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088976024', 'Miss Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, 'Texted Jocelyn to reconnect and schedule call to close more than interested as described in the email.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2022-02-21 14:41:44', '2022-02-21 14:41:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087052101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089240642', 'Rick Sanders', NULL, 'Called Rick and no answer. Texted him with waived enrollment promo within the week.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2022-02-21 14:40:12', '2022-02-21 14:40:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087062136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087122002', 'Robert Chupek', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-21 14:32:15', '2022-02-21 14:32:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087062131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603201', 'Kamaljeet Singh', NULL, 'Member called in to update Pmt info.  I sent out link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-21 14:25:17', '2022-02-21 14:25:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087124003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087060131', 'Emily Hubbard', NULL, '02.21.22:  Recvd. an email from Emily.  Asked me to call her to discuss the CARE PLUS plan.  Called, discussed plan. Emily said she wants to enroll.  Enrolled Emily today for a Marach 1 start date.  Explained the on-boarding process and scheduling a Welcome Call.  Sent a thank-you email.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-02-21 14:08:58', '2022-02-23 09:26:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087112033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084311010', 'Marcella Friel', NULL, 'Left detailed message and will be sending another Welcome Call scheduler for member to reschedule at a more convenient time. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-21 14:08:11', '2022-02-21 14:08:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087121003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601059', 'Jered Garrison', NULL, '2-21-22 Jered got a new job and they are paying nearly all of his plan cost except he now will pay only $40 a month! So, he''s cancelling and if anything changes he''ll come back. He also was excited to hear about the referral program and will be happy to refer people to me. Cancelling for March 1st 2022.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-21 13:52:48', '2022-02-21 13:52:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087112028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082405010', 'Mark Bailey', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! Mark lives in a very remote area, does not have a working cell phone and only has limited access to a computer. I explained to Mark that he is more than welcome to call the concierge team (he has a landline only) whenever he has a question or needs assistance, and we will be happy to help. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-21 13:43:12', '2022-02-21 13:43:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087113013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466094', 'Chad Broker', NULL, '2-21-2022:   Chad''s wife called back wondering how she gets a new RCI card so she can make an appt for her husband.  We went over how that card is only for prev -- this knee issue will not be preventative.  He''s going in for diagnostic &amp; treatment = will be something on his Sedera Healthsharing once they''ve pd their 2500 IUA (cash pay to that point).  Sent her the temp for submiting a ''need'' to Sedera.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-21 13:36:29', '2022-02-21 13:36:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087062123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921456', 'Joe LeFebre', NULL, 'Member''s 3/22 declined I email &amp; spoke to member he will update.  Member submitted update CC info I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-21 13:29:33', '2022-02-21 13:29:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087062118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061030', 'Denny Lewenkamp', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form.  Updated in Admin 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-21 13:26:55', '2022-02-21 13:26:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087112023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755162', 'Scott Yarbrough', NULL, 'Scott called regarding a screening colonoscopy that he has scheduled for this week. He advised me that he paid his $1000 IUA as a deposit for this test. I explained to Scott that I would have done this differently: I would have verified that the doctor is in the PHCS network and then gave my Planstin card information to the billing department. Before I could finish with Scott and explain things properly to him, he had to hang up. I asked Scott to give us a call back so that we can make sure he is heading in the right direction with this colonoscopy. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-21 13:23:32', '2022-02-21 13:23:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087062110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084530002', 'Paul Campanello', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update form I will send Conf email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-21 13:19:21', '2022-02-21 13:19:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087112018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084832001', 'Gail Cole', NULL, 'Welcome Call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-21 13:18:59', '2022-02-21 13:18:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087062105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466094', 'Chad Broker', NULL, 'Members spouse called in because member has a knee injury ans needs to see a provider.  I explained how it worked and will send her the PHCS Provider search Insturctions', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-21 13:18:17', '2022-02-21 13:18:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087062097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048228151', 'Jennifer Wright', NULL, 'Member 3/22 payment declined email &amp; VM left - 2/21 Member advised that I could re-run pmt tomorrow 2/22.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-21 12:58:33', '2022-02-21 13:01:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000087062092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331041', 'Karen Tips', NULL, 'Member''s 3/22 Payment declined1st notice sent &amp; VM left - 2/21 2/23-second notice sent 2/23-member called in and advised me to rerun share amount on same card', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-21 12:51:15', '2022-02-23 13:51:54'),
