  ('zcrm_1579374000086927063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692364', 'Brandi Weaver', NULL, 'Brandi called in and initially spoke to Guy about her Liberty membership and the $50 charge she had been getting.  Asked what it was for.  I told her the whole history and that she had been notified by us when Liberty made Sales change.  She wanted to know what she got initially and where she would have gotten the Concierge number to access services.  I will send her the cancellation and refund her the 2 mos back.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-18 13:36:21', '2022-02-18 13:36:21'),
