  ('zcrm_1579374000086909026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '2-18-22 Talked with Brian Guarneros and let him know we don''t want to move Joy Lanzano off of her grandfathered membership bc it''s protecting her for pre-x. Also she has a DPC which she will want to keep. The most significant benefit of combining memberships is to have 3 IUA vs 2 x 3 = 6. But, with her current open needs for frozen shoulder and other issues, we need to leave it all alone. He understands. Only if there are new options in the future, should we think about combining their memberships. They got married on Dec. 22nd. 2021.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-18 12:43:18', '2022-02-18 12:43:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086909021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331068', 'Brian Guarneros', NULL, '2-18-22 Talked with Brian and let him know we don''t want to move Joy Lanzano off of her grandfathered membership bc it''s protecting her for pre-x. Also she has a DPC which she will want to keep. The most significant benefit of combining memberships is to have 3 IUA vs 2 x 3 = 6. But, with her current open needs for frozen shoulder and other issues, we need to leave it all alone. He understands. Only if there are new options in the future, should we think about combining their memberships. They got married on Dec. 22nd. 2021.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-18 12:42:44', '2022-02-18 12:42:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086909016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086951001', 'Stephanie Baltz', NULL, '2-18-22 Stephanie will have one more chat with Nathan about what they plan to do. If they chose some form of Cobra through his employer they can keep their FSA funds to use. Hoping if they keep VSP with Cobra then they can use their FSA funds that way, otherwise they will lose them.  They''d prefer to have entire family on SECURE. She doesn''t seem like she dug into HMA too much yet. She does want to discuss options for LTD, not STD. I told her we can discuss Living Benefits in the future. She sees what can happen with her job in the hospital and wants to protect their assets.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-18 12:26:59', '2022-02-18 12:26:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086927048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044781197', 'Daniel Siegrist', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove son Stephen from the plan I will notify Sedera no change to billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-18 12:24:16', '2022-02-18 12:24:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086927043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331068', 'Brian Guarneros', NULL, 'Brian was transferred to my by Cari-he called to ask about combining his membership with the membership of his wife Joy Lanzano.  After looking at both of their memberships this would be problematic because of the following:  Joy is managing a current Long Term need and also Joy is on the Conversion and Brian is not.  Joy would have to be added to Brian''s plan.  I advised Brian to hold off until Joy is no longer incurring and expenses connected to this need and all bills have been paid.  After speaking with Wendy she advised me that Joy has a DPC, thus the reason why she does not have Planstin.  Brian also was going to talk to Joy about adding Planstin to her membership.  Wendy is aware of all of this and will reach out to Joy to discuss.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-18 12:13:00', '2022-02-18 12:13:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086938008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069080024', 'Jennifer Vasquez', NULL, '2-18-2022:  Joy wanted to understand her ''counseling'' on her OPD prod.  Gave her Mazz &amp; Sull assistance ph # &amp; how appts are structured.  Also, let her know to tell them MPowering Benefits is the company her memb comes thru.
     - Joy also needed a new card so I trans her directly to Kelly F''s phone.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-18 12:01:01', '2022-02-18 12:01:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086938003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331068', 'Brian Guarneros', NULL, '2-18-2022:  Brian called in w/a ton of questions:
     - He just had his prev appt, but his wife told him to be a ''self-pay'' not realizing they are on diff plans.  So we went over in detail how to use his prev Planstin.
     - He''s scheduling his colonoscopy, so we went over that on Planstin & if it moves to diagnostic on Zion.
     - He just married our other member Joy Lanzano & wanted to know about combining their plans.  I got him to Patti.  It sounds like the concerns are:  Joy has pre-x heart murmur & is on a conv prod.  Joy has a current ''need'' open due to an accident.  Different plans may make it hard to combine.  & he likes having the prev.  Both are self-emp.  Patti''s going to help if she can.
     -  I sent him Patti''s temp to change his address prior to knowing all the above.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-18 11:58:49', '2022-02-18 11:58:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086911023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064054011', 'David Williams', NULL, 'David called with questions regarding what is covered with his preventative services (after the fact of his appointment) and we went over the items that are included on the ACA list. David also wanted to verify that the Gastroenterologist that he has chosen for his screening colonoscopy is in the PHCS network. I verified that and also explained that his prescriptions do not count towards his IUA. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-18 11:42:24', '2022-02-18 11:42:24'),
