  ('zcrm_1579374000086858003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008568067', 'Andrea Williamson', NULL, 'Member emailed me and told me that she had taken a full time job that had benefits.  She wants to "step out" and leave her husband on the plan.  I emailed Wendy because we are coming up on the billing deadline and husband will have to re-enroll.  Also spouse will be aging out of the plan 12/22.  Will wait to hear from Wendy.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-18 07:38:01', '2022-02-18 07:38:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086816023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887044', 'Jack Pardo', NULL, 'Karen called asking for information about therapists in her area and if her therapist may belong to the MAP program. I transferred Karen directly to MAP so that she could speak with their team. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-18 07:34:56', '2022-02-18 07:34:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086782098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004737025', 'Taylor Hirst', NULL, '02.17.22:  Emailed Taylor, included a spreadsheet comparing MPB SECURE with the 3 LHS plans.  Asked Taylor to review the info. I sent.  Told her I would circle back with her in a few days.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-02-17 15:33:16', '2022-02-17 15:33:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086824018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415323', 'Wallace James', NULL, 'Wallace is having issues with his TPA and getting detailed billing in order to submit a need and an upcoming surgery he is having. I advised Wallace that he should speak with Zion because they may be able to advocate on his behalf. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-17 15:03:20', '2022-02-17 15:03:20'),
