  ('zcrm_1579374000086778058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087126001', 'Kevin Coan', NULL, 'Emailed Kevin more prices on SECURE quote and called back left voicemail of CARE prices and can lock in before price change.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2022-02-17 14:07:59', '2022-02-17 14:07:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086824013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078638002', 'Claudia Nanino', NULL, 'Claudia called for information regarding her CirrusMD account not working, how to go about setting up her yearly screening mammogram, and naturopathy. I will be reaching out to CirrusMD support due to the fact that Claudia had switched plans and it seems as though it messes with CirrusMD account. I will be sending her a list of in-network doctors in her area for her mammogram. And I transferred her to Zion for pre-approval for her naturopathic care. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-17 13:59:02', '2022-02-17 13:59:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086834038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082692002', 'Angela Taylor', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after 1 month seems she found  a Catastrophic plan for less than $100.  I will notify Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-17 13:55:52', '2022-02-17 13:55:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086824008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992038', 'Willa Bonzi', NULL, 'Willa called in confused and looking for advice with her decision to take FMLA for her pregnancy since she just recently took FMLA for an injury/surgery she sustained in January. She thought that was something that we could handle for her, but I did suggest she speak with the MAP program and perhaps they could point her in the right direction. I gave Willa MAPs phone number and warm transferred her as well. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-17 13:10:29', '2022-02-17 13:10:29'),
