  ('zcrm_1579374000086714003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087060131', 'Emily Hubbard', NULL, '02.16.22:  Cindy called and asked for me.  Was referred by my member, Malinda Russo.  Interested in a health care plan for her daughter, Emily, age 27, healthy, no pre-x, non smoker, no meds.  Emily owns her own business, One Rose Decor (vintage home decor). Cindy has been researching health sharing organizations, joined the health sharing Facebook group and was referred by Malinda Russo.  Daughter needs routine care and some behavior health care for occasional anxiety, etc., due to work stress.  She had Anthem health but the deductible is $8500 - too expensive for her.  I explained all the plan options.  Cindy thought Emily would want either CARE PLUS or SECURE.  Said she''d discuss it with Emily and have Emily contact me to further discuss.  Emailed Cindy my website link and guidelines.  Pricing is the same for Emily whether current or new.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-02-16 16:45:41', '2022-02-16 16:45:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086671048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040874041', 'Robert McCord', NULL, '2-16-2022:  Primary member Robert called.  They just rec''d 2 new cards and he was trying to figure out what they were for.  It sounds like they are the new MPB.Health reference cards w/QRcodes.  He needs a third for his son Christopher that is still on the plan &amp; was confused as to why the QRcode # is now different from the previous ones they had.  I let him know Kelly F supplies the cards, but she''s already gone for the day, so I transferred him into her VM.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-16 15:52:28', '2022-02-16 15:52:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086681121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024355002', 'Linda Reely', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation to cancel her Sedera Membership.  I will cancel Sedera &amp; Apex &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-16 14:59:11', '2022-02-16 14:59:11'),
