  ('zcrm_1579374000086671008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068022001', 'Justin Breaux', NULL, 'Justin called with questions regarding his ex-wife having their daughter seen by a CirrusMD doctor. I explained to Justin that because his ex-wife is not on the, there is no way for her to access CirrusMD but advised him that he is able to log her into CirrusMD to be seen by a doctor. He decided that wasn''t the route they could take so his ex-wife will be taking her to an urgent care. I explained the self-pay process to Justin. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-16 09:04:57', '2022-02-16 09:04:57'),
