  ('zcrm_1579374000086681003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058265053', 'Mary Jo Wood', NULL, 'Received forwarded email from Jane &amp; Member wanting to know why she had been sent the request for 1099 upload back on 12/17/21.  I was unable to determine why that was sent but I had sent a copy of the 12/1 receipt for her Share Amount.  In looking in her file she never uploaded proof of Business Ownership, so I suggested that she do that.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-16 08:13:24', '2022-02-16 08:13:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086676003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089240642', 'Rick Sanders', NULL, 'Called Kelly from 1800 line lives in NJ requires SECURE plan for ACA mandate. Uses HSA and loves compatibility due to having an HSA already. Currently using health share through sedera from Knew Health. Works from home call after 4pm.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2022-02-16 07:40:27', '2022-02-16 07:40:27'),
