  ('zcrm_1579374000086612091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086610063', 'Sharon Johnson', NULL, '1-20-2022:  This came through as a ''Quote Request''.  However, she''s 78 years old.  I did LM just to verify, but never heard back.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-16 00:59:27', '2022-02-16 00:59:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086612076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086610034', 'Timothy Ball', NULL, '1-17-2022:  Tim responded letting me know he''s going to continue living in Thailand for now.  If/when he moves home, he may reach out to me.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-16 00:23:44', '2022-02-16 00:23:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086612061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086964002', 'Lani Cordova', NULL, '2/15/2022:  Sent mo deadline reminder &amp; last chance for orig quoted prices thru 9/20/22 draw for 10/2022 contribution.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-15 23:39:55', '2022-02-15 23:39:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086612046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069918001', 'Joseph Hatch', NULL, '2-15-2022:  Annie called back, the cheaper RX items we found are no longer available because the pharmacy closed!  I finally got everything repriced and some have doubled in price.  Since she''s purchasing the Aklief thru Reid, we decided to see if there was anyway he could do everything.  Sent him the list w/the prices I could find.  Annie &amp; I will see what he sees, then do coupons from there.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-15 22:48:36', '2022-02-15 22:48:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086607028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086950002', 'Summer Deaton', NULL, '2-15-22 Summer is 47, kids 15 and 19. Met her at BSU. Soon to be x-Mark stopped working 6 months ago and they are all on Cobra now for $1300 and some discount is expiring soon. Also paying $150 for dental. Summer was diagnosed with Hashimotos few years ago. No treatment and no meds. She''s not sure what bad could become of this. She chooses to get her own blood work done to keep an eye on it but not required by dr. She will find out what negative things could happen with this if turns bad. Also, son had a torn labrum some time ago and not planning on doing surgery or anything. She needs to determine what and when visited docs for this or if it has or will heal on its own.  More interested in CARE+ bc doesn''t do traditional annual wellness and does more acupuncture, chiro, naturopathic for wellness and prevention. She will try for March 1st start date but might not have enough answers fast enough.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-15 17:45:48', '2022-02-18 15:19:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086607023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001653225', 'Isabelle Peyrichoux', NULL, '2-15-22 Isabelle is enrolling now for $1000/$275 SECURE and paid the $100 to honor Fawn''s recommendation to reach back out to me. All set for March 1st and knows of price increase in Sept.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-15 17:31:30', '2022-02-15 17:31:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086595013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081789002', 'Gary Mau', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 1334 Question : How do I find my member portal?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-02-15 17:29:03', '2022-02-15 17:29:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086607018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462092', 'Delia Villarreal-Webb', NULL, '2-15-22 Delia is getting a subsidy so her new cost is $0 through ACA. She was super sweet and will come back when her finances are better. Relieved that I called her back to finalize cancellation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-15 16:45:46', '2022-02-15 16:45:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086612038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086942001', 'James Evans, Jr.', NULL, '2-15-2022:  Jimmy says he''s ready &amp; wants to signup for the Care+ this week.  We will talk to submit his application.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-15 16:38:53', '2022-02-15 18:23:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086612033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016721056', 'Susan Crocker', NULL, '2-15-2022:   Susan rec''d her Medicare cancellation e-mail & was curious about the Care plan.  She just confirmed the items (which she has liked & used in the past), but thinks she will let that go for now and will send her cancellation form (=eff 3/1/2022).  I assured her, if she changes her mind her advisor can easily get her setup on the Care plan (curr $29/mo + $25 setup fee).   She was extremely grateful for all MPB has provided over the years and said the concierge line has always been super helpful.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-15 16:34:47', '2022-02-15 16:34:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086612023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085146002', 'Rebecca Snyder', NULL, '2-15-2022:  Rebecca called.  She is on Jennifer Thorin-Savard''s ''Welcome Call'' sched for tomorrow at 4:30pm, but she needs to reschedule.  She could only find a ''sched another call'' button & wasn''t sure that would cancel the curr appt.  I also tried to cancel & it would not allow that either.  She went ahead & sched w/Vanessa for Thurs, 2/17 at 1pm Eastern because that gave her the desired earlier time (11:00 am her time).  I sent Jennifer a Teams chat that the 4:30pm on her sched 2/16/22 needs to be cancelled.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-15 15:17:14', '2022-02-15 15:17:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086599149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085957002', 'Carl Ross', NULL, 'Sent reminder to member as I have not received cancellation for previous membership.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-15 14:49:41', '2022-02-15 14:49:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086599144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939033', 'Tal Diamant', NULL, 'Sent email to remind member that he need to cancel previous membership.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-15 14:46:38', '2022-02-15 14:46:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086599139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086621002', 'Christy Cox', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-15 14:00:38', '2022-02-15 14:00:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086607013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089144002', 'Sarita Yeldandi', NULL, '2-15-22 Sarita is 43 and Vikram 46, Mira 9 and Ananth 6. They are all healthy except Sarita has chronic back pain with 2 herniated discs and takes duloxetine every day and currently pays a $10 co-pay with Kaiser. But, it looks like through mail order it''s even cheaper at around $6-$7. She also broke her wrist last year and it''s all good now. Her daughter broker her arm last year as well and healed. Her husband is looking to leave his current job with benefits and take a break to work on his own. Their estimated income is about $150K but unknown. They will get about a $52 APTC at that level with cheapest plans are around $750 for lowest level bronze plan. I am sending a sample of plans as well as SECURE to compare. She also wants vision and HMA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-15 13:47:13', '2022-02-15 13:47:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086616043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087122002', 'Robert Chupek', NULL, 'Got in contact with me today. 

Described that he wanted to move forward sooner then later. I sent him the application and he said he will go over it and contact me with any questions.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-02-15 13:45:41', '2022-02-15 13:45:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086616038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086621002', 'Christy Cox', NULL, 'Just spoke, requoted. She is in the middle of the application process for her &amp; her husband.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-02-15 13:13:30', '2022-02-15 13:13:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086599134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063894027', 'Kristine Nicoletti', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation.  I was in contact w/Wendy who contacted her.  Wendy gave go ahead to cancel.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-15 13:11:07', '2022-02-15 13:11:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086612018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '2-15-2022:  Quentin called again confused.  Part of the issue, Quentin held onto & presented his old Planstin card and an MPowering Benefits card both times he’s tried to schedule an appointment (1/24/2022 & today).  When we talked, hopefully he heard me this time in saying his Planstin card is for an old plan and he can discard that.  He was able to locate his OPD card (I let him know he’ll want to present that card.  Although, after we talked I realized since we are changing his assigned office, he’ll want to use a new card we’ll send once the change is complete).

I tried to call his Dr Patel’s office & they were very combative saying "they''ve never heard of OPD.  How were they supposed to know he''s their member.  They''ve never been contacted, other than someone just coming in trying to sell it to them. Etc."   Their office contact Laurie Anthony demands we send someone to the office to tell them what this program is.  [Maybe we have an inaccurate e-mail for Laurie?  In Admin123 I do see contacts, but did not say anything to her because of her anger.  It looks like someone signed in w/her user name & pw to look at their members.  They were notified of a ‘new member’ on 11/15/21 via e-mail, but it’s showing as unopened.  Also, unless we have the wrong e-mail, Wendy has been connecting w/her offices & this is one of hers.  So I don’t know.]

We’ve been instructed to contact Mitesh & let him know if offices are not understanding so I did.  Both John Kach & Wendy Scipione were cc''d as well.

Mitesh suggested we move the patient to: Dr Juan Suarez'' Downtown Orlando practice (due to the combative nature at Dr Varesh Patel''s office) and Quentin was totally fine with the suggestion.  I’ve supplied all the information for John to start that process and Quentin knows the change will be effective 3/1/2022 & is fine with waiting for his annual until that time.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-15 13:07:15', '2022-02-15 13:07:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086616033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087122002', 'Robert Chupek', NULL, 'Scheduled a call for this Saturday. 

Potential employer group.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-02-15 13:00:30', '2022-02-15 13:00:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086612013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091256', 'Cynthia Shiko', NULL, '2-15-2022:   Cynthia called and has now injured her other knee (right side this time?).  I sent her the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion.  She wass starting a ''need'' w/Zion as we talked.  Once that''s acknowledge and she''s signed the record release form &amp; HIPPA forms, she''ll contact us so we can contact Care Connect because they expect surgery to be end of March.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-15 12:46:41', '2022-02-15 12:46:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086599095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083455002', 'Shreya Reddy', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will notify Zion and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-15 12:34:01', '2022-02-15 12:34:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086599090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082307002', 'Massimo Giammarco', 'New Plan eff 3/1/22', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-15 12:24:58', '2022-02-15 12:24:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086599082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082307002', 'Massimo Giammarco', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to change IUA from $2500 to $1000 eff 3/1/22.  He is aware of the price difference.  Traci to make him aware of the 60 day wait.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-15 12:17:50', '2022-02-15 12:21:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086599077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005956089', 'C. Michaele Hogan', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-15 12:06:06', '2022-02-15 12:06:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086612008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083455002', 'Shreya Reddy', NULL, '2-15-2022:  Shreya called to cancel.  She unintentionally got pregnant during her waiting period.  I transferred her directly to her advisor Karen Torsoe, letting her know some of our advisors can help with other options.  Because we are so close to the mo contribution draw date, I sent Patti a Teams chat as a heads-up.  Shreya said she will talk with Karen (& was thrilled Karen may be able to point her in a direction that will help cov prev & pregnancy).  Then, she''ll get the completed form submitted to Patti later today.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-15 11:49:43', '2022-02-15 11:49:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086607008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002834005', 'Anthony Moreno', NULL, 'Anthony called in and stated that he is going to be having surgery on his wrist and wanted to make sure he was talking with the correct people and doing the correct thing. I let him know the process he would need to go through with Sedera about the 2nd MD program & being a cash pay patient up to his IUA of $1500. He said he is familiar with all of that due to a gallbladder issue he has last year. So I gave him Sedera''s phone number as he did not have it on him and to call them to get the process started now rather than later. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-02-15 11:08:17', '2022-02-15 11:08:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086612003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462092', 'Delia Villarreal-Webb', NULL, '2-15-2022:  Delia called back.  Really hard to hear her until the last second and then it was good.  She needed me to trans her to Patti, so I did a direct transfer.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-15 10:56:21', '2022-02-15 10:56:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086599072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005116389', 'Katherin Khidirian', NULL, 'Member emailed into Accounting that she is now on Medicare and wants to cancel.  I will send out cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-15 10:34:25', '2022-02-15 10:34:25'),
