  ('zcrm_1579374000086607003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071780031', 'Kora Gilbert', NULL, 'Drew called in and just wanted a run down of how things work &amp; what him or Kora would need to do in certain situations. Explained Planstin &amp; Zion, etc. Basically a short Welcome Call. Sending emails that are needed for Gyno''s in their area for Kora to have a Women''s Well Visit along with the PHCS Network Provider Search tool with the 64+ list mandated by the ACA. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-02-15 10:02:09', '2022-02-15 10:02:09'),
