  ('zcrm_1579374000086551043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, 'Quentin called in with questions regarding why Dr. Patels office has not heard of MPB.Health, Empowering Benefits, or Planstin. Due to the fact that I do not know much about the OPD plan, I reached out to Cari for assistance. She is going to be calling Dr. Patels office to speak with her contact there to find out what is going on. I have informed Quentin that someone will be in touch with him today. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-15 09:08:52', '2022-02-15 09:08:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086599043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176011', 'Dona Tolan', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form.  I will update.  Member''s CC was previously on file so I reactivated.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-15 09:04:51', '2022-02-15 09:06:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086599036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177222', 'Amy Vasterling', NULL, 'Member submitted a cancellation request.  I spoke to Amy to let her know and she said to go ahead and cancel her.  I will cancel w/Sedera &amp; Billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-15 08:53:36', '2022-02-15 08:53:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086551038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084375002', 'Troy Axelson', NULL, 'Lisa called in with questions on how to present herself at her sons audiologist appointment tomorrow. They found out yesterday at her sons PCP visit that he does have some hearing loss, this is the first that her son has had this diagnosis. I advised Lisa on the self-pay process and let her know to collect all of the bills stemming from the original visit in the case this goes above her $5,000 IUA amount. I added Lisa''s email address as the secondary email to this account and sent her how to submit needs to Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-15 08:34:19', '2022-02-15 08:34:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086578028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083771001', 'Robert Godfrey', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-15 08:19:39', '2022-02-15 08:19:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086551028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462092', 'Delia Villarreal-Webb', NULL, 'Delia called in to cancel her membership. She had been exchanging emails with Redirect Health assuming that they could cancel her membership. She received an email last night from Redirect letting her know that she does have to contact MPB in order to cancel. I transferred her to Patti. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-15 08:17:50', '2022-02-15 08:17:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086578023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084172001', 'Jacqueline Wolfe', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-15 08:13:28', '2022-02-15 08:13:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086578018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084301001', 'Brittney Lary', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-15 08:04:15', '2022-02-15 08:04:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086551018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689144', 'Lori Altman', NULL, 'Lori called in stating that she was on her way to her annual physical appointment with her doctor who is not in the PHCS network. I explained to Lori that if she chose to see this doctor who is out-of-network it will be an out-of-pocket expense for her. I asked Lori if she had requested a list of PHCS in-network doctors from the concierge team and she stated no. I offered to do a quick search for her, and it appears that the doctor she is going to see today is in the PHCS network. Lori was so happy, and I made sure to reiterate to Lori that she does need to verify that her doctor is still in the PHCS network. Lori understood and was very happy with her service. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-15 08:02:47', '2022-02-15 08:02:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086578013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084832001', 'Gail Cole', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-15 07:50:51', '2022-02-15 07:50:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086551013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081634001', 'Pamela McCoy', NULL, 'Pam called in frustrated because she is currently waiting at Quest labs to have her preventative bloodwork done and does not have a Planstin card to provide to the staff for billing. I advised Pam that I would reach out to Planstin to request her cards but in the meantime, I will transfer directly to Planstin so that she may get her card number. I also advised Pam that there are only a few bloodwork panels included with her Planstin membership and to present herself as a self-pay patient for the other labs that are not included in her preventative services. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-15 07:47:37', '2022-02-15 07:47:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086578008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084903010', 'John Devanny', NULL, 'Spoke to member he said with all his emails and paperwork he really doesn''t need a welcome call. He understands his plan. If he has any questions I told him he can call our concierge team. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-15 07:44:32', '2022-02-15 07:44:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086578003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085042002', 'Alexa Fetta', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-15 07:33:20', '2022-02-15 07:33:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086551003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005806201', 'Marti Winkler', NULL, 'Marti called at 4:59 PM on 2/14/2022 to inquire on how to upload her needs to Zion Health and her MPB.Health member portal. I explained that she does not need to log into her MPB.Health member portal in order to upload her needs to Zion. Marti was adamant that she does need to be logged into her MPB.Health portal in order to upload her bills for her Need. I kindly again explained that she would need to log into her Zion Health portal to do this and walked her through how to create her account with Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-15 07:03:26', '2022-02-15 07:03:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086529031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082839002', 'Donald McClendon', NULL, '2-14-2022:  Jeff called back w/more questions re: in Network prev doc options.  We discussed &amp; went through the search engine &amp; options.  He was very receptive and seems to understand his options.  We also discussed labs &amp; how little is actually covered, but options &amp; pricing ahead of time.  As well as submitting the bills via Planstin for the network discount.  He was very appreciative of the time I took to discuss and help him.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-14 18:18:42', '2022-02-14 18:18:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086533008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '2-14-22 Carolyn called in to figure out how to speak with a gynecologist due to a new partner. She hasn''t done her Welcome Call yet and she will schedule that now. There are openings on Feb. 16th. Then she can download and use the CirrusMD app to speak with a women''s healthcare doctor at no cost. There''s nothing she needs to do in person and no issues of her own. So, this will be a perfect solution.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-14 16:58:47', '2022-02-14 16:58:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086529023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061950028', 'Khrystyna Chekhlata', NULL, '2-14-2022:  Khrystyna (pronounced Christina) moved &amp; wanted to update her files.  I sent her Patti''s  Plan Chg form temp.  She wanted to confirm it will chg the address w/all the companies: Planstin, etc.  I told her that''s why we have her fill out the form &amp; submit it to Patti, because Patti will update with the various companies.  She was quite pleased to hear she only needs to send one update form.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-14 16:17:36', '2022-02-14 17:57:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086529018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429101', 'Karyn Burke Whitcomb', NULL, '2-14-2022:  Richard''s chiropractor thinks he needs MRI.  Because it''s a chriropractor, we discussed going direct to Zion for guidance.  He''s started a ''need'' before, so is aware of the process.  I suggested they could guide him & go over the full instructions in case he exceeds his 1k IUA, & how he can request pre-auth for alternative care if that''s what is decided after the MRI.  He says he''s had issues before, "but not like this", so he doesn''t believe it will be pre-x.  (That''s between him and Zion, so I did not push here.  It sounds like it could be in his records from prior to start date though even though it''s worse this time?)  I gave him Zion''s # & transferred him directly.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-14 15:50:57', '2022-02-14 15:50:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086520030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005806201', 'Marti Winkler', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1330 Question : How do I log into my portal to submit a receipt?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-02-14 14:57:32', '2022-02-14 14:57:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086462015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005806201', 'Marti Winkler', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1329 Question : I need to log into my portal, but have not done it before. How do I get started?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-02-14 14:55:43', '2022-02-14 14:55:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086487083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238233', 'Michelle McCaster', NULL, 'Member called in to request cancellation.  I spoke to Zach and he does not know that she can be saved.  I will send out link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-14 14:31:51', '2022-02-14 14:31:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086487078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471317', 'John Kline', NULL, 'Whitney called and asked about her Preventative Appt because her provider has told her that he will need a $100 deposit when she sees him and then she can get reimbursed.  I told her that she is not to pay anything for her Preventative and that provider will be reimbursed by RCI.  I sent her a copy of her ID Cards and ordered her new cards.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-14 14:25:23', '2022-02-14 14:25:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086505033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061255020', 'Timothy Cobbett', NULL, '3rd attempt at trying to contact this member for her Welcome Call. I left a detailed vm asking for Alison to call me back to do her Welcome Call. I will be sending Alison another scheduler, but I am also going to make a notation that it is a phone call and not a Teams meeting since this seems to be confusing a lot of our new members. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-14 14:07:49', '2022-02-14 14:08:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086533003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086951001', 'Stephanie Baltz', NULL, '2-14-22 They submitted a quote inquiry online which is why Leonardo received their inquiry earlier today.  I met Stephanie via BSU and through my presentation last week. Stephanie is a nurse and husband is between jobs and possible new job the ins is fine for him but expensive to add family for $800+. Stephanie works at hospital and is paid as W2 and currently no benefits. She also has her own LLC and works on nutrition and lifestyle and pondering opening an IV clinic soon. She''s 45 and healthy, 9 year old girl is turning 10 soon, plus 7 year old girl and 29 month old girl. She manages most of their ailments. But, they also prefer chiro, acupuncture, osteopathic care and functional medicine. They are looking for March 1st start date and they know of price change for Sept. billing for Oct. They have both prices for EC and EF, if Nathan decides to join as well. He currently is seeing PT for an arm overuse injury. I also explained HMA if their employer group dental plan isn''t any good.  Told them we can enroll them on Friday for March 1st, if they choose.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-14 14:02:02', '2022-02-14 14:02:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086529013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081352001', 'Eileen Tierney stone', NULL, '2-14-2022:   Eileen called.  She''s having trouble getting into her CirrusMD &amp; her allergies have gotten really bad.  I submitted a support ticket to get help for both Eileen &amp; her son Ralph to get their accounts setup.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-14 13:01:33', '2022-02-14 13:01:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086529008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496002', 'Ryan Murphy', NULL, '2-14-2022:   Raquel called.  They sent in a change of pymt to ACT from cc, but are seeing a new cc charge.  Transferred her to Patti since she will have to help her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-14 12:57:44', '2022-02-14 12:57:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086487073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176011', 'Dona Tolan', NULL, 'Member requested Payment update form to change Pmt method.  I emailed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-14 12:53:51', '2022-02-14 12:53:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086505028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077566038', 'Todd Lesnett', NULL, 'Spoke to member''s wife who is very confused about her plan. I explained that with her plan she simply presents herself as a self-pay patient, ask for the best cash pricing, and collect all receipts in case it goes over her IUA amount. She still had no idea what her plan consists of, she insisted that this should cover everything like traditional insurance. I explained the benefits of her plan (i.e. taking control of her own healthcare)...she is still very confused. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-14 12:25:38', '2022-02-14 12:25:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086505023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082839002', 'Donald McClendon', NULL, 'Jeff called with some questions regarding his plan and his preventative services. I also showed Jeff how to log in to the MAP program, he was very happy with his service! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-14 12:04:34', '2022-02-14 12:04:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086487063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004997077', 'David Whiley', NULL, 'As requested by advisor Diane Border member employer has sold the company and member has lost his job (he was a 1099 contractor).  He has secured new employment with new owners however income won''t start for a few months.  We had secured an offer from Zion to charge member half price for 3 mos, however all of members income will be going to keeping their house out of foreclosure.  So unable to afford that.  Member will be re-enrolling whne they are in a better financial position.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-14 11:51:14', '2022-02-14 11:51:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086487058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086528002', 'Cynthia Colandrea', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-14 11:44:47', '2022-02-14 11:44:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086508048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082507001', 'Brandee Venable', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-14 11:21:22', '2022-02-14 11:21:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086487053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084375002', 'Troy Axelson', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in with a question about plan.  She says that her son has just been to his annual wellness visit and that they have determined that he has hearing loss in his left ear.  She wanted to know if specialists are covered.  I told her that she will be responsible for the 1st $5000 and to save all receipts.  Then she will open a need with Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-14 11:21:07', '2022-02-14 11:21:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086487043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086621002', 'Christy Cox', NULL, 'Quoted. She needs to get her EIN / Business license. 

Wil send email and schedule day to follow up.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-02-14 11:06:26', '2022-02-14 11:06:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086487038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086951001', 'Stephanie Baltz', NULL, 'Called an spoke with Stephanie.  She let me know that Wendy had already reached out too her. 

Waiting  for more info to see how I should proceed.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-02-14 11:04:43', '2022-02-14 11:04:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086529003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568233', 'Sherry Lewis', NULL, '2-14-2022:  Sherry needed help creating an acct w/Zion so she can see the ''need'' she started.  We got her in, but she doesn''t see anything re: ''need''(s) she''s submitted.  I gave her Zion''s # & transferred her directly.  She knows now to monitor her e-mail through all of this.  She''d been ignoring those until this weekend, so that may be part of the issue (but, took care of signing forms, etc., while in her e-mails this weekend).  I went over the importance of keeping an eye open for e-mail communication because they will contact her in that manner as they are working on her ''need''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-14 11:01:10', '2022-02-14 11:01:10'),
