  ('zcrm_1579374000086355016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079422002', 'Aaron Handler', NULL, '2-10-22:  Shari called Jennifer crying this am.  Her GI doc of 20-yrs reception/office told her they do not accept self-pay pts!  She even asked if her doctor (since she''s been seeing them for 20-years) could call or speak with her to see if they can work something out.   They were extremely difficult, left Shari in tears, and she says it was a horrible experience.
     - I tt Wendy Scipione & she suggested that all though this is pre-x (& self-pay which the member knows & is fine with), Zion may step-up and advocate for her since she is their member.  Jennifer & I created a chat and sent it through the Teams system.  (Jennifer has access to that, but I do not.)  She did not see Tim Hirsch on the chat list, so we sent it to Dr. Lee.
     - I LM for Shari that I''m accelerating this to see if I can get someone to advocate for her.  Told her we are looking at different options (& mentioned a ''Special Need'' may also be a way to work with the doctor & Zion).  Let her know we are waiting to hear back.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-10 15:57:56', '2022-02-10 15:57:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086355011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091208', 'Cheryl Yeary', NULL, '2-10-2022:  Cheryl called in &amp; the call was missed while I was at lunch, so I ret''d the call.  She said they have an employee that quit so she sent Patti an e-mail because they want to remove them.  I had her forward the e-mail she sent Patti (&amp; cc Patti in this fwd) to Karina at accounting@mympb.com, saying that might help because I know Karina helps with the billing on these cases.  At least now they both know -- hopefully, that will work for everyone involved.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-10 15:47:47', '2022-02-10 15:47:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086355003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461475', 'William (Randy) Wheeler', NULL, '2-10-2022:  Advisor Steve Remmel called to verify a Secure Member still qualifies for an HSA.  I let him know absolutely.  Also let him know Jennifer mentioned to me Randy''s situation &amp; there may be something more he needed, but she''s already gone for today.  Steve is going to call Randy to see if he can help him.  Sent Jennifer a chat to let her know Steve returned her call &amp; he''s calling the member straight away.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-10 15:37:21', '2022-02-10 15:40:53'),
