  ('zcrm_1579374000086314021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656043', 'Pennye Nixon', NULL, '2-10-2022:  Penney called because she wants to start a ''need'' to get reimbursed for her doctor visit.  Her advisor told her to pay cash & call us to get help getting reimbursement.  
     - Turns out it was preventative services.  We went thru everything Planstin.  Thank goodness at least her doc shows in the PHCS Network search.  I instructed her on how to have the MD office bill the appt because Planstin does not reimburse the patient directly.  
