  ('zcrm_1579374000086314016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081509011', 'Tammy Goen', NULL, '2-10-2022:  tt Tammy she is having trouble finding PHCS providers in her area.  Interpath, Quest, or LabCorp sb fine per PHCS.  But, they told her to call Planstin to see if since she has no in network Imaging srvcs for her mammogram closer than 1-1/2 hours away, to see if they would authorize out-of-network for her situation.  I made sure she has Planstin''s ph# & did a direct transfer.  She seems happy with the solutions so far.     - CA

