  ('zcrm_1579374000086269013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, 'I have called RCI/APEX and left messages for both of the contacts I have on file several times. I have yet to hear back about why Jennifer''s bc is no longer covered by her RCI card. I left another voicemail for Heather Neidesser at RCI, hopefully I will get a return call today. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-10 08:16:31', '2022-02-10 08:16:31'),
