  ('zcrm_1579374000086269003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, 'Krista reached out to for instruction on how her IUA''s work. I explained to her how IUA''s work, when to submit her bills to Zion, and if explained that her and her husband''s dermatology visits would count as separate IUA''s if they went above her $1,000 IUA amount. Krista was very happy with her customer experience. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-10 08:00:45', '2022-02-10 08:00:45'),
