  ('zcrm_1579374000086253003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359127', 'John Scarrow', NULL, 'Member was transferred to me because member had am issue with changing his wife"s name to his.  I will change in RCI Portal &amp; notify Sedera &amp; change in A123. Change was from Stacy Pearson to Stacy Scarrow.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-10 07:03:04', '2022-02-10 07:09:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086232023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, '2-9-2022:  Macay called - he''s wanting to see if chriopractic is covered.  He says it''s just for an alignment, so I told him about WHLC &amp; how to get into the site for possible discounts near him.  We also talked about the ''need'' scenario &amp; how in that type situation it can be pre-authorized potentially by his healthsharing company for that specific need.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-09 16:54:08', '2022-02-09 16:54:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086232018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563065', 'Petrus Timmermans', NULL, '2-9-2022:  Patric (= Petrus) called. 
     - He needs to have his annual exam.  We went over everything Planstin.  I showed him how to access the MultiPlan search & reminded him to always confirm when making the appt, when arriving, & for any other srvcs (lab, ec).  
     -We discussed how to get his BP meds.  That having that in the appt makes some of it treatment and what options since treatment is not a part of prev.   He does have his CirrusMD setup and if he starts to run short before the appt he''s making, he may call to see if they can help him get thru.  He knows they will have to tell him if that''s in their scope.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-09 16:00:55', '2022-02-09 16:00:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086236018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095963008', 'James Kjellsen', NULL, '2-8-22 Jim called to find out deadline for March 1st bc wife''s not getting response from her employer whether or not they will keep providing her benefits if she drops down to 20 hrs a month. If yes, they will remain on that. If not, they want to switch in time for the lower price locked in start March 1st and they know of the price increase for Oct. 1st in the Sept. billing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-09 15:56:42', '2022-02-09 15:56:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086236013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048143018', 'AJ Chamberlin', NULL, '2-9-22 I spoke with AJ and she''s pissed bc she wants us/me to resolve the problem with Redirect for her. I tried to give her the extra help link to contact Redirect and she didn''t want it. She''s now telling me she doesn''t have the authority to speak on behalf of Alex, she''s just paying for it. She didn''t like MPB calling and telling her she''s using the membership wrong. She tried contacting Redirect in advance without success via phone. She''s had better success via the app. She really just wants to throw her hands up and have someone do it all for her. She pretty much hung up on me. She kept blaming MPB for her frustrations with Redirect. I usually have success with these challenges but she truly didn''t want to participate. However, she did say that she''d called Redirect again.  I completed the Extra Help form myself and called and email her to let her know a top leader from Redirect will reach out to her in the next day or two.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-09 15:26:57', '2022-02-09 16:20:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086232013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887102', 'Shelley Sanner', NULL, '2-9-2022:  Shelley called:
     - her first name is misspelled, so I sent her Patti''s temp for making membership changes
     - she''s also ready to make her mammogram appt (see Oct notes from Jennifer).  We went over Planstin, in Network, etc, again.  She''s going to call Planstin though because she''s high risk for breast cancer & would like to have a specialist do the procedure and wants to see if they can help her locate a specialist in network anywhere near her because she lives in pretty remotely w/Durango, CO being her closest town (~ < 20k people).  She''s not super far from the NM border, so maybe there are options there too?     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-09 15:26:48', '2022-02-09 15:26:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086197018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359127', 'John Scarrow', NULL, 'John called because he states that he has been trying to change his wife''s last name for the past 3 years and for some reason it has never been changed. I apologized and warm transferred him to Miss Patti. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-09 14:58:13', '2022-02-09 14:58:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086236008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086450002', 'Andrew Bishop', NULL, '2-9-22 Andrew will continue to get his diabetes meds from Canada and I read him the sections about diabetes as an exception to pre-x and he hasn''t been to hospital for diabetes in past 24 months. No issues. He might need a pump sometime but I read the other clause making it clear he will need to pay for meds and pump on his own which he''s fine with. He''s ready to enroll but needs Natalie''s bank account information to enroll him. She has a membership, plus her son and now Andrew. But, Natalie is on older PDHC. So, if we get one more employee to join then we can set up a List Bill for the group.  I have Friday, Feb. 11 as tentative meeting to enroll in CARE+. Natalie pays half and he will pay half. That feels reasonable to him now. He wasn''t clear before that she will pay half. I also let him know of price increase on Sept. billing for Oct. 1st change to $240 / $1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-09 14:31:48', '2022-02-09 14:31:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086237003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082146002', 'Ursa Abernathy', NULL, '02.09.22  Ursa called to ask if we have any kind of service that can help her with a will and end-of-life planning.  I told her I spoke w/MSEAP.  They said, on their website is a "Legal" folder with articles and information on how to manage specific tasks and  a Legal Forms" folder containing specific forms to use.  For Legal Counsel services, MSEAP provides the names and contact info. of attorneys in the member''s area in the field of interest the member needs.  This would be paid by the member.  I showed her how to access MAP.  She did so and I gave her the phone number to call them.  I told her to let me know how she fares.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-02-09 14:07:08', '2022-09-07 15:11:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086197013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064054011', 'David Williams', NULL, 'David called with questions regarding his plan and to verify that his provider is in fact in the PHCS network (he did his own search but just wanted to make sure he was correct). I verified that his doctor is in the network and explained how to present his Planstin card at his wellness visit. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-09 14:06:39', '2022-02-09 14:06:39'),
