  ('zcrm_1579374000086213003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084632010', 'William Spokes', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-09 08:23:40', '2022-02-09 08:23:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086197008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085553002', 'Georgina Worley', NULL, 'Asked member to reschedule her Welcome Call for some time after her March 1, 2022 start date. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-09 08:02:02', '2022-02-09 08:02:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086197003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086124001', 'Cyndi Freeman', NULL, 'Member''s start date is not until March 1, 2022; I sent her an email asking to reschedule her welcome call for some time after her start date. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-09 07:58:09', '2022-02-09 07:58:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086152003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508059', 'Marla Ratcliff', NULL, 'Member resubmitted address change already updated', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-09 07:13:47', '2022-02-09 07:13:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086128008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073472001', 'Madeleine Blanchard Cupolo', NULL, '2-8-22 Cancelled plan for end of Feb. 2022. I will confirm with Sandra that this is intended.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-08 16:53:01', '2022-02-08 16:53:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086125018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084818001', 'Daniel McManus', NULL, '2-8-2022:  Daniel called.  He''s having stomach issues & wants to see a PCP.  I sent him several items:
     - HCBB Fair Price in his area for a 30-min New Patient visit ($168-$525 range w/$210 = Fair Price)
     - Fam Med docs in his are from HCBB w/in 8 miles of his zip  [let him know he also has access to HCBB with his membership if he''d like to access & search for himself.]
     - I suggested he could start w/CirrusMD (he''s already registered, so just reminded him he can use the app or go online) at no expense to him w/a few details & if they cannot help he can still make the appt as he originally intended
     - We talked about this being outside his Planstin preventative care, but he did acknowledge he rec''d that card.  I told him to hold onto it, but let him know he will NOT use it for this visit.
     - Then we discussed he is a ''cash-pay'' patient to his 1k IUA.  That potentially  he will start a ''need'' w/Zion & I sent him that temp.  Went over limited time to have things apply towards the 1k IUA & best to start a ''need'' if any possibility it will reach or exceed the IUA &/or the problem will continue.  He says this is a brand new issue that he has never seen the doctor for.
     - I included the link to schedule his ''Welcome Call'' & let him know that an important way to begin understanding how best to utilize his plan.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-08 16:36:35', '2022-02-08 16:36:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086128003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001950031', 'Eric Nehls', NULL, '2-8-22 Playing phone tag. Left vm at 4:08 today.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-08 16:08:29', '2022-02-08 16:08:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086125013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176037', 'Kathleen Burke', NULL, '2-8-2022:  Kathleen called.  She cancelled her Liberty and couldn''t figure out who we were.  I tried to explain this is a companion product to the Liberty, from MPB, but different companies.  Since the advisors want us to have them speak to them prior to cancellation, I transferred her directly to Jane Kassel''s office.  To keep Patti in the loop I sent a Teams chat filling her in.  I have NOT sent the cancellation form since Jane may want to try to save this.  Kathleen sounds like she''s hoping for a refund for the last few months anyway, but I let her know I do not know how that works and that Jane/our Benefits Administrator would have to help her with that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-08 15:22:44', '2022-02-08 15:22:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086066048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410109', 'Steven Lodge', 'Redirect Term:', 'Tracking #12905692
Sent by Patti Baron on 2/8/2022.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-08 14:44:25', '2022-02-08 14:44:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086066043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410109', 'Steven Lodge', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel Redirect &amp; Sedera &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-08 14:43:56', '2022-02-08 14:43:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086066038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877120', 'Andrea Thomas', NULL, 'Received cancellation from this member I will let Planstin know and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-08 14:34:22', '2022-02-08 14:34:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086063038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725199', 'Susan McCormick-Davis', NULL, 'Susan called in VERY confused about her plan. She has had several items she''s collected in order to submit a "need". She was assuming that she could bundle her dermatology appointment, her foot injury bills and anything else in order to meet her $1,000 IUA. I explained to Susan that it works very differently, and that she cannot bundle all of her medical bills for any of her issues to submit for a need. It is a per needs basis (i.e. her urgent care foot issue would be one need, if her dermatology issues went over her IUA then it would be a second need). She also stated that her bills are from September 2021, and I informed her that Zion only accepts bills for needs that are 6 months old or less. She then asked to be transferred to Zion so that she could talk to them about the age of her bills. I strongly feel that Susan should be contacted by her advisor so that her advisor can clarify this plan for her.  ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-08 14:20:45', '2022-02-08 14:22:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086125008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094002', 'Theresa Stratton', NULL, '2-8-2022:  Theresa wanted information on how to setup her HSA.  Sent her the temp Wendy let us know about that has the 7 attachments.  Let her know she can choose her financial institution, but that all the information she needs is included.  She''ll call back if she still has questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-08 14:05:31', '2022-02-08 14:05:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086063033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084737002', 'Chad Petherick', NULL, 'Script quote completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-08 13:55:03', '2022-02-08 13:55:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086063028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084647002', 'Michelle Olejarz', NULL, 'Welcome Call complete! Michelle is a great addition! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-08 13:49:58', '2022-02-08 13:49:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086066033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086124001', 'Cyndi Freeman', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-08 12:44:26', '2022-02-08 12:44:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086125003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763189', 'Karen Levine', NULL, '2-8-2022:  tt Karen, she wanted to confirm uploading the bills, what to include, and where to do that.  I let her know the link is in the e-mail I sent yesterday.  She''ll get the bills and receipt today and get that done immediately.  Her 24 yr old daughter is in isolation, so things are pretty scary right now.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-08 12:30:24', '2022-02-08 12:30:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086066028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085365002', 'Douglas Saum', NULL, 'Douglas Saum re-enrolled as a single member as spouse Amber changed her mind.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-08 12:27:43', '2022-02-08 12:27:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086066023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085365002', 'Douglas Saum', NULL, 'Member decided she does not want to be on the plan. Zac will be re-enrolling the spouse who want to stay on plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-08 12:04:39', '2022-02-08 12:04:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086121008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081805002', 'Evan Chrisman', NULL, 'Emily called and asked what she would do about submitting bills & receipts for a therapist she is seeing and also asked if everything was activated and all set with their membership with Planstin. Per the not below and what Emily said when they first started they had the wrong plan and got switched to the correct one and when they contacted Planstin they said Planstin told them they did not have membership. So Jennifer contacted Tim about this and figured out what was wrong. I called Jennifer and asked if everything was sorted out and what not. Jennifer said yes they are all set and should have gotten their cards. I got back with Emily to let her know this and she said they still have not gotten cards. I am going to have Jennifer reach out again to Planstin and Zion for cards to be re sent out. I confirmed their mailing address as well. So in regards to the receipts for the therapist I explained to Emily about their IUA of $2500 they are responsible for first and then they submit everything to Zion and open a Need. I sent the How to Submit Bills to Zion email over to Emily to explain what to do. Emily is all set and cards will be sent out again to the family. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-02-08 11:47:59', '2022-02-08 11:47:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086066018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410109', 'Steven Lodge', NULL, 'I was notified by Sedera that this member wishes to cancel his membership.  I left him a VM letting him know that he must cancel with us not Sedera.  I will send out link &amp; copy Analisa on this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-08 11:31:16', '2022-02-08 11:31:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086121003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763189', 'Karen Levine', NULL, 'Karen called in and said that her daughter Solina is in the hospital with Malaria. She wanted to know after the $1000 she pays if this would be something that is covered. I let her know that would be a question for Zion as they are the ones that would be covering it and who she opens the Need with. She then asked if she has a prescription if that as well would be included in the $1000. I told her yes, anything in relation to that Need is covered and falls into the $1000 IUA costs. She has Zion''s phone number and is going to call them now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-02-08 11:30:38', '2022-02-08 11:30:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086101013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084186002', 'Kevin MacMaster', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-08 11:15:37', '2022-02-08 11:15:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086063023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838096', 'David Sailer', NULL, 'Anne called looking for mammo, colonoscopy and OBGYN providers in her area. She also inquired about her MPB.Health member portal login information. I sent all of the above to the member via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-08 10:26:49', '2022-02-08 10:26:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086066013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877120', 'Andrea Thomas', NULL, 'Member called in requesting to cancel.  She had not spoken to Wendy as yet and did not wish to.  I let Wendy know and will send out Cancellation Link to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-08 10:18:46', '2022-02-08 10:18:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086101008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-08 09:49:41', '2022-02-08 09:49:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086101003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084741002', 'Kathleen Benning', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-08 09:24:05', '2022-02-08 09:24:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086063018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, 'Jennifer called in with her birth control issue from yesterday. I explained to her that I was unsure as to why her birth control is not something that is covered (like Planstin). I have placed a call to Emily at RCI/APEX to get further clarification for Jennifer. Once I have received an answer I will reach out to the member and let her know. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-08 08:58:05', '2022-02-08 08:58:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086063013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023796008', 'Nancy Micloskey', NULL, 'Nancy called back because the email that CirrusMD sent her to help fix her account went into her Junk folder and the ticket is now closed (per the email). I have gone ahead and let both Vanessa and Nancy know that I will be opening a new ticket for Nancy. I tagged the member and Vanessa in this email. I also asked CirrusMD to directly respond to my email because Nancy is extremely irritated with this situation. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-08 08:40:04', '2022-02-08 08:40:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086066008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656075', 'Erin Sortino', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update.  I will update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-08 07:36:49', '2022-02-08 07:36:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086066003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070294005', 'Kelly Alvarez', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation request.  I contacted Zac and he spoke to her and sent her out the link.  I will process, notify Zion &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-08 07:31:18', '2022-02-08 07:31:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086063008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023796008', 'Nancy Micloskey', NULL, 'Member called wanting to speak with Vanessa about the status of a ticket Vanessa put in for her with CirrusMD. My GoTo (phone system) is acting up so I was unable to warm transfer her so I direct transferred her to Vanessa. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-08 07:18:12', '2022-02-08 07:18:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086063003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083369001', 'Melanie Lamere', NULL, 'Script quote sent to member for Natatriptan ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-08 07:09:09', '2022-02-08 07:09:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086042043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, '2-7-2022:  Wendy cc''d me on a reply to an e-mail from Janann (=Jennifer Cowden).  She says her bc''s have gone to $500 for a 3mos supply.  That even GoodRX is $450, & a brand coupon is still $250.  She wondered if we can help.  
     She doesn''t include the name of the medication, so I replied & let her know our hours, cc''ing Jennifer Thorin-Savard so she''s in the loop.  
     Note:  Janann is on APEX - she seems open to "suggestions" of other bc options.  So, I thought we should at least find out if APEX could help because I can tell from the notes she''s been involved in her husband''s prev care & maybe she''s utilizing APEX for hers.
     I can see a long while ago she tt Kelly F regarding submitting RX info for a quote.  But, it was quite some time ago & before I just send her that temp, it seems prudent to get more information from her so we have all the facts.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-07 17:45:27', '2022-02-07 17:45:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086042038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359127', 'John Scarrow', NULL, '2-7-2022:  John called.  His wife is still being told she does not have coverage &amp; they are telling him/her it''s due to the name issue (which I can see has been worked on before).  He''s feeling frustrated.  I sent him Patti''s change form temp &amp; let him know she will be the best one to help.  He will complete the form right away.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-07 17:31:33', '2022-02-07 17:31:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086036036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105661034', 'Aaron Ingalls', NULL, '2-7-22 Juana supposedly chose a dental plan but won''t respond to let me know which one. Nothing shows up on my end after spending a TON of time helping her with dental.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-07 17:18:40', '2022-02-07 17:18:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086042033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '2-7-2022:  Michael called - they have been working w/CirrusMD around Lauren''s depression, medication, etc., but it''s time for them to look into a counselor &amp; their advisor told them there were "20-hours included in their insurance?"  I went into MAP, 12 visits per member/yr, pattern, paying ok during waiting periods, etc.  He''s going to give the info to his wife &amp; daughter &amp; they''ll take it from there.  For now he seemed grateful, but will call if questions down the road.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-07 17:04:30', '2022-02-07 17:04:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086042028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026675105', 'John Cimbura', NULL, '2-7-2022:  Amy called re: new age band &amp; pricing.  I transferred her directly to the ph # on file for her advisor: Analisa Cleland so she can get the answers she needs.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-07 16:27:23', '2022-02-07 16:27:23');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000086042023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079686002', 'Ronald Flake', NULL, '2-7-2022:  Ron called re: RX coupons again.  Sent him 2 for the same item: Valacyclovir 1g, #24 = Fred Meyer $16.51 from GoodRX / Broulims $8.97 from RXSaver.com  (in case the Fred Meyer hours were worth the extra $).', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-07 15:44:47', '2022-02-07 15:44:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086036028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877120', 'Andrea Thomas', NULL, '2-7-22 Patti called to let me know that Annie contacted Zion about her pregnancy and Desiree reached out to Patti to let her know Annie might want to cancel bc she no longer remembers about the 60 day waiting period. My notes from 10-21-21 clearly show that I did make sure she was aware of that and I sent her the maternity guidelines. She had all of the necessary information. I just left Annie a vm now as well. I''ll share my knowledge with Desiree.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-07 15:15:01', '2022-02-07 15:15:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086045028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877120', 'Andrea Thomas', NULL, 'Received an email from Desiree at Planstin saying that this member called into to them today saying that she did not know about the 60 day waiting period for Pregnancy and might want to cancel.   Wendy clearly noted in her conversation with this member on 10/22/21:   "She''s interested in maternity care and knows she has to wait until March to begin trying or will not have maternity costs shared."  Wendy will contact this member and hopefully clear this up.  She to let me know outcome of this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-07 15:06:25', '2022-02-07 15:06:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086042018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082060001', 'Shannon Cleary', NULL, '2/7/2022:  Shannon saw her eye doctor, but after the appointment, they have her seeing medical doctors, having lab tests, etc.  She''s paid over $900 & wondered if this will be covered.  We went over that it depends on what it is considered:  uncovered opthalmic vs medical (which she seemed to understand).  We went thru ''cash-pay'' patient at least to the 1k IUA (unless it doesn''t qualify), starting a ''need'' right away - the sooner the better so she knows asap.  She''ll get it done immediately.  I sent the temp for starting a ''need'' w/Zion.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-07 15:04:36', '2022-02-07 15:04:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086009033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082042002', 'Christel Scomparin', NULL, 'Member was unable to take my call this afternoon due to her driving. I sent the member another Welcome Call scheduler so she can choose another day and time for her call. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-07 14:34:33', '2022-02-07 14:34:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086042013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763189', 'Karen Levine', NULL, '2/7/2022:  Karen called.  Her daughter had to go to the ER today (she said super high fever, they are thinking Sepsis, Covid, but are still trying to figure it out) &amp; she was panicked on how to pay.  We went over her being ''cash-pay'' to the 1k IUA, getting the detailed inv w/med codes &amp; a receipt for the $1000 pymt.  I sent her the temp for submitting a ''need'' to Zion &amp; explained how to start &amp; monitor the ''need''.  She sounded much relieved when we finished our call.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-07 13:46:37', '2022-02-07 13:46:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086045023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656075', 'Erin Sortino', NULL, 'Member called in asking how to update payment information.  I will send out Pmt update link via email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-07 13:37:57', '2022-02-07 13:37:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086009028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083369001', 'Melanie Lamere', NULL, 'Left Melanie a message because she was supposed to have a 3:30 Welcome Call with me, but come to find out she was a double booking. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-07 13:33:15', '2022-02-07 13:33:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086045018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085687002', 'Danielle Howley', NULL, 'Member submitted updated Payment information.  Updated in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-07 13:00:10', '2022-02-07 13:00:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086009023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, 'Kathryn called in because she was never given any instructions on how to go about getting and HSA account with her Secure plan. I sent Kathryn the HSA info that we have on file. She was also inquiring about her mammogram that she had when she had her Redirect plan. I explained that she would have to speak with Redirect about that bill and I warm transferred her to Redirect. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-07 12:58:13', '2022-02-07 12:58:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086042008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032216', 'Suzanne Morgis', NULL, '2-7-2022:  Suzanne called.   She''s setting-up an annual exam &amp; wanted to know what she tells the doc when they ask for her ins.   She seemed to understand there is no preventative care on her plan.   We went over being a ''cash-pay'' patient &amp; if at some point it''s not a preventative item and falls into a qualified need, then it''s still ''cash-pay'' to her 1k IUA, but we need to submit a ''need'' to her healthsharing.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-07 12:43:43', '2022-02-07 12:43:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086045013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810280', 'Alfred Shaw', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment info, however was the Rt &amp; acct that was on file.  I will email the member to advise.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-07 12:12:15', '2022-02-07 12:12:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086045008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006552025', 'Roxanne Ramiro-Shanahan', NULL, 'Member cancelled per Cognito form submission.  Member has not paid for 2/2020 so no refund required.  I also cancelled member out of A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-07 12:03:59', '2022-02-07 12:03:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000086045003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176275', 'Vianney Klein', NULL, 'HES cancelled eff 3/1/2022', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-07 11:53:40', '2022-02-07 11:53:40'),
