  ('zcrm_1579374000086009003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084818009', 'Troy Conrad', NULL, 'Carrie (member''s wife) called with questions regarding her CirrusMD account and a new welcome call scheduler. Her 6-yearl old daughter is currently ill and Carrie wanted to know the steps to take to get her seen by a doctor. I explained the self-pay process, sent her an invite to CirrusMD and explained how to start with getter her daughter seen by a doctor on CirrusMD. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-07 08:34:51', '2022-02-07 08:34:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085980003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083369001', 'Melanie Lamere', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-07 07:53:28', '2022-02-07 07:53:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085973013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712116', 'Dorcas Mella', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove spouse as he will be aging into Medicare eff 3/1/2022.  I will notify Zion &amp; adjust member''s price.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-07 07:45:12', '2022-02-07 07:45:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085976003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877120', 'Andrea Thomas', NULL, 'Andrea called in because she recently found out that she was pregnant and is confused about Zion Health''s pregnancy guidelines. She states that she did not know there was a 60-day waiting period upon joining MPB.Health/Zion Health for pregnancies. Andrea asked if I knew of any exceptions that Zion has made regarding pregnancies, and I was honest with Andrea and I let her know that I have never had this situation before. Andrea asked to be warm transferred to Zion so that she could ask a few questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-07 07:41:19', '2022-02-07 07:41:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085973008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082256026', 'Doug Daniel', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update address.  I will notify Zion &amp; update in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-07 07:26:23', '2022-02-07 07:26:23'),
