  ('zcrm_1579374000085952012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079839002', 'Richard Goecke', NULL, 'Hey all! I just wanted to share a very lovely success story from one of our members concerning their prescription pricing. She was looking for an expensive medication that aids with her Epilepsy called Tegretol XR. When doing my research on our discount prescription sites, the cheapest pricing I could find in her area was $540 for a 90 tablet supply. I reached out to Reid from The Canadian Med Store to see what pricing he could provide for our member and received an amazing price of $215.85 + $9.95 shipping for 180 tablets. The member and her husband were kind enough to call me personally today to thank me for the savings on her prescription. They have 4 children, 3 in which live at home and they said that money is flying out of their pockets faster than they can earn it. They wanted me to know how much stress was alleviated from them when they received their completed prescription quote, there were even some tears shed Smile
 I thought that we could use a little piece of positivity in such a negative world right now...these are the stories that set us apart from everyone else. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-04 12:20:26', '2022-02-04 12:20:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085915013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084642013', 'Nicole Pietramale', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-04 11:12:41', '2022-02-04 11:12:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085915008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890018', 'Laurie Morse', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail.  If she had further questions she can always contact our concierge team.  She was on calendar twice but already had a welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-04 10:34:47', '2022-02-04 10:34:47'),
