  ('zcrm_1579374000085868011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080095009', 'Robert Martines', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Advised member to call Zion in regards to hernia surgery. Putting in request for replacement QR Life code cards to Kelly F. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-04 09:29:05', '2022-02-04 09:49:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085857013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939464', 'Krista Irmischer', NULL, 'Krista called very confused about her plan. She did complete a Welcome Call but she said in all honesty it was too much to take in on a phone call. She was inquiring about her preventative services so I explained that she needed to find a doctor in the PHCS network (she stated she has already verified that her doctor is in the PHCS Network) and to let them know that her preventative services will be covered by her Planstin card. She also asked for Planstin''s phone number, which I provided for Krista. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-04 09:25:31', '2022-02-04 09:25:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085859018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035426019', 'Ernest Bernet', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation citing the fact that he had to spend large sums out of pocket.  Clearly did not have a good understanding of the plan.  He contacted me on the 2/4 wanting to cancel eff 2/1.  and be refunded.  Never submitted cancellation also said that he never authorized automatic withdrawal from his account.  This member would never have been transitioned to Zion had he shared that he would be getting other coverage eff 2/1.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-04 08:55:12', '2022-02-04 08:55:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085857008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297480', 'Kimberly Honeycutt', NULL, 'Sadie from Zion Health called and had Kimberly on the other line wanting to ask MPB.Health some questions about her plan. Sadie switched back over to Kimberly only to find out that Kimberly had hung up. At Sadie''s request I did try to return Kimberly''s call on both of the numbers listed but she did not answer, and her mailbox was full. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-04 08:38:00', '2022-02-04 08:38:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085859013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480088', 'Sheila Finch-Manzagol', NULL, 'Member submitted Pmt Update form with same acct info.  I updated the address on the account as was different.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-04 08:28:39', '2022-02-04 08:28:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085868003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023796008', 'Nancy Micloskey', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in a tech support ticket with Cirrus MD for member. Message that was coming up no records matching information provided. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-04 08:15:22', '2022-02-04 08:25:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085859008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746052', 'Shirley Grigsby', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation aging into Medicare', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-04 08:12:40', '2022-02-04 08:12:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085859003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467575', 'Michael Morrison', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation citing Prescription coverage as reason.  I checked in w/Zac and he told me that members health had changed over the last year and was now a Type 1 Diabetic I will cancel w/Zion &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-04 08:05:44', '2022-02-04 08:05:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085857003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035426019', 'Ernest Bernet', NULL, 'Ernie called to cancel his plan and ask for a refund for February''s payment because he can no longer afford this plan. I transferred Ernie to Patti. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-04 07:46:33', '2022-02-04 07:46:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085816027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101280089', 'Jack Taylor', NULL, '2-3-22 Jack got through the financial portion of the C4 app and has a $0 APTC and can now choose a plan. We will review when we connect.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-03 17:36:27', '2022-02-03 17:36:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085822013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480088', 'Sheila Finch-Manzagol', NULL, '2-3-2022:  Sheila called asking to update her payment info.  I sent her Patti''s temp to take care of that &amp; warned her we often see inverted #s, etc., so good to double check herself.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-03 16:27:50', '2022-02-03 16:27:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085816019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603082', 'Sean Lionello', NULL, '2-3-22 Sean was calling to see if we sent out the tax form showing proof of ins. I don''t believe they''ve gone out yet. He was super nice and he''ll wait for it to come. I have a note into Karina to find out and I''ll let him know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-03 14:35:08', '2022-02-03 14:37:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085794034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080311001', 'Nancy Johnson', NULL, 'Sent member a missed welcome call scheduler. Could not reach her at the time of her call. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-03 14:11:33', '2022-02-03 14:11:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085772021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032281037', 'Tammie Petty', NULL, 'Tami called in and she was unclear as to what she should do.  She has been speaking with Guy about enrolling w/Zion.  I advised to just enroll with Guy and after that submit cancellation form that I will send her.  David is now on Medicare because of a medical condition so it will be Member Only.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-03 13:44:53', '2022-02-03 13:45:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085822008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, '2-3-2022:   tt Frances, she submitted her ''need'' on the 21st &amp; when she called (yesterday?), they said it takes a while.  We went over the process and that calling M, T, W of next week just to ask about an anticipated timeline might be ok.  We talked about all the moving parts, she signed the HIPPA form, but dr''s records have to be requested, then it has to be reviewed, sometimes it then has to go in front of the Doctor review panel, etc.  I think knowing it''s a process helped her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-03 13:11:05', '2022-02-03 13:11:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085822003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890002', 'Bonita Keith', NULL, '2-3-2022:  tt Bonita.  Both her ob/gyn &amp; mamm cntrs are listed in the PHCS MultiPlan Network.  She knows to confirm w/any prov, facility, etc. when she sets appt &amp; arrives to make sure still a part of the network.  She hadn''t seen her post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail, but was able to locate it while we spoke.  I pointed out the ACA MEC site for her reference and encouraged her to confirm cov w/Planstin on anything that she''s not sure of.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-03 12:14:52', '2022-02-03 12:14:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085794026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084311002', 'Cynthia Delgado', NULL, 'Script quote completed on 2/3/2022 ~JTS

NOTE: Cynthia would always like her prescription coupons for Walgreen''s as she has used that pharmacy for over 15 years.', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-03 12:13:24', '2022-02-03 12:29:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085794021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496002', 'Ryan Murphy', NULL, 'script quote completed on 2/3/2021 ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-03 12:11:23', '2022-02-03 12:11:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085768026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084311002', 'Cynthia Delgado', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-03 11:25:11', '2022-02-03 11:25:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085794013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, 'Matthew called asking for the number to APEX because he stated he did not have a card for APEX, that he strictly had an MPB.Health membership card. I provided the following number: 1-800-795-7772 to Matthew so he could call and get his card information. Matthew called back stating that when he called, he was told that MPB.Health no longer had a contract with APEX. Matthew was very frustrated so I advised him that I would speak with Patti about this and reach back out to him with an answer. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-03 11:24:23', '2022-02-03 11:25:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085816008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, '2-3-22 Matt is confused about how to find out who''s in network for his wellness visit and he was going in circles.  But, he simply needs to show his card with Apex/PHCS/RCI/MPB logos on it to give the provider the necessary information to let him know if they are in the network. He thought he needed to provide a bunch of other things and say it''s through MPowering Benefits.  I think I have him squared away. I also made it clear that he only needs to worry about this network for his annual wellness visit. Everything must be coded as wellness or he will receive the bill and have to pay for diagnostic. Anything else he needs to go as self-pay. I think he''s on track now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-03 10:57:54', '2022-02-03 10:57:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085768018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001172005', 'Kate Paulin', NULL, 'Welcome Call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-03 10:56:01', '2022-02-03 10:56:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085772016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650401', 'Frederic Besch', NULL, 'Member''s Payment declined 1st notice sent &amp; VM -1/27 1/31-Final notice sent  2/3 sent notice of deadline also Wendy contacted member.  He advised to rerun.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-03 10:44:21', '2022-02-03 10:44:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085768013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084951011', 'Paul Notartomaso', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-03 10:31:21', '2022-02-03 10:31:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085816003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001653225', 'Isabelle Peyrichoux', NULL, '2-3-22 Left vm for Isabelle returning her call to answer a few more questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-03 10:30:01', '2022-02-03 10:30:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085794008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, 'Matthew called because he would like to do a Welcome Call for his plan since he has not used his plan in over a year. I sent Matthew a Welcome Call scheduler so he can do so. I also sent Matthew a list of Colon/Rectal specialists and primary care providers in the PHCS network. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-03 09:59:40', '2022-02-03 09:59:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085772011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073297065', 'Lance Logsdon', NULL, 'Received another call from member saying he has not received any response from Analisa.  I will send him the link and process cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-03 09:52:27', '2022-02-03 09:52:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085772006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085759046', 'James Brown', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-03 09:08:53', '2022-02-03 09:08:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085794003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076675024', 'Steven (Scott) Harter', NULL, 'Had to fix Scott''s mailing address here in his CRM profile due to the fact, and this is not the first time this has happened with mailing address and members, but if a mailing address has an Apt # or Bldg # or letter or anything along those lines, Admin123 does not transfer that over when pulling the info to create the member''s profile in the CRM. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-02-03 08:57:53', '2022-02-03 08:57:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085768008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084737002', 'Chad Petherick', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-03 08:54:23', '2022-02-03 08:54:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085768003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084640027', 'Malinda Russo', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-03 08:29:30', '2022-02-03 08:29:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085741013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082148002', 'Angela Johnson', NULL, 'Angela called regarding her son being ill. She was not sure if she should present her Planstin card or present herself as a self-pay patient. I explained that in this instance of illness she will need to present herself as a self-pay patient and I explained the process. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-03 08:17:12', '2022-02-03 08:17:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085741008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496002', 'Ryan Murphy', NULL, 'Raquel called with questions regarding a prescription and blood work that her son''s dermatologist would like to give/run on him. I explained to Raquel that in this instance, since it is not a preventative service, that she can go anywhere she would like, and I explained the self-pay process. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-03 08:16:00', '2022-02-03 08:16:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085741003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079147335', 'Stacia Montenegro', NULL, 'Angel called because when he calls the PHCS in-network providers on the list that I sent to him last month, they don''t recognize who Planstin is when they ask him for his insurance. I advised Angel that he should ask them first if they are still participating in the PHCS network, if yes then they should recognize Planstin. He is going to call the providers again and proceed with the information I gave him. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-03 07:49:02', '2022-02-03 07:49:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085728003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083937002', 'Benjamin Lee', NULL, 'Spoke to member was at beginning of welcome call with Benjamin with wife on call as well that is not on plan. I referred them back to Misty Berryman because wife said they were looking for just a catastrophe coverage plan. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-03 07:45:09', '2022-02-03 07:45:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085710003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085539002', 'Carl Harris', NULL, 'Refunded Members $125 from "second "enrollment &amp; cancelled.  Refunded $100 from 1st enrollment since he is a member of ASHI.  Enrollment came thru Wendy''s platform that is the reason he was charged $100.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-03 07:26:17', '2022-02-03 07:26:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085685018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, '2-2-2022:  Tina called wanting to sched a ''Welcome Call'', so I sent her the temp &amp; she was able to get in.  We talked a little, but she was cognizant of the fact that she''ll be doing her Welcome Call &amp; that may be the place to start instead of just bit piecing right now.  I assured her if she still has questions later, this is the right number.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-02 17:11:35', '2022-02-02 17:11:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085685013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '2-2-2022:  Joy called wanting to review her need.  Gave her Zion''s ph # &amp; transferred her there.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-02 14:39:58', '2022-02-02 14:39:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085634088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085687002', 'Danielle Howley', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-02 14:33:00', '2022-02-02 14:33:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085669021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890002', 'Bonita Keith', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 1304 Question : Hi, there!! I need to ask a question about the included yearly mammogram on our Secure Plan.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-02-02 14:13:50', '2022-02-02 14:13:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085634083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209074', 'Michael Flynn', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse called in and had some questions Ann saw that the charges were coming out of their personal CC wanted to know if they could be reversed and recharged to a business Acct.  I said no.  I made the change after the deadline as a favor.  Went over CC Fees Member will be updating to a bank account.  Member asked if Share Amount could be paid out of HSA.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-02 14:07:22', '2022-02-02 14:07:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085620013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209074', 'Michael Flynn', NULL, 'Welcome Call complete! Spoke with both Ann and Mike, lovely folks who may need a little guidance, but they are willing to listen and ask questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-02 14:06:05', '2022-02-02 14:06:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085685008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004215055', 'Mary O''Fallon', NULL, '2-2-2022:  Mary called looking for an end-of-yr stmt showing she''d had ins in 2021.  Prev was told Planstin will send those out.  Offered to trans Mary &amp; she said she started w/Planstin &amp; they told her should had to call MPB.  Wasn''t sure who could help her so trans her to Patti.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-02 13:39:19', '2022-02-02 13:39:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085668013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061132', 'David Pool', NULL, 'Wendy called in in regards to a prescription she has gone through us before in the past. When she gave me the information of the medication the lowest coupon I found was $1,588. So I explained to her about reaching out to Reid at WorldMeds and she said Yes that is exactly what she did before and just wasn''t sure if she was calling the right place or if should could just call Reid. I let her know she did the right thing and since she has ordered this exact prescription with Reid in the past then she certainly can call him directly and place the order. She was thrilled and said that is the route she wants to go with Reid as he has it for more than half the cost she would get at the pharmacy. She is contacting Reid now. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-02-02 12:49:18', '2022-02-02 12:49:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085634078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176275', 'Vianney Klein', NULL, 'Former Liberty Member  02/01/2017 to 03/01/2022', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-02 12:13:18', '2022-02-02 12:13:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085634073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085646002', 'Karen Lapchinsky', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-02 11:58:38', '2022-02-02 11:58:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085685003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078409064', 'Maria Blaettner', NULL, '2-2-2022:  Maria called.  She''s seeing her thyroid doc for a follow-up appt &amp; wondered if any of it was covered.  We went over prev vs treatment = what this is &amp; the healthsharing pre-x waiting period, then step up in sharing.  She knows it''s the waiting period year and at this time she''s 100% self-pay.  She''ll let the doc know she''s cash-pay to see if she can get some form of discount.  We talked about her HSA for future expenses like this as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-02 11:33:18', '2022-02-02 11:33:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085655023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083247001', 'Michael Kjelgaard', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-02 11:22:24', '2022-02-02 11:22:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085634068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810493', 'Michael Lutfy', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to lower his IUA from $1000 to $2500.  I will notify Zion and update billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-02 10:48:18', '2022-02-02 10:48:18'),
