  ('zcrm_1579374000085668008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096791017', 'Peter Lehmann', NULL, 'Peter''s daughter Delaney &amp; son Hunter were both cancelled and removed from plan  both due to turning 26 years old. 26 years old is the age member''s children are legally no longer eligible to be under their parent''s Health Care plans. Delaney was removed effective 1/1/22 &amp; Hunter was removed effective 8/1/20. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-02-02 09:11:19', '2022-02-02 09:11:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085668003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810493', 'Michael Lutfy', NULL, 'I responded to Michael via email about his missed chat of his requesting to change his IUA. I found his Member Change Form that he submitted. Patti Baron is the one that takes care of these types of changes and I checked with her on the status of this and she said she is working on it and will be in touch with Michael shortly on what needs to be done. I let Michael know this and that everything is being worked on as we speak. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-02-02 09:04:03', '2022-02-02 09:04:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085634028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033336100', 'Jack Lipton', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation as he will be aging into Medicare eff 3/1/22,  I cancelled RCI &amp; Sedera.  Will cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-02 08:57:50', '2022-02-02 08:57:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085634023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871160', 'Katie Roth', NULL, 'Member aging into Medicare 3/1/2022.  Submitted cancellation I will cancel w/Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-02 08:48:59', '2022-02-02 08:48:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085655003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084611002', 'Laura Carr', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-02-02 08:38:55', '2022-02-02 08:38:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085634018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361828', 'Andrew Papantoniou', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation.  Per Wendy''s note below she is aware of this.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-02 08:38:54', '2022-02-02 08:38:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085620008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497146', 'Jon King', NULL, 'Someone from Zion called to change Jon''s address for him. I informed the young lady from Zion that I will send Jon an address change link so that he may do this as we like to have a record of the member approving the change. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-02 08:19:01', '2022-02-02 08:19:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085634008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064070001', 'Luis Romero', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation, he had called in on 1/31 and I directed him to Misty.  She did not get back to him until yesterday 2/1.  I will honor cancellation since member is located in PA and will most likely cancelled soon anyway', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-02 08:18:00', '2022-02-02 08:18:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085634003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082626002', 'Leon Wisniewski', NULL, 'Member emailed in with a question about the Portal saying that his plan change was not reflected in there.  I logged  in as member and the correct plan configuration is reflected.  I advised that login &amp; password would be the same as what was sent to him in email that was sent to him when he changed his plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-02 08:14:56', '2022-02-02 08:14:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085620003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889025', 'Laurie Testa', NULL, 'Laurie emailed asking for a physical address to Sedera Health. I explained to Laurie that I believe you have to submit your Needs through the Sedera Member Portal and that if she is having any difficulties using the Sedera Member Portal she should call Sedera and they will be able to assist her with her issues. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-02 07:18:04', '2022-02-02 07:18:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118411', 'Nathalie Joly', NULL, '2-1-22 Natalie wants to add some employees to membership. She will send me their information such as name, DOB, Phone and email.  We will need to add to SECURE like her son Raphael is on. They are still working on his Need from horrible accident. Zion keeps asking for more information, so I instructed them to ask for Super Bill which she will do to get it to move forward. Chicago hospital kept sending bill to wrong address and then trying to send it to collections but they never got the bill. They are now working to get it out of collections and get the entire correct information. She''s calm and great. Son is getting better. Leg is the next phase of their process to focus on. UGH!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-01 16:46:40', '2022-02-01 16:46:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079754001', 'Catherine Engelman', NULL, '2-1-22 Left vm to help her in case she has any further questions or concerns about accessing her medications. Per Cari "In case you want to address it with: Cathy Engelman. She wrote back saying the only reason they can save her ~$1000 on her RX, is because it''s coming from outside the country. Tried to let her know they only work w/top quality products and that''s why we choose to work with them, but, that it is ultimately her decision and comfort level."  This came after Cari got this quote "I just got the quote. Her 90-day supply will go down from $1250-$1400 to $296 + $10 S&H amazing!" Meds for spastic bladder.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-01 16:24:26', '2022-02-01 16:27:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085583011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810493', 'Michael Lutfy', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1303 Question : I just submitted a change request to my plan. I want to change my shareable amount (IUA?) from $1000 to $2500. Thank you', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-02-01 16:13:18', '2022-02-01 16:13:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085594005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086453002', 'John Burke', NULL, 'Recvd. John''s quote request.  Called - spoke w/John.  Doing a comparison chart of health sharing groups.  Liked us for the HSA - set us apart from other groups.  Gave notice at work - wants to be self-employed.  Could get Cobra but its expensive.  Pre-x - wife takes thyroid supplements and a yearly check-up.  No meds, non smokers.  Wife does thermography - John asked if Zion shares in that. Quoted John current and new pricing for Care Plus and Secure at $1000 and $2500 IUA.  Explained the price increase as of October 1, 2022 if he enrolls March 1, 2022.  Emailed him my website link and the guidelines.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-02-01 16:10:21', '2022-02-01 16:10:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081762001', 'Michael Gaffey', NULL, '2-1-2022:  Renee called.  Michael passed out &amp; hit his head.  She said they live really far out, so she''s not sure where she''ll find to have him looked at.  But, she will tell them she''s a ''cash-pay'' pt to the 5k IUA &amp; will gather detailed invoice w/coding &amp; receipts.  I sent her the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion, but told her to call when he''s taken care of.  We''ll talk on the other side.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-01 15:25:25', '2022-02-01 15:25:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538168', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064070001', 'Luis Romero', NULL, '2-1-2022:  Luis called while I was at lunch and somehow his call did not come thru to anyone.  I called him back &amp; he said he was able to talk w/his advisor already so he''s all set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-01 15:16:31', '2022-02-01 15:16:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084311002', 'Cynthia Delgado', NULL, 'Cynthia called with questions regarding her membership. I did answer all of her questions and noticed that she has not done a Welcome Call as of yet. I sent Cynthia a Welcome Call scheduler and reiterated how important it is to complete one. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-01 14:51:34', '2022-02-01 14:51:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '2-1-22 Michelle just wants to understand good and bad of joining Aetna vs SECURE. Explained both and she''s preferring to stay put since changes jobs and travels, etc. also prefers alternative care. She is divorced now after a bad marriage and coming out of it. Her current boyfriend is helping her to get everything in order. His name is Dan and he may call me as well. I explained HMA to her and I will send her some information.  She''s a massage therapist and river guide in Eagle and Buena Vista.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-01 14:46:52', '2022-02-01 14:55:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538160', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078279', 'Jaime Pingatore', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-01 14:42:50', '2022-02-01 14:42:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538155', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084517001', 'Kyle King', NULL, '2-1-2022:  Sent follow-up e-mail regarding pymt where the bank could not locate the account.  Hoping Kyle will get this taken care of...    Patti got to me &amp; I didn''t realize it was already corrected.  Sent apology to Kyle &amp; thanks for fixing sooo quickly!', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-01 13:31:41', '2022-02-01 15:04:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538150', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '2-1-2022:  Michelle has a new job where she can get Aetna ins.  However, in tt her, it''s not a job she''ll have long term.  Sent her Ob/Gyn docs in both Eagle &amp; Glenwood on the PHCS MultiPlan Network list.  Also sent her the one DPC doc I see in Basalt (she misses having a doc that has time for you, etc.) - told her to tt her advisor Wendy Scipione because she can help her understand all of this better (&amp; sent a Teams chat to Wendy so she knows tt Michelle is a bit time sensitive).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-01 13:15:55', '2022-02-01 13:15:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538145', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085590002', 'Mike Goldstein', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-01 13:09:51', '2022-02-01 13:09:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538140', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085589002', 'Brittani Alsobrook', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-01 13:01:38', '2022-02-01 13:01:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132176', 'Mary Marchwinski', NULL, 'Welcome call somewhat complete. Mary asked quite a few questions before we could finish her Welcome Call. I advised Mary to schedule another call so that we may go over her plan in a little more detail. She has scheduled another call for 2/2/2022.~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-01 12:50:31', '2022-02-01 12:50:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083931002', 'Kelsey Banuelos', NULL, 'Welcome Call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-01 12:42:14', '2022-02-01 12:42:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005995075', 'Daniel Yechout', NULL, '2-1-22 I was erroneously thinking they were still with Sedera and digging into any health issues. But, they are set with Zion and the pre-x clause since they were grandfathered in with $25K sharing first and second year. Dan did a endoscopy and colonoscopy June 17th 2021 more for his own knowledge to make sure nothing was wrong. Endoscopy was recommended by Dr. but colonoscopy was his choice. He didn''t submit either for sharing. It''s too late to do so now. He wasn''t sure it would have been shared, so didn''t bother. Also, goes to Functional Medicine dr. and most of what he''s doing is now for preventative purposes. Labs are within normal range but dr. is still tweaking things to be optimal. Let him know if he has a new issue/diagnosis then he will want to submit that for pre-approval for sharing. But, the preventive stuff will remain his cost. Also made sure he understood Planstin''s value beyond just HSA. He gets it. Explained Life Care too and they probably won''t use it for Margaux who is on med prescribed by psychiatrist for something called guanfazine(?). They are able to get it for $30 now instead of regular price $800 via a coupon or something through the dr. He will also call Concierge for meds in future and ask for prescription to be given to him to take where he chooses.  Not sure if it makes any sense to move them to SECURE for 6 months or leave it alone. Not sure of any downfalls of moving....', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-02-01 11:41:08', '2022-02-01 11:41:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032033', 'Cheryl Cuozzo', NULL, 'This member called in 1/31 requesting cancellation.  I then sent her to Rick Willard. I received pushback from member who just wanted to cancel.  I sent Rick the email out of Admin 123.  I am unsure what Rick sent this member but I never received any cancellation.  Rick posted that he thought that the plan was "not a very good fit for her".  If so unsure why she was put on the plan to begin with.  He also alludes to her developing a condition after enrollment.  Member rude to the Concierge and me.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-01 11:36:47', '2022-02-01 11:36:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080095009', 'Robert Martines', NULL, 'Member emailed me telling me that spouse will be needing Hernia Repair asking about Surgeon Referral.  I told her that we would do a HCBB search if procedure was over $5k.  Advised that she should do a welcome call hat she hadn''t and also advised to be in contact w/Zion sooner rather than later.  She was unsure if this happened prior to membership or not, advised about Pre-Ex', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-01 11:25:52', '2022-02-01 11:25:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032033', 'Cheryl Cuozzo', NULL, 'Cheryl called regarding her cancellation survey that Patti sent to her and stated that she had submitted it via the MPB.Health member portal. I explained to Cheryl that I didn''t think it was possible to submit it through the member portal, but I would check with Patti. Upon checking with Patti, we realized that Cheryl''s member cancellation survey was never received. I explained to Cheryl that it was never received and that she will have to submit the cancellation again via the link that I was sending her in her email. Cheryl then proceeded to inform me that MPB.Health will be in a "world of sh!t" if her membership is not cancelled. I explained to Cheryl that we were not trying to give her a run around but rather trying to make sure that we received her cancellation survey so that we can ensure that her membership is cancelled. Cheryl then advised me that MPB.Health is a scam and that she will make sure something happens if her membership is not cancelled. I sent Cheryl another cancellation survey, Cheryl then sent me an email back stating the following: 

The cancellation survey has been submitted and noted to be recorded by your system 2/1/2022 @12:34pm.
Please notify me in writing of the cancellation and remove my bank account from your system.

Cheryl Cuozzo
Member #  678460794

I requested that Patti follow up with Cheryl so that she knows definitively that her membership is cancelled. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-01 10:50:24', '2022-02-01 10:51:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077233034', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, '2-1-2022:  Josh e-mailed asking who he would see re: a cold.  I responded suggesting CirrusMD is the best place to start &amp; offering to help get that setup if he''d like.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-02-01 10:12:58', '2022-02-01 10:12:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074214077', 'Brian Trefry', NULL, 'Allison called to start the process for their sons upcoming surgery in May 2022. I let Allison know that she will have to speak with Zion so that they can send her a HIPAA form to sign in order to get the negotiation process started for this surgery. I warm transferred Allison to Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-02-01 09:59:20', '2022-02-01 09:59:20'),
