  ('zcrm_1579374000085538104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650716', 'Daniel Coates', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that he had signed up for a new plan w/ACA that started today 2/1.  He had been in contact with Sedera who directed him back to me.  I told him that we should have been prior to the 20th or any time since then.  We had a long discussion about the ACA and he told me that as a small business this was a good option for him.   I told him to be wary of the networks.  He was interested in the option to come back if he did not like the plan and I told him that he could.  Sent out cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-01 09:10:20', '2022-02-01 09:11:03'),
