  ('zcrm_1579374000085538094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442036', 'Bernard Fleming', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to cancel.  Then directed him to Paul who was out of town.  Spoke to Paul and he told me member had a change in income and now qualifies for a big subsidy.  I sent out cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-01 08:11:08', '2022-02-01 08:11:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003158023', 'Lorene Cecilia', NULL, 'I received an email from this member asking why she was charged an additional $25.  Member started 2/20 and was assessed Yearly renewal Fee.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-02-01 07:29:20', '2022-02-01 07:29:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037788057', 'Jean Thompson', NULL, '1-31-2022:  Jean''s estradiol RX coupon expired, so I sent her a new one.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-31 18:48:26', '2022-01-31 18:48:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057125429', 'John Smieszek', NULL, '1-31-2022":  Kat called - she''s quite upset.  This is just too hard.  I tried to help her understand how easily she can start a ''need'' and sent her the temp to get that done.  She just wanted to tell me how the world is falling apart and if we aren''t careful we won''t have anything on our shelves (even Canadian truckers are boycotting & the news is falsely reporting), they force us to have insurance, and wear masks ...   I tried, yet she sounds really overwhelmed so there was nothing that seemed to smooth over where she''s at - hating having to wear a mask, etc.  She kept saying as a "single mom", but there''s a spouse on here, so maybe the split is really fresh, adding to the burden.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-31 17:17:30', '2022-01-31 17:17:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081769002', 'Robert Henchel', NULL, '1-31-2022:  Rob called, he wants to go for his prev appt.  We went thru everything Planstin:  all entities must be in network, present card, links in post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail for network &amp; MEC, dr must bill, etc.  He was very complimentary on how helpful the call was, but will call if more questions.  His first wife died last night &amp; he was headed to see his kids (I think his mortality was hitting him &amp; hence the prev appt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-31 17:13:00', '2022-01-31 17:13:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '1-31-2022:  Cindy called, her son is in a lot of pain.  He had a fever a few days ago, called CirrusMD & has gone for a Covid test (his home test was negative), but now the fever is gone, it hurts to breath, and under his rib cage, etc., has a ton of pain.  He''s afraid to go to sleep.  They live in a rural area w/not many options, so they are going to call CirrusMD again to see what they recommend.  We talked ''cash pay'' to the $1000 IUA, I sent the temp for submitting a ''need'' to Zion, and Urgent Care vs ER (but where they live treatments at the 2 may be limited as are hours).  She seemed much relieved when we got done, but will call if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-31 16:48:36', '2022-01-31 16:48:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081054002', 'Stephanie Foo', NULL, '1-28-22 Logged into HMA portal and see that Joseph DiColandrea has enrolled on their behalf on 12/22/21.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-31 16:35:00', '2022-01-31 16:35:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '1-31-2022:  Jim called.  He''s really quite sick.  He went to an Urgent Care thinking they could continue his treatment, but they''ve referred him to a Pulmonologist.   We looked in HCBB & Dr Wood they suggested is high-quality, higher priced.  He''s going to call & see if they will give him a good ''cash-pay'' discount.  I sent him a few other doctors w/in 8 miles of his home in case he wants to look at other doctors = all off HCBB that are high-quality, fair price.  We tried looking up fair price for the suggested procedure(s) & I couldn''t find anything on HCBB.

Sent him temp for submitting a ''need'' to Zion as well, so he can get that started as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-31 16:27:37', '2022-01-31 16:27:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974121', 'Maria Crompton', NULL, '1-31-2022:  Maria called to see if CirrusMD would be able to get back with them today.  Let her know they are generally pretty quick, but it is later in the day so it could be tomorrow.  She seemed to understand.  Jennifer sent the support ticket to CirrusMD, so she''ll be the one that knows once it''s taken care of and she got off a while ago.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-31 16:22:36', '2022-01-31 16:22:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209074', 'Michael Flynn', NULL, '1-31-2022:  tt Michael, let him know his eff date needs to have passed so we can help setup &amp; access certain accts before we can do the ''Welcome Call''.  He rescheduled for Wed &amp; is hoping they can do a conference call so his wife Ann is also on the call.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-31 13:47:34', '2022-01-31 13:47:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085533083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085548002', 'Kirby Gorham', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-31 13:45:27', '2022-01-31 13:45:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085533075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085539002', 'Carl Harris', NULL, 'In going over this enrollment, member enrolled with dependent that will be turning 26 on 3/30/2022.  I let Wendy know this and to let member know that we would not be able to take dependent on the plan for 1 month.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-31 13:35:01', '2022-01-31 13:35:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496002', 'Ryan Murphy', NULL, 'Raquel called in with questions on how to present herself and her son at his dermatology appointment. I explained the self-pay process and advised Raquel to collect all superbills in the case that this goes above the $1,000 IUA. I also sent Raquel a prescription quote form for her convenience when her son receives his prescriptions. ~JTA', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-31 13:18:54', '2022-01-31 13:18:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974121', 'Maria Crompton', NULL, 'Maria and Richard are both having issues logging in to CirrusMD. They have both reset their passwords but unfortunately, they are not able to log in with their new passwords. I have reached out to CirrusMD support on their behalf to get this issue fixed. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-31 13:16:10', '2022-01-31 13:16:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085482056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084651019', 'Nicole Sylvestre', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-31 12:41:25', '2022-01-31 12:41:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085482048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605213', 'Allison Lemke', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-31 12:22:00', '2022-01-31 12:22:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085482043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083686002', 'Jeffrey Lee', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly F to send out replacement QR life code cards. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-31 12:07:25', '2022-01-31 12:26:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085539002', 'Carl Harris', NULL, '1-31-22 Left long vm letting him know he enrolled twice and we are refunding his 2nd enrollment. Also he gets a benefit from being an ASHI member which I want to share with him and make sure he knows I''m here to support him ongoing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-31 11:59:09', '2022-01-31 11:59:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442111', 'Sarah Getzelman', NULL, '1-31-2022:  Sarah called re: her colonoscopy.  We went over making sure all entities (dr, facility, anesthesiologist) are all in network.  IF they pull polyps, then she will be responsible for her 1k IUA and we will need to change directions in starting a need w/Zion, uploading her details inv &amp; proof of pymt.  She seems to understand now.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-31 11:43:10', '2022-01-31 11:43:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067291089', 'Heidi Beachley', NULL, '1-31-22 "Turns out Labcorps wiped my bill out, because I filed out a financial aid form.

Thanks,
Heidi"
This is great news and something the Concierge Team needs to learn as well. I''ll let them know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-31 11:37:26', '2022-01-31 11:37:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049815023', 'Andrew Vick', NULL, '1-31-22 Left vm to alert Andrew of payment decline for Feb. and to update it immediately since today is the deadline to avoid lapse or additional fees.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-31 11:26:55', '2022-01-31 11:26:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085543023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650401', 'Frederic Besch', NULL, '1-31-22 Left vm for Fred to update payment information bc there''s a problem. But, I see he just switched his membership for Feb. 1st. I suspect Patti can pull out his past payment information to look for the error.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-31 11:22:25', '2022-01-31 11:22:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085538019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079754001', 'Catherine Engelman', NULL, '1-31-2022:  Catherine called.  She needs to see if we can get a better price on her Myrbetriq.  Reid is able to drastically bring the price down.  Sent her his quote & information.    - CA

Cathy wrote back that since it''s coming from out of the country she isn''t sure she wants to try them.  I let her know they only work with top quality, no secondary mkts, and that Reid could give her better details, but we choose to work with them because of only being top quality mkts.  However, it was up to her.    [She''s saving >1k on the RX thru Reid.]  Not sure what she will decide.  Did send her advisor, Wendy Scipione a Teams chat to let her know about Cathy''s concern in case she wanted to talk with Cathy.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-31 11:20:55', '2022-01-31 15:58:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085482038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085464111', 'William Vanderwall', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of February 1, 2022. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-31 11:06:15', '2022-01-31 11:06:15'),
