  ('zcrm_1579374000085543018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071646064', 'David Jones', NULL, 'Amy called in frustrated because she needs a prescription refilled via Telemed. When asking for her information she got snippy with me because "I should already know this information". I then was trying to ask Amy questions to try to get to the bottom of the situation and she then got even ruder and stated "what don''t you understand about what I''m saying? Obviously, you''re not the correct person to speak with". When I tried to explain to Amy, several times, that I am just trying to get the information so that I can assist her she stated that "I was wasting her time". I then told Amy that I would be more than happy to assist her when she has calmed down and she stated that I was being rude to her. I advised the member that I cannot assist her when she is not willing to give me the information I need to do so and she continued to yell and argue. I explained to Amy again that I could not assist her until she has agreed to work with me by providing the information needed to do so, she would not so I again advised her to call back when she is ready to give the information needed to provide her assistance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-31 10:31:44', '2022-01-31 10:31:44'),
