  ('zcrm_1579374000085502008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442111', 'Sarah Getzelman', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1298 Question : I am scheduled for a colonoscopy in March. My question is it is scheduled as preventative, however if they remove polyps its diagnostic. how does this work? Do I need to fill out a zion health need if its diagnostic in advance? I''ve reached out to healthcare bluebook to find the most cost efficient facility but have not heard back.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-01-28 10:44:24', '2022-01-28 10:44:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085523003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069727014', 'Nathanael ORTIZ', NULL, '1-28-2022:  Briseida called.  She said their acct was corrupted &amp; we had sent her a payment change request form, but she hasn''t seen it (not in her spam either).   I resent the form &amp; gave her Patti''s # in case she doesn''t receive it this time either.  We waited on the phone for a short while after I sent it and it hadn''t arrived yet.  If she doesn''t receive it this time, she''ll call Patti to see if there''s any other way she can fix the issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-28 10:35:27', '2022-01-28 10:35:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085518003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206016', 'Jacqueline Olivier', NULL, 'Jacqueline called with questions regarding where any of her cards associated with her plan would be because she has never received any cards.  We also addressed the fact that William still cannot access CirrusMD. I will be reaching out to CirrusMD on the member''s behalf along with requestions MPB membership cards and copies of her Planstin card. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-28 10:28:02', '2022-01-28 10:28:02'),
