  ('zcrm_1579374000085466003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209074', 'Michael Flynn', NULL, 'Received phone call from Misty about this member.  Member enrolled in Zion and "forgot" to enroll his wife Ann.  I got a member change  from member also updated the file in Admin 123.  I then refunded the $275 for Member Only &amp; recharged $500 for Member &amp; Spouse.  Planstin was also notified via email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-28 08:06:14', '2022-01-28 08:06:14'),
