  ('zcrm_1579374000085438036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083471002', 'Randall Mass', NULL, '1-27-2022:  Randall called wondering what the charge on his cc from this number was.  He was sure I was charging him inaccurately.  We went over why he saw 2 diff amounts:  1) = enrollment &amp; annual fee  2)  monthly contribution.  He wanted to know who I was, and when I tried to explain he hung up...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-27 17:31:08', '2022-01-27 17:39:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085407056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '1-27-22 She wanted to see the receipts for her kids membership and she found some under Admin@MyMPB.com. If she can''t find them all, she''ll call Concierge or Billing tomorrow. She needs dental and can get it through a new employer bc she may need a root canal soon. Told her to get it through employer if can''t wait. Also let her know her membership includes all ACA compliant annual wellness visit since she didn''t remember this and was thinking of switching to Aetna via employer to have access to this and switching back. She now sees why it''s not a good idea to leave and come back due to possible pre-x and already included in membership. She''s thrilled! Also told her to call Concierge for list of drs. in network for wellness.  She will do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-27 16:41:38', '2022-01-27 16:41:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085407051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '1-27-22 Talked with Michelle and she just needed to know when the kids were added to the membership which was 3/1/21. She''s all set now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-27 16:11:48', '2022-01-27 16:11:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085407046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005995075', 'Daniel Yechout', NULL, '1-27-22 Their membership is going from $731.50 to $931.50 bc Dan is turning 50 in March. They''ve already converted to Zion with the Bridge Worksite membership. So, it would only benefit them to switch to SECURE for March 1st - Oct. 1st for $685 and then it will increase to $915/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-27 16:03:01', '2022-01-27 16:03:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085438028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082159001', 'Katherine Avinger', NULL, '1-27-2022:  Katherine called trying to understand how Gina will handle a Thyroid appointment.  We went over this is probably going to be pre-x (which she understood), so they are a ''cash-pay'' patient.  tt her about pre-x waiting period, then amts of sharing each yr.  We also went over the basics &amp; diff between Planstin Prev and her Zion Healthsharing.  She seems to understand.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-27 15:56:44', '2022-01-27 15:56:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085438023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '1-27-2022:  Michelle called for the breakdown above.  However,  her CRM file was coming up while I was transferring her, so I didn''t see the info until after putting her into Patti''s e-mail.  Called Michelle back and let her know "the kids are $220 and she''s $275" and sent Patti a Teams chat that she does not need to respond the Michelle.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-27 15:50:35', '2022-01-27 15:50:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085407038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610622', 'Leif Anderson', NULL, '1-27-22 Talked with Natalie to help explain all additional benefits through MPB vs using Direct membership with Zion. She''s happy to see the Life Care program since they just had their first counseling session with a new counselor for their son. Wish they knew of this sooner. They will see if their counselor will become part of the network. This benefit would make it worthwhile for them. They are choosing not to upgrade to add MEC since their preventive care visits only cost about $140 per person, per year. They are young and don''t need the expensive items yet.  She also wants to see if her dentist will join WholeHealth Living to get a discount. I showed her how to Request a Provider on that site. She will do that and also poke around at all of the other benefits in the Life Care membership. I''ve also reached out to Eric Najera with Planstin to get their account corrected. It shows they have Planstin on the front end and then not on the back end. They DO NOT have Planstin but were sent the card and faked out when they call Planstin initially, so super frustrated about this. They aren''t good candidates to switch to SECURE since they don''t want need the wellness part. OH, if we convert to CARE+ she will get membership for $550 which is the price she''s seeing on Zion for their Direct membership. 
UPDATE - I just called her back and Leif has a brand new need for an ER visit for a kidney stone from last week and Natalie had a basal cell spot removed last year and needs to do a follow up on it soon to make sure it''s fine. So, the price difference is negligible and she''s happy to stay the course until further notice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-27 15:33:17', '2022-01-27 15:40:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085438018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086942001', 'James Evans, Jr.', NULL, '1-27-2022:  tt Jimmy and gathered a lot of info.  He qualifies &amp; may look at Secure instead.  We went into depth on the diff beween the 2 plans.  Both he &amp; his wife are self-emp (went over what they''d need to submit for proof of self-employment if they go that route).  I''m going to send him revamped pricing and we will talk next week.  He does want a 3/1/2022 eff date.  We discussed the price change coming with the 9/20/2022 (Oct contribution), so he''s aware that''s coming.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-27 15:13:20', '2022-01-27 15:13:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085438013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610622', 'Leif Anderson', NULL, 'Natalie called, she can''t get into the member portal.  Tried going thru John''s instructions, but there''s nothing in the CRM, so maybe people who can access Admin 123 can see something?  Sent chat to John asking him to please help her.  I can tell she has Wendy on the other line as well.      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-27 15:10:24', '2022-01-27 15:10:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085438008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630114', 'Elgin MacMillan', NULL, '1-27-2022:  Elgin needed help getting into his CirrusMD account.  We got the app on his phone and he can''t figure out his PW.  He''s going to try resetting it &amp; will let me know if he needs further assistance.     - CA

Elgin called back.  We got him into his app and got all the way to connecting with an MD ...  then he decided he didn''t really have time to do this right now.  So, he''ll go in later, but at least now he knows how.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-27 15:09:07', '2022-01-27 15:59:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085443003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081920010', 'Daniel Minerva', NULL, 'Per Jennifer I am assigning and mailing out a new QR Life Code Card and Fulfillment Package now. He should get it within 3-5 business mailing days. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-01-27 15:07:37', '2022-01-27 15:07:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085407033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081920010', 'Daniel Minerva', NULL, 'Welcome Call complete! Dan is going to be another AWESOME member of our Secure plan! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-27 14:52:50', '2022-01-27 14:52:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085407028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610622', 'Leif Anderson', NULL, '1-27-22 Per Patti, "I just got off the phone with Natalie Anderson. She is one of your Conversion members. She had just been in contact w/Zion who sent her to me. She is thinking of going direct with Zion as she is confused by all the "layering". I told her that she would be giving up alot of services that Zion doesn''t have. Talked about the MAP, Whole Health Living, Virtual Primary Care etc. She is hung up with the fact that Planstin thinks she has the MEC when she doesn''t. Also said that Sedera was easier to work with. I gave her your contact info and told her to call you and I said that I would let you know that she would be calling and that you would probably call her. She is the spouse of Leif Anderson."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-27 14:50:03', '2022-01-27 14:50:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085407023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001955049', 'Ting Ju Liao', NULL, 'Member did not answer for her Welcome Call. I left her a message asking to call back before 4:10 due to our busy Welcome Call schedule. She did not call back until 4:15 which did not give us enough time to go through her plan details and I had already sent Ting an email to reschedule. I explained to Ting that we did not have enough time for her call today due to the fact that I had another call right at 4:30 PM, but I do look forward to going over her plan with her soon. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-27 14:15:57', '2022-01-27 14:15:57'),
