  ('zcrm_1579374000085438003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689144', 'Lori Altman', NULL, '1-27-2022: Lori called -- she just had a telehealth appt w/her out-of-network doctor she works w/for ''mold'' health issues.  In talking we realized:  1) she''s had it a long time, so if it is a qualified ''need'', it could be pre-x  2) I went over the pre-x sharing.  I sent her the temp for submitting a ''need'' to Zion, deadlines, etc.  Also sent her the Prev temp as she''s going to need her annual phys soo.  Went over Planstin details: in network, MD must bill all prev coding to pay, etc.   She really appreciated all the help and thanked me for my assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-27 11:18:25', '2022-01-27 11:18:25'),
