  ('zcrm_1579374000085378033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069727014', 'Nathanael ORTIZ', NULL, 'Member''s 2/22 share amount declined I spoke to spouse who will update the account I will send out email to both emails 1/27 1/31-member submitted pmt update form I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-27 09:07:17', '2022-01-31 08:01:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085378028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065153628', 'Mojisola Collins', NULL, 'Member''s 2/22 share amount declined I spoke to member who will fill out pmt update I will email 1st notice -1/27 1/31- Final notice sent. 2/3-advised member that they had until 2/4 to make payment via email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-27 09:00:38', '2022-02-03 08:32:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085412003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082159001', 'Katherine Avinger', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-27 08:54:26', '2022-01-27 08:54:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085378023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061648159', 'Patrick Johns', NULL, 'Member 2/22 Share Amount declined.  Spoke to member he will fill out Update Form.1/27 1/31-sent final notice.  2/3 - advised member that he had until 2/4 to submit pmt info of be cancelled via email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-27 08:50:32', '2022-02-03 08:17:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085378018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004997077', 'David Whiley', NULL, 'Member''s 2/22 payment declined 1st notice sent 1/27 unable to leave VM 1/31-  3rd notice sent', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-27 08:47:10', '2022-01-31 09:54:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085407008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889025', 'Laurie Testa', NULL, 'Laurie called because she was confused as to who she should submit a Need to; I explained that she would need to submit any bills to Sedera for a need that goes over her $5,000 IUA. She asked to be transferred to Sedera and I also gave her their direct number and sent her instructions for how to submit a Need to Sedera. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-27 08:35:34', '2022-01-27 08:35:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085407003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085155002', 'Tova Jacober', NULL, 'Members start date is Feb. 1, 2022. Sent an email to Tovar to reschedule call for some time after start date. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-27 08:25:14', '2022-01-27 08:25:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085378013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191450', 'Terese McGroarty', NULL, 'Member''s 2/22 pmt declined VM &amp; 1st notice email sent 1/27 1/31-Member left VM that I can rerun pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-27 08:14:40', '2022-01-31 08:14:40');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000085378008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085365002', 'Douglas Saum', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-27 07:53:03', '2022-01-27 07:53:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085378003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471144', 'Scott Kendrick', NULL, 'After speaking with Wendy member submitted cancellation request.  I will notify Zion &amp; cancel &amp; refund 2/1 share amount', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-27 07:38:57', '2022-01-27 07:38:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085360024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297375', 'Kathleen Gramzay', NULL, '1-26-2022:  Kathleen called, she tested positive for Covid & wanted to know what is paid for because they are having her go in for IVs.  I went over cash-pay pt unless it turns into something more severe (example: end up in the hospital), then it would be something to submit for possible healthsharing past the 1k IUA (gave her deadlines too).  Sent her the temp for submitting a ''need'' to Zion in case she needs it.   She asked what her Planstin card was for & we went over ''preventative care''.  She''ll call when she needs prev to make sure she''s proceeding properly.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-26 17:32:40', '2022-01-26 17:51:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001653225', 'Isabelle Peyrichoux', NULL, '1-26-22 Isabelle is super nice and wants program similar to Fawn Gilmore Kraut and she has PDHC. So, I explained the differences between that and SECURE. Isabelle doesn''t have any pre-x, no meds, no tobacco and hasn''t really used LHS. Needs wellness visits soon and hasn''t done them in a while either. She''s paying $374 now. We can get her cost down to $275 March 1st until Oct. 1st at $300 / $1000. She''s ok with that. I can''t really waive the $100 since Fawn is highly recommending this and it was previously a different person, Lauren Wilson. She will need to pay the full $125 to make sure Fawn gets credit. Isabelle is self-employed and wants to cancel LHS as soon as possible, if we can get her in for Feb. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-26 17:18:02', '2022-01-26 17:18:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085360013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082256010', 'Martha Corona Torrez', NULL, '1-26-22:  Martha called to get instructions on the Planstin Preventative network, billing, screening vs diagnostic, what happens if it moves to healthsharing, on her annual labs, mammogram, colonoscopy, etc.  She seemed to grasp it and has the information.  Will call us if needs more help.     

Martha also mentioned her family member who has coverage thru us referred her.  I''m not seeing a referral person. = Rebecca Snyder = an MPB Member.   tt Patti & she suggested I ask Jane, who can in turn contact her regarding this.  Sent Jane an e-mail with the info.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-26 15:56:22', '2022-01-26 18:41:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471144', 'Scott Kendrick', NULL, '1-26-22 Scott called me back and wants to cancel for Feb. 1st. He''s working with an asset management company and he wants to keep everything under one roof. He said he had a accident this past summer with a terrible splinter in his hand. He went to the ER and claims no costs were shared. But, he couldn''t tell me the cost of the visit and he has a $2500 IUA. So, it may not have reached his IUA. He''s choosing a RMHC plan through broker through asset manager with a high ded and high mop. He doesn''t realize how terrible those plans are. He feels more comfortable with typical insurance upon pressure from asset managers. Nothing more I can do. His mind was made up!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-26 15:45:29', '2022-01-26 15:45:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659919', 'Rachel Denning', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 40-49 age band.  I will notify member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-26 14:32:13', '2022-01-26 14:32:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085350027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024193001', 'Mike Montes', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1294 Question : Hi, what is Guillermo''s email address?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-01-26 14:31:20', '2022-01-26 14:31:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, '1-26-22 Left vm for Melissa to help her with her membership. Left vm on her work phone as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-26 14:07:56', '2022-01-26 14:16:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085351028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, 'I called Melissa back to help clarify some information for her plan. I left her a vm and she did call back. After explaining her plan and directing her where to start, I tried asking Melissa if there was anything else I could assist her with...to which the answer was a dead phone line. She hung up on me. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-26 14:06:24', '2022-01-26 14:06:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810902', 'Michelle Chavez', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 30-39 age band.  I will notify member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-26 14:00:47', '2022-01-26 14:00:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055292170', 'Caleb Fisher', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 30-39 age band.  I will notify Member &amp; Advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-26 13:54:41', '2022-01-26 13:54:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085363002', 'Cory Muscara', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-26 13:48:37', '2022-01-26 13:48:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085360008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, '1-26-2022: Melissa called wanting to know how to have a colonoscopy and see an orthopedist.  She was challenging from the second I answered, yelling into the phone & not allowing me to reply.  I let her know I hadn''t worked with this plan before so I needed to gather a little info, which made her even more angry.  I tried to gather basic info: was she referred to an orthopedist?  general questions receive, "no one ever told me I''d need referrals to see doctors, but I work in a doctor''s off so I can get that if I have to."  I tried to explain I''m just gathering information since I''m new & haven''t worked with this plan.   Everything I said got a bad reaction.  tt Jennifer, we looked up guidelines and got together a plan of action.  Jennifer is going to call her back since I''m triggering her and go over how everything she does, needs to start by using Redirect''s app or calling them.  Hopefully, having a different entity on the phone will help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-26 13:45:09', '2022-01-26 13:45:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085362001', 'Laura Plummer', NULL, 'Member &amp; Child $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-26 12:57:06', '2022-01-26 12:57:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085351023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082418002', 'Patricia Sweeney', NULL, 'Script quote for Aimovig completed on 1/26/2022. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-26 12:53:36', '2022-01-26 12:53:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459043', 'Laura Plummer', NULL, '1-26-22 Laura is enrolling for her and kids. Scott is on Champ VA with permanent disability. He gets separate benefits and about $45K per year, non-taxable and will not need to join Laura and the kids on the membership. He''s going back to get his master''s degree now. Laura is leaving her current job at the end of Jan. and will lose her benefits by Feb. 1st. She can at least have Champ VA to protect them for major issues through Feb. Choosing SECURE $1000/$495 now for March 1st start date and $525 for Sept. 20th billing for Oct. membership. No pre-x other than one son with ADHD and anxiety meds. She excited to use the Life Care program to save money on that front.  She will be going back to work with an old client and she''s going to start out as 1099 contract worker on March 1st, 2022. If she chose to get benefits from them it would cost $1650 and her portion would be over $1000! Thrilled to have this option instead. I waived the $100 fee since she was a previous client on PSDHC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-26 12:38:28', '2022-01-26 12:38:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085361002', 'Belinda Fortman', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-26 12:34:40', '2022-01-26 12:34:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084517001', 'Kyle King', NULL, 'Members 2/22 Payment declined.  I let Cari know and will send out 1st email. 1/26-Member submitted updated info There was a typo in the Acct# entered at enrollment.  I reran Enrollment Fee &amp; Share Amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-26 12:15:56', '2022-01-26 14:28:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085351018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077830004', 'Angela Coy', NULL, 'Angela had called in asking whether or not her IUD would be something that Zion Health covers. After some research and speaking with Wendy, her IUD is not a covered expense due to her Care+ plan. I did call Angela back to inform her of this and she was thankful. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-26 12:15:44', '2022-01-26 12:15:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085351013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082414002', 'Trinity Bieker', NULL, '3 script quotes sent by Trinity were researched today. Most of the medications did have coupons but I could not find Progesterone Micronized - Bioidentical Hormone or the B12 injectable. I called Trinity to let her know and she stated that it is something that her Physician, who is also a holistic doctor, provided these 2 medications to her. I advised Trinity that she should speak with Zion regarding prior authorization for the holistic aspect of her Physician. I warm transferred Trinity to Zion to see if her physician would be eligible for the holistic medicine pre-approval. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-26 12:06:28', '2022-01-26 12:06:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085360003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081805002', 'Evan Chrisman', NULL, '1-26-2022:  Emily called.  She saying she hasn''t received anything from Zion or Planstin and when she called Planstin to ask for a card, they told her they do not see a membership for her.   Jennifer has access to the Teams chat w/Planstin & found a message from Timothy Hirsch saying our member just called & in their records, it shows the plan started & cancelled the same day: 1/1/2022.  Jennifer is going to keep me in the loop & help make sure once it''s sorted, that cards have been ordered for her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-26 11:51:06', '2022-01-26 11:51:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471144', 'Scott Kendrick', NULL, '1-26-22 Left cm for Scott to see if I can help him further with other options and to help cancel.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-26 11:50:28', '2022-01-26 11:50:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082599002', 'Joseph Morris', NULL, 'Members 2/22 Share Amount declined.  I sent out email and member submitted form with same info/slightly differently acct number.  I called member and compared the acct #''s come to find out that the 1st 5 numbers on original was a check #.  I put just Acct number and reran.  I will monitor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-26 11:00:07', '2022-01-26 11:00:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085328026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085155002', 'Tova Jacober', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of February 1, 2022. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-26 10:34:31', '2022-01-26 10:34:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085359003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141312002', 'Jude Hebert', NULL, '01.26.22:  Called and spoke with Jude.  He was referred by my member, Barry (James) Fontenot who has the same plan.  Wanted more information about the plan - gave presentation to Jude.  He is a w-2 employee.  I advised him there are no preventive care services included in CARE PLUS (immunizatons for his children).  He was ok with paying out-of-pocket for it.   Family is healthy, no meds.  Wife''s name is Sabrina.  Wants a $1000 IUA.   He has one child and one step-child.  Looking to have more children.  No particular start date required.  I explained the price increase as of 10/1/22 and deadline start date of 3/1/22 for current pricing until 10/1 ($550 - current, $580 - increase).  Said he would discuss it with his wife and get back to me next week.  Emailed Jude my site link, Guidelines and Maternity Guidelines.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-26 10:31:27', '2022-01-26 10:31:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085351008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890010', 'Carolyn Foss', NULL, 'Prescription quote sent to member. Unfortunately, neither myself or Reid were able to find Ivermectin 12 mg. Reid believes that this medication has been discontinued in the US and they do not have any supplies available to Reid. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-26 10:22:25', '2022-01-26 10:22:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082062002', 'Janice Jackson', NULL, 'Members 2/22 Share Amount declined 1st notice sent +VM - 1/26 1/27-Member called in and directed me to rerun pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-26 10:19:07', '2022-01-27 10:53:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085328021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081152001', 'Marilyn Arnold', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-26 10:16:38', '2022-01-26 10:16:38'),
