  ('zcrm_1579374000085334036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667061', 'orpheo mccord', NULL, 'Member ended up changing plan from initial enrollment in Care + to the Secure plan because located in CA.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-26 09:47:02', '2022-01-26 09:47:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085237002', 'Marie Pond', NULL, 'Member only $1000 IUA Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-26 09:43:24', '2022-01-26 09:43:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023159', 'Max Rebel', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation from after speaking with Darius.  I will notify Planstin and cancel in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-26 09:32:27', '2022-01-26 09:32:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085351003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877120', 'Andrea Thomas', NULL, 'Andrea called due to a recent visit to Urgent Care for what she thought was a UTI. I explained that with her plan she simply presents herself as a self-pay patient, ask for the best cash price and to collect all superbills related to this issue in case anything else stems from this visit to Urgent Care. Andrea also thought that her $1,000 IUA was something that was a one-time accumulation for the year, she did not realize that it was on a per needs basis. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-26 09:29:19', '2022-01-26 09:29:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085328016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029295143', 'Guy Travis', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-26 09:21:42', '2022-01-26 09:21:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471144', 'Scott Kendrick', NULL, 'Member emailed letting me know that he wanted to cancel his membership.  I will send out the cancellation and copy Wendy on it.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-26 09:19:23', '2022-01-26 09:19:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085334016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366134', 'Janell Vennard', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add newborn.  I will notify Zion and he will be effective 2/1/22.  No change in pricing as existing membership family.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-26 08:49:24', '2022-01-26 08:49:24'),
