Waiting on call back from client.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2022-01-25 15:45:32', '2022-01-25 15:45:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085251076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081920010', 'Daniel Minerva', NULL, '1-25-2022:  Dan just called 45 minutes late &amp; wondered if there was any way to do his ''Welcome Call'' today.  I helped him find the e-mail for rescheduling &amp; let him know I was sorry, but we cannot do it today as those employees are already gone today.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-25 15:17:19', '2022-01-25 15:17:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085251071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081920010', 'Daniel Minerva', NULL, 'Left vm for Daniel to do his Welcome Call. If I do not hear back from him by 4:45 PM EST I will be sending him a rescheduling link. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-25 14:34:18', '2022-01-25 14:34:18'),
