  ('zcrm_1579374000085233071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141312002', 'Jude Hebert', NULL, '01.25.22:  Called - mailbox not set up yet.  Texted to let meknow if he would be available tomorrow to talk.  Jude texted me back he would be free any time tomorrow.  I suggested 10 a.m. tomorrow for a call and he agreed.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-25 13:47:51', '2022-01-25 13:47:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085233066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141312002', 'Jude Hebert', NULL, '01.23.22:  Jude submitted a Quote Request.  Interested in Care Plus for his family - age 23, non smokers, IUA of $2500.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-25 13:46:12', '2022-01-25 13:46:12'),
