  ('zcrm_1579374000085251058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '1-25-2022:  Jennifer called back w/Samantha''s verified e-mail address:  samdenoyerappraisals@gmail.com     Sent CirrusMD invitation so Samantha can setup her account.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-25 12:56:33', '2022-01-25 12:56:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085251053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, 'Jennifer seems very confused about her plan, even after her Welcome Call. I answered her concerns about the CirrusMD app because she stated she just downloaded the app and the app let her go in without any log-in information. Upon verification, it appeared Jennifer had already registered for CirrusMD. We are awaiting her daughter, Sam''s, email so that we may send Sam a CirrusMD invitation. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-25 12:49:58', '2022-01-25 13:12:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085254003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162245', 'Rhonda Savage', NULL, 'Received phone call from Rhonda regarding the letter she received from us stating that we still have not received her itemized bills.  She stated that she had sent the email out already but that she would do it again.  I text her my email address.  She will send it again.  I will check with proof point to see when it comes in.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-01-25 12:33:25', '2022-01-25 12:33:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085251048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005806201', 'Marti Winkler', NULL, '1-25-2022:  Hadn''t heard from Marti, so I tried calling again.  LM wanting to make sure ''need'' started and this is progressing for them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-25 12:32:18', '2022-01-25 12:32:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085251043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297375', 'Kathleen Gramzay', NULL, '1-25-2022:  tt Kathleen.  Answered her questions.  She''s struggling to understand the diff layers of coverage: prev vs healthsharing.   I took about 4 calls in a short time &amp; I cannot remember specifics on this.  I think we talked basics...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-25 12:20:59', '2022-01-25 12:20:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085251038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714174', 'Jatin Bhatia', NULL, '1-25-2022:  Jatin called, his wife''s IUD is expiring and he wondered if Planstin would cover it.  I told him they do cover some bc''s but had him call Planstin (he had his card &amp; their #) because they can tell him with certainty.  He knows it must be an in network dr &amp; seemed set there.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-25 12:17:21', '2022-01-25 12:17:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085251028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '1-25-2022:  Jennifer''s daughter has had back pain for quite some time (so symptoms, treatment, etc, prior to their eff date.  She didn''t seem to know this could be pre-x.  I sent her a list of MDs in her daughter''s area from HCBB (she''s not found yet, but we are just at the 3 wk mark...) so they can try to find her a dr in TX.  She''s going to have her daughter go as a cash pay pt, and they may submit everything to Zion, knowing it may be denied as pre-x.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-25 12:08:15', '2022-01-25 12:08:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085252003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082421002', 'Luis Chug', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-25 11:12:16', '2022-01-25 11:12:16'),
