  ('zcrm_1579374000085251023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974237', 'Kylie Walsh', NULL, '1-25-2022: Kylie called.  She''s org &amp; verifying everything from her orig e-mail.  She''s off this wk &amp; will get her ''Welcome Call'' sched.  We did go over some basic info: make sure you both get your telehealth setup, Prev vs Need, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-25 10:37:27', '2022-01-25 10:37:27'),
