  ('zcrm_1579374000085233051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085361002', 'Belinda Fortman', NULL, '01.25.22:  Recvd. an email from Belinda.  Thanked me for notifying her of the price increase.  Wants to enroll today at 2 p.m. but I have an appointment at that time, so we scheduled her enrollment for tomorrow at 2 p.m.  Told her the info. she''ll need to enroll.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-25 09:48:07', '2022-01-25 09:49:08'),
