  ('zcrm_1579374000085184043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081805002', 'Evan Chrisman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request for another set of QR life code cards to member and wife. Stated they didn''t receive. Verified address as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-25 08:52:05', '2022-01-25 08:56:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085251008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670268', 'Andrew Braudis', NULL, 'Rachel called in regarding how to contact Planstin for the two tests that Kelly F. spoke with her about (Kelly F. did also provide Planstins contact information when she spoke with Rachel). I advised Rachel that she would have to speak with Planstin on how they would like to proceed with the payment for those 2 tests since she did not present her Planstin card. Rachel also stated that they had not received either copy of their Planstin card so I asked for those via the Teams channel. Rachel also inquired about Leahs (Eliots) hormone therapy because they are transitioning. I advised Rachel that Zion does not share in the cost of hormone therapy at this time. We discussed the CirrusMD app, the MAP program, and then I transferred her to Planstin so that she could speak with them about her two preventative care bills. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-25 08:37:03', '2022-01-25 08:37:03'),
