  ('zcrm_1579374000085251003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084517001', 'Kyle King', NULL, 'Sent email with Welcome Call scheduler asking member to reschedule her call for some time after her February 1, 2022 start date. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-25 07:50:34', '2022-01-25 07:50:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085184028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052617079', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, 'Member submitted the cancellation request as she needs to have surgery.  I will cancel her for an 2/1 eff &amp; refund her the Share amount.  I will notify Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-25 07:16:13', '2022-01-25 07:16:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085229021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086942001', 'James Evans, Jr.', NULL, 'James called &amp; asked for other IUAs &amp; pricing.  Sent Care+ &amp; Secure, all IUAs, &amp; his age banding 50-65, plus deadlines.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-24 21:18:50', '2022-01-24 21:18:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085233046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503016', 'David Mandell', NULL, '1-24-22 David''s wife is terrified of this membership and David no longer wants to press her on it. He''s giving in and deciding it''s necessary to cancel in spite of his desire to test the waters. They never cancelled their reg ins, so keeping that. They did it through C4 and he''ll ask his wife if she used a broker this year or not. If not, I sent him the instructions to select me as his agent. We''ll see...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-24 17:28:22', '2022-01-24 17:28:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085233041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746052', 'Shirley Grigsby', NULL, '1-24-22 Shirley will be aging into Medicare in March 2022. Patti asked her to wait until after 2-1-22 to submit her cancellation form which Patti will send in the next few days.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-24 17:12:04', '2022-01-24 17:12:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085233033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052617079', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, '1-24-22 Merryl reached Ann Davis and she is somehow able to allow Merryl to join by Jan. 25th for Feb. 1st start date. I don''t know how she''s doing it. But, she spent a ton of time with Merryl already and we all agree it''s not right to switch brokers at this point. Merryl will likely come back to me when she''s ready to re-join Cloud Medical and MPB after she''s through the surgery. She''s relieved and I don''t have to waster a bunch of time on reg ins for this complicated case.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-24 16:10:57', '2022-01-24 16:10:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085192071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862130', 'Marion Steed', NULL, 'Member called in saying that she needed to cancel because she was now on insurance.  I will send her the link.  Analisa knows she helped her enroll.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-24 14:55:45', '2022-01-24 14:55:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085186021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083296002', 'Jeffrey Keim', NULL, 'Welcome Call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-24 14:13:34', '2022-01-24 14:13:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085186016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104534011', 'Yu Deng', NULL, 'Welcome Call complete. She is not a good fit for MPB.Health as she does not understand anything. I went over the same thing throughout her Welcome Call because she could not understand what any of the components were for her plan. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-24 13:57:51', '2022-01-24 13:57:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085233028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052617079', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, '1-24-22 Merryl needs a nasal surgery which may cost $18-$20K or more and with Sedera only has sharing of $15K in her 2nd year of membership.  This is pre-x from when she was with LHS. If she can wait until July 1st she will have sharing up to $30K to help but she doesn''t want to wait bc she can''t breathe due to a bad surgery the first time around. She had 3 failed surgeries already! She wants to see Dr. Clark Walker at Integrated Ear, Nose and Throat and has surgery already scheduled for Feb. 24th! I called Broker Services and talked with Demaya who confirmed my belief that she can''t enroll now outside of open enrollment. Ann Davis with Anthem''s Direct Sales Team in Cincinnati, OH told Merryl she has until tomorrow/Jan. 25th to enroll for Feb. 1st start date. Ann''s # is 855-551-6917. Merryl just left her a vm to see if she was confused since she''s in OH, not CO. I will try her in a little bit too.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-24 13:40:25', '2022-01-24 13:40:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085233023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503016', 'David Mandell', NULL, '1-24-22 David is wanting to cancel for Feb. 1st already! I just left him a vm. Not sure what''s going on with them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-24 13:34:57', '2022-01-24 13:34:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085192066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153321', 'Elizabeth Limberg', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation as she was now going onto Spouses Insurance I will cancel w/RCI &amp; Sedera &amp; refund the Feb/22 Share Amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-24 13:24:48', '2022-01-24 13:24:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085192061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712116', 'Dorcas Mella', NULL, 'Member''s spouse submitted a cancellation as he will be turning 65 in the month of March/22.  I emailed him explaining that his wife must submit a Member Change Form to remove him.  I copied Mike Montes.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-24 13:21:20', '2022-01-24 13:21:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085231026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974301', 'Gerardo Garcia', NULL, '1.24.22:  I recvd. an email from Janna:  "I reached out and spoke with Gerardo on the same day I spoke with you on the phone. I was able to discuss this situation with our claims department and petition for these claims to be reconsidered for payment. It took a little bit of work to get this pushed through all the necessary channels but ultimately, I was able to get approval to reprocess the claims using reference-based pricing! I called and let Gerardo know and he is very pleased. I suggested that they find a new provider moving forward, that is in the network and guided him to where he can find that information from now on. Thank you for bringing this to our attention and going above and beyond to help this member get the best care possible. It brings me so much joy to be apart of solving these types of problems! What an exciting way to begin our work week! 
I responded to her email and thanked her for all her assistance.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-24 13:20:58', '2022-01-24 13:20:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085231018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974301', 'Gerardo Garcia', NULL, '1.13.22:  Recvd. an email from Rod asking me to resolve this issue. Gerardo''s wife, Jessica was having difficulty getting her "preventive" bills paid.  Despite all her efforts to go through the provider network, once she had the visits, etc., she was told that most of the bills would not be paid.  I called Janna at Planstin and discussed this issue w/her. I followed up w/an email stating the following:  "As we discussed, you will contact Jessica, ask for her approval to get the information you''ll require to review this case and explain the steps she''ll need to take to resolve her issue with the preventive services by her provider."  I asked Janna to keep me posted on her progress.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-24 13:16:31', '2022-01-24 13:18:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085233018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022038331', 'Ari Newman', NULL, '1-24-22 Ari is looking for mental health benefits. I sent him information about Life Care and referred him to the Concierge for assistance in accessing it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-24 13:04:21', '2022-01-24 13:04:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085233013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101280089', 'Jack Taylor', NULL, '1-24-22 Jack Taylor is the father of Henry (legal name John Henry). Henry is 13 and on employer coverage it will cost $500+! Employer is paying for Jack but not son. We can get him lower cost ins through C4. Jack also just raised $5K for Marshall Fire Assistance in a few days, but needed to step aside bc became too much to manage.  Jack''s a teacher and changed jobs. Ended past job on Jan. 11th. New teaching job is reason for losing affordable coverage for son and needing new ins for him Feb. 1st onward. Jack will finish the financial application part and call me when he''s ready to proceed. He had to jump off phone to conduct a class.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-24 12:54:57', '2022-01-24 12:54:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085192056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084962002', 'Amy Parker', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation prior to start.  I received email from advisor.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel in file. &amp; refund', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-24 12:49:40', '2022-01-24 12:49:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085233008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052617079', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, '1-24-22 Sedera notified Patti that Merryl called to cancel her membership with Sedera and has regular ins starting Feb. 1st. I left a vm with Merryl just now letting her know I will walk her through the cancellation process and that I''m happy to help her with any other options. Told her to call me back ASAP to complete cancellation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-24 12:48:44', '2022-01-24 12:48:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085231008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004737025', 'Taylor Hirst', NULL, '01.24.22:  Sent Taylor an email explaining what the $50/mo. fee was for - described the services.  Also compared the LHS current plan option, Liberty Unite (most expensive w/no cop-pay - the others have a co-pay) with SECURE and showed Taylor how much she would save with SECURE and get so many more services than w/LHS.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-24 12:39:53', '2022-02-17 13:37:35'),
