  ('zcrm_1579374000085227013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084640002', 'Deloris Spatafore', NULL, 'No response. Not able to leave message. Mailbox is full. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of February 1, 2022. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-24 12:34:26', '2022-01-24 12:34:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085192046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026291070', 'Alex Lutterbein', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation to be effective 1/31/22.  Per Karina he had not paid for February so no refund needed', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-24 12:33:21', '2022-01-24 12:33:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085233003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095963008', 'James Kjellsen', NULL, '1-24-22 Jim is 62 and turning 63 in July. Wife Cathy is 64 and retiring in March and they will lose their benefits. I explained price change of March 1st start date vs April 1st and he''s thinking of pushing it up to March 1st to save money until the Oct. 1st membership. Wife is totally healthy, no issues. Jim''s only concern is his knee which he had a meniscus surgery done in Aug. of 2021. He''s recently got a gel injection which is supposed to work for 2-3 years. He may need a few more injections over the years. He thinks he might need a knee replacement in the next few years and possibly after he''s on Medicare. He''s going to talk this over with his wife and doctor before he makes any decisions. Jim is self-employed, so SECURE $1000/$500 is March 1st start date and knows of price increase to $625 April 1st or Oct. 1st membership. He will share video with his wife and other info I send. I mentioned regular ins and he''s not really interested in that. He "gets" this and prefers to support this type of solution.  He also called back and asked about dental. I explained HMA and he will likely just put the $ in the markets to let it grow that way, but will still look at it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-24 12:26:16', '2022-01-24 12:26:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085192041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297144', 'Joseph Silva', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation because he got a ACA plan w/subsidies.  I will cancel w/Zion &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-24 12:17:51', '2022-01-24 12:17:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085231003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085361002', 'Belinda Fortman', NULL, '01.24.22:  Received an email from Belinda.  Couldn''t make it for 2/1 but wants to enroll for 3/1 and asked for next steps.  I responded and let her know about the price increase as of 10/1.  Told her I would help her complete her enrollment.  Asked her to let me know when she can schedule a call to enroll.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-24 12:16:04', '2022-01-24 12:16:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085229013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '1-24-2022:  Quentin called asking Jennifer for his ''Planstin'' card.  Being an OPD membership she asked me.  I let her know that since he has a DPC, it''s covered under that membership.  LM for Quentin so he knows he does not need a card.     - CA

Quentin called back.  Dr Patel''s office is telling him they need his ins card.  I let him know they prob haven''t realized he''s one of their OPD Members.  Offered to call them for him, but he wanted to try them first.  Let him know Laurie Anthony is our contact at the Winter Park location (although we show she''s only there until 11:30am), so if they are still unsure, she may be the one who can verify for him.  He had questions about lab work they may order.  I let him know the price of the labs is not included, so to make sure to be clear w/the MD that he needs to know prices upfront if they are done in office.  (some DPCs have discounted pricing for labs).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-24 12:12:13', '2022-01-24 12:23:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085229008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, '1-24-2022:  Eric called.  Zion is telling him one thing, his surgeon another...  He owes about $152 to meet his 1k IUA (Zion is saying they cannot talk to the surgeon until he''s done that).  The surgeon is telling him he has to pay 50k upon arrival for his surgery next week!  So, he''s going to call & overpay slightly on his IUA getting a receipt from the surgeon to show that payment; upload that pymt to Zion; then call Zion & ask them to talk w/his surgeon & workout the 50k.  He asked if he could call back if he needs to & I told him of course he can.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-24 12:11:32', '2022-01-24 12:11:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085192036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497185', 'Virginia Haupert', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation because she will be enrolling in the Secure plan.  I will notify Planstin and refund her Share Amount', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-24 11:58:29', '2022-01-24 11:58:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085192031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042309169', 'Rebecca Levine', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I notified Sedera &amp; will cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-24 11:53:36', '2022-01-24 11:53:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085186011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081968001', 'Curtis Freeman', NULL, 'Curtis called with a general question about going to a specialist. I explained the self-pay process and advised him to collect all of the detailed billing in the instance this goes over his IUA. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-24 11:53:22', '2022-01-24 11:53:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085192026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will notify Zion &amp; refund billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-24 11:39:08', '2022-01-24 11:39:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085227008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081302002', 'David Pearson', NULL, 'Followed up with Patti for the request to send David''s wife (Lisa) a consent form. Patti emailed on Jan 6, 2022. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-24 11:37:35', '2022-01-24 11:37:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085229003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881295', 'Lu Corvelli', NULL, '1-24-2022:  Lu ( I think she identified herself as LuAnn) called.  She was having trouble getting her 24 yr old son setup on CirrusMD.  We realized she was using Josh, instead of Joshua &amp; that fixed the issue.   I sent a req to Jennifer to req a hardcopy Zion card for her thru Teams as well, since I don''t yet have access.  Lu knows it will take at least 3 weeks.  We also did quick education on diff layers:  prev, telehealth, healthsharing.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-24 11:23:05', '2022-01-24 11:23:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085227003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075243068', 'Aaron Malusky', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-24 11:16:37', '2022-01-24 11:16:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085192021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049734012', 'Christine Dunn', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to know why she was still being charged.  I told her I never received a cancellation from her.  She expressed that she never used the plan.  I said that there are costs associated with the plan even though you do not use it.  Member refunded current payment of $49.95', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-24 11:06:24', '2022-01-24 11:06:24'),
