  ('zcrm_1579374000085192003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083475009', 'Mark Stevens', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in and left VM with sone question about plan her husband bought.  I emailed Leslie to reach out to her, however she is out of the office until 1/25 tomorrow.  I left VM for her leting her know that Leslie would be in contact with her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-24 08:47:12', '2022-01-24 08:47:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085186003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, 'James called in with questions about a possible COVID/Flu/Bronchitis issue he just went to the doc for. He was inquiring what happens if he does end up in the hospital with this issue. I explained the self-pay process up to his $1,000 IUA and then instructed him to keep any bills associated with this illness in the case that it goes about his IUA. James informed me that his prescriptions were already filled and payed for so I did go over the prescription quote form with him and sent him one via email for future use. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-24 07:52:22', '2022-01-24 07:53:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085184003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081595012', 'Aron Groner', NULL, 'Already seems he had a welcome call. Followed up and called member if he had further questions because he was on calendar for today at 9:30 a.m. est. for a welcome call but no response. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-24 07:37:54', '2022-01-24 07:37:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085154008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086942001', 'James Evans, Jr.', NULL, 'Sent req''d quote:  MS, Care+, 1k IUA, 50-65 age band.  Curr &amp; New &amp; deadlines.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-22 13:16:44', '2022-01-22 13:16:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085143036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072471089', 'Anita Fisher', NULL, '1-21-2022:  Anita is having her mammogram &amp; the facility asked if she wanted a 3D screening.  I let her know Planstin would have to answer that.  We discussed PHCS Network too.  She also is looking at some lab work - went over in network, kicks out disc generally even if not cov, &amp; ask pricing ahead so no bad surprises &amp; sometimes worth cking more than one lab (I sugg a few) &amp; she was good with that info.   Then I transferred her directly to Planstin.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-21 15:15:47', '2022-01-21 15:15:47'),
