  ('zcrm_1579374000085144018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497185', 'Virginia Haupert', NULL, '1-21-22 Ginny finished enrolling in SECURE from MPB CareZ Bridge and added kids to membership for Feb. 1st start date. She''ll completed cancellation form when she gets back home tonight.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-21 14:44:23', '2022-01-21 14:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085080127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085146002', 'Rebecca Snyder', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-21 14:42:18', '2022-01-21 14:42:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085127038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132050', 'Elizabeth Longbotham', NULL, 'Steve called with questions about doctors being in the PHCS network. He seems very confused on how his wife''s plan works, so I tried to take some time to help him with some of the issues he feels she is having with her plan. Steve was very happy at the end of our call with the information I provided him. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-21 14:21:00', '2022-01-21 14:21:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085127033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082845002', 'Mark Freeman', NULL, 'Welcome Call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-21 14:19:45', '2022-01-21 14:19:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085143031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '1-21-2022:  Jennifer called.  She has her ''Welcome Call'' next week, but wondered what her daughter might be able to do for a back ache that comes w/her periods.  We discussed Planstin = purely preventative, or I told her how to have her 21 yr old daughter signup for CirrusMD because they are a good starting point if it''s not an emergency.   She knows I''m available another 4+ hours and will let me know if they need further assistance today.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-21 13:53:19', '2022-01-21 13:53:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085143026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032830004', 'Thomas Schell', NULL, '1-21-2022:  Thomas called w/questions regarding moving to Care+.   W/Guy out I tried to help a little - transferred him dir to Sedera so he can see what his cut-off date for reapplying to their new platform.  He''ll plan to call Guy next week to go over options unless he finds out it is 1/31/2022, then he will just call me right back.  He''s been researching Zion vs our Care+ and we discussed our extras, prev vs no prev, but I told him Guy is really the person who needs to go over this with him.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-21 13:30:25', '2022-01-21 13:30:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085127028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081778002', 'Patrick Neary', NULL, 'Welcome Call complete! Pat is very knowledgeable about health share plans, he''s a great fit! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-21 13:27:34', '2022-01-21 13:27:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085144008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, '1-21-22 Kerek got a new job will full benefits. His company will pay 100% of his health insurance. So, he''s cancelling his membership for Feb. 1st, 2022. He was super pleased with the service he received. He plans to refer his friend Carolee Salad (Sp?) bc her family is totally panicked about the cost of their ins at the moment. They live in Gunnison. He will give them my information to reach out to me. He was extra nice in saying he doesn''t want the $100 fee! He wants me to have it and really just wants to help his friends who need help! Super nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-21 13:11:41', '2022-01-21 13:11:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085080107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, 'Per member they reached out tot the bank and they said that 2/22 pmt was declined because billing address was wrong. Member had not updated address w/us. I updated and will rerun pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-21 13:05:48', '2022-01-21 13:05:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085080102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064054002', 'Mark Dunkley', NULL, 'Member''s 2/22 payment declined 1st notice &amp; VM-1/21 Spoke to member he will update 1/26-member submitted pmt update form I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-21 12:48:57', '2022-01-26 12:29:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085143021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937123', 'Tracey Nauright', NULL, '1-21-2022:  Tracey is struggling w/her MAP mental health &amp; appts.  Her info was confusing.  First she said she was on hold w/them an hour yesterday (she did admit she was confused who she had called for this long hold time).  Then she said the 800# on their site wasn''t working.  I tried it from another line &amp; it did go thru, so she''s going to try them again today.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-21 12:46:28', '2022-01-21 12:46:28'),
