  ('zcrm_1579374000085080094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083935002', 'Henrik Andersen', NULL, 'Member''s 2/22 payment declined I will send first notice &amp; leave VM 1/21 Spoke to member he will fill out 1/21 Member submitted Pmt form I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-21 12:38:06', '2022-01-21 14:02:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085143013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042309169', 'Rebecca Levine', NULL, '1-21-2022:  Becca called &amp; her partner''s insurance, so she needs to cancel.  She''s calling Andrea right now.  I did go ahead and send her the cancellation form &amp; will let Patti know Becca''s calling Andrea as well.  She thought she was in time to stop payment, but we went over yesterday was the draw date.  She was fine with that when she realized.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-21 12:34:41', '2022-01-21 12:34:41'),
