  ('zcrm_1579374000085127023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080304002', 'Marcell Hetenyi', NULL, 'Marcell called wanting instructions on how to submit his Needs to Zion. I sent him the instructions via email.~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-21 12:17:01', '2022-01-21 12:17:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085143008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061317', 'Patricia Barnett', NULL, '1-21-2022:  Calling re: carpel tunnel.  We talked on the 14th &amp; I''m not sure why my notes are not here!  She wants to work naturally &amp; I suggested she submit a treatment plan w/Zion.  But, she''s slowly starting the process.     - CA

Orig collected info for Care Connect.  But, since Patricia has now decided not to have surgery, it will not be submitted.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-21 11:52:58', '2022-01-26 18:42:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085127018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061317', 'Patricia Barnett', NULL, 'Patricia called in asking about a follow up telehealth appointment she has with her primary care physician and wanted to know if it was covered by her Planstin card. I was trying to ask what the follow up appointment was for (preventative or not) when Patricia got frustrated and stated that she was sick of the rabbit hole called MPB.Health. Since Patricia did not want to cooperate with my questions, I transferred her directly to Planstin so that she could get an answer from them. When I stated that I was transferring her to Planstin due to her not wanting to clarify whether or not it was preventative, she said that I was useless. I then transferred her to Planstin. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-21 11:46:18', '2022-01-21 11:46:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085144003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, '1-21-22 Redirect just told Maya they are gifting her the services and payments they''ve been paying on her behalf when she was technically cancelled for the past year! This is why she was so confused and Redirect was confused too apparently. She will now move forward with Planstin for wellness and Zion for MCS. She is all set and happy!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-21 11:37:56', '2022-01-21 11:37:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085143003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, '1-21-2022:  tt Maya -
     -  Needed help setting-up their CirrusMD accts.  Sent support ticket to Cirrus to get help adding their daughter to both of their accts.
     -  Went over Planstin details for the annual prev.
     -  She needed help submitting multiple needs (some of the items are > a year, she understands timeline issues, but will get the various needs started (foot pain, sleep apnea, & something else).  She needed help sorting thru what goes to Planstin vs Zion.
     -  She''s still confused why Redirect is in the mix.  I confirmed we checked & it was cancelled.  Warned her that the pymt they have just auth for her mammogram is weird & I''d worry they''d come back to get that money.
     -  Questions re: COVID testing, I sugg using one of the free local Bldr Cty locations & she was good with that.  She has ordered her free tests from the gvmt as well.     - CA

Nestor w/CirrusMD let me know he got Annabelle added to both Nathan & Maya''s accts.   She sb all set.  It looks like the ph # we have for Maya may be inaccurate.  I tried to notify her via ph & it''s telling me it''s ''not a valid extension''.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-21 11:29:49', '2022-01-21 12:39:34'),
