  ('zcrm_1579374000085127013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949076', 'Michelle Smith', NULL, 'Michelle called in regarding whether or not a rapid COVID-19 test is something that is a covered expense. I explained to Michelle that due to it not being on the ACA list of preventative services, it is an out-of-pocket expense. She was very upset and hung up on me before I could let her know about the free test information that Wendy sent out to the concierge team. I did attempt to call Michelle back but could not get through. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-21 10:44:29', '2022-01-21 10:44:29'),
