  ('zcrm_1579374000085127008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075689380', 'Julie Wilson', NULL, 'Julie called in about going to an urgent care to be seen for a rash she just developed last night. I explained to Julie that she can use the CirrusMD services for this type of instance, but she was adamant that she wanted to go to an urgent care. I explained the self-pay process and to be sure to collect all of her super bills in case this does go over her $1,000 IUA. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-21 09:53:46', '2022-01-21 09:53:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085080048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844131', 'Adam Nolan', NULL, 'Member''s 2/22 declined  1st notice sent  - 1/21 spoke to member and he had fraud in his account I will send him the email w/the link to update and he will return. 1/26-received Pmt update from member and will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-21 09:51:32', '2022-01-26 08:18:24'),
