  ('zcrm_1579374000085080038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077181001', 'Andrea McDonough', NULL, 'Reached out to member for some reason this member declined however never came up in FTNI.  I called and left a VM for member and will send her out 1st email to update Pmt Method.  She owes for Jan &amp; February.  1/25-Member got back with me after speaking w/her bank.  Bank was bought out by another institution so Routing # changed.  I updated and re ran Jan &amp; Feb pmts.  Will monitor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-21 09:33:24', '2022-01-25 11:53:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085098018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496017', 'Asiye Erdilek', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-21 09:18:32', '2022-01-21 09:18:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085127003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, 'James called in requesting what happens if he is incapacitated and brought to the ER. I explained to James that we normally will receive a call from the hospital, we will explain that you belong to a medical cost sharing community and the process. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-21 09:12:32', '2022-01-21 09:12:32'),
