  ('zcrm_1579374000085098003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081054002', 'Stephanie Foo', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Member already had a welcome call on Jan 7, 2022 but was on booking calendar for today as well. I left a message if she like to have another call to reschedule a time that''s best for her. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-21 07:43:29', '2022-01-21 07:43:29'),
