  ('zcrm_1579374000085080003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, 'Member emailed me asking if the billing that we just took would be for the month of Jan as he is looking to cancel eff 2/1.  I emailed him back and told him to be in contact with Wendy to advise.  Copied Wendy', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-21 07:19:24', '2022-01-21 07:19:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085066003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890002', 'Bonita Keith', NULL, '1-20-2022:  Bonita replied to my RX pricing & it was very confusing.  When I look at her e-mail, the prices I sent her are still best, plus she''s talking about Optum RX (did she receive some of the Optum RX cards Zion sent out that do not apply to our members?).  Anyway, I replied "maybe I''m missing something?  My pricing is for 90-day supply as she requested, some of hers are 30-day, others 90... I think it''s just very confused.  Went ahead and attached my GoodRX coupons from yesterday so she could see the Brookshire Pharmacy prices that were excellent and yet she could get both at the same location.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-21 00:29:59', '2022-01-21 00:29:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085052018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871160', 'Katie Roth', NULL, '1-20-22 Katie is aging into Medicare in March.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-20 17:42:33', '2022-01-20 17:42:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085052013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497185', 'Virginia Haupert', NULL, '1-20-22 Ginny is looking to add her  kids and convert to SECURE from CareZ Bridge since past pre-x period and can get better rate. Sent her instructions and let her know to do so ASAP for Feb. 1st. Extension to 21st for making the change.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-20 17:32:44', '2022-01-20 17:32:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085015036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086964002', 'Lani Cordova', NULL, '1-20-2022:  Lani Cordova (the wife/mother) & I talked - they have Liberty & are looking to chg.  Her husband Sherdon (sp?) Cordova owns his own bus w/10-15 emp.  [we may look at employees later, but the deadline for a 2/1/2022 eff date has only been extended to tomorrow], so we are focusing on their family first.  The have 7 children still at home:  18, 15, 14, 12, 9, 7, 5  plus a 20, 21 yr olds that are no longer in the HH.  She likes the HSA & that may be a deciding factor.  However, the prev Zion has if she purchases from them doesn''t have the Network limitations and they live in a small town, so that is difficult.  We went over the doctors in their area & she''s reviewing as part of her decision.  Discussed pre-x, RXs, no tobacco users.  Sent her quotes for now & coming pricings, plus Sherdon is 48, so let her know what top age band currently looks like (so they have an idea of that scenario).', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-20 17:24:38', '2022-01-20 17:24:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085015031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013377044', 'Michael DeSocio', NULL, '1-20-2022:  Michael called.  He needs to submit everything for a growth on his lymph nodes (I think that''s what he said).   I sent him the temp for submitting a ''need'' w/Zion.  However, he said this dates back about 6-months, so I let him know he needs to get this going asap!  That they do limit how long you have to submit things to consider them part of the ''need''.  He''ll start work on it right away.  We went over he has a $5000 IUA.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-20 17:00:36', '2022-01-20 17:00:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085052008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, '1-20-22 Per Patti, "...they emailed me this morning verified if she was cancelled. Yet they told me that they would continue to help her with her bills. So not sure what that''s all about. Either way I have a tracking # for all Redirect cancellations."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-20 16:19:52', '2022-01-20 16:19:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085052003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, '1-20-22 I talked with Maya (Elizabeth) Burlingame and got her on track with her current membership. BUT, Redirect has been helping her for the past year via their Spruce app and they''ve been helping to negotiate rates on her behalf. It sounds like Redirect never got cancelled properly. They are able to pull her account up somehow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-20 16:19:18', '2022-01-20 16:19:18'),
