  ('zcrm_1579374000085015026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082226002', 'Garrett Taylor', NULL, '1-20-2022:  Marybeth called &amp; needed help correcting how their CirrusMD accounts were setup.  I sent a support ticket so they could get help correcting things.

Also walked her thru the WHLC registration.  The link was not working, so I helped them get in so they can look for a dental discount.   If they are interested in dental insurance, rather than discounts, I let her know to call their advisor Zach Masters.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-20 14:25:05', '2022-01-20 14:25:05'),
