  ('zcrm_1579374000085015013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080021001', 'Amy Fowler', NULL, 'Amy called for guidance on using her Planstin for a well-woman appt.  We went over everything.  She seems set &amp; will make sure her MD is in Network to make sure it''s covered.  Went over looking at what is and is not cov on the ACA site too.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-20 13:47:48', '2022-01-20 13:47:48'),
