  ('zcrm_1579374000085015008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233193', 'Rebecca Kirk', NULL, 'Geoffrey Kirk called (=Rebecca''s husband).  He needs to add their week old baby &amp; himself.  Also, the address in their CRM file hasn''t been updated.  Sent him Patti''s change form &amp; did let him know today is the deadline for having those changes effective 2/1/22.  He says he will do it right now.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-20 12:57:24', '2022-01-20 12:57:24'),
