  ('zcrm_1579374000085013008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009836013', 'James Brignall', NULL, 'James called regarding a upcoming orthopedic appointment. I explained the self-pay process and he had the needs submission link for Zion already. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-20 10:33:03', '2022-01-20 10:33:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085015003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949076', 'Michelle Smith', NULL, 'Michelle needed help getting into her CirrusMD account.  She should be all set.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-20 10:21:10', '2022-01-20 10:21:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000085013003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084272002', 'Stephanie Wolk', NULL, 'Stephanie ended up speaking with Karen Torsoe about her plan components and start date. After her conversation with Karen, it was determined that she is going to hold off on starting her plan until 4/1/2022 per John Kach. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-20 10:16:31', '2022-01-20 10:16:31'),
