  ('zcrm_1579374000084991018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '01.20.22:  Jenni texted to ask if we could give her and her daughter the tools to find a provider in Fort Worth, TX, where she is temporarily residing.  I told her to call our concierge (and included their phone number) who will research is for her or, if she prefers, will provide her with the tools to look it up herself.
I noted in Jenni''s profile, she hasn''t yet had a Welcome Call.  I texted her to advise that she schedule this call, as it will educate her on how to use and register for the services in her plan.  I gave her options to get the link.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-20 10:04:41', '2022-01-20 10:04:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084991013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '01.14.22:  I responded to Jenni''s LASIK inquiry - it is not shared by Zion.  Cataracts are, after a 1-year waiting period.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-20 09:42:29', '2022-01-20 09:42:29'),
