  ('zcrm_1579374000084991003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '01.08.22:  Jenni responded to my text that the situation is good for now and thanked me for checking in.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-20 09:38:26', '2022-01-20 09:38:26'),
