  ('zcrm_1579374000084974003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083256010', 'Marc DiNunzio', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-20 08:06:54', '2022-01-20 08:30:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084969018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063771010', 'Katherine Pettit', NULL, 'Members spouse called in letting me know that they had other coverage and had to cancel.  I asked if he had spoken to Zach, which he had not.  I sent the cancellation link to him and advised him to get that to me today and to be in touch with Zach.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-20 07:53:57', '2022-01-20 07:53:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084972003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063771010', 'Katherine Pettit', NULL, 'Ron called in for several reasons: He would like an update on his Need with Zion, he wanted to cancel his membership, and inquired about MPB.Health member portal information. I explained that he would have to call Zion about his needs status, transferred him to Patti for his cancelation, and sent him and Katherine the MPB.Health member portal log-in information. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-20 07:50:37', '2022-01-20 07:50:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084969013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027220170', 'Trisha Fortune', NULL, 'Member emailed me letting me know that she wanted to cancel.  I responded and sent her the cancellation link and advised her that she needed to submit cancellation form.  She also wanted to know about a "prorated refund"  I advised that her membership would cancel 1/31 so no refunds.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-20 07:40:25', '2022-01-20 07:40:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084969008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001063061', 'James Tipple', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-20 07:21:58', '2022-01-20 07:21:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084969003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082256018', 'Megan Ford', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-20 07:18:59', '2022-01-20 07:18:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084955049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087106', 'Jennifer Mangin', NULL, '1-19-2022: Tyler called wondering how he would go about looking into dental coverage for his family.  I made sure he has Wendy Scipione''s phone # &amp; he will call her.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-19 16:49:04', '2022-01-19 16:49:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084955041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890002', 'Bonita Keith', NULL, '1-19-2022:  Spent time pricing with Bonita &amp; sent preliminary (GoodRX) prices &amp; which pharmacies.  She was doing this over chat &amp; had to run.  She knows to look for my e-mail &amp; get back to me once she can give me specifics on where she wants to go so I can send her the coupons.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-19 16:37:18', '2022-01-19 16:37:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084955036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380257', 'Rachel Brisson', NULL, '1-19-2022:  Rachel e-mailed asking if she should upload RXs that are linked to her ''need''.   I told her it can''t hurt to upload them, however, RXs are handled in diff manners & some will be out-of-pocket, including maint RXs.  I reminder her to call the Concierge Line for help finding the best prices in her area.

She''s been paying everything out-of-pocket, so I went in to details on working w/Zion to make sure they have everything to approve her need so they can start paying.  Gave her Zion''s ph #, & other details on how this works.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-19 16:35:50', '2022-01-19 16:35:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084955031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974301', 'Gerardo Garcia', NULL, '1-19-2022:  A doctor''s office called requesting ''insurance'' information for Jessica Ramirez.  However, in trying to confirm, the DOB the doctor''s office gave was in Sept for Jessica &amp; that did not match our DOB records.  I suspect one of us may have the wrong DOB on file because it was for a "Planstin Insurance Claim".   So, I did a direct transfer to Planstin &amp; gave her their number.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-19 16:15:47', '2022-01-24 13:12:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084933015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890002', 'Bonita Keith', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Cari', 'Visit ID : 1275 Question : Hi!! I am looking to find information on my son''s maintenance medications before I call in his refill to his doctor. Are you able to help me with that?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-01-19 15:12:41', '2022-01-19 15:12:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 14:34:07', '2022-01-19 14:34:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084955023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, '1-19-22: Haven''t heard back from Catherine after sending her a reminder e-mail 3 days ago.  Tried calling yesterday & the system wouldn''t complete the call, so called & LM today:  it''s critical we talk today, tomorrow, or Friday (we have ext this month to Fri the 21st) to get her moved to the new plan!

1-19-22:  Catherine & I walked thru getting her signed-up on Care+.  She is registered on her husband''s business and it sounds like would qualify for Secure.  At some point she may ask to change.  We went over the limitations there, but she was okay with that, plus she''s on the 1k IUA, so it won''t change that.  She should be all set for a 2-1-22 eff date on the new Care+ w/Zion.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-19 13:48:38', '2022-01-19 14:29:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075870199', 'Jennifer Voigt', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel w/Sedera and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 13:46:13', '2022-01-19 13:46:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075870247', 'Kyle Gustafson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will notify Zion and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 13:39:35', '2022-01-19 13:39:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084919013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082418002', 'Patricia Sweeney', NULL, 'Script quote completed 1/19/2022 ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-19 13:22:58', '2022-01-19 13:22:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084962002', 'Amy Parker', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 12:57:05', '2022-01-19 12:57:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084955018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001637159', 'Gretchen Wegner', NULL, '1.19.2022:  Gretchen is in a very complicated situation.  Zion is unsure if it''s one or more separate ''needs'', they are trying to figure out what she has.  After a looong talk, she feels better & is going to ask Zion for a point of contact since this is convoluted.  I transferred her there directly.  I think she felt better knowing they may be evaluating and have answers soon (she was told the doctors at Zion were meeting yesterday to go over her case).  It turns out I had a similar issue and surgery so I was able to help her thru the situation in a way that made her feel better.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-19 12:52:04', '2022-01-19 12:52:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082614002', 'AMY TANTAU', NULL, 'Member submitted Plan Change form to change her plan frm Care + to Secure was unaware that she did not have Preventative benefits.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 12:44:40', '2022-01-19 12:44:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083717854', 'Teresa Bradford', NULL, 'I was able to get Teresa back on to the RCI CoPay plan.  I did not know she needed the drug coverage.  I changed her plan in A123 and sent Wendy a teams msg to this effective.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 12:42:19', '2022-01-19 12:42:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084955013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, 'Frances called back.  We went over the diff entities, how to utilize her prev thru Planstin, when it moves to healthsharing, telehealth, etc.  She''s starting to understand &amp; will call now ahead of appts to make sure she understands if she has further questions.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-19 12:16:52', '2022-01-19 12:16:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084956002', 'Paul Notartomaso Jr', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 12:07:23', '2022-01-19 12:07:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084951011', 'Paul Notartomaso', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 12:04:29', '2022-01-19 12:04:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084955008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366134', 'Janell Vennard', NULL, 'Janell called, needing to add a child:  Benjamin Vennard  11/29/2021.   I sent her Patti''s chg form temp. 
 Her pregnancy was declined as pre-x item so the maternity need wasn''t covered by Zion.   She says between him coming a month early & her having to go straight back to work, she just realized she hasn''t added him.  She asked if it was too late.  I let her know it''s not too late to add him, however there may be a waiting period when it''s outside the 30-day window for adding a newborn.  She seemed to understand.  She''ll get the form sent to Patti.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-19 11:24:16', '2022-01-19 11:24:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084955003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084170014', 'Michael Misko', NULL, 'Michael called re: his ''Welcome Call'' at 1:15pm Eastern.  We talked about his eff date &amp; how the call needs to be past that date &amp; why, so he''ll go in and reschedule.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-19 11:18:07', '2022-01-19 11:18:07');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000084954003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075243068', 'Aaron Malusky', NULL, 'Karen created a Ticket for Aaron. For more details see Ticket, which is now Closed as I have fixed the issue and got everything he needs sent out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-01-19 11:10:47', '2022-01-19 11:13:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084894042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082599002', 'Joseph Morris', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-19 11:05:25', '2022-01-19 11:05:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084894037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084170014', 'Michael Misko', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of February 1, 2022. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-19 11:02:47', '2022-01-19 11:02:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084894028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-19 10:49:15', '2022-01-19 10:49:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084946002', 'Tracie Reithmann', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 10:30:39', '2022-01-19 10:30:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084894023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083445002', 'Kathleen Randall', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-19 10:21:32', '2022-01-19 10:21:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084903010', 'John Devanny', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 10:14:50', '2022-01-19 10:14:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084903002', 'Christopher Key', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 10:12:35', '2022-01-19 10:12:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014189229', 'Gemma Lynn Davis', NULL, 'Member called in with some questions.  He son had some sort of accident last year possibly Sept. time frame and they incurred approx $800 in expenses.  She mentioned that son was still having problems and that they were going to take him to a specialist.  I told her that if current issue was a result of previous accident the $800 that they spent would count towards their IUA.  I advised her to be in contact w/Zion.  She also asked about a referral I told her to give name to Jeff and that enrollee would need to put her name down as referrer and would have to be on the plan for 60 days.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 10:07:40', '2022-01-19 10:07:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084894018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069192221', 'Leslie Alexander', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-19 09:37:39', '2022-01-19 09:37:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084919008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695318', 'Regina Mailloux Jensen', NULL, 'Fred called in because he is looking to have a hernia repair done at the end of this month. I warm transferred Fred to Sedera so that they can instruct him further on what he needs to do. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-19 09:19:36', '2022-01-19 09:19:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, 'I have submitted the request to change the name on the account.  Not sure why this was not done back in May.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 09:15:40', '2022-01-19 09:15:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084919003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, 'Tess called due to an injury she sustained last night. She is wanting to go to her child''s pediatrician since the nearest urgent care does not open until this afternoon. Upon verifying information for Tess, we realized that her last name is incorrect as well as her address. I have reached out to Patti since the member states that she submitted both a name change and an address change form via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-19 09:01:15', '2022-01-19 09:01:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084894013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084457009', 'Eugena Bring', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of February 1, 2022. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-19 08:35:16', '2022-01-19 08:35:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084894008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080864013', 'Marian Townsend', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-19 08:25:37', '2022-01-19 08:25:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521183', 'Samuel Conklin', NULL, 'We were notified that Sedera no longer is able to offer it''s memberships in PA and will cancel this members plan eff 2/1/22.  Ron following up with member to possibly enroll in Zion.  I will cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 08:08:03', '2022-01-19 08:08:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084894003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082415002', 'Evolene Premillieu', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-19 07:49:07', '2022-01-19 07:49:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084833002', 'Heath Honbarrier', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 07:47:40', '2022-01-19 07:47:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084832001', 'Gail Cole', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 07:42:46', '2022-01-19 07:42:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084818009', 'Troy Conrad', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 07:40:31', '2022-01-19 07:40:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486039', 'Sean Keefer', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I left message for advisor to f/u with member but since I have not heard back and member is on Sedera I will process cancellation.  Member citing cost as issue.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 07:31:02', '2022-01-19 07:31:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081697002', 'Jennifer Zoldock', NULL, 'Per Cari''s note below I will go ahead and process Jennifer''s cancellation.  I will notify Zion &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 07:24:19', '2022-01-19 07:24:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084872003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'ID cards ordered via RCI portal after address update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-19 07:17:19', '2022-01-19 07:17:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084816049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084822458', 'William Denham', NULL, '1/12/2022:  Sent price quotes for Care+ 1k & 2500 IUAs, plus other details.

1/14/2022:  Had detailed phone conversation with William, going over the extras our Care+ plan includes.  He''s looking at going direct w/Zion, so we compared.

1/18/2022:  William decided since Zion includes the telehealth for free & that''s the only extra he cares about the $45 >/mo (new pricing structure) with us is not of interest.  I let him know I understand.  That we use diff telehealth providers (or used to), so if anything changes, plez let me know.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-18 17:24:56', '2022-01-18 17:29:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084816041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032454006', 'Georgannna Garrison', NULL, 'Georgeanna called.  They are traveling internationally to a country that requires they show proof, that if they are hospitalized for Covid while there, they have "insurance" to pay for it.  I gave her Zion''s ph # &amp; transferred her directly letting her know they''d be the ones that would have to provide something &amp; reminding her they have a 1k IUA per incident (so if they both got it &amp; were hospitalized, they''d both need to cover an IUA)    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-18 16:59:13', '2022-01-18 16:59:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084816033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081697002', 'Jennifer Zoldock', NULL, 'Jennifer called - she just got a new job where they are giving her insurance so she needs to cancel.  Due to the timing issue with the up-and-coming draw, I went ahead &amp; sent Patti''s cancellation temp.  I notified Patti and let her know via a Teams chat that Jennifer is going to contact her advisor Zach Masters right now, so that sb done too.   - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-18 16:30:56', '2022-01-18 16:43:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084816028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005806201', 'Marti Winkler', NULL, 'The process for submitting and handling Care Connect cases is adjusting.  So, I sent Marti the link for starting a ''Need'' with Zion right away.  Let her know they would contact her to sign a medical records release form, so keep an eye on your e-mail.  LM when I couldn''t contact her w/instructions.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-18 16:19:16', '2022-01-18 16:19:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084816023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079897013', 'Shawn Weiman', NULL, 'Shawn called - he was able to setup his CirrusMD acct, but CJ (Cathy Jane) is receiving an error code that they do not recognize her.  I sent a support req e-mail to CirrusMD including her unique e-mail: cjweiman123@gmail.com and asked for help.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-18 16:00:18', '2022-01-18 16:00:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084755008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079897013', 'Shawn Weiman', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1271 Question : Hi. My wife and I are new to the program. I was able to register, but a "no record found" error is returned when my wife tries to register. Thank you.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-01-18 15:20:58', '2022-01-18 15:20:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084826009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004737025', 'Taylor Hirst', NULL, '01.18.22:  Called Taylor - l/m to c/b.  Taylor called.  Talked to her about changing her HES plan for SECURE.  She seemed interested.  She said her daughter, Harper, has hip displasia but has been cleared of this condition.  She said she lost her membership card a few years ago.  She, then, said she''d tried for 4 years with LHS to remove what she thought was a monthly processing fee of $50.  LHS told her they have nothing to do with us. Taylor said HES didn''t exist and she didn''t know how to cancel the $50 fee.  I started to explain the payment process, etc. and got cut off.  I called and left a voicemail and a text, asking her to call me when she can. Taylor texted back her phone died.  She''ll call me today or tomorrow.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-18 15:04:38', '2022-01-18 15:10:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084762136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082626002', 'Leon Wisniewski', NULL, 'New Plan Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-18 14:34:17', '2022-01-18 14:34:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084762131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082626002', 'Leon Wisniewski', NULL, 'Member submitted change form to change plan from Care + to Secure.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-18 14:33:59', '2022-01-18 14:33:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084817013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696196', 'Daniel McManus', NULL, '1-18-22 Daniel is employee at DMak Productions with Joe Forte organizing their healthcare. DMak is paying for the memberships for Daniel and James Rosenow. Daniel doesn''t have pre-x but seems to have needs for mental health counseling. He danced around the topic with Joe and James around. I let him know that pre-x wasn''t relevant for the virtual healthcare app or for the mental health counseling and that seems to appease him. He doesn''t have any other pre-x. He was happy to switch from PDHC to SECURE for the mental health, HSA and virtual healthcare benefits.  Wasn''t worried about losing unlimited in person PCP visits. Chose $1000/$275.  I believe I told Joe Forte of the price increase in Oct. I didn''t remember to tell Daniel just now. His will go from $275 to $300.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-18 14:13:46', '2022-01-18 14:14:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084817008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011237', 'Kristen Leatherman', NULL, '1-18-22 Left vm with Kristen to let her know I have some new options to offer to help save them $. SECURE $1000/$685 now and $715 in Oct is better than their $849+$50 per month now. Also let her know if the payment issue.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-18 14:07:37', '2022-01-18 14:07:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084772034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132050', 'Elizabeth Longbotham', NULL, 'Steve called back very frustrated that his wife''s doctor is not in the PHCS network. I explained to Steve that he could nominate her doctor if he would like but he does have to find an in-network provider for her preventative services. Steve will call back with any other questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-18 13:55:48', '2022-01-18 13:55:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084762126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011237', 'Kristen Leatherman', NULL, 'Members CC Declined I will notify member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-18 13:19:55', '2022-01-18 13:19:55'),
