  ('zcrm_1579374000084772029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060578572', 'Steven Ford', NULL, 'Steven called wondering why he cannot use his teledoc services. Upon further investigation with Patti, Steven cancelled his plan in September of 2021 with an October 1, 2021 end date. I called Steven and left him a vm informing him of his cancelation. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-18 13:08:09', '2022-01-18 13:08:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084816018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132050', 'Elizabeth Longbotham', NULL, 'Eliz''s husband Steve called.  His wife (&amp; daughter?) are having prev appts. Eliz''s is Thurs, so he wanted to find out how to handle it.  We went over all the Planstin guidelines.  The doctor, Michelle Wong is not coming up on the PHCS search, so we went over what to do from here.  He seems to understand, but will call us back if he needs further assistance.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-18 13:06:42', '2022-01-18 13:06:42'),
