  ('zcrm_1579374000084824003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084653001', 'Marianne Aultz', NULL, 'QR Code for Ammon 5th one, no space in QR Code spot above: H0UGZ. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-01-18 12:01:10', '2022-01-18 12:01:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084816013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032281037', 'Tammie Petty', NULL, 'Tammie called.  Last April both David & Tammie had their wellness ck ups & she wanted to submit those receipts.  So, we went through the education process of how to handle prev, MD must bill, must be in network, etc.  She''s appreciated knowing the proper steps and was a bit frustrated realizing how little she knew about this, but did say maybe she''d just forgotten.  She''s going to contact the doctor''s office to see if maybe they''d bill it, yet knows it may be outside the billing window.

They moved to TX, so I sent her Patti''s template with the change form too.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-18 11:55:18', '2022-01-18 11:55:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084762076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084814001', 'James Rosenow', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-18 11:53:10', '2022-01-18 11:53:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084772021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084272002', 'Stephanie Wolk', NULL, 'Stephanie called in with some very interesting questions today. She is a Feb. 1, 2022 start and is wondering if she can start submitting bills to Zion for her vision, dental, and therapy sessions so that she can start getting reimbursed right away. I explained to Stephanie that she cannot use any of her plans components until her Feb.1 start date. She then asked how she can get around the pre-existing conditions clause because she just recently went to the optometrist who told her that she may have to have cataract surgery soon. She wants to make sure that Zion does not find out this is a pre-existing condition because she doesn''t want to have to pay out of pocket for the procedure.  I explained that, even if her plan had started, Zion could easily pull her medical records to see if the cataracts were in fact a pre-x condition. Next Stephanie wanted to know when she could start submitting her therapist bills to Zion for partial reimbursement (a $60 reimbursement) that she states Karen promised her she would receive starting at the time of her joining MPB. At this point I advised Stephanie that she needs to speak with Karen about her plan and its components. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-18 11:53:01', '2022-01-18 11:58:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084762071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084812002', 'Hermilo Cavazos', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-18 11:49:18', '2022-01-18 11:49:18'),
