  ('zcrm_1579374000084772013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065477526', 'Richard Bausch', NULL, 'Richard called regarding an open need he has with Zion and how he should upload some updated information for a need. I warm transferred Richard to Zion so that they can assist him with his need. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-18 10:51:55', '2022-01-18 10:58:04'),
