  ('zcrm_1579374000084817003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084814001', 'James Rosenow', NULL, '1-18-22 James is enrolling in SECURE for him and 1 year old son $1000/$495. Wife will be having baby in April and they will add her and baby sometime after that time. They will make sure wife gets through all traditional follow up appts for her and baby. They will include MEC to get all wellness visits as well. No pre-x. DMak is paying for it so just need to show proof of employment through DMak.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-18 10:32:04', '2022-01-18 10:32:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084816003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048347128', 'T. Michele Armstrong', NULL, 'Michele called: she rec''d a form for authorization to access her records, but has no way to print it out.  She thought I could resend.  Let her know it most likely came from Sedera &amp; she agreed.  She said she could use a refresher on submitting her bills to Sedera so I sent her the temp &amp; she''ll call them re: the form.  She has been making sure everyone knows she''s a cash-pay pt.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-18 10:31:30', '2022-01-18 10:31:30'),
