  ('zcrm_1579374000084772008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491891', 'Brenda Pepin', NULL, 'Zoho ticket from 1/11/2022 went unanswered until 1/18/2022 due to Jennifer being out sick with Covid-19. I left member a vm on 1/18/2022 to have her call the concierge team for instructions on how to proceed with her need for her ER visit for a gall stone. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-18 08:23:22', '2022-01-18 08:23:22'),
