  ('zcrm_1579374000084762003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921360', 'Maria Lorences-Cruz', NULL, 'Per email member cancelled with Zion.  Paul had directed her to me however I received no calls from her and she said that she has left VM''s for me.  I will send her out the link via email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-18 07:12:32', '2022-01-18 07:12:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084734060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, 'Julie e-mailed Wendy asking for help with seeing a ''Need'' she submitted online w/Zion.  I replied all with instructions &amp; Zion''s ph # in case she has issues.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-17 19:49:25', '2022-01-17 19:49:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084734052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331068', 'Brian Guarneros', NULL, 'Brian called for several items:
     - He wants to find a new PCP closer to him in the 80302 area.  I asked how he felt about a Family Practice MD because there are more listed in the areas he suggested then Gen Practice that come up high quality, fair price.  He said he was find starting there.  This is key because he needs to get a refill on his prescription (which he was told he needs to see a Dr to have refilled).
     - I gave him a quick price on the anticipated expense if they keep him on the same RX & Costco was best.  Once he has a new RX, he will call for a coupon.
     - He''s starting to have post hip-replacement issues.  The pain is getting worse.  I asked & his hip replacement surgery was Dec 2019 (I think that was the timeline = < 1 yr from his eff date.  However, he''s in his 2nd yr of member w/eff date 9/1/2020 so he will have some help.  We discussed it and since first & foremost looking for a new MD (see above) he''ll see if they have someone they would suggest since he thinks he needs a specialist.  I did go over how pre-x sharing steps up, that he''s in yr 2 and what he''ll need to do via e-mail.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-17 18:02:22', '2022-01-17 18:45:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084740053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084814001', 'James Rosenow', NULL, '1-14-22 James is 25, wife is 23 and still on parent''s insurance. Wife is pregnant and due in April. James works for DMak with Joe Forte that has been communicating with me. He''s healthy, no meds, no tobacco. He does his annual wellness sometimes, not always. Wants Feb. 1st start date.  They will add his wife later and baby is born. Live in AZ. DMak will pay for the membership fee, so we will need them to provide banking information at enrollment since only 2 members at this time.  Price won''t increase for his age group.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-17 17:36:44', '2022-01-17 17:36:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084740048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063198002', 'Rosana Bowman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Corrected phone number as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-17 17:06:59', '2022-01-17 17:55:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084734044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974154', 'Erica Rysberg', NULL, 'Erica called.  Last April, just after she became a member, but NOT before.  Had joint pain, so she went to a physical therapist, as well as her MD.  Dr tested & she was diagnosed with Lyme disease.  I looked at Zion''s curr Memb Guidelines & I don''t see that listed in ineligible expenses.  However, all this started almost a year ago and she hasn''t done anything for starting a need, I read her Zion''s guideline for starting ''Need''s within 6-months of the treatment date.  She''s upset because "no one told her."   I asked if she keeps her old e-mails because her advisor Wendy generally sends her members the Guidelines so they know how the system works.  She also had her ''Welcome Call'' and there may be a post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail that will have directions for her on what to do if you have an incident.  But, she''s not sure she kept and of that information and has "no idea where those items would be."  I let her know I can only  guide her and cannot speak to what''s been said before.  She''s very upset and going to give Wendy a call.  She couldn''t get off the phone fast enough.   
     I''m sent Erica the e-mail temp on how to submit a ''need'' to Zion and suggest she submit everything immediately.  (Then it can be Zion that tells her it''s been too long if they cannot make an exception.)    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-17 16:28:56', '2022-01-17 16:28:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084743003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974154', 'Erica Rysberg', NULL, '1-17-22 Talked with Erica after Cari warned me that she was mad. Erica is newly being treated for Lyme disease but started immediately upon enrollment in April and May. She waited until now to learn the process of submitting the Need bc of life and not reaching the IUA immediately. She thinks she''s possibly at around $3K of costs at this point. Only a few appts in the most recent 6 months. But, at the very lest she needs to start the Need and get it on record. I explained the pre-x clause and she''s not sure what will be in her records. I also explained the newer rule to submit the costs within 6 months from date of service which she was not aware of. Either way, as of April 1st 2022, she will have sharing begin and up to $25K to help her soon here on out. I showed her how to submit the need. She didn''t realize how easy it would be and would have done it sooner had she known. Seeing the site it looks very simple. She''s trying to figure out if she submits all of the dates and bills at once. I told her I believe so since it''s part of the same Need. She will move forward doing that and see what Zion says.  She felt much better and truly just needed some compassion. Lyme disease is tough and some challenges are all related but it''s not always clear. She''s dealing with some serious joint pain now. She''s seen a doctor and PT primarily thus far. I told her I''d send her the spreadsheet to help her track the need. Perhaps suggest Sound Clinic to help her as well!  She''s also done some acupuncture and paid cash for that as well. I let her know any alternative treatment must be pre-approved if she ever wants to go down that path. She was very appreciative for my help and just assumed I was just an Agent selling with no further knowledge. :-)', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-17 16:22:37', '2022-01-17 16:26:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084734039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Marc &amp; Hillary called.  Pearl has a fever and when he tried using his account to call CirrusMD, he was told the dependents must be added to his account to help with Pearl.  Both he &amp; Hillary are receiving error codes saying the dependent cannot be added.  Submitted support tckt asking them to add the 3 minors: Raphael, Jonah, &amp; Pearl to both parents'' accounts.  Also, put in the tckt Pearl is needing to see a  MD &amp; provided Marc''s cell #: 561-350-7872  per his request.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-17 16:15:36', '2022-01-17 16:15:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084740043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, '01.17.22:  Found email from Lisa she sent on 1/10/22. Responded today, apologizing for missing her email.  Answered her questions about her membership cards and HSA eligibility verification. Told her to give the bank her Planstin card that shows MPB /HSA eligibility.  If they are not satisfied, they should call Planstin directly.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-17 15:10:41', '2022-01-17 15:10:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084707056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Member called into the Concierge to request RCI cards.  I had sent them out previously. emailed  to member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-17 14:40:03', '2022-01-17 14:40:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084740032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085361002', 'Belinda Fortman', NULL, '01.17.22:  Called - l/m to c/b.  Reminded Belinda of this Friday''s deadline for a 2/1/22 start date.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-17 14:20:39', '2022-01-17 14:20:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084734031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037788057', 'Jean Thompson', NULL, 'Jean called needing 2 RXs priced up for her area.  I e-mailed them to her confirmed e-mail above.  We went w/2 diff stores because of pricing:  KS &amp; Costco.  One of the RXs wasn''t lining up with the online options, so she knows we may need to rerun one or both for her.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-17 14:13:03', '2022-01-17 14:13:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084740016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084640027', 'Malinda Russo', NULL, '01.17.22:   I responded to Malinda''s email and reminded her she has a telehealth service in her SECURE plan.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-17 13:41:25', '2022-01-17 13:41:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084707051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480020', 'Marian Salley', NULL, 'I processed at Member''s request a plan change to the Secure eff 2/1/22.  I will notify Zion via email as well.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-17 13:41:24', '2022-01-17 13:41:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084740008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084640027', 'Malinda Russo', NULL, '01.15.22:  Malinda emailed to thank me for my help. She used the PHCS Directory w/instructions that I sent her and found that not only is her current PCP in it but her previous one, Dr. John Smith, is too and she thinks he''s wonderful.  She said Dr. Smith offers telemedicine.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-17 13:40:35', '2022-01-17 13:40:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084734026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380257', 'Rachel Brisson', NULL, 'Rachel e-mailed saying she hasn''t notified Zion yet.  Her co-worker is bringing in her laptop today so she can go online.  I reminded her to call & notify Zion right away & provided their ph # again.  Let her know the process.  She''s trying to get her memb # to start the ''need'' & Zion is closed for the MLK holiday.  They had to fly her to the hospital, so she''s there without a lot of things (including her information).  Ck''d w/Patti & we do not have this #.  Also, Rachel asked about the phase-in, so maybe this is a pre-x issue!  I went over those levels, but she''s currently still in the waiting period and saying it may be 6-figures! [see blow, should not be pre-x per Rachel.    - CA

Rachel e-mailed back:  this is NOT a pre-x, she just thought all items were on the phase-in schedule.  I sent her the information & assume not having resp past the initial $2500 IUA will bring her great relief (assuming Zion agrees it''s qualified & not pre-x).    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-17 13:35:40', '2022-01-17 14:19:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084707046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043541115', 'Monica Andersen', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation reques to cancel Sedera option I will notify Sedera &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-17 13:30:23', '2022-01-17 13:30:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084734018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063198002', 'Rosana Bowman', NULL, 'Rosana called, she has a Welcome Call sched w/Kelly Anne (but since she''s gone it''s going to be w/Vanessa) &amp; realized she may have give the wrong ph #.  Sent Vanessa the corr info via chat: "Rosanna Bowman is your 3:00pm call.  She needs you to call: 1-954-864-7227." Vanessa was able to confirm she rec''d the info, but this is the only file I can find.  Maybe someone else is primary &amp; I''m not finding her file?    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-17 13:08:20', '2022-01-17 13:11:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084734013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447348', 'Iris Frieling', NULL, 'Iris called wondering if she gets an annual preventative exam on her Planstin.  We went over PHCS, dr billing, etc, &amp; I sent her the prev temp.   She seemed grateful for the info.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-17 12:50:56', '2022-01-17 12:50:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084740003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000919219', 'Leigh Gannan', NULL, '1-17-22 "Hi Wendy,

