Thanks!
Leigh" 

I sent her instructions to cancel and cc''ed Patti.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-17 12:36:58', '2022-01-17 12:36:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084734008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042343089', 'Carrie Stephens', NULL, 'Carrie called needing guidance on starting a ''Need'' with Sedera for Tim''s passing out.  She did let them know they are cash-pay patients (&amp; they have a 1k IUA).   Sent her the temp for starting a ''need'' with Sedera &amp; went over what to submit, that she''ll be assigned a ''need'' counselor &amp; to watch her e-mail closely in case they communicate in that manner.  She seemed concerned about how to prove pymt, but I think we resolved that.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-17 12:19:22', '2022-01-17 12:19:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084714033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083455010', 'Leron Levy', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-17 12:05:34', '2022-01-17 12:05:34'),
