  ('zcrm_1579374000084734003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084651027', 'Jenell Henson', NULL, 'Jenell called.  She''s confused.  So many issues:  didn''t know she needs to provide proof-of-business, didn''t know bus owner needs to be primary, etc.   She is concerned about her membership.  Let her know she''ll be okay, but did get her to Patti to make sure her plan setup properly.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-17 10:49:40', '2022-01-17 10:49:40'),
