  ('zcrm_1579374000084707036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083247001', 'Michael Kjelgaard', NULL, 'I resent the Enrollment Confirmation email for member to schedule Welcome call. Advisor inquiring why he has not had a welcome call as yet.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-17 10:42:21', '2022-01-17 10:42:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084714018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081140001', 'Alexandra Roldan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-17 10:21:05', '2022-01-17 10:21:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084689018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, 'Tania called in regarding her preventative mammogram and her woman''s wellness visit. She wanted to know if she had to choose between one or the other and I explained that she does not have to choose, that both will be a covered expense as long as the provider is in the PHCS network, and everything is coded preventative. I transferred Tania to Planstin for her questions regarding certain labs. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-17 10:17:14', '2022-01-17 10:17:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084707028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064231002', 'Alexandra Goldburt', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation citing the monthly share amount being too expensive and not being happy w/Cirrus MD.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-17 10:12:24', '2022-01-17 10:12:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084707023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893337', 'Katarina Payne', NULL, 'Member submitted change request to add dependent eff 2/1.  I will notify Zion &amp; change billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-17 10:00:10', '2022-01-17 10:00:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084689013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442111', 'Sarah Getzelman', NULL, 'Sarah called in frustrated that she has not received an EOB from Planstin from her November 2021 preventative visit. She states that she had a difficult time finding the website for Planstin and that we need to make access to the different platforms more user friendly. She then proceeded to state that she is very confused by everything when it comes to her preventative care visit. I asked all of the questions: did you verify that the doc was in the PHCS network, did you triple verify that the doc was in the PHCS network, did you verify that all codes are preventative...she was growing very impatient and would not listen to my explanations for anything. I ended up transferring Sarah to Planstin so that they could explain the EOB to her since we do not have access to that information. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-17 09:53:30', '2022-01-17 09:53:30'),
