  ('zcrm_1579374000084707013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130714', 'Steven Hase', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove dependents Peter &amp; Andrew from the plan eff 1/31/22.  Sedera notified &amp; billing updated.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-17 08:56:24', '2022-01-17 08:56:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084689008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939522', 'Adrienne Mitra', NULL, 'Member''s husband called regarding the concierge team doing negotiations for him for an urgent care visit. I explained that for urgent care visits the member must present themselves as a self-pay patient, ask for the best cash price, and collect the super bills in case this goes above his $1000 IUA. Member stated that he was told by his advisor that the concierge team negotiates rates for him. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-17 08:45:33', '2022-01-17 08:45:33'),
