  ('zcrm_1579374000084655008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084640027', 'Malinda Russo', NULL, '01.14.21:  Malinda called me - referred by my member, Jim Lee.  Has a health sharing plan (Universal Health Share) but doesn''t feel confident in them as they keep giving her different information.  Wants to terminate her membership which began this month.  Interested in SECURE and an HSA for herself - age 62.  Husband is on Medicare.  she is self-employed, health, no pre-x.  Had a gastric by-pass 19 yrs. ago and has been fine since.  No meds.  Interested in Dental/vision plans or discount programs.  Said we offer them and I will talk to her about them.  Send Malinda the link to Planstin''s PHCS Multi Plan Directory.
