  ('zcrm_1579374000084587038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081707002', 'Christina Johnson', NULL, 'Christina called to see if she could find out if her counselor is part of our ''counseling'' (thru MAP).  I guided her to the instructions for the MAP program in the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail she rec''d today and went over some of the details with her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-14 15:41:28', '2022-01-14 15:41:28'),
