  ('zcrm_1579374000084639023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084651019', 'Nicole Sylvestre', NULL, '1-14-22 Nicole and Shannon Korn finally chose to enroll in SECURE $500/$1000 and told them of the price increase as of Oct. 2022 to $525/$1000. They are fine with it. They are legally married but live separately. They successfully enrolled for Feb. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-14 12:20:25', '2022-01-14 12:20:25'),
