  ('zcrm_1579374000084629043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578042', 'James Forro', NULL, 'James called a left a message on my direct line looking for the Concierge Team.  I gave it to Front Desk Kelly to follow up since she is back up today until 12 noon.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-01-14 07:34:51', '2022-01-14 07:34:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084634046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058649064', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, 'Maria found out she may be able to go onto her boyfriend''s insurance as a domestic partner, but said they won''t allow her to have other health insurance.  I mentioned we aren''t actually health insurance, so she may have some wiggle room there.  She''s going to think about it and call when she''s not entertaining.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-13 19:59:04', '2022-01-14 10:02:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084636046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650401', 'Frederic Besch', NULL, '1-13-22 Fred is choosing SECURE to remain compliant in CA and HSA compliance and to reduce monthly from $335 / $1500 PDHC to $235 with a $2500 IUA now. No pre-x. Setting it up for Feb. 1st start date. Told him prices for Oct. 1st moving forward as well. Cancelled PHCS membership now as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-13 17:13:40', '2022-01-13 17:30:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084636041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '1-13-22 Kath is choosing SECURE to be compliant in CA and for HSA ability. She was hesitant since her income might be low this year and possible Silver Covered CA plan for $80 but $3700 Ded and possibly getting married sometime soon too. No pre-x.  Choosing $2500/$235 and knows cost will increase to $300 in Oct.  She and Fred cancelled current PDHC memberships as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-13 16:55:20', '2022-01-13 17:30:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084630055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442111', 'Sarah Getzelman', NULL, '01.12.22:  Email from Charles - Using the facility and provider they planned on, for a schoulder arthroplasty, original fee was $41,500; self pay (30% off) $30,505.14; 10% disc. for pre-pay, totalling 
$27,634.63 for facility, provider, anesthesia.  this price unbeatable by BBCC, who found fair price at $37,663 for that area.  CT needed:  at University Med., $1500; $1046.58 self-pay.  At RAYUS Radiology, $400.  Sarah sent some med. records to Zion.
Dr. Lee responded Zion has all the records needed to make the determination this is a shareable need with a $25,000 cap for this as a pre-existing condition, any time after 1/1/22.
The Zion Advocacy team will reach out to Sarah to let her know they will be responsible for payment for the CT scan.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-13 16:21:43', '2022-01-13 16:26:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084630050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467454', 'Michelle Oftedahl', NULL, '01.06.22:  Dr. Lee emailed Jami that they received the Need request yesterday and sent out the HIPAA request to be signed.  They will then  request records from a second provider to determine if the condition pre-dates membership and where it falls under the phase-in cap.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-13 16:02:31', '2022-01-13 16:02:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084630045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467454', 'Michelle Oftedahl', NULL, '01.05.22:  Jami emailed Dr. Lee saying Erik''s wife called asking for any updates on if Zion has smade a determination for sharing yet.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-13 16:00:02', '2022-01-13 16:00:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084636036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, '1-13-22 Called me back and I talked her through the process to cancel for Feb. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-13 15:56:40', '2022-01-13 15:56:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084630031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467454', 'Michelle Oftedahl', NULL, '12.30.21:  Dr. Lee emailed Jami Erik has not yet submitted a Need request for the Sx of right shoulder ligament repair.  Additionally, he said they need records from another of Erik''s doctors, as the records of the doctor they have state this issue is chronic.
Jami responded she will contact Erik and let him know there are a few more steps for them to take to plan the Sx.  Dr. Lee said they will reach out as well.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-13 15:55:38', '2022-01-13 15:58:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084630026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467454', 'Michelle Oftedahl', NULL, '12.29.21:  jami/CC emailed Dr. Lee Erik''s medical records requesting Dr. Lee''s team to review them for determination of approval for sharing.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-13 15:53:33', '2022-01-13 15:53:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084636031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291686', 'Craig Frithsen', NULL, '1-13-22 Craig and kids can get on wife''s employer plan for nearly the same cost, but the wellness visit doctors will be in the network with wife''s plan and not within the PHCS network. So, makes more sense for them to switch for now. Completing form now for Feb. 1st end date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-13 15:46:50', '2022-01-13 15:46:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084636026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, '1-13-22 Left vm for Faith with instructions of how to cancel membership bc turning 65 on Feb. 2nd.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-13 15:39:30', '2022-01-13 15:39:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084634033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509046', 'Greg Jenkins', NULL, 'Sheila called.  Very confused!  She picked the doc for her colonoscopy & they were telling her it isn''t covered. (Says she hasn''t had one in 3yrs)  I went over Planstin (prev only, verifying all entities part of PHCS!, presenting the card, MD must bill, what happens if becomes diagnostic, etc.).  Then went over if diagnostic, moves to Zion w/1k IUA.  Sent her temp for both prev & Sub a need to Zion in case she needs it (& what to submit in that case).  She was super grateful for the detailed map of how to get through this.  We also discussed her annual she had relatively recently and options if that MD is in the PHCS network.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-13 15:31:41', '2022-01-13 15:35:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084630021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, '01.12.22:  Emailed Jami for a status report on Eric. She said she spoke w/him last week.  Made sure the medical records got to Zion - being reviewed for approval.  All is on track for his Sx.  
Dr. Lee emailed that Eric''s need is shareable and Zion is preparing for his Sx date of 1/31/22.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-13 15:31:18', '2022-01-13 15:31:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084630016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, '01.07.22:  Called Jami for a status report - l/m to c/b.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-13 15:28:13', '2022-01-13 15:28:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084630008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, '01.06.22:  Cari notified me Eric Lipp called extremely frustrated that he''s trying to move through the process of planning his bypass Sx w/Care Connect who told him they don''t generally work with cardiovascular Sxs because they usually need to be performed more urgently and planning may take longer than those type of Sxs will allow for.  They recommended he go straight to Zion to get his medical records and approval for sharing.  His information was sent to Zion who said they sent the med. records requests to his providers but hadn''t heard from them.  The providers said they hadn''t received any requests from Zion.  
I called Jami at CC.  She said she spoke w/Eric, explained the situation to him.  I told her of his current frustration. She said she would call him and assist in any way she could and she would call Dr. Lee for a status report.  She said Eric already made plans r his Sx for 1/31/22 with a high-quality fair priced surgical package that BBCC wouldn''t be able to beat.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-13 15:19:25', '2022-01-13 15:24:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084636021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028294073', 'Amber Shipley', NULL, '1-13-22 Answer to chiro care is in my Advisor Agreement with HMA and many other helpful answers.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-13 15:15:28', '2022-01-13 15:15:28'),
