  ('zcrm_1579374000084636016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084637032', 'Hila Benyacov', NULL, '1-13-21 Hila has insurance on her own and she doesn''t have a SS #.  Omri has a SS# and he also has ins separately on his own. He''s self-employed and earns about $120K MAGI. They don''t qualify for a subsidy. They want to keep Dr. Jennifer Pulliam from Centennial Valley Pediatrics. Chose Bright Health Bronze $0 Deductible for $366.90 for both kids.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-13 14:42:58', '2022-01-13 14:42:58'),
