  ('zcrm_1579374000084605023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083082002', 'Wendy Ali', NULL, 'According to Patti Baron payment was accepted on January 5th 2022 a few days ago. So Wendy is all set and active. I was waiting to hear if payment went through so I could send out the Welcome Email and the Fulfillment Package. Sending both now before the end of the day. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-01-13 14:39:42', '2022-01-13 14:39:42'),
