  ('zcrm_1579374000084634028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096043', 'Melisa (Lisa) Levitt', NULL, 'tt Melisa, needed guidance on her preventative ''Planstin'', how billing works, labs, etc.  Then she also needs to start a ''need'' so I sent her the temp for Zion &amp; went over that.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-13 13:48:04', '2022-01-13 13:48:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084634023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082141001', 'Richard Caravetta', NULL, 'Zach called. He''s not feeling well &amp; in a text w/CirrusMD they told him to go to the ER.  He''s feeling like thru texting they may not have communicated well. I helped him find a way to talk with CirrusMD instead and he felt better about that. We talked about how to handle it if he does need to see a doctor (cash-pay to his IUA of 1k) and to get detailed super bills (=w/codes), proof-of-pymts, etc.  Sent him the temp for submitting a ''need'' to get that going in that case as well.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-13 13:09:56', '2022-01-13 13:09:56'),
