  ('zcrm_1579374000084634018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080107001', 'Lorna Mulkey', NULL, 'Lorna called.  For work, they are requiring COVID testing &amp; she wondered what we would suggest.  I found a free drive-up testing site near her and sent her the link so she can ck it out.  She was grateful because she was struggling to find anything online herself.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-13 13:08:15', '2022-01-13 13:08:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084634013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918205', 'Richard Wilkinson', NULL, 'Richard called saying he''d changed plans as was unsure of the services with his new plan.  Sent him an invitation to schedule a ''Welcome Call'' for the new plan.  He liked that he could do that.  He''s also looking for help in rewriting his will, etc.  Sent him the MAP temp and explained how that works.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-13 13:06:45', '2022-01-13 13:06:45'),
