  ('zcrm_1579374000084605018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082141001', 'Richard Caravetta', NULL, 'I found that with this persons phone number 305-465-5667 when I copied and pasted from GoToConnect from a missed call that a Contact comes up named Richard Caravetta, same phone number as this Lead. The contact is a member with a 1/1/22 start date under Michael Montes. The contact Richard Caravetta has under nick name Zach, so obviously this is the same person with the difference of the name Richard Caravetta is an actual member now with Mike Montes and this name Zach Caravetta is a Lead under Kevin. Just wanted to put this info in for future reference. When I called back it rang and went to voicemail. I left a voicemail to call back if needed.  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-01-13 12:44:36', '2022-01-13 12:44:36'),
