  ('zcrm_1579374000084583058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091742', 'Louise Meusel', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update address.  I will update w/Zion &amp; in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-13 10:25:26', '2022-01-13 10:25:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084629003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082316001', 'Lindsey Poirier', NULL, 'Spoke to member has to reschedule welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-13 10:03:28', '2022-01-13 10:03:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084605008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064231002', 'Alexandra Goldburt', NULL, 'Alexandra called in and asked for me to find a Dentist that would accept that fact that she already had X-Rays done, basically a second opinion. I was not sure exactly what she was wanting me to look up for her. I told her I can certainly look up Dentists in her area and she said that she can just do that herself online. She thought that I could find information about Dentists in her area that she can''t simply find online. I told her that it does not exactly work that way with what we look up. I explained that we just look up providers or specialists for her in her area at low costs. We don''t have access to specific information that Providers themselves don''t allow to be put online. To find what she is looking for is something she would have to call and physically ask the Dentist themselves. I would not be able to find out if the Dentist on the list I find would be Ok with looking at the X-Rays she already had done. She wants to avoid having to go through the whole process again of getting X-Rays done by another Dentist. She just wants a second opinion on what she already had done. She understood when I told her that people don''t have access to that information unless you physically call the provider. She then asked about her Preventative and how it works, what exactly is a physical and what do they do and what type of blood work. I told her I can email her a list of the 64+ Preventative items that are included in her plan, etc. Sent her that email and she is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-01-13 10:00:55', '2022-01-13 10:00:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084583053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084611002', 'Laura Carr', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-13 09:42:58', '2022-01-13 09:42:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084587023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083445002', 'Kathleen Randall', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-13 09:42:29', '2022-01-13 09:42:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084583048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084611002', 'Laura Carr', NULL, 'Member requested Payment update form I emailed', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-13 09:41:10', '2022-01-13 09:41:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084587018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081602002', 'Kristi Carr', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-13 09:19:46', '2022-01-13 09:19:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084583043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026950477', 'Bonnie Blair', NULL, 'Was notified by Sedera that they are no longer able to sell to members in PA.  That they will be cancelling affected members eff 1/31/22.  I contacted Leslie Jablonski to have someone in their organization contact member with Alternate options.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-13 09:08:01', '2022-01-13 09:08:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084583038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342007', 'Paul Roberts', 'Revised Plan eff 2/1/22', 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-13 08:43:56', '2022-01-13 08:43:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084583033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342007', 'Paul Roberts', NULL, 'Member requested removal of dependent prior to start date.  Planstin has been notified via email and file has been updated.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-13 08:43:11', '2022-01-13 08:43:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084587013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080239001', 'Candece Niss', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the  welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-13 08:35:18', '2022-01-13 08:35:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084587008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081059002', 'Vikas Kumar', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-13 08:27:14', '2022-01-13 08:27:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084605003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670268', 'Andrew Braudis', NULL, 'Rachel called in and stated that she just had her endoscopy and colonoscopy done but when she contacted Zion to have both of those covered Zion told her that for the colonoscopy they would not cover as she does not have any Preventative coverage through them. She emailed them back stating they were incorrect and that her and her husband Andrew in fact DO have Preventative coverage as of 12/2/21 through us MPB.Health. She was getting Zion and Planstin confused and thought everything was through Zion. When I explained to her about Planstin and that is why Zion was saying no they don''t have preventative through them that is why. So Rachel also said she does not and knows for a fact as she is the one that goes through the mail, did not get any kind of cards from Planstin. So I gave Rachel Planstin''s phone number and told her to give them call and she can get new cards sent digitally through email and hard copies through the mail. Along with sending Planstin the bill she has for her colonoscopy. I let her know for anything preventative for it to be covered full by Planstin the provider and or facility has to be in the PHCS network. She told me because of her area in CO there are not that many options and when she asked the Valley View Hospital if they were participating in the PHCS Network they told her no. But I said there is no harm in checking so while on the phone I pulled up the Planstin PHCS Network look up and Valley View Hospital in fact came up as in the PHCS Network. Rachel was thrilled and is going to give Planstin a call to get everything sorted out. I also sent Rachel and Andrew an email with all of Planstin''s contact and claim info in it for the future. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-01-13 08:23:28', '2022-01-13 08:23:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084583028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756164', 'James Evanko', NULL, 'After sending out link to this member he has requested to change his IUA to $5000.  I will let Sedera know and adjust billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-13 08:14:23', '2022-01-13 08:14:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084583023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072471038', 'Kristen Hounsom', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove son from plan eff 2/1/22.  I will notify Planstin &amp; change billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-13 07:58:56', '2022-01-13 07:58:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084583018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078893002', 'Lander Scott', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update form I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-13 07:52:22', '2022-01-13 07:52:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084587003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082256010', 'Martha Corona Torrez', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-13 07:46:45', '2022-01-13 07:46:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084583013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949076', 'Michelle Smith', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-13 07:41:33', '2022-01-13 07:41:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084583008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949076', 'Michelle Smith', NULL, 'Former Sedera member from 7/1/2020 to 1/31/2022', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-13 07:35:29', '2022-01-13 07:35:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084583003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949076', 'Michelle Smith', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel Sedera &amp; billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-13 07:34:54', '2022-01-13 07:34:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084534021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058649064', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, 'Maria & I went over the items Wendy discusses above:  whether it''s determined to be preventative (Planstin) or Medical (a ''need''). etc.  She also hasn''t heard (via reimbursement) on a ''need'' she started 10/1/21 so she''s going to tt Zion about the holdup.  From the e-mails they''ve sent she says they are asking for duplicates of things already provided.  I let her know it''s worth contacting them to clarify since she''s already pd far more than her IUA.  We plan to continue the discussion tomorrow once they''ve talked & I have time to verify some information.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-12 18:30:24', '2022-01-12 18:30:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084528046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058649064', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, '1-12-22 Maria is thinking she will need a total knee replacement this year and not sure she wants to wait until Nov. 2022. She might be able to get on boyfriend John''s insurance through his employer benefit with UHC and if not she has until Friday this week to enroll in open enrollment for traditional. Also she''s thinking of keeping current membership as secondary to keep pre-x clause moving forward and to possibly seek out Dr. Storrie NP and chiro for hormone health via alternative medicine care.  She''s calling Cari with Concierge now for help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-12 17:33:56', '2022-01-12 17:33:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084528041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012048004', 'Paula Slick', NULL, '1-12-22 Paula sent me a text to let me know she paid Cigna now. She was delayed due to evacuation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-12 16:14:19', '2022-01-12 16:14:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084534013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496002', 'Ryan Murphy', NULL, 'Ryan e-mailed Wendy looking to schedule a ''Welcome Call''.  I sent the temp inside that e-mail string for him.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-12 15:28:24', '2022-01-12 15:28:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084534008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050956676', 'Elizabeth Card', NULL, 'LM for Liz, she was trying to contact the concierge office in the morning (poor Jennifer is out sick)  & wasn''t getting  an answer, so Wendy e-mailed & asked me to reach out to her.    - CA

Liz called back.  I sent her the temp for submitting a ''need'' to Sedera & showed her the Maternity info in the guidelines.  She says other than her pregnancy, she doesn''t have anything else (no pre-x).  I suggested that MAYBE (only her advisor would know), there could be an option in the next few months that would bring down her Maternity IUA options (it was just announced last night).  I was clear: her advisor will be the one in the know.  She''ll make sure to touch base w/Wendy.  She knows it''s a maybe ... not a guarantee.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-12 15:19:55', '2022-01-12 17:08:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084490103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756164', 'James Evanko', NULL, 'I was notified by Sedera that this member wanted to change his IUA.  I tried to contact him left VM.  explained to him that he need to submit Change form. I will email link to him', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-12 14:36:04', '2022-01-12 14:36:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084490098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461501', 'Lisa Reis', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation form I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-12 14:28:04', '2022-01-12 14:28:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084513013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461501', 'Lisa Reis', NULL, 'Lisa called in and wanted to cancel her plan. I explained what she needs to do once I send her the cancellation email with the link to the online cancellation form. She just fills it out with effective date of 2/1, sign it, and then click submit. It will then come back to Patti Baron who deals with the cancellation''s and Patti will cancel her out effective 2/1. After Patti cancels her out Patti will send a confirmation email to Lisa stating she will be cancelled out for 2/1 with no more payments being drawn from her account on the 22nd of the month for the next months coverage. Lisa did state she let Mike Montes know about this as that is the new process. BEFORE we send out the cancellation forms the Advisor must be let known to possibly save the sale unless the cancellation is due to aging out into Medicare or the member getting coverage through a job or spouses job''s benefits. But Lisa already spoke to Mike so she is all set to fill out the form and cancel. Lisa then stated that Mike had her sign up with some policy called IAH Group that was around $13/mo and it was to cover any gap in her coverage when Lisa was switching from Sedera to Zion back in April/May 2021 time frame and how to go about cancelling that as well. I let her know that IAH Group is not something involved with us or affiliated with us so she needs to get back with Mike and speak with him about that, as that is not something we can help her with. Other than that Lisa is all set and she recieved the email while on the phone with me and filling out the form now. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-01-12 14:21:12', '2022-01-12 14:21:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084490093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072471038', 'Kristen Hounsom', NULL, 'Member called asking about how to remove her son fro her membership and what the new pricing would be.  I sent out change form via email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-12 14:20:57', '2022-01-12 14:20:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084490088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084530002', 'Paul Campanello', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-12 14:16:30', '2022-01-12 14:16:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084534003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072471038', 'Kristen Hounsom', NULL, 'Kristen sent chat to SalesIQ &amp; Julie asked me to cal Kristen back which I did.  She wants to price out &amp; change her plan to one without her son.  I sent her Patti''s plan change form &amp; since pricing is currently changing, I let her know Patti can answer the pricing question.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-12 14:09:32', '2022-01-12 14:09:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084528031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949076', 'Michelle Smith', NULL, '1-12-22 Michelle is switching to CARE+ $215/$1000 and not needing wellness at this point. If/when she has a baby she will likely want to add the MEC upon her annual renewal. I walked her through enrollment and cancellation. She''s completing both and is all set!  I believe I told her of the price increase as of Oct. 1st as well. Maternity is WAY better with this new membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-12 14:03:59', '2022-01-12 14:03:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084490083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838059', 'John Huie', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that he wanted to cancel.  I asked if he had spoken to Karen, which he had not.  He will be in contact with her and will go from there.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-12 13:34:15', '2022-01-12 13:34:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084528023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004455005', 'Carleen Andersen', NULL, '1-12-21 Talked with Carleen just now bc I received email saying her payment is late. She will take care of it right away.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-12 13:07:08', '2022-01-12 13:07:08');
