  ('zcrm_1579374000084490078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082049', 'Dayna Horton', 'Redirect Term:', 'Tracking #12745051
Sent by Patti Baron on 1/12/2022.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-12 12:59:14', '2022-01-12 12:59:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084490073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082049', 'Dayna Horton', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will notify Sedera &amp; Redirect &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-12 12:53:40', '2022-01-12 12:53:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084528013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082049', 'Dayna Horton', NULL, '1-12-21 Dayna is going onto her husband''s plan which she''s not excited about. She is cancelling now for Feb. 1st end date. She''s submitting her annual wellness visit with Redirect already from visit in Nov. She wasn''t able to reach them prior to going and just had to go. Told her to call MPB Concierge if she needs to escalate it. She''s also closing out a Need with Sedera and they are ready to deposit the money into her account. She thinks she has all of the bills submitted and knows it''s best to close this out before the end of the month. She''s working with Needs Coordinator Micky or Mikey... All set for now. She''s also leaving country from Nov. 14-23rd.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-12 12:47:49', '2022-01-12 12:47:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084528008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756038', 'Lisa Birkhofer', NULL, '1-12-22 Lisa called bc she hasn''t received anything from Oscar yet to make her payment. I told her to call 855-672-2788 and pay them immediately now and ongoing. She will ask them for her policy information now as well for upcoming appts.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-12 12:31:17', '2022-01-12 12:31:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084513008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067740001', 'Jessica Ramey', NULL, 'Jessica called in today because she had recently passed a kidney stone and is going to go to her clinic that she trusts to give the stone to them. Along with requesting for some sort of CAT scan to see if there are anymore kidney stones that she will need to pass. Her question was what she needs to do in this situation. I explained how this is considered injury/illness so she is to present herself as a cash pay and is responsible for her IUA of $1000. Anything there after Zion will pick up the remainder of the costs. I told her that she has 3 Needs per year for the $1000. I advised that she give Zion a call to let them know what is going on and make sure that she is doing what she needs to do. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-01-12 12:21:25', '2022-01-12 12:21:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084490068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716761', 'Bruce Talley', NULL, 'Was notified via email by Wendy that this member was affected by the wildfires in CO and is requesting the waiver for the 2/22 Share Amount.  I will advance pmt in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-12 11:37:01', '2022-01-12 11:37:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084490063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084517001', 'Kyle King', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-12 10:04:48', '2022-01-12 10:04:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084490058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990282', 'Maryann Mcleod', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-12 09:34:27', '2022-01-12 09:34:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084490053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084501002', 'Emre Ozturk', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-12 09:27:43', '2022-01-12 09:27:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084513003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094002', 'Theresa Stratton', NULL, 'Theresa called in and just wanted to know what she needs to do for her regular dermatology checkup that she has every year due to her having "light skin". I told her that it would not be considered preventative so in that case she doesn''t have to stay in a network and can go to anyone of her choosing. She would present herself cash pay up to her IUA of $2500. Anything there after would be covered by Zion by starting a Need with them. I provided Theresa with Zion''s phone number also because she wants to make sure that if her dermatologist wants to do a biopsy on something that it would be covered and no need for Pre approval. She is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-01-12 09:09:14', '2022-01-12 09:09:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084490048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480158', 'Margaret Weaver', NULL, 'Received cancellation from member will notify Zion and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-12 09:09:03', '2022-01-12 09:09:03'),
