  ('zcrm_1579374000084428124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082049', 'Dayna Horton', NULL, 'Dayna called.  She''s moving into her husb plan @ work &amp; she wants to cancel.  She''s going to call Wendy Scipione to make sure of the best way to handle everything since she has some open items.  We discussed the draw date this mo, so she''ll call her right away.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-11 17:51:57', '2022-01-11 17:51:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084428119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, 'Elsa called.  She needed 2 items:
  - She setup their CirrusMD accounts (hers and Dave''s) putting the kids on Dave''s.  Then realized she will be the one primarily working with them, so she wondered if she should move them to her account.  I submitted a support req to CirrusMD to please advise her.
  - Since she does all the acct wk for the family she''d like to have her e-mail:  ElsaMusik@yahoo.com  &amp; cell ph: 720-273-6747  added to their acct(s).  I sent her Patti''s membership chg temp.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-11 17:44:20', '2022-01-11 17:44:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084428111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079686002', 'Ronald Flake', NULL, 'Ron called - he rec''d a coupon from us for the Gen Epi-Pens,1 box of 2 pens = $112.56.  He was confirming the coupon includes 2 pens.  We also priced 2 boxes for his info = $216.63.  He''s going to keep that in mind, but we discussed staggering the purchases instead due to expiration dates &amp; just pay the extra.  He was thrilled by the price we sent him (= GoodRX).    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-11 16:51:06', '2022-01-11 16:51:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084422028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043191048', 'William Bradford', NULL, '1-11-22 Just sent him the cancellation form. Son will go onto wife''s insurance and he will go onto new employer ins.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-11 16:26:55', '2022-01-11 16:26:55'),
