  ('zcrm_1579374000084428013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130714', 'Steven Hase', NULL, 'I contacted member to go over how to remove dependents from plan and answered a few questions for him in the process.  He told me that he had some preventative bills that he needed to reimbursed on.  I explained to him that he was not to pay for these services and that he should be in contact w/RCI for this.  I explained differences in presenting in Preventative vs Injury/illness.  I quoted him Member &amp; Sp pricing still very high!!!  Sent out change link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-11 12:07:48', '2022-01-11 12:08:07'),
