  ('zcrm_1579374000084422023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028294073', 'Amber Shipley', NULL, '1-11-22 Amber wants an HSA compatible plan but then she loses her CSR with the Silver plans. She thinks she''ll spend about $5K annually with the chiro. She also sees a mental health counselor that she wants to write off. I suggested the HMA for a better solution. I''m now waiting to hear back from Geoff Kirk about what limitations exist for chiro care and functional medicine doctor.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-11 11:50:52', '2022-01-11 11:50:52'),
