  ('zcrm_1579374000084422018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062250051', 'Cody Bennett', NULL, '1-11-22 Called Cody bc his payment is late. His cc was stolen so he''s now waiting for a new card which takes 5-7 days. He knows and he will update Cigna. He''ll also call them to let them know his card was stolen and he''s just waiting for the new one at this point to make the payment. He chose Cigna Connect Flex Silver 5500 for $380.28 with APTC of $316.25.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-11 11:24:32', '2022-01-11 11:24:32'),
