  ('zcrm_1579374000084422013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050370005', 'Arian Shirakhoon', NULL, '1-11-22 Arian called me back and she''s living in AZ for now. Will call me back if/when she moves back to CO and needs help. Told her to cancel with C4 now so Cigna isn''t trying to collect her money for 2022. She will do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-11 11:16:51', '2022-01-11 11:16:51'),
