  ('zcrm_1579374000084305064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050956676', 'Elizabeth Card', NULL, '1-10-22 She is pregnant again after having a miscarriage last year. She paid cash at her first appt and wants to know what to do moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-10 17:52:26', '2022-01-10 17:52:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084305056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696196', 'Daniel McManus', NULL, '1-10-22 Joe Forte called to add a new employee to membership. Their company DMak Productions is already paying for Daniel McManus'' membership. They are now wanting to pay for new employee who is 25 years old, whose name I don''t know yet. Joe''s # is 602-926-0036 and he called from 914-906-9069.  We will likely want to move Daniel to SECURE at this time as well assuming no pre-x.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-10 17:22:39', '2022-01-10 17:23:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084303008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130714', 'Steven Hase', NULL, 'Spoke with member about specific questions he had about changing programs to Zion from Sedera....Want to talk again on Friday  1/14/2022 about final decision.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2022-01-10 16:41:14', '2022-01-10 16:41:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084305051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '1-10-22 Kath called to see if she could get lower cost option or might choose Covered CA bc changed jobs and it getting paid less. She is engaged now, so that will change the equation soon as well. She''s paying $335/$1500 PDHC and can switch to SECURE for $275/$1000 and told her about price increase in Oct. 1st of $325/$1000. She may refer her fiance to me as well. She has no health issues, except a skin spot she needs looked at right now. She is W2 and 1099 contractor, so qualifies for SECURE which she needs to be compliant in CA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-10 16:23:59', '2022-01-10 16:23:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084300033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005212158', 'Charlene Gigante', NULL, 'John called and I helped him learn how to get into the MAP Program &amp; WHLC.  He''s dealing with probate and wondered what resources he had.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-10 15:31:04', '2022-01-10 15:31:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084300028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, 'Frances called quite frustrated.  She is at her PHCS Network doctor''s off & they wanted her ins card.  She had no idea what card they wanted.  Her doctor''s office then called & I transferred them directly to Planstin to see if they could give them the information.  I also asked Jennifer to submit a req for replacement pdf & hardcopy Planstin cards since I cannot access them on Teams yet.  Hopefully, this worked out for her...    - CA

Frances called back.  She was unable to have her appt.  Nothing she is saying is adding up.  She says she made sure the doctor was in our Care+ network (but she''s on SECURE) when she made her preventative appt back in Oct (but her plan was eff: 1/1/22 & I don''t see another plan in this name previously).   The receptionist said she has no idea if they are in network & I still don''t know what happened when they called Planstin.  She said she had to call me back... more to come.    - CA

Okay, Frances called back & this time I think we got her to a good place.   The office had told her twice that they were in network & the receptionist had worked like the gatekeeper not listening or helping her.  Frances said the gal said no one answered when I transferred her to Planstin, but I tried just moment after transferring her, I got right thru.  She had to go back to the office (she forgot her water bottle) and the receptionist said the manager is going to call her, so maybe that''ll fix it with the office.  She seemed to feel better at the end of this call.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-10 15:30:20', '2022-01-10 16:48:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084305046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529151', 'Sherry Marriner', NULL, '1-10-22 "H Wendy,
Thank you for reaching out. I’m very impressed that you contacted me to give me the below assistance. Our home is not in an affected area, and thankfully, your home is still standing. (I didn’t realize that you lived in Louisville, which has experienced unimaginable loss.  My husband and I have been evacuated three times in the past because of fires, so I do understand the fear and anxiety that the wildfires here in Colorado cause). I cannot imagine what those who lost their homes must be feeling, and so every time anyone personally or professionally reaches out, it must be very soothing to them. Take care of yourself, and your friends and neighbors, and thank you again.  Stay safe and healthy in 2022.
All the best,
Sherry Marriner"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-10 14:54:40', '2022-01-10 14:54:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084300023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081753002', 'Anja Price', NULL, 'Husb found spot on his forearm &amp; is having to see his dermatologist to have it checked out because it''s growing.  Sent her the temp for submitting a bill to Zion.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-10 14:41:04', '2022-01-10 14:41:04'),
