  ('zcrm_1579374000084305018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084309014', 'Andrea Beacham', NULL, '1-10-22 Andrea chose Bright Health Peak Bronze 8700 Rx Copay with APTC of $80.20 and her cost is $533.57, full price $613.77. Put in about $80-$100K for now since her job is ending and she will take time off for a few months. She may get a low key job at that point. If/when she loses the APTC I told her to call me and I have some other options. Also chose Anthem Dental Family Value for $19.70. She wants a March 1st start date but somehow the system is showing April 1st. On hold with Mariah at C4 to get it corrected to March 1st, 2022. Acct # 4006984560. TKT #220110-001414.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-10 13:00:03', '2022-01-10 13:40:02'),
