  ('zcrm_1579374000084300013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964297', 'Brooke Bangart', NULL, 'Brooke called.  She''s having symptoms and her family has heart issues, so her doctor told her to see a cardiologist.  We went over cash-pay, 1K IUA, elig ''need'', submitting med bills & pymts to Zion, timeline, etc.  Sent her the temp for sub to Zion too.

