  ('zcrm_1579374000084305013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763104', 'Bryan Lonergan', NULL, '1-10-22 Brian called to update his address which he just completed the form online and to determine what to do for possible sharing for stem cell procedure for knee next week. I confirmed with him that this is a new issue, not pre-x. He had surgery on the knee 5 years ago and no problems since until he sought an MRI in Nov or Dec of 2021. He got the MRI for $300!!! Stem cell procedure will cost about $6400. He will call Concierge to open a Need and inquire how to get pre-approval. He''ll do this immediately.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-10 12:12:53', '2022-01-10 12:12:53'),
