  ('zcrm_1579374000084273008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083545001', 'Sarah Douglass', NULL, 'Sarah called regarding her Xifaxan prescription that she spoke to Michele about. Both Michele and I tried to contact Sarah regarding the dosage frequency because this is an expensive medication, and we were trying to get it through Reid. Sarah said that she was told there was a card that she needed to present at the pharmacy in order for her prescriptions to be covered and I explained the prescription process to her. Sarah stated that she doesn''t care how expensive this medication is and to just send her the coupon. I sent Sarah a coupon via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-10 09:55:11', '2022-01-10 09:55:11'),
