  ('zcrm_1579374000084179047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084822458', 'William Denham', NULL, 'William is actually shopping for a plan to cover his wife = 27 yrs old &amp; daughter = 1.5 yrs old (he gets coverage thru his work, but they want 15k a year for his spouse and child)!  We had a relatively long chat.  I provided him with the Care+ brochure, Maternity Guidelines, and a base quote (until I know further details).', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-07 18:02:20', '2022-01-18 17:25:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084179039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080233002', 'Rebecca Renner', NULL, 'Found out through a prospective member that Rebecca has suggested our services through a Facebook Post.    :o)', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-07 15:32:34', '2022-01-07 15:32:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084179023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080015002', 'Betsy Muller', NULL, 'Betsy called.  She''s getting ready to have her first ''preventative'' annual appt &amp; want to make sure she was on the right track.  We went over everything Planstin.  She seems to have a good grasp on it.  Since the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mails are slightly delayed, I sent her the link for the gvmt''s ACA MEC site so at least she has that to begin looking over.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-07 15:19:50', '2022-01-07 15:24:18'),
