  ('zcrm_1579374000084179018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044265014', 'Rebecca Rechtman', NULL, 'Rebecca called.  She''s trying to setup her CirrusMD, but it saying they don''t have any matching records.  Sent a support req e-mail to CirrusMD support team.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-07 14:53:02', '2022-01-08 12:39:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084131116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676445', 'Maureen Pisani', NULL, 'Maureen called in and needed to make an appointment for a Annual Wellness Visit, her physical. I had to get with Patti to find Maureen''s info about her previous plan that she still has until her 2/1 start date of Care+. She has Redirect. I provided her with Redirect''s phone number and told her to give them a call and explain what she said to me and they will set up the appointment for her. I also explained for her new plan we have what is called a Welcome Call and she asked for the scheduler to schedule it for the future. As I told her it is best to have the Welcome Call on or after her start date so she can have the Fulfillment Package that I send out in front of her while going over the plan. She was very thankful and is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-01-07 14:48:24', '2022-01-07 14:48:24'),
