  ('zcrm_1579374000084179013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, 'Quentin called.  He didn''t realize he had a doctor for his OPD membership.  I gave him Dr. Patel''s information &amp; the Winter Park location address &amp; ph #.  He''ll give them a call.  Went over the items covered by the DPC and let him know he''d have to talk with them about lab work pricing.  He''ll call if he has other quesitons.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-07 13:24:16', '2022-01-07 13:24:16'),
