  ('zcrm_1579374000084159023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756038', 'Lisa Birkhofer', NULL, '1-7-22 She''s having trouble paying Oscar for a Feb. 1st start date. They are showing March 1st. Her son has a life change event due to loss of coverage from school as of Dec. 31st. She needs to contact C4 to request the date of Feb. 1st worst case and they will submit to Oscar so she can pay. I explained via vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-07 13:17:24', '2022-01-07 13:17:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084131081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082517012', 'Carrie Jeske', NULL, 'Spoke with Kirk regarding his member wanting to cancel her plan.  Explain that she called in and spoke with Patti and that she advised her to speak directly with her advisor.  Kirk was appreciative and grateful and is going to do what he can to save her.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-01-07 13:12:10', '2022-01-07 13:12:10'),
