  ('zcrm_1579374000084143089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081753002', 'Anja Price', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-07 13:07:02', '2022-01-07 13:07:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084159018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081054002', 'Stephanie Foo', NULL, '1-7-22 "Hi Wendy,

I had a welcome call with MPB today! In it, they told me that I don''t need a referral to be able to go and get my yearly mammogram/breast ultrasound, etc. -- that I could just book with a doctor in network. I just called Planstin today and they said that I only can get a breast ultrasound with a referral. Any way around this--I guess I have to go for my yearly checkup immediately in order to get referrals for all my doctors..?

Thanks!

-SF"

I called her back and let her know that you don''t need a referral to do your annual physical/wellness visit.  You can go to an in-network doctor for your preventative mammogram. If they find an issue, this is typically when they order an ultrasound. But, she apparently has dense breasts, meaning they always have to do an ultrasound to get a good reading. She understands now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-07 12:58:44', '2022-02-03 14:10:18'),
