  ('zcrm_1579374000084179008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992038', 'Willa Bonzi', NULL, 'Willa had an accident last Sat.  After talking w/CirrusMD, the doc sugg she go to an Urgent Care, who in turn recommended  an orthopedic appt.  The orthopedic sched an MRI for Mon.  She  also has ''accident ins'' that she''ll send the qualifying expenses thru first.  I sugg she upload a copy of what''s cov on the accident ins so Zion knows (they pay very spec list of items & amts:  $1500 twds MRI, etc.).  Being a hospital employee she rec''s 50% off certain procedures too.   She''s going to get the ''need'' started with Zion and submit the one pymt receipt she has to get things going (a receipt from the orthopedic that req''d pymt up front).  She''ll call Zion to make sure she doesn''t need to do anything before her MRI Mon.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-07 12:30:32', '2022-01-07 12:30:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084131056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082517012', 'Carrie Jeske', NULL, 'Member called wanting to cancel because of finding a better plan.  I directed member to Kirk to try and save.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-07 12:29:16', '2022-01-07 12:29:16'),
