  ('zcrm_1579374000084159008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045806225', 'Mark Johnson', NULL, '1-7-22 Called Mark and left vm letting him know that with her membership it includes ACA compliant ins to appease the schools. He already cancelled and didn''t call me back from the first vm. We''ll see if he calls me now. Slated to end Feb. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-07 11:09:36', '2022-01-07 11:09:36'),
