  ('zcrm_1579374000084131028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104296', 'Roland Jefferson Jr', NULL, 'I let Karen know that I had been unable to contact member she asked me to give them another day which would be the 6th.  No choice but to cancel them as it is 1/7.  I will notify Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-07 10:15:16', '2022-01-07 10:15:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084131023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366069', 'Natasha Pledger', NULL, 'After card declined when run 12/30 I tried to leave a VM mail box was full.  I will cancel eff 12/31', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-07 10:05:08', '2022-01-07 10:05:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084143054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595001', 'Robert Moore', NULL, 'Robert called with questions as to why his echocardiogram was $1100 when I said the fair pricing was roughly $600 and the billing department at the hospital he had his echocardiogram told him it would be $154. I explained to Robert that he is supposed to use the fair pricing as his negotiation too and as far as what the hospital''s billing department told him, he would have to take that up with them. I sent him instructions on how to submit his bills to Zion so that he could possibly get the $100 that is above his IUA paid. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-07 10:00:34', '2022-01-07 10:00:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084143049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080546012', 'Kyle Hoppe', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-07 09:47:53', '2022-01-07 09:47:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084143044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082612012', 'Ken Carpenter', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-07 09:20:12', '2022-01-07 09:20:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084131018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737213', 'Debra Leech', NULL, 'I received VM from member Payment hadn''t been being drafted since she changed her payment method.  I found out method was still under List Bill.  I voided 2 pmts out for Dec &amp; Jan then billed her.  I left VM for her explaining.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-07 09:08:31', '2022-01-07 09:08:31'),
