  ('zcrm_1579374000084131013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070506070', 'Alicia Swalley', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-07 08:34:06', '2022-01-07 08:34:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084143023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, 'Macay called in about the flu vaccine. I explained that with his plan, he just needs to present himself as a self-pay patient and I did give him the average cost of a flu vaccine in his area to use as a negotiation tool. Also, Macay feels embarrassed and feels that he wasted the concierge''s time yesterday. I reassured Macay that he absolutely did not waste anyone''s time and that the concierge team is here for all of his questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-07 08:21:20', '2022-01-07 08:21:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084143013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079147335', 'Stacia Montenegro', NULL, 'Member''s husband, Angel, called to receive information about his physical and colonoscopy. I answered all of Angels questions and sent him a list of providers in his area that are in the PHCS network. ~JTS

NOTE: I also added Angel''s email address to this member''s profile.', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-07 08:03:51', '2022-01-07 08:03:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084131008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, 'Member has decided to retain the Care + Plan as he cannot prove business ownership.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-07 07:58:13', '2022-01-07 07:58:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084143008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083545001', 'Sarah Douglass', NULL, 'Per Michele''s request, I called Sarah this morning regarding the frequency of the Xifaxan 550mg. I left a vm. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-07 07:54:39', '2022-01-07 07:54:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084143003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001955049', 'Ting Ju Liao', NULL, 'Member called regarding COVID testing. I explained that it is an out-of-pocket expense due to it not being on the ACA list of preventative services. Ting had a very hard time understanding this information because she states that when she was with Liberty Health, she did not have to pay for a COVID test. I explained that most COVID 19 testing is free, she just had to find a free testing site. She was going to call CVS to find out the price of her COVID test. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-07 07:44:44', '2022-01-07 07:44:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084131003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083256002', 'William Coble', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-07 07:34:22', '2022-01-07 07:34:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084069061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529781', 'Robert Johnston', NULL, '- I called to make sure Rob had spoken with Jill after his chat Mon & call yesterday,  since he''s in the Sedera members that will have to move.  She responded to his VM with an e-mail saying he should look at the "HSA" plan with MPB, but she doesn''t seem aware he may need to potentially protect his pre-x longevity with Sedera.  I told him to respo saying he may hand & let her know he may have a pre-x to protect.  I did tell him the new plan is great if pre-x isn''t a concern.  He seems interested in keeping the balance of our products, even if it''s now in two bills now instead of one.
  - I then had him call Sedera directly to see if/when they sent notification of their platform chg & when he needs to submit a new application.  He tt a guy named Chris who said they "haven''t gotten to him yet", so at least he hasn''t missed the e-mail.  Chris said his effective date will stay the same with this chg, so they will be honoring his longevity.  Robert''s going to keep a close eye on his e-mail and I suggested he call (them) around 2/22/22 if he hadn''t hear anything, since Chris just said it would be in the next few months.  We went over the importance of making sure he keeps his coverage active.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-06 17:31:07', '2022-01-06 18:19:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084069056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737213', 'Debra Leech', NULL, 'Debra called.  She says she submitted a pymt chg form with new cc info (although, I don''t see anything except she req''d the form in Nov 2021.  Since then, she''s worried because she''s not seeing payments go through.  Due to being so time sensitive, I put her into Patti''s VM for tomorrow.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-06 17:18:54', '2022-01-06 17:18:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084069051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083455010', 'Leron Levy', NULL, 'I called Planstin and spoke to Celeste.  She had to go ask someone (sounded new), then came back and said no, they don''t consider a vasectomy preventative.  Because she was so new & I had no idea where she got her answer, I in turn called Michele & for verification she went thru the new Teams chat (I think) and got a clearer response.  They consider this elective surgery & therefore the ACA does not include it in the preventative category.  I called & spoke with Leron.  He wondered and hence his call.  I encouraged him to schedule his ''Welcome Call'' & it sounds like he will.  He was grateful that we got back to him so quickly.  I confirmed cards are taking a while right now so to anticipate 2-3 weeks.   - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-06 17:12:16', '2022-01-06 18:21:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084066023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590075', 'Jason Adams', NULL, '1-6-22 Before we make a change I''m asking Tim Hirsch this, "Tim, I have a client wanting to switch memberships within Zion for Feb. 1st new effective date (original effective date is Sept. 1st, 2020). The client''s wife just had a small procedure done on Dec. 20th which they just submitted the need. Can they proceed with enrolling in the new membership (with the original Sept. 1st, 2020 effective date honored) or do they need to wait until that need is paid and closed out?"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-06 17:06:48', '2022-01-06 17:06:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084066018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030990050', 'Michael Fargano', NULL, '1-6-22 I just learned from Andrea that Michael''s house burned down in the fire! He''s on traditional health insurance and aging into Medicare in March. So, we can''t waive his monthly fee. So brutal!!!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-06 16:52:18', '2022-01-06 16:52:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084090008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080558020', 'Laura Murphy', NULL, 'Member called about seeing a Dermatologist.  She had been speaking with Cirrus MD and they suggested that she have it removed.  Member was given direction to call Dermatologist and let them know she is self pay patient and to keep reciepts in the event in turns in to a NEED.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-01-06 15:27:36', '2022-01-06 15:27:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084090003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083545001', 'Sarah Douglass', NULL, 'Member called to have scripts filled.  The medication is:  Xifaxan 550mg.  Left message with needed frequency as per Reid.  Sent email to member to get Frequency as a follow up to the phone call.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-01-06 15:04:54', '2022-01-06 16:23:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084036058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842273', 'Lincoln Young', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will cancel with Sedera &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-06 14:46:30', '2022-01-06 14:46:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084036053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084087001', 'Cynthia Hurst', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-06 14:37:21', '2022-01-06 14:37:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084036043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083981010', 'Caylen Cavazos', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-06 14:25:17', '2022-01-06 14:25:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084069038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366095', 'Tim Dye', NULL, 'In ER yesterday, tested positive for Covid.  (He sounds miserable.  Says he''s at about 10% capacity.)  The hospital wanted his insurance info.  We went over being a ''cash-pay patient'' (that should bring the bill down some to start),  Then pay up to the 1k IUA & get a receipt to prove pymt.  Sent him the temp for submitting a ''need'' to Zion & went over uploading both detailed inv & proof-of-pymt.  He wrote everything down, but was struggling.  We''ll probably hear from him again, but he was writing everything down, but you could tell his concentration was impacted by his medical issue.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-06 14:22:11', '2022-01-06 14:22:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084036038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083981002', 'Steve Laube', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-06 14:20:14', '2022-01-06 14:20:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084069033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059611038', 'Heidi McGuire', NULL, 'Heidi called.  She''s had multiple lab works done &amp; has a blood issue.  We talked about being a ''cash-pay'' patient up to her 1k IUA.  She''s not sure if this will go over that amount, but wants to submit to Zion in case.  I sent her the template, but had to do it from a different e-mail because with the e-mail opt-out it will not allow me to send it from the CRM.  She was grateful for the guidance.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-06 13:59:15', '2022-01-06 13:59:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084066013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001637159', 'Gretchen Wegner', NULL, '1-6-22 Gretchen was super overwhelmed by a new diagnosis with some weird neck pain she had about 1 year ago. She''s in the Worksite Bridge membership which protects her more. Her neck pain is now having advanced arthritis and ortho is saying she possibly needs a double join replacement in the future! However, an incredible Physical Therapist she''s working with wants to do manual manipulation for 1-2 years first. I''m not sure if this is the same person she mentioned that is a myofunctional or myofascial therapist? She got the run around from the newbies at Zion telling her she had multiple different needs. But, it''s all tied together also causing sleep apnea and tongue drop. I''ve coached her to submit the Need with all the supporting docs she currently has to make sure they have record before 6 months has passed. She will reach out to all docs and request a super bill and from chiro. Again, this is all part of one large issue. I told her the Dr. records and the Dr. at Zion will determine if it''s all related or if she has multiple Needs. She will also ask her ortho if he coded it all as medical or dental. If dental, she will continue to pay the cost. If medical she can submit it with her new Need. She''s hoping she won''t need surgery and the PT will work! I also explained how MPB can help get a per-negotiated rate and Zion would then pay the bundled rate up front on her behalf if she agrees to the proposal. Also she would save $500 possibly. This is year in the future. Not relevant now. But, it helped her understand how and why this all works in her favor. I also sent her the Excel spreadsheet to help her track the Need with all of the moving parts.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-06 13:55:42', '2022-01-06 13:55:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084036033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083937002', 'Benjamin Lee', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-06 13:54:45', '2022-01-06 13:54:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084036028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083935002', 'Henrik Andersen', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-06 13:52:23', '2022-01-06 13:52:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084036023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043541115', 'Monica Andersen', NULL, 'Per Robin Member has re-enrolled with Zion w/spouse Henrick as Primary.  I have let Robin know that I will need a cancellation form to cancel this option.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-06 13:50:42', '2022-01-06 13:50:42'),
