  ('zcrm_1579374000084038003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081920003', 'James Platt', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Cari', 'Visit ID : 1231 Question : Hello - are you there?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-01-06 13:29:00', '2022-01-06 13:29:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084069028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, 'Macay called.  Jeff Kanter did call and they got him setup on Secure for next month.  However, he has questions and called us instead of asking Jeff (no idea why).  He had questions on what he needs for the proof of self-employment.  Let him know he will receive an e-mail that gives a link for uploading and what is acceptable.  He''ll watch for that &amp; get it taken care of.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-06 13:25:53', '2022-01-06 13:25:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084021023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082418002', 'Patricia Sweeney', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-06 13:02:48', '2022-01-06 13:02:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084069023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568233', 'Sherry Lewis', NULL, 'Sherry called needing help in how to submit a ''need'' to Zion.  Sent her the temp & walked her through how to do it.  She was confusing IUAs and deductibles, so we went over that in depth too.  She has two items that happened recently and she knows to submit them as separate ''needs''.  The one for her hip will definitely be >her 1k IUA the way it''s going, the other may only be $1100, but since it was recent enough, if it is deemed medical, I encouraged her to submit that need as well asap (so she doesn''t go past their limit) to get the $100 reimbursed, & to have a 2nd IUA out of the way should anything else happen this year.

Sherry didn''t realize she had CirrusMD.  Walked her thru getting that setup (she was very appreciative because she found it very confusing.  Now she''ll be ready when she needs it.

Since she''s been w/us so long, we cleared out her cards too (she still had ASI, Sedera, etc).  She really appreciated help with that & will also go in and setup her QR Code.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-06 12:59:44', '2022-01-06 12:59:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084069018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083832001', 'David Yonker', NULL, 'David called and was concerned because he thought he wanted the $2500 IUA.  We discussed the pricing, why he might want to have the $1k and he decided I was right.  He''d stay with the 1k IUA.

He''s going to sched his ''Welcome Call'' for after his eff date of 2/1/22.

Also, says he uploaded the proof of business today.  sb all set there.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-06 12:57:54', '2022-01-06 12:57:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084082003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '01.06.22:  Jenni texted me with a question re: how to deal with payment for her daughter to see a GYN, has menstual pain. Asked if her cash payment goes towards her IUA.  I explained this process and told her to first call Telehealth.  She said she heard of a Women''s Care practice that only takes cash at a discounted rate and asked if she could utilize this service w/Zion.  I responded this type of practice is perfect for our plan.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-06 12:54:15', '2022-01-06 12:54:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084021018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081692002', 'Sara Baal', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-06 12:47:52', '2022-01-06 12:47:52'),
