  ('zcrm_1579374000084006008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, 'Eric called, Care Connect told him they would normally negotiate, but they need 4 months to do that so they cannot help him.  The sent him to Zion who is asking for his medical records.  Says he''s given them everything and they aren''t doing it.    Dr. Office = Tyler Southwell PCP: 480-991-9271,  All Medical Records Req are required to come thru via fax :  844-284-7758 [& Cardiologist:  Young Soo Cho: 602-386-1100   Fax #: 602-386-1150;  Surgeon...]  

Eric is beyond frustrated & super rude (I''m sure he''s not feeling well either).  [Jane told him to call the concierge & we''d fix everything.]   However, when trying to talk with him, he says he understands, yet doesn''t listen, interupts, super curt, upset we aren''t doing everything for him (so, from what he''s saying I can tell he doesn''t understand).  We finally agreed he would tt Zion (I transferred him directly) and let them know that none of the offices involved have received record requests!  Hopefully, they will help him instead of continuing to bounce him around.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-06 10:24:42', '2022-01-06 10:24:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084006003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, 'Frances &amp; Carlos called.  They were asked for their ins card for Covid testing &amp; wanted to know how it works with their plan.  Confirmed w/Joan to be sure.  Then went over they are ''cash-pay'' patients and how to handle the situation.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-06 09:42:23', '2022-01-06 09:42:23'),
