  ('zcrm_1579374000083956003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083455010', 'Leron Levy', NULL, 'Member called about vasectomy. Attempted to connect to Planstin but they were not opened yet. Will try again later.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-01-06 07:19:47', '2022-01-06 07:19:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083899016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083886126', 'Jonathan Gruen', NULL, '1-5-22 Riva Gruen is helping her son Jonathan get ins bc his just ended bc of school ending as of Dec. 31st. She called C4 on the 29th and they told her she has until Jan. 15th to enroll. Gold Elite- $0 Ded (Choice) ($0 Virtual Care + $0 Primary Care + $3 Drugs) No APTC. They don''t know what his job will be yet and Riva will pay for now.  Acct # is 1402018021. Now we need to try to get Jan. 1st start date if possible. C4 will go back and look at notes to see if they will honor Jan. 1st. They mislead her to believe she could get Jan. 1st by letting her know she had until the 15th to choose. She didn''t understand she had to decide by the 31st for Jan. 1st start date. She also didn''t know or have the final information from the school that it was cancelled for sure on the 31st bc they were closed for the holiday. She only got the news on the 3rd or 4th.  She will call C4 if she doesn''t hear back from C4 tomorrow or the next day. She doesn''t want him to be without ins of course.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-05 17:42:59', '2022-01-05 17:52:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083910019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529781', 'Robert Johnston', NULL, 'Rob called back.  We went over the pre-x in further detail and what to look for:  in his doctor records, what type issue is this (injury, over use, etc), and that his 37 month (longevity) is coming in Aug 2022.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-05 17:28:45', '2022-01-05 17:28:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083910008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, 'Macay called, has baby 7mo old right now, tomorrow gets a flu shot.  Was curious how flu shot is handled.  He''s going in as a ''cash-pay patient'' and I will call him back regarding some questions he has.  Have a call into Joan to confirm info.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-05 16:43:55', '2022-01-05 16:46:46'),
