  ('zcrm_1579374000083910003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004997077', 'David Whiley', NULL, 'David called saying his plan doesn''t seem to be working for them.  That the lady he originally got it from mentioned there were other plans and he''d like to go over those.  I gave him Diane Border''s name &amp; # and he will call her.  We went over waiting to cancel this plan should he decide to go elsewhere until he has that paid for and in place.  I also went of the draw date and how cancellation would work.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-05 11:26:56', '2022-01-05 11:26:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083899011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048165014', 'Cynthia Brown', NULL, '1-5-22 Living in Mexico now in Baja area. She''s a pro-athlete turning 60 in Feb. Super healthy. Just doing hormone replacement therapy HRT. Thinks she needs a colonoscopy in the next year or two. So, chose SECURE to have access to do a colonoscopy. There are 8 internal med drs. within 20 miles and 3 of those are in Hood River, OR. She''s happy with that. Her chosen Katherine Walker ND is not in network but she knows she has to go somewhere else for pap screening or pay cash to ND.  I also told her if colonoscopy is coded as diagnostic then she will have to pay IUA of $1000 to make sure she understands system. I told her the price will be increasing in Oct. to $325 for her. She''s fine with that. Much better than the $530 with Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-05 11:22:35', '2022-01-05 11:22:35'),
