  ('zcrm_1579374000083899003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575365', 'Leonard Hunt', NULL, '1-5-22 Wife saw some documentary that scared them into choosing to cancel. Leonard didn''t realize that I am also a broker for traditional insurance. They want to protect their assets and lost faith in this from bad information they came across. They are cancelling now. They already signed up through another broker for traditional insurance out of fear. They never even used their membership. They want a single payer system to help it become more transparent...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-05 11:08:32', '2022-01-05 11:19:30'),
