  ('zcrm_1579374000083808008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570152', 'Pamela Nichols', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-05 08:20:10', '2022-01-05 08:20:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083808003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081882001', 'Richard Whalen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-05 07:57:10', '2022-01-05 07:57:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083796003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595001', 'Robert Moore', NULL, 'Robert called with questions regarding an echocardiogram his doctor is requesting he has done. I explained the self-pay process and gave him the fair price for one in his area. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-05 07:42:44', '2022-01-05 07:42:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083782003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130714', 'Steven Hase', NULL, 'Left message with Member to discuss options for conversion From Sedera to Zion program.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2022-01-05 06:22:00', '2022-01-05 06:22:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083757047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257594', 'Emily Taylor', NULL, 'Wendy sent e-mail to me asking me to send information on CirrusMD registration &amp; Life Care to Aaron &amp; Emily = done.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-04 18:32:35', '2022-01-04 18:32:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020350047', 'John Knowlton', NULL, '1-4-21 John has been removed and Teresa is now the primary as of 1/1/22 as EO. Should be good moving forward and Patti is taking care of the billing. Drug Teresa needs is brand of percoset. It should be all set moving forward now. Patti got it set to go and will bill the new rate on 1/20/22 for Teresa Bradford.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-04 17:35:45', '2022-01-24 16:50:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257594', 'Emily Taylor', NULL, '1-4-22 Aaron has a rare esophagus condition with a crazy name that I can''t repeat or know how to spell. He had to get his esophagus  stretched last year. It''s an allergic condition to food or the environment. It''s swelling in the esophagus. He takes a PPI OTC generic drug for it. He also has new blood pressure meds and is only 41. Emily is pregnant and due Feb. 22nd. They want to stay with Sedera bc of his health issues. He may need to do another endoscopy again this year. He did have his costs shared with Sedera and they are happy with it! He did not know about MPB.Health/CirrusMD or Life Care. I will connect him with Cari to get both of those going now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-04 17:26:56', '2022-01-04 17:26:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083757042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081140001', 'Alexandra Roldan', NULL, 'Alexandra Called.  She''s trying to setup her accounts, but has not rec''d the ''Member Portal'' information so she can get to the various links.  Sent Teams chat to Patti since I can''t access the info yet.  sb all set.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-04 17:26:23', '2022-01-04 17:26:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257594', 'Emily Taylor', NULL, '1-4-22 Aaron called to discuss the newer options I mentioned. They could possibly move to SECURE for $685 for EO with $1000 IUA instead of $783 for $500 IUA, IF they don''t have any pre-x and the pregnancy goes smoothly. Deadline is March 18th to make the change.  This will lock in the price until Oct. 1st and a possibly very small price adjustment at that point. It will still be less than $783 I believe! Double check.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-04 16:10:58', '2022-01-04 16:10:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069727014', 'Nathanael ORTIZ', NULL, 'Member called to update payment info. Sent member a payment update form. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-04 14:58:47', '2022-01-04 14:58:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083768003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, '01.04.22:  Lisa called to ask if she completed everything we needed for their enrollment, as she didn''t remember.  I told her she did and asked her to call me when she gets their membership cards.  She said she sent in their Schedule C for the DBA proof.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-01-04 14:49:39', '2022-01-17 15:07:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451009', 'Kay Sasser', NULL, 'New plan welcome call complete! ~JATS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-04 14:41:21', '2022-01-04 14:41:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083757037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081119010', 'Christian Perry', NULL, 'Christian missed his ''Welcome Call'' &amp; called in.  I let him know it was past a time available, but we''d sent him an e-mail to reschedule.  He was sorry he''d missed it and sounded sincere.  We talked about the importance of the call &amp; he will go in and reschedule.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-04 14:33:45', '2022-01-04 14:33:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, '1-4-22 They called back to understand who to pay the $1000 IUA to. I suggested they split it in half and pay $500 towards each bill which will then buy them more time to pay the rest after Sedera reimburses them for the remaining balance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-04 14:26:16', '2022-01-04 14:26:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083757032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081699002', 'Marcia Johnson', NULL, 'Marcia called right after her ''Welcome Call'' to take care of some things per Vanessa''s instructions.  
  - She needed further instructions on how submitting a ''need'' to Zion looked.  We went over it and will call us if/when she needs the temp w/instructions.
  - I sent her the temp to update her billing information.  She just wants to chg cking accts.  We discussed being careful (people accidentally add extra 0 & it throws everything off).  I let Patti know this is coming.
  - Marcia never rec''d her orig ''Member Portal'' e-mail.  Curr I do not have access to Admin123, so Patti is going to send it to her.  I tt Marcia to let her know to be on the lookout for that e-mail.
  - She had questions about CirrusMD.  We talked about the importance of getting all of them setup (so IF they need it, it''s already done).  She''ll work on that too.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-04 14:22:19', '2022-01-04 14:22:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083710081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081699002', 'Marcia Johnson', NULL, 'Pmt method updated', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-04 14:08:11', '2022-01-04 14:08:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083710076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081699002', 'Marcia Johnson', NULL, 'Per Cari Member requested the Enrollment Confirmation be resent sent out of A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-04 14:05:27', '2022-01-04 14:05:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083757024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081595012', 'Aron Groner', NULL, 'Aron called &amp; was having trouble w/getting his portal setup, but he''s all set.  He thought our attention to him was wonderful &amp; much appreciated!   He has his ''Welcome Call'' setup for the 10th as well.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-04 13:59:42', '2022-01-04 13:59:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082839002', 'Donald McClendon', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-04 13:51:51', '2022-01-04 13:51:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083710071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342007', 'Paul Roberts', NULL, 'Jennifer contacted me as this member called in looking to add a dependent.  I advised at this time we were not adding any family members to any Sedera plan as the time is short when they will have to re-enroll.  I reached out to Charlie and let him know of this and went over the all the information about the transition.  He will be reaching out to the member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-04 13:24:07', '2022-01-04 13:24:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083482002', 'Beth Anderson', NULL, 'Beth called numerous times about not receiving her welcome call today. I was able to finally see the names on the Bookings calendar and she is schedule for next Tuesday, January 11 @2:30 PM. I called Beth to let her know. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-04 13:11:45', '2022-01-04 13:11:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083760018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081699002', 'Marcia Johnson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-04 13:08:11', '2022-01-04 13:08:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083757019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081699002', 'Marcia Johnson', NULL, 'Marcia called.  She does not have the appropriate apps for her Welcome Call, so I tt Vanessa &amp; she will call Marcia instead.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-04 13:05:16', '2022-01-04 13:05:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083760013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080943010', 'Gaia Marrs', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-04 13:02:05', '2022-01-04 13:02:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949076', 'Michelle Smith', NULL, '1-4-22 Left vm for Michelle to answer any billing questions and possibly offer her a move to CARE+ with Zion from Care Plus with Sedera. Looks like she had asked about maternity a while back. This will be good to note if she''s not pregnant yet! Benefits way better with Zion for maternity.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-04 13:01:56', '2022-01-04 13:01:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083710066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083717903', 'Anne Singleton', NULL, 'I will bill this member for the 3 mos that she has been on the plan (backdated by Sedera) on 1/6.  I will set her up in A123 in the interim.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-04 12:55:19', '2022-01-04 12:55:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992038', 'Willa Bonzi', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-04 12:46:06', '2022-01-04 12:46:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756136', 'Cynthia Schell', NULL, '1-4-22 "Thanks for checking in.  My employer has chosen to go with an Anthem PPO that is somewhat more affordable.  Since I’ll be ready for medicare in late 2022 I’ll go with the Anthem  for now.
Thank you!
Cindy Schell"
She is aging into Medicare in Oct. of 2022.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-04 12:45:01', '2022-01-04 12:46:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083710061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011910001', 'John Singleton', NULL, '3 pmts refunded and membership cancelled.  I will set spouse Anne up as a single (she has enrolled directly w/Sedera) and bill her for the 3 mos on 1/6.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-04 12:44:23', '2022-01-04 12:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912017', 'Stephen Padwe', NULL, '1-4-22 Left long vm for Stephen explaining how to go about the annual wellness visit for his son. It doesn''t look like he followed through with his Welcome Call either. I told him he needs to go back to his confirmation emails and sign up for a time to go over it all which will help him tremendously.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-04 12:29:46', '2022-01-04 12:29:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083710056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065731120', 'Rosendo Mendoza', NULL, 'Per Accounting this member has requested cancellation and requested has been submitted to Planstin and they have confirmed', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-04 12:29:33', '2022-01-04 12:29:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243567', 'Tanya Dueri', NULL, 'Tanya called because she wanted more clarification about what she spoke with Kelly Anne about in July 2021. I let Tanya know that she was given the incorrect information from Planstin regarding her preventative testing for breast cancer. Tanya is very, very confused about everything regarding her plan, and I did try to clarify as much for her as possible, but she still seems very confused. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-04 12:25:36', '2022-01-04 12:25:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679079', 'Bonnie Kern', NULL, '1-4-22 I called Analisa and told her Bonnie has to cancel their membership and Steve will have to re-enroll hopefully in SECURE if he''s self employed. I suggested the $1000 IUA and said $5000 is not worth the extra risk. She said OK and will reach out to them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-04 12:24:40', '2022-01-04 12:24:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083760008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080863018', 'John Rex', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-04 12:23:04', '2022-01-04 12:23:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083710051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083717854', 'Teresa Bradford', NULL, 'Teresa''s spouse John Knowlton aged into Medicare.  She enrolled directly with Sedera.  I was told by Elizabeth that we would still be billing her.  Just set her up in A123 and billed her for 1/22 Share Amount.  Wendy to let member know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-04 12:22:47', '2022-01-04 12:22:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756136', 'Cynthia Schell', NULL, '1-4-22 She did not select a final plan option. Still just in the Eligibility stage. Just sent her an email to see what she decided. I am showing as her agent in C4.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-04 12:06:25', '2022-01-04 12:08:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, '1-4-22 Mariah called in with her parents to help her through this process. She''s totally frustrated bc she went in for annual mammogram and they see some calcifications they want to check on. She did further testing including an ultrasound. Then they wanted to do a biopsy but that wasn''t going to be possible with the location of the calcification. So, the next step was an MRI. She''s not sure if Redirect paid for the first preventive screening but she did call them for pre-approval. She doesn''t know how it''s coded. She now has two bills or $1668 and $736. I explained that she needs to pay the first $1000 IUA of the medical need and Sedera will share the cost of the rest above that point after they negotiate. Told her she needs to create the Need ASAP and get assigned a Needs Coordinator to move the process forward immediately. Valley View is threatening taking it to collections. Once she pays her $1000 that will buy her more time for Sedera to work through their process and to pay her to then pay Valley View.  She feels better! She thought she had already submitted the bills to both Redirect and Sedera, but she was never assigned a Needs Coordinator, so she probably didn''t submit it to Sedera.  I also coached them to request the Super Bill to help speed up the process and avoid any hiccups.  They will work on all of it and I gave them the MPB Concierge # to get the instructions to open the Need. All set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-04 11:58:23', '2022-01-04 11:58:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083710046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032492', 'Jani Osborne', NULL, 'Member called in to update Payment info I will send her email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-04 11:46:40', '2022-01-04 11:46:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083757011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206164', 'Dena Traxler', NULL, 'Dena called.  She had a cardiac incident and was hospitalized over the weekend.  I sent her the temp for submitting a ''need'' to Zion so she can start the ''need'' right away.  She knows she has a 1k IUA (&amp; assuming qual ''need'' she know that''s what she needs to pay &amp; to upload the proof of pymt too.  She also thought it would be nice if her advisor Andrea Hinman knew about this, so I tt Andrea &amp; let her know.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-04 11:37:02', '2022-01-04 11:38:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083760003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080943002', 'Roy Ellis', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-04 11:33:26', '2022-01-04 11:33:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083710041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081509011', 'Tammy Goen', NULL, 'Member called in asking how to update Pmt info.  I will send out pmt update form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-04 10:54:17', '2022-01-04 10:54:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083719033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939263', 'Rachelle Dunn', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-04 10:50:51', '2022-01-04 10:50:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083757003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529781', 'Robert Johnston', NULL, 'Called &amp; LM for Rob to help with the above request.    - CA

Rob called back &amp; we discussed.  Pg 28 of the Sedera Memb Guidelines show month 37 &amp; beyond, this will be past the "longevity" clause in his membership.  I LM with that pg # since we''d been looking together before.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-04 10:46:22', '2022-01-04 11:12:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756038', 'Lisa Birkhofer', NULL, '1-4-22 Dear Lisa Birkhofer ,
Congratulations on purchasing a Direct Vision plan!

Please take the time to review your order details as well as our terms of service. If you have any questions, call us at 888-890-1944 or e-mail us at info@directbenefits.com.

Do not respond to this confirmation email. Allow 5-7 business days for your application to be processed. Your cards and plan information will be delivered via mail in 7 to 10 working days to the address you provided in the Primary Enrollment Information section.  

Your specific coverage information is as follows:

Plan Selected: VSP Choice Plan B
Who’s covered: Applicant
Effective Date: 02-15-2022
Carrier: Ameritas
Monthly Charge: $12.22

Reference Number: 300038165
Agent Info: Wendy Scipione (Phone : (720) 259-1555) 

VSP:

With the VSP plan you will not receive an ID card. An ID card is not required when visiting a VSP Choice provider. Simply tell your VSP provider you have the VSP Choice Network plan. If you would like to print an ID card for yourself or covered family members simply visit vsp.com register and then download card(s).

EyeMed:

Your cards and plan information will be delivered via mail to the address you provided in the Primary Applicant Information section. Please allow 7 to 10 business days to receive your cards and plan information. 

Directbenefits | www.directbenefits.com
888-890-1944 |  LinkedIn Twitter Facebook', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-04 10:36:01', '2022-01-04 10:36:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756038', 'Lisa Birkhofer', NULL, '1-4-22 Choosing Oscar Silver Simple- HSA (Choice) for $797.06 with APTC of $755.66.  Choosing VSP Plan B for $12.22. She''s healthy but income will be around $24K dependent upon how much she draws from IRA in 2022. Will also fund HSA for tax benefits. Zip code 80538. No problems with teeth, just annual exams and reading glasses. Also has chronic dry eyes. Starting Feb. 1st for medical and Feb. 15th for vision. She''s paying $41.06 and $12.22. Acct # 4008980040.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-04 10:34:38', '2022-01-04 10:46:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083719028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081509011', 'Tammy Goen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-04 10:30:06', '2022-01-04 10:30:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083705019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529781', 'Robert Johnston', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 1210 Question : Both my knees constantly cause me pain and discomfort and have limited me to walking only. Does this cost sharing plan cover this? Please advise. Thank you, Rob Johnston 970-759-0444', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-01-04 10:25:17', '2022-01-04 10:25:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083710036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362044', 'Therese Antonino', NULL, 'I reached out to member and she told me that she updated her pmt info.  Also asked me if she updated her Address.  I will send out Change form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-01-04 10:19:39', '2022-01-04 10:19:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014539007', 'Kris Srnka', NULL, 'Kris called with questions regarding an anesthesiologist in her are for her upcoming colonoscopy. She had reached out to Planstin and was still waiting for a list from them, so in the meantime I sent her a list of anesthesiologists in her area. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-04 10:11:53', '2022-01-04 10:11:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083699024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081119002', 'Azeem Tajani', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 1209 Question : hi i have the secure plan, i am trying to sign up forwhole health living butthe email i received just now does not match what i am seeing on the website', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-01-04 10:10:42', '2022-01-04 10:10:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083719023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081119002', 'Azeem Tajani', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-01-04 09:59:37', '2022-01-04 09:59:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857037', 'Ilan Brown', NULL, 'Ilan called wanting to use his CirrusMD services. I tried to send Ilan an invite but with no success. I reached out to CirrusMD on Ilan''s behalf and asked for them to reach out to Ilan with a resolution. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-04 09:58:58', '2022-01-04 09:58:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083752003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057253057', 'Tobin Ortenblad', NULL, 'Tobin called in about a foot injury that CirrusMD told him he needs to have an x-ray done on. I explained the self-pay process and submitting his needs to Zion if this goes above his $1000 IUA. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-01-04 09:30:16', '2022-01-04 09:30:16'),
