  ('zcrm_1579374000083685008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290213', 'Amy Bloom', NULL, 'Amy called looking for the counseling her advisor told her about.  I did send the Life Care temp Wendy created since these are her members, but realized the link does not work & she knows that.  She''ll try calling the 1-800# Wendy''s listed in the e-mail to find out which doctors are available here in Westminster, CO & for her daughter in Boston.   Sent a 2nd e-mail with the updated member portal address:  https://mpb.health/portals/   - CA

CO has 3 free counseling sessions Amy & I discussed.  I couldn''t find the information orig, but located it later in the day.  Sent her the information.  This may help if the counselor her son likes is not eligible on the Life Care program.  She was grateful I could supply this as well.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-03 16:10:35', '2022-01-03 18:31:33'),
