  ('zcrm_1579374000083553003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811278', 'Sheri Bowes', NULL, 'Sheri e-mailed she finally got her account setup, only to be told there was no doctor available in AZ.   Sent CirrusMD a support request to see if that''s accurate.  She tends to struggle with everything.  Hopefully, they will get someone to help her.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-01 17:28:01', '2022-01-01 17:28:01'),
