  ('zcrm_1579374000083522041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826048', 'Trent Mullikin', NULL, 'Mandy wrote saying she needs an invitation for CirrusMD again.  But, I''m sent a note to CirrusMd support to have them contact her to help because I couldn''t get the system to send her an invitation either.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-01 03:18:15', '2022-01-01 03:18:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083522036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361908', 'Paula Ward', NULL, 'Paula seems to think requesting information via e-mail is easier.  It''s super labor intensive and I tried to make that clear in my e-mail (note:  it took hours to answer all her questions and I''m finishing this on New Year''s Eve at 3:03am, ugh...)  Sent her info on Planstin, preventative vs diagnostic colonoscopies, mammograms, how to search, find what''s covered, etc.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-01-01 03:05:38', '2022-01-01 03:05:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083522028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811278', 'Sheri Bowes', NULL, 'Sheri e-mailed because she could not reach the concierge line (we are closed for the holiday).  She wanted the ph # for the telehealth.  I sent her the sign-in link &amp; gave instructions for sign-in &amp; registration in case she hasn''t done that yet.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-31 15:21:14', '2021-12-31 15:57:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083497028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082049', 'Dayna Horton', NULL, 'Member called in and asked about cancelling as she was going on new husbands employer coverage.  In the conversation she stated that she just spoke to Sedera about her "bills" that were aprox  6 mos to a yr old that she hadn''t submitted.  She paid these out of pocket.  I told her that she should not cancel until she gets all of these bills shared.  Went though difference between Sedera &amp; Redirect.   She will be in contact with Sedera to ask how to submit bills/open a need.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-31 11:27:20', '2021-12-31 11:27:20'),
