  ('zcrm_1579374000083454027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, '12.30.21:  Lisa Schutt (Micheal''s wife) called me.  She couldn''t remember who she spoke with initially, but was not convinced this advisor would suit her needs and was hesitating to enroll.  She had been referred to me by the Facebook group members I helped and enrolled and given my phone number but during her research for MCS plans, had called the MPB number and got Guy.  When I tried to refer her back to Guy, she said she''d prefer to have me help her as she needs much more detail to better understand the plan.  In the interest of saving this enrollment, I did my presentation, answered the questions she had not gotten enough clarity on, helped her with documentation she needed for the SECURE plan and enrolled her.  Sent an email thank-you.  
Per Lisa, their BCBS plan was going up to $1800/mo. w/a $18,000 deductible. Has a DBA called Colloquia,  Patti said Lisa could submit her Schedule C first page as proof of DBA.
Lisa has no pre-x or medications.  Her husband takes med. for high blood pressure and an antidepressant for stress.  He smokes occasionally a cigar or pipe.  Must add $50/mo.
Lisa asked me to look up her PCP, Craig De Lisi, M.D.  Did not find him in Planstin Multi Plan network but found the Medical Center he works for.
Lisa decided to enroll today.  I enrolled her and her husband, Michael.  Explained the on-boarding process.  Told her to be sure to schedule a Welcome Call.  Sent a thank-you email.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-30 14:12:01', '2021-12-30 14:21:28'),
