  ('zcrm_1579374000083411008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401086', 'Andrew Brinkmeyer', NULL, 'Andrew called to ask if the shingles shot was covered by his preventative care benefits, I told him that it was and that he needed to go to an in network provider for it.  I sent him a link and instructions on how to find providers in the network. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-30 11:04:07', '2021-12-30 11:04:07'),
