  ('zcrm_1579374000083454014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016570002', 'Michael Wisner', NULL, 'Michael called regarding why his preventative services were denied at his providers office. We both believe that this is just an error on his provider''s end as he feels they did not update his information when he was in their office last year. I transferred Michael to Planstin to get his member number so that he can provide the correct billing information to his doctor''s office. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-30 10:41:45', '2021-12-30 10:41:45'),
