  ('zcrm_1579374000083459003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667255', 'Kathleen Kronz', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of January 1, 2022. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-30 10:01:28', '2021-12-30 10:01:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083454003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659413', 'Brad Uhlig', NULL, 'Brad called regarding a need he needs to submit to Zion for his daughter''s recent hospitalization. I sent him the instructions on how to submit his needs to Zion and then explained that he will have to pay his $5000 IUA before Zion will share in the rest of the bills. Brad then got very ignorant with me and told me that he needs to "dump the f''ing sh!t out of MPB health and that this was complete bullsh!t". He also stated that he was told that he only had to pay a portion of the $5000 IUA in order for Zion to share the Need. I then told Brad that his portion is the $5000 IUA, he continued to be ignorant. I explained to Brad that he did not have to be belligerent with me and that I understand his frustrations. Brad continued to swear at me so I explained to Brad that I would be happy to assist him when he has calmed down and has quit swearing at me. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-30 09:23:12', '2021-12-30 09:42:04'),
