  ('zcrm_1579374000083372023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758457', 'Bradley Steele', NULL, 'Spoke to Bradley Steele and will probably enroll on 12.30.2021.   He will call me in the morning on 12/30/2021.   Checking on Care+ or SECURE Plan.   Waiting on call.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2021-12-29 16:54:28', '2021-12-29 16:54:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083381003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081107338', 'David Sepac', NULL, '12-29-21 Finally connected with Andy again to explain SECURE. He''s healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco and hasn''t been to a dr. in years. Never used MPB Group membership before or his Cigna plan. But, realizes he should have protection for the big things! He just enrolled in SECURE $1000/$275 and is interested in funding HSA but not necessarily doing annual wellness. He wants a Jan. 1st start date. I waived his $100 fee since he was a member before. He appreciated that. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-29 15:15:50', '2021-12-29 15:18:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083345021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798144', 'Erin La Grassa', NULL, 'Erin called in needing a copy of her 1095B for ASi for January thru July of 2020.  I was able to find it and email it to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-29 14:55:23', '2021-12-29 14:55:23'),
