  ('zcrm_1579374000083367011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595001', 'Robert Moore', NULL, 'Robert called inquiring about naturopathy. I advised him that he would have to speak to Zion and get any naturopathy pre-approved through Zion. I warm transferred Robert to Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-29 13:03:22', '2021-12-29 13:03:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083367003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075689424', 'Jason Redman', NULL, 'Yadira called in because she is very confused about her plan. She keeps insisting it is traditional insurance because (as she stated) that is what the person they purchased this plan from told her. I explained that this is not traditional insurance, explained how to use her plan, the self-pay process, and also explained that there is a waiting period for pregnancies. She also inquired about an HST debit card, and I advised her to speak with Zack Masters regarding this card. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-29 12:52:44', '2021-12-29 12:54:33'),
