  ('zcrm_1579374000083286003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060856001', 'Jerry Dodge', NULL, 'Member called in after hours wanting to know if the payment that was drafted on 12/22 was for December or January.  Advised that he will be going with another ins company eff 1/1 and wants money back.  I called and left VM letting him know how to cancel.  I will send him the link and copy Amy as well.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-29 08:05:38', '2021-12-29 08:05:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083279003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885002', 'Pamela DeVos', NULL, 'Brain called in and wanted to know if Covid testing was a covered expense on either part of his plan, Planstin or Zion. I let him know that unfortunately no they have not put Covid testing on the ACA list as of yet so it is an out of pocket cost completely. He was fine with that just wanted to check. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-12-29 07:44:13', '2021-12-29 07:44:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083278003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885002', 'Pamela DeVos', NULL, 'Brian called regarding COVID-19 testing and I explained that this is something that is currently an out-of-pocket expense. Brian did not seem happy with this, but our call disconnected due to him having poor service. I did try to call Brian back but could not get through to him, it was just a busy signal. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-29 07:42:15', '2021-12-29 08:07:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083240013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, 'James called.  Zion sent him e-mails regarding the ''need'' he just submitted.  He did not understood how his coverage works.  He thought submitting this ''need'' & putting it on record would mean, even if this returns way down the road (he used a year or more) and with no continuous treatment/monitoring, etc.,  it would always be the same ''need'' & all the money would go towards the same IUA (even after the extended time of no treatment).  I let him know with ''continuous'' treatment, he would only pay once as he''s describing.  However, with a break in treatment of 12mos or more, it becomes a new ''need'' with a new IUA.  Went over what I could and I transferred him to Zion for specific ''need'' questions.  He will upload his proof-of-pymt once he''s paid it as well.   

He''s feeling like there were some misunderstandings in how the plan was presented (like the above misunderstanding).  That it seems like his advisor should have helped him understand that taking an anti-inflammatory for his knee, would make his knee issue a pre-x before he started on our plan.  [He must have talked to someone regarding this, because it sounds like Zion or someone told him it''s now pre-x.]    Hopefully, he understands better now and will not have issues with his knee.   - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-28 15:49:07', '2021-12-28 15:49:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083259008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083258001', 'Jonathan Atwell', NULL, '12-28-21 Anthem Silver Mountain Enhanced X HMO 5000 APTC $274.31 and his cost $138.13. Enrolled on 12/22/21 for Jan. 1st bc of divorce. Also chose Anthem Dental Family for $14.01.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-28 15:41:20', '2021-12-28 15:42:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000083259003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020350047', 'John Knowlton', NULL, '12-28-21 Elizabeth Vargas is sending Teresa the link to complete her enrollment as the primary member on the membership EO for Jan. 1st 2022. John will be removed bc he''s turning 65 on Jan. 3rd and will be moving to Medicare.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-28 15:31:37', '2021-12-28 15:31:37'),
