  ('zcrm_1579374000082883008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890002', 'Bonita Keith', NULL, '12.24.21:  Enrolled Bonita and her family for 1/1/22.  Explained the on-boarding process.  Sent her a Thank-you email.  Bonita said her financial advisor at Fidelity Bank asked for written proof of the SECURE plan to be eligible to use with an HSA account.  Get proof from Planstin.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-24 08:24:08', '2021-12-24 08:39:50'),
