  ('zcrm_1579374000082822132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041953095', 'Susan Farrar', NULL, 'Susie called back asking for Kelly Anne.   Phones were weird, she kept cutting in & out, then she said there was some loud sound on her end.  Tried calling her back immediately & she didn''t answer so I left her a message.    Waited about 5 minutes & tried her a 2nd time, still now answer, left her another message.  We finally got to talk.  She decided she''s going to make sure they send the labwork thru LabCorp so we know it''s in network.  I let her know not a ton of labs are covered, but they generally kick back at a discounted rate when they are not.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-23 15:18:41', '2021-12-23 15:56:18'),
