  ('zcrm_1579374000082844008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104104', 'Lisa Potter', NULL, 'Lisa called because she was getting stuck logging into the CirrusMD app....I helped her through.  The CirrusMD app said that no one was available to help her and it asked her to type a message of what she needed and someone would get back to her.  So that''s what she did. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-23 12:33:24', '2021-12-23 12:33:24'),
