  ('zcrm_1579374000082849008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762009', 'Lori Keller', NULL, '12-23-21 Lori has chosen another indemnity plan through UHC. We had a long conversation. She''s really nervous about joining a self-funded plan. She had a bad experience with LHS and doesn''t want to have that again. I explained that the indemnity plans are potentially putting her at a much greater risk! But, she wants a more traditional solution. She doesn''t have a good feeling. She said nobody at our company that she talked with has this membership. I said I had a different version of it and our group is moving to this exact membership starting Jan. 1st. But, this isn''t what I told her before she said. We hadn''t moved to SECURE yet at that point. She was nice but I truly believe she''s moving in a much lesser of an option. Nervous for her. But, up to her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-23 12:18:32', '2021-12-23 12:24:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082849003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674005', 'Deborah Pyles', NULL, '12-23-21 She''s moving to MN with her daughter and they are getting a MN Sure Exchange plan for $0! We can''t beat that. Plus she couldn''t find a DPC in MN. But, doesn''t matter if she''s paying nothing for her new plan bc of her low income.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-23 12:03:38', '2021-12-23 12:03:38'),
