  ('zcrm_1579374000082822038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082061002', 'Wendy Eidman', NULL, '12/23 I left a VM for Wendy because her Enrollment &amp; 1st months share amount declined.  I advised her to be in contact with her bank to see what they could tell her. 12/27-Wendy called in and said that she does not understand why both her payments were declined.  I told her that the error msg indicated a typo and she needed to re-submit info and I will rerun. 12/29-Left vm for member to submit Payment update form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-23 10:03:34', '2021-12-29 09:04:43'),
