  ('zcrm_1579374000082708046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064604206', 'Patricia Moran', NULL, 'Karen called.  She''s trying to see what the best price for Xiidra 5%, 60 ampules is.  GoodRx &amp; RXSaver are both coming in at $591.21. Sent req to Reid &amp; will let Karen know what he says.  Also, put Karen thru to Patti''s line.  She wants to see if they already processed Patricia''s contribution (I told her I thought they prob had since it''s past the 20th).    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-22 15:23:20', '2021-12-22 15:24:32'),
