  ('zcrm_1579374000082781003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890002', 'Bonita Keith', NULL, '12.22.21:  Recvd. quote request from Bonita Keith (Jonathan is her husband).  Interested in either Care Plus or Secure (has LLC) at $2500 IUA.  Looking for 1/1/22 start date. Youngest child has his own insurance for a congenital disorder.  Her husband was laid off a corporate jobin August and is on COBRA.Brother-in-law has Samaritan but Bonita feels that health share group isn''t for them. She has been researching Med. Cost sharing and found us through Zion. They don''t have an HSA but she''d like to start one.  They have the funds to put into it.  Both children (boys) are on ADHD meds.  Oldest boy takes Prozac for depression & anxiety and goes to counseling once per month - self-pay - cash.  Bonita has thyroid nodules - her doctor keeps an eye on it with yearly biopsy.  She said she will discuss this w/her husband, check out her spreadsheet comparing all the  plans she has researched and let me know their decision.  Emailed her the link to my site and guidelines.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-22 14:24:00', '2021-12-22 14:24:00'),
