  ('zcrm_1579374000082768013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056140001', 'Betsy Green', NULL, 'Betsy called wondering why she was told her plan was cancelled when her providers office called to verify her plan. After further explanation from Betsy, she did not present the correct card at her annual visit. I will be requesting a new PDF/hard copy of her Planstin card and I advised her that once she receives her card she should call the providers office with the card information. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-22 13:15:01', '2021-12-23 09:04:26'),
