  ('zcrm_1579374000082768003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862096', 'Edward Christopher Wiencek', NULL, 'Edward called back with a question regarding his shingles vaccination. I explained that he would have to pay the $105.00 office visit price but as long as this doctor is in the PHCS network (verified by Kelly F via phone with Edward) his shingles vaccination will be paid by Planstin. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-22 12:13:40', '2021-12-22 12:13:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082767003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082599002', 'Joseph Morris', NULL, 'Spoke with Joe Morris and instructed him to obtain an EIN number for service of the SECURE plan.  He will work on getting that EIN number and give us the information when he obtains it.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2021-12-22 12:12:14', '2021-12-22 12:12:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082763019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '12.22.21:  Jenni texted they are ready to enroll and asked what the next steps are.  I asked her when she would be free for a call for me to help them enroll and told her what information she needs to have in hand.  Enrolled Jenni and her family.  Explained the on-boarding process and the preventative care warnings.  Sent a thank-you email.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-22 12:00:20', '2021-12-22 16:46:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082763014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '12.21.21:  Jenni texted, asking if MPB is a middleman for Zion and could they enroll right on Zion''s website?  I explained that Zion only offers catastrophic care and is only one of our seven different services MPB offers as a value-added product. She responded that she understood.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-22 11:58:18', '2021-12-22 11:58:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082719089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152148', 'Justin Acker', NULL, '12/22- Member''s 1/22 payment declined I will send out 1st email 12/27-second email sent', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-22 11:57:13', '2021-12-27 13:30:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082763009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '12.17.21:  I responded to Jenni''s text to please get in touch w/me when she can. She responded it would probably be early next week.  She asked a few more questions about her children as not being declared as dependents by her and her husband on their taxes, could they still be included in a family plan.  I researched it w/Zion as told her they can, as long as they are legally their children.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-22 11:52:12', '2021-12-22 11:52:12'),
