  ('zcrm_1579374000082660003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082612012', 'Ken Carpenter', NULL, '12.22.21:  Sent Ken a Thank-you email. Found out he paid by c.c.  Thought he was paying through his bank account.  Mentioned this in my email and asked him to let me know if c.c. is ok since he''ll have to pay an additional 3% of his fee through this type of pmt.  Also, I recvd. an email from Mitesh stating he was entered in Admin 123 as an Employer group instead of a M&amp;C.  Will check this w/John.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-22 07:44:23', '2021-12-22 11:29:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082649008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078714002', 'Kathryn Rowden', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request due to the fact that her 10 medications would not be sharable.  Extremely expensive.  I will notify Zion and cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-22 07:39:51', '2021-12-22 07:39:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082655003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862096', 'Edward Christopher Wiencek', NULL, 'Edward called in and said that he was having a lot of difficulty finding someone that carries the Shingles Vaccine. He has done a bunch of research and calling and looking up and has gotten nowhere. Finally after doing all this digging he has found a site that has a shingles location locator and found 3 people/places. I looked up the first one and thankfully that doctor IS in the PHCS Network so he can certainly go to them. I also sent him the website link to see the ACA List of Preventative services that are approved. Emailed him all the info and should be all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-12-22 07:38:33', '2021-12-22 07:38:33'),
