  ('zcrm_1579374000082550018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020350047', 'John Knowlton', NULL, 'Member has not submitted cancellation as he will be aging into Medicare eff 1/1/2022.  I will cancel w/Sedera and RCI has been cancelled.  Payment drafted 12/20/21 has been refunded.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-21 18:41:59', '2021-12-21 18:46:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082601047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083258001', 'Jonathan Atwell', NULL, '12-21-21 Just talked with Jonathan and he will follow my instructions to set up his C4 account and to select me as his agent. He''s super appreciative of my help and thanked me for talking with him after hours. He''s planning to choose the Anthem Silver Mountain Enhanced X HMO 5000. His cost is about $57.44 from the estimator tool. APTC about $355. Ded is $200 and Mop is $700. Not tied to any Dr. This gives him a super low ded and mop. He''ll enroll tonight and let me know if he has any problems.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-21 17:30:19', '2021-12-21 17:30:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082601042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, '12-21-21 I just tried called again because he has this need that Tim Hirsch says is ineligible for sharing and cost is in excess of $500K! I can''t leave a vm. I''ll text again and I don''t believe he ever checks email. He uses a friend''s service to get online, if I remember correctly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-21 16:54:34', '2021-12-21 16:54:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082601031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005271219', 'Jacklyn (Jackie) Gartman', NULL, '12-21-21 Jackie originally said no pre-x until we were deep into the conversation of converting to SECURE or DIRECT and then she finally realized she has smaller things she''s dealing with such as seeing a pain management specialist for neck pain. She did a nerve ablation and may need to do another one soon. She had a DNC done and cost was $20K and LHS negotiated it down to $5K, but they still haven''t paid their portion yet. Her gyn docs aren''t in the network either, Dr. Ota or Dr. Ben-Yehuda. Looks like neither accept ins. She also has sciatica issues she''s tending to. She also pays Dr. Daniel Rosen $400 a month for her and husband to have unlimited access to him as Concierge doctor.  So, she doesn''t need the virtual healthcare app. I should make sure they have access to Life Care!  After talking through it, John will age into Medicare in March. Jackie gets discounted meds through Concierge and unlimited access to him already. Only tangible benefit of MPB will be Life Care. I just emailed her the Life Care, Whole Healthy Living and Referral Fee email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-21 14:24:00', '2021-12-21 15:29:22'),
