  ('zcrm_1579374000082601023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011910001', 'John Singleton', NULL, '12-21-21 Talked with Anne. She hasn''t received an email from Sedera yet to remove John and kids. Patti is in communication with Elizabeth Vargas on this. I emailed Anne on Dec. 9th with information about SECURE to enroll in that for John and kids. She didn''t remember seeing that email but it was opened by her and John. She will find it again and read it. They already have regular ins because they were told they couldn''t move to a new MCS option. She is thrilled to have this option back again and will review the information. I told her I am leaving for the holidays and she will look it over this afternoon and call me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-21 13:03:43', '2021-12-21 13:10:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082550013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060779385', 'Lorrie Marchant', NULL, 'Lorrie called regarding her Zoho SalesIQ chat question not being answered. I answered her physical therapy question along with some other questions. Lorrie was happy to speak with a real human being. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-21 12:51:49', '2021-12-21 12:51:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082538028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038052', 'Brian Walsh', NULL, 'member called because he is going to get a covid test at his nephew''s girlfriend''s practice, they wanted a form of insurance for payment.  I explained that his plan doesn''t cover covid testing unless it turns into a medical need, then he can submit that bills and others to Zion for sharing. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-21 12:29:28', '2021-12-21 12:29:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082601018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005271219', 'Jacklyn (Jackie) Gartman', NULL, '12-21-21 She keeps moving appt and then not confirming. I just left her a vm bc she is interested in moving away from LHS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-21 12:28:44', '2021-12-21 12:28:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082601013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083258001', 'Jonathan Atwell', NULL, '12-21-21 Jonathan is getting divorced and his coverage is ending Jan. 1st, 2022. He''s starting his own new biz and expects to earn $20K this year. So, he wants to get a C4 plan now for Jan. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-21 12:24:48', '2021-12-21 12:24:48'),
