  ('zcrm_1579374000082603052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082612012', 'Ken Carpenter', NULL, '12.21.21:  Emailed Ken, asking to schedule a day and time to discuss his health care needs and the OPD plan. Ken called back.  Had Liberty HS but the price doubled and it takes long to get reimbursed. Dr. Patterson told him about OPD. He visited the website and likes the plan.  I explained the plan services.  Ken said he wants a 1/1/22  start date. Enrolled Ken and the kids. Explained the on-boarding process.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-21 11:59:00', '2021-12-21 17:18:16'),
