  ('zcrm_1579374000082603003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085361002', 'Belinda Fortman', NULL, '12.20.21:  Called - l/m to c/b.  Belinda returned my call.  Used to be part of a Christian Health Group (Christian Health Ministries).  Did a web search and found us.  No pre-x; had arthritis in her hips 4 years ago but was cured - no treatment needed since then.  Takes an anti-inflammatory, Bio-identical HRT and anti-anxiety med.  Has an HSA and wants to continue using it.  Is a bus. owner.  On COBRA now and it''s expensive.  Wants to review our site more and think about it for a possible Feb. 1 start.  Explained the SECURE plan services.  Emailed her the link to my site and guidelines.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-21 10:48:03', '2021-12-21 10:48:03'),
