  ('zcrm_1579374000082549028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921634', 'Joanna Lyons', NULL, 'Member called in and expressed interest in cancelling.  She said that she has put out alot of money over the year and Zion has no covered anything.  I get the impression that she has not submitted anything.   Wants some reimbursement for at least  4 separate blood works.  Would not say if they were all related.  my guess is that they are not shareable.  I advised her to speak to Zion after Andrea will not be available until after 1st of the year.  Very disgruntled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-21 09:14:30', '2021-12-21 09:14:30'),
