  ('zcrm_1579374000082572003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762009', 'Lori Keller', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after her start date of January 1, 2022. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-21 08:04:00', '2021-12-21 08:04:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082538008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, 'Tania called in wanting to know if I could find a mammogram facility in the PHCS network, she said she''s had issues in the past with finding any.  I did a search for mammogram and imaging and came up with no results, I told her that she needed to call Planstin directly to let them know this and ask if they have any suggestions or could make an exception for her.  I told Tania that I would give her Planstin''s phone number just in case when I transferred her they weren''t in yet, because they are mountain time.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-21 08:01:13', '2021-12-21 08:01:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082550003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069341714', 'Mark Read', NULL, 'Mark called with questions regarding continuous therapy for a neck injury. I explained that in this instance he is a self-pay patient and went over the self-pay process. I then sent him information on how to submit his needs to Zion in the case that this exceeds his $1000 IUA. Mark does not seem to understand his plan and does not want to do the work that is required for his plan. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-21 07:10:08', '2021-12-21 07:10:08'),
