  ('zcrm_1579374000082491102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '12-20-21 Carolyn is deciding to keep SECURE and cancel Oscar. She''s less concerned about the cyst now. She did see dr. and they can''t remove it yet until it''s no longer inflamed. But, they don''t seem concerned. I told her she can wait to cancel Oscar until the end of the month or whenever she''s ready. She hasn''t paid them yet, so no need to worry about payment part. She feels better. She also knows she will pay cash price if/when she has it removed. Believes it will cost $100''s of dollars, not 1000''s of dollars. Would never reach her ded. All set for now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-20 16:08:15', '2021-12-20 16:08:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082519003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', NULL, 'Ben called back.  He wanted to ck if it matters where they get the lab work done for their daughter.  Is LabCorp in Avista ok?  Went to HCBB & tried multiple lab lookups including Lab Corp & the one in Avista never came up even though I was using their zip code.  We went over how they are still cash-pay up to the $1k IUA so I would ck on pricing first (being in the Avista compound, it could be more expensive?  Gave the example of another client & in compound pricing) although LabCorp has come up for me as fair priced elsewhere, I just Sndle those.  He has the link for submitting a Zion ''need'', but will let us know if he needs anything further.  He said he appreciated the help.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-20 16:04:52', '2021-12-20 16:04:52'),
