  ('zcrm_1579374000082491070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008640041', 'Allison Adams', NULL, '12-20-21 Allison Adams F.K.A Allison Gaughan just got a new job with Canyon Ranch. They are located in AZ, N. CA, VT, and Las Vegas. She will work partially remotely for these retreats. She also has her own 3 retreats in IT that she will continue to do and believes these will be much more in high demand for transformations that will be taking place here on out. She will get coverage through Canyon Ranch moving forward. She originally sent an email to the info@mympb.com and got no response to her request on Dec. 6th to cancel. She called in and Patti sent her the email to cancel and it''s complete already. She will be refunded for Jan. 1st membership. Super nice as always!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-20 13:08:39', '2021-12-20 13:12:29'),
