  ('zcrm_1579374000082491052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489118', 'Darrin Levy', NULL, '12-20-21 Darrin will keep his new Cigna plan for at least Jan to see if a new test/trial drug works for his acid reflux problems. It''s getting worse and he can get a free endoscopy on Jan. 31st from the company doing the trial treatment. If his hiatal hernia is large enough, they will include him in the test study. So, he has some variables to sort through before he starts SECURE if/when it makes sense. Best to stay put with Cigna for now since condition is not doing well and can''t wait a year as it stands now. Cigna Connect HSA Bronze 6500 for $497.64, no APTC. Acct #2530006865.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-20 11:52:43', '2021-12-20 11:55:24'),
