  ('zcrm_1579374000082491003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496002', 'Ryan Murphy', NULL, '12-20-21 Raquel is enrolling in SECURE now for EF $1000/$685. She wants her email address to be the primary but she has to put in Ryan''s for the virtual healthcare app. She included it on the app and I put in hers here for our communications. Has atypical cells in mole that she will need to get removed in Feb. She knows it''s her responsibility to pay and will not be reimbursed. Son has peanut allergy. Not worried about him for this. Not serious.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-20 10:08:02', '2021-12-20 10:16:43'),
