  ('zcrm_1579374000082487003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096043', 'Melisa (Lisa) Levitt', NULL, 'Melisa called because she wanted to know what was included with her preventative care benefits, I told her that I would send her a link that lists the full 64+ services.  She also wanted to know if massage therapy would be covered for a lymph node issue she is having- I told her that Zion Health needed pre-approval for alternative medicine needs and sent her the Zion Needs Submission link to request.  I also told her that she could find Massage Therapy coupons via Tivity/WHLC and sent her more information on how to login to that site. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-20 09:50:16', '2021-12-20 09:50:16'),
