  ('zcrm_1579374000082350116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082742002', 'Kara Baas', NULL, '12-17-21 Kara and Wayne? are both 53 or Wayne''s turning 53 in Jan. 15th 2022.  They are both healthy, no real pre-x other than Wayne needs thyroid meds and Kara takes compounded progesterone. They also take ivermectin prophylactic and Wayne had a hemorrhoid this year. Healthy otherwise. They are with LHS now and don''t love it. They don''t get much help or response from LHS. Her Dr. Mary Weubben is in the PHCS network. She also prefers thermography which isn''t included. She knows to pay cash and not reimbursed. $1000/$500. Enrolling on Wed. Dec. 22nd and back date to Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-17 18:15:24', '2021-12-17 18:15:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082398094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082413287', 'Blaire Speaker', NULL, '12-17-21 Blair chose FRIDAY Gold Rx Copay: Unlimited $0 Primary Care Visits, $0 Preferred Generic Rx, $0 Mental Health Counseling, $0 Vision Exam, Urgent Care Copay. Acct # 9027565048.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-17 17:08:00', '2021-12-17 17:08:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082346066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067291089', 'Heidi Beachley', NULL, 'Heidi called.  She feels like she''s being "screwed" (see Wendy''s last comment for details).  We tried to look up the various lab work done, but none I found match exactly.  The STD screening I found on HCBB is showing a fair price of $60, so I sent her a screenshot of that information for her area, although we agreed it''s hard to be sure we''ve selected an exact match for what was done.   If it is, her lab name shows they are normally a fair price lab.  Maybe she can show them the screenshot & save $?  The bill says $200+, so unsure if same item as was done.  Try find other test, but unable to find anything on that one.
     Sent her a copy of her post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail as well & highlighted the HCBB section for her.  We discussed that for this, we don''t do negotiation.  Then did go over non-emergency surgery over 5k so she understood that situation.   
    Sent temp for submitting a ''need'' to Zion and went over, pretty easy.  She''ll take pictures and get the ''need'' started.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-17 16:54:24', '2021-12-17 16:54:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082346061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570050', 'Silvina Irimia', NULL, 'Call came in from 720-415-9000.  When I answered, I don''t know if they couldn''t hear me or changed their mind and they hung-up.  Called right back &amp; LM.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-17 16:45:11', '2021-12-17 16:45:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082398075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067291089', 'Heidi Beachley', NULL, '12-17-21 Information here NOT to be shared.  Heidi just called me back and is super upset by this ridiculous bill. The Dr. charged $205 for the visit. Then Lab Corps charged $909 for very basic labs. For example full STD panel through Jason Health is $108 for 8 items! Her Dr tested for 2 items and now she has a $909 bill from Lab Corps. She was simply prescribed basic antibiotics for yeast infection.  She can''t reach a human at Lab Corps. I told her to call Concierge for further help and hopefully Zion can also help negotiate bill lower if possible. She will call Concierge now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-17 16:17:10', '2021-12-17 16:18:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082398070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082413134', 'Nathan Knecht', NULL, '12-17-21 Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 7000 Rx Copay for 1183.68 Full cost and APTC $848.75. They are still pondering SECURE but they need more time to dig into it before they commit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-17 15:58:55', '2021-12-17 15:58:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082398065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067291089', 'Heidi Beachley', NULL, '12-17-21 I had to see the gyno two weeks ago for some issues.  I spent $205 just to see the doctor and just received a bill for $909.00 for the two lab tests.  I can''t pay that bill, it''s so effn expensive.  How the hell?  Anyway, I''ve never made a claim yet to Zion, can you please guide me on how to do this?  I need this bill lowered and some guidance.  The two bills total are over $1,000 - I wouldn''t even be surprised if I got another bill.  I seriously don''t understand our horrible medical sytem.

Peace,

Heidi Beachley
E-RYT 500 
Professional Yoga Therapist
Lagree Teacher

I just left her a vm. I will see if that''s the cash price or some other inflated rate...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-17 15:48:00', '2021-12-17 15:48:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082398060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, '12-17-21 Playing phone tag. Left her another vm now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-17 15:20:42', '2021-12-17 15:20:42'),
