  ('zcrm_1579374000082346028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069341714', 'Mark Read', NULL, 'Mark called complaining that none of the doctor''s that Jennifer sent him from the PHCS network were in network.  (I spoke to Jennifer, there is no way that he would''ve been able to call all 64 pages of doctor''s that she sent him in less than an hour)  He complained that this plan "just wasn''t working for him"  I told him that I could send him a link and instructions on how to do a PHCS network search on his own, I also told him that if he can''t find ANYONE in network that he should talk to Planstin, the company that he get''s his preventative benefits through.  I gave him Planstin''s number and transferred him.  Mark was rude and impatient, he has called Jennifer, Wendy and myself today and doesn''t seem to want to accept how his plan works,  he said "this is too much work". - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-17 12:39:28', '2021-12-17 12:42:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082398026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082413051', 'Rowan Steel-Hall', NULL, '12-17-21 Rowan will complete his enrollment after his discussion with his new employer today at 2:00. They are in negotiations now and his job may start on Feb. 5th or 7th. He may go without insurance for those day if his employer insurance starts immediately.  He wants the most catastrophic plan since only needs it for one month. Friday Bronze for $783.20 for family of 4 , $8700 ded individual and $17400 mop. I told him he must call C4 to request Jan. 1st start date as well since after the deadline. He understood.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-17 12:32:20', '2021-12-17 12:32:20'),
