  ('zcrm_1579374000082406003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069341714', 'Mark Read', NULL, '12-17-21 I talked with Mark as well. He was told his blood pressure is out of whack when he went in for IV therapy purely for wellness, no needs or symptoms.  He wanted to figure out what to do exactly for next steps. He was thinking of going in for his annual wellness visit but doesn''t have a PCP doctor and it might take a while to get in. I suggested he goes to Urgent Care and calls Concierge back for suggestions of high quality places for good price locally. He will do that. He has no symptoms or anything but wants to be safe. He will let me know how it goes. 
We talked again and he might just go find a PCP and go for his annual wellness visit since he truly has no symptoms and needs his annual check anyhow. He''s going to call around.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-17 10:06:06', '2021-12-17 10:19:24'),
