  ('zcrm_1579374000082398008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069341714', 'Mark Read', NULL, 'Mark called with many great questions. He does not seem too confident in his plan, as I spent 42 minutes with him via phone going over his plan with him. But he did ask some great questions and asked for a positive testimony, so I reached out to Wendy. I sent Mark the following via email: link to the 64+ ACA preventative services, Zion needs submission instructions, and 2 lists of PHCS network PCP''s in Longmont and Boulder, CO. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-17 09:36:56', '2021-12-17 09:36:56'),
