  ('zcrm_1579374000082346008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081920010', 'Daniel Minerva', NULL, 'member was having a difficult time getting into the MPB.Health portal.  I told him that he could send his self-employment information over to Patti and have him her email address.  He called back later, concerned that his portal didn''t work....I spent about 15 min with him and he was eventually able to get into his portal.  I talked to Patti, she is going to respond to him, as the information was already uploaded 3 times in his portal, and that he doesn''t need to do anymore.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-17 09:02:18', '2021-12-17 09:02:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082350016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082617', 'Melinda Kadinger', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation form after speaking to advisor.  I will notify Sedera &amp; RCI &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-17 08:14:55', '2021-12-17 08:14:55'),
