  ('zcrm_1579374000082350003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816049', 'William Webb', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will let Planstin know &amp; cancel billing.  Wendy spoke to member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-17 07:28:43', '2021-12-17 08:08:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082346003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081698002', 'Jeanne M Braun', NULL, 'Jeanne called with many questions regarding her plan, she seemed like a very nice lady, just completely clueless as to what plan she bought.  I went over how Zion Health and her IUA work, the MEC program; it''s services and how it would allow her to fund and HSA account if she chooses.  She seems to still be in "shopping" mode and told me that she is going to do research on Zion Health and their standing with the BBB,  and then make a decision on whether or not she will keep her plan, she asked me about our cancellation process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-17 07:27:38', '2021-12-17 07:27:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082257018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079922001', 'Pamela Luna', NULL, 'Bryan called again.  He wanted help getting into HCBB.  Pointed out in his ''Welcome E-mail'' it can take 2-3 weeks.  So, sent him HCBB Gen Prac &amp; Int Med suggestions near him.  We went over a lot.  Prev, CirrusMD, &amp; Healthshare pretty in depth.  It seems like he''s getting it...    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-16 17:41:48', '2021-12-16 17:41:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082310081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756136', 'Cynthia Schell', NULL, '12-16-21 Cynthia will talk to her HR tomorrow to see if she''s already paid for Jan or not. She will read through the plan docs and may choose the Bright Health Bronze $0 ded to get co-pays for all of the items she will need. She sees a cardiologist due to an event a few years ago with a blocked artery. She shes a hematologist due to a blood condition and she got covid this year. Takes multiple meds (atorvastatin is one) which she believes are all generic bc she spends $24 for all of them total for 3 months supply. She will call me tomorrow with status of her decision. She''s a tobacco user as well and lives in 80504 in Weld County.  Bright Health and Friday Health are the only two that will accept all 3 docs. Dr. Kimberly Myers, Dr. Norman Gray, Dr. Neuman Moazzam.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-16 17:07:27', '2022-01-04 12:04:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082310073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756136', 'Cynthia Schell', NULL, '12-16-21 Cynthia works for a law firm and her MAGI is showing as $68,640. Her employer coverage is not affordable within the 9.86%. Her portion of the plan is $648 a month. She believes she has the cheapest option from her company. It should be $558.73 or less to be considered affordable which it''s not. She has a blood condition and wants to keep her doctors as well. Latawphia with C4 instructed us to remove the box stating she has health insurance through her employer since it''s not affordable via the gov guidelines. She now gets an APTC of $370.80. Tkt # is 211216 002003.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-16 16:43:23', '2021-12-16 16:46:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082310068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816049', 'William Webb', NULL, '12-16-21 They are getting a $0 plan with their tax credit now! Plus they get even more mental health benefits with new plan. He was very happy with the membership but you can''t beat $0! Super nice and appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-16 16:30:42', '2021-12-16 16:30:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082318010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887044', 'Jack Pardo', NULL, 'Karen called requesting information re COVID 19 testing....instructed client to ask  for free testing and call us with any problems with testing....', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2021-12-16 16:22:55', '2021-12-16 16:22:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082310058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007406003', 'Andrea Flynn', NULL, '12-16-21 Explained SECURE to Andrea bc LHS price is going up substantially. After talking it all over with her she''s most concerned about her blood tests for her thyroid condition and possible cost of ultrasound. We are researching the cost of TSH, Free T3, Thyroid Antibody, T4 and white blood cell count, plus thyroid ultrasound and fine needle aspiration. She says CO prices are way better than AK prices. She lives near Soldotna and Kenai AK now. Her daughter Julia also broke her leg this year and now just has a 6 month follow up check up in March or so. Andrea is looking for a March 1st start date. Apparently LHS won''t pay any new medical cost within 2 months prior to annual renewal dates. Their renewal is May 1st, therefore she wants a March 1st start date to avoid to months without any benefits from LHS if they cancel.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-16 15:42:50', '2021-12-16 15:42:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082257008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496002', 'Ryan Murphy', NULL, '12-16-21 Talked with his wife Raquel and she wanted to check on the doctor network. Dr. Donna Waters, Dr. Anthony McDavid, Dr. Szczepenski, Dr. Rabito all show in the PHCS network. They will review the information I already sent to Ryan and we will talk again on Monday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-16 15:29:23', '2021-12-16 15:29:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082287076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082320001', 'Kimberly Garcia', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-16 14:44:25', '2021-12-16 14:44:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082287071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082319002', 'Steven Smith', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-16 14:39:52', '2021-12-16 14:39:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082310053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001172005', 'Kate Paulin', NULL, '12-16-21 Kate has Medishare now and paying $193 without wellness and $9K AUA! She''s interested in SECURE to add wellness and HSA. The only concern is she had pre-cancerous polyps removed 9/17/2020. She needs another one done in 3 years to check up on it. Labeled as tubular adenoma and sessile adenoma. She''ll ask dr. if this is a concern. Otherwise, healthy. She likes the additional benefits and may switch after talking to her dr.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-16 14:39:27', '2021-12-17 14:37:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082268128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073951174', 'Doreen Burbidge', NULL, 'Doreen''s husband called again about Doreen''s CirrusMD account, he says that she is able to login- however, the system seems to be "freezing"  and not allowing her to get past the set up page to speak to a doctor.  I told Doreen''s husband that I would tag her in an email to CirrusMD''s support team, asking that they reach out to Doreen to help her resolve this issue. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-16 13:50:13', '2021-12-16 13:50:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082317008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '12.16.21:  Called - l/m to c/b to let me know if she and her husband are still interested in either Care Plus or Secure and want to enroll for 1/1/22 or if they haven''t decided yet. Jenni responded they need more time and asked if they could move forward next week?  I told her we are extending the deadline through next week and asked if that would help.  She said yes.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-16 13:43:38', '2021-12-22 11:49:31'),
