  ('zcrm_1579374000082096251', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '12-15-21 Carolyn is nervous bc she has a cyst on her bra line that dermatologist wasn''t worried about 6 months ago. Now it''s inflamed and she''s getting it checked out on Friday to make sure it''s nothing bad. She''s keeping Bright Health as backup until she''s certain she''s in the clear. She''s on the phone with Bright Health now to figure out the closest plan to what she has now. She will keep me posted. I also let her know she can use her tax docs showing her investment income as proof of self employment. That was  a relief to her and easy to do.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-15 16:26:50', '2021-12-15 16:27:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082096246', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082411001', 'Clement Wong', NULL, '12-15-21 Clement is 58 and wife Jennifer is 40. They are both self-employed and currently don''t have health ins bc it''s so expensive. They are paying everything as cash pay now, so totally comfortable with that. Clement has high blood pressure managed with generic meds and he''s borderline type 2 diabetic controlled with generic meds. Wife has asthma and no hospital visits from asthma. She takes Symbicort but hasn''t bought it in a while. Doesn''t need it often. She got attacked a number of years ago and now has PTSD which she also takes meds for. Otherwise, they are healthy, no tobacco I believe. I might have forgotten to ask!  He''s a truck driver. He''s ready to enroll on Friday when he''s near a computer.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-15 16:02:54', '2021-12-15 16:02:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082144046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, 'Tracey called, she needed help knowing what to do about the ER bills and how to submit/start a ''need'' w/Zion.  Resent her the template.  Walked her through what to do.  She will be calling Zion to find out how the ER can send the information directly (per the hospitals request for info).  She knows my hours in case she needs more help &amp; seemed happy to be working w/someone who lives so close to her.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-15 15:37:53', '2021-12-15 15:37:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082157003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021903103', 'Jodi Anglin', NULL, 'Spoke to Jodi Anglin about an issue she has with MEC bill for Mammogram.....she is sending email with issue....will follow up with her.  She is interested in converting to MEC + ZION.....Secure program.....need to contact Jane Kassel....will contact Jane Kassel when email is sent from client to convert her to new program.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2021-12-15 14:54:09', '2021-12-15 14:54:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082136028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257237', 'Ken Bechtel', NULL, 'Kenneth called regarding whether or not dermatology is a preventative service. I explained that it is not, I explained the self-pay process, and advised him to keep all bills regarding his dermatology visit in the case that it goes above his IUA amount. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-15 14:39:14', '2021-12-15 14:41:28'),
