  ('zcrm_1579374000082140008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082146002', 'Ursa Abernathy', NULL, '12.15.21:  Recvd. quote request from Ursa.  Called and spoke to her.  Interested in Care Plus.  No health issues or pre-x, no meds, only supplements.  Age - 51, non-smoker.  Had been lookin at a different plan w/Zion Health that isn''t up and running yet.  She needs health care for Jan. 1, so did more research and visited our site.  I explained the Care Plus plan services, on-boarding process and need for a Welcome Call.  She enrolled today.  Also told me she referred Kyle King (female from Az?) to MPB.  Kyle told her she talked with another Advisor.  I don''t know who that is. Sent Ursa a Thank-you email for enrolling.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-15 12:12:24', '2021-12-15 12:12:24'),
