  ('zcrm_1579374000082096159', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885083', 'Susan Best', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation Per Cari she has already been in touch with Wendy.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-15 11:32:21', '2021-12-15 11:32:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082096154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, 'Joy called in and stated that she wants to know what she needs to do or what the process is for payment on the bills that care coming in for the surgery she had due to a sporting accident. I told her she needs to contact Zion directly since they are the ones who take care of the claims etc. She has already submitted a need and what not due to this. So I gave her Zion''s phone number and she is calling them now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-12-15 11:31:39', '2021-12-15 11:31:39'),
