  ('zcrm_1579374000082144033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885083', 'Susan Best', NULL, 'Susie wrote in on SalesIQ that the cancellation link Wendy Scipione sent her to, she could not find.  She cut &amp; pasted Wendy''s response, so I can tell Wendy is already aware of the situation.  Went ahead and sent Patti''s cancellation template.   Sent Patti an e-mail as a heads up so we catch this cancellation in time &amp; she knows Wendy is already aware.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-15 11:13:52', '2021-12-15 12:40:35'),
