  ('zcrm_1579374000082096139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862244', 'Andrew Racuch', NULL, 'Andrew called in and asked to point him in the direction of finding a provider for a colonoscopy that he needs to get. I sent him the email with all the info on searching for a provider and also send an email with Planstin''s info to call them and speak to them before anything is scheduled so he knows what to do for anything preventative. He stated that he never uses the plan and when he does he feels he is starting over. So he doesn''t seem to know much about Planstin. He has their info to give a call. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-12-15 11:08:34', '2021-12-15 11:08:34'),
