  ('zcrm_1579374000082096013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046632018', 'Richard Spiegel', NULL, 'I was informed by Sedera about a week ago that this member enrolled in the access + membership direct with Sedera.  His membership with us is still active which means he not has 2 memberships.  I let Zach know at that time.  I just got an email from Sedera asking about the member I followed up with Zach and he had not been in touch with the member.  I explained that he now has 2 memberships and that he will be double billed.  Zach said that he is rich so he won''t care.  I explained that if he elects to stay with us w/Sedera he will most likely have to re-enroll early next year.  Also that if he stays with Sedera A+ questionable if we will still get commissions on him.  Also that he will loose Redirect as Sedera is not allowing any MEC''s.  Zach to let me know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-15 07:52:26', '2021-12-15 07:52:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082115003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077566038', 'Todd Lesnett', NULL, 'Spoke to member Theo had to reschedule welcome call. Sent email to do so. Also added secondary email. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-15 07:36:52', '2021-12-15 07:36:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082096008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132148', 'Rhoda Goff', NULL, 'Member submitted change form to raise his IUA frm $2500 to $5000.  I will notify Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-15 07:21:25', '2021-12-15 07:21:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082096003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081381002', 'Bren Frisch', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form.  Payment updated in Admin 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-15 07:12:21', '2021-12-15 07:12:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082009161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082060001', 'Shannon Cleary', NULL, '12-14-21 Shannon enrolled in SECURE $275/$1000. She found a bill that is supposed to go into effect Jan. 2022. I''ve never seen anything showing that the insurance companies will honor this yet. I don''t believe the Planstin MEC will since they can remove themselves from the mandate via their religious roots. https://leg.colorado.gov/bills/hb20-1158', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-14 19:02:52', '2021-12-14 19:02:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081994016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691274', 'Scott Savage', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1129 Question : I want to cancel my membership immediately. I don''t want to be billed for my upcoming bill, which usually comes in the next couple days. How do I do this', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-12-14 18:38:21', '2021-12-14 18:38:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082057013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, 'tt Robin,  she''s going to Mexico & wondered how it would wk if she broke her leg or something.  I made sure she has Zion''s ph # & told her to call them asap  if something happens, so they can guide her.  That generally, they want you to become stable & get home asap.  That it''s important to get detailed bill(s) in English (if at all possible).  Sent her temp to submit items to Zion in case she needs that while she''s gone (she is taking her laptop).   Told her she can try CirrusMD (which she does have setup on her phone) for non-life threatening items while she''s away too.   She had questions I couldn''t answer, but said she would try Kelly Anne Thurs since she''s our most experienced concierge member (then I can learn to answers on the backside).    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-14 18:06:41', '2021-12-14 18:06:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082057008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826048', 'Trent Mullikin', NULL, 'Wendy sent an e-mail asking for me to help Trent setup their CirrusMD.  I sent an inviation to Trent, but it wouldn''t allow me to send one to Mandy (maybe she''s already setup?).  Sent an e-mail reply to all: Trent, Mandy, Wendy w/cut &amp; paste of instructions from the curr post Welcome Call e-mail, info on the invitations per above, no need to setup child since &lt;18 yrs old, use the 2 e-mails on file (&amp; confirmed those for them).  Let them know to let us know if they need further help, as I can  submit a request for support on their behalf.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-14 18:05:23', '2021-12-14 18:05:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982194', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082111037', 'Jackie Ewing', NULL, 'Called Jackie Ewing to follow up on email sent...left message....waiting on call back.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2021-12-14 16:47:54', '2021-12-14 16:47:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982179', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080544007', 'Lisa Smith', NULL, 'Lisa Smith called to ask a question and confirm 12/16/21 phone appt for possible enrollment....answered her questions.....will speak to her for 12/16/21 possible enrollment.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2021-12-14 16:36:51', '2021-12-14 16:36:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982174', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032122001', 'Eileen Fagan', NULL, 'Called Eileen Fagan to compare Zion &amp; Sedera...waiting on call  back....will try tomorrow.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2021-12-14 16:33:49', '2021-12-14 16:33:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982164', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080705046', 'Courtney Barnes', NULL, 'Left message with possible client for enrollment....left message...waiting on call back from client', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2021-12-14 16:30:02', '2021-12-14 16:30:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082009101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', NULL, '12-14-21 Andi just enrolled in SECURE EC $495/$1000. She''s going to keep her Anthem plan for her 3 month check with her dermatologist to make sure she''s all set with her skin check before she cancels that. She''s letting that auto renew directly with Anthem, not through C4. I didn''t help her with that part. She''s good to go for Jan. 1st start date with SECURE.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-14 16:21:59', '2021-12-14 16:21:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082057003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, 'tt Jillian.  She says because her last item was declined (I''m assuming she''s talking about the colonoscopy discussed above on 10/25/21), she''s calling to make sure she uses her plan properly this time.   Her son was in an accident and his tooth has died, so they need to do a root canal.   I told her if they consider it a ''medical'' need then they might help with it, however if it''s considered ''dental'', they may not.  She says well I have ''accident'' insurance & this was an ''accident''.  Because she''s sure it should be covered, I transferred her directly to Zion (& gave her their # in case she needs to call them again), since they will be the ones who can confirm whether this will be an eligible need.  She seemed okay with that solution.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-14 15:25:30', '2021-12-14 15:25:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713058', 'Dena Conine', NULL, 'Member called back.  She is needing to drop both of her children.  She wants to add her husband.  With him being younger than her, Member was informed that she would still remain as the Primary Member.  She was instructed that all she had to do was complete the form by dropping her two children and adding her husband.  

She was told that she would be charged only $5 a month more than the monthly fee now and she was ok with that.

She was also told that she would need to get those changes in place by the 18th of this month so that when we do billing it will reflect the new family configuration.

Membership Change form was emailed to her.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-12-14 14:52:17', '2021-12-14 14:52:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082041028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041953095', 'Susan Farrar', NULL, 'member called to ask how her preventative benefits work.  I went over the process and sent her the preventative care template with a link and instructions on how to find providers in the network. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-14 14:48:45', '2021-12-14 14:48:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082009096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496002', 'Ryan Murphy', NULL, '12-14-21 Ryan Murphy is good friends with Tom McCarthy who spoke very highly of his membership with MPB/Zion. Ryan is self-employed as 1099 contact worker and has real estate properties too. They are a family of 4, healthy, no pre-x other than wife with slightly high blood pressure and possible meds but not certain. Kids are 13 and 15. No tobacco. Currently have an HSA through wife''s employer. He wants to read it over and share with wife. Sending video and overview.  Talking again tomorrow. Live in Louisiana in CST.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-14 14:31:46', '2021-12-14 14:31:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '12.14.21:  Texted Jenni to remind her the deadline is approaching for a 1/1/22 start date (which she said she needed).', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-14 14:17:16', '2021-12-14 14:17:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, '12.14.21:  Amy emailed to thank me for referring them to Rod and MSEAP and said she''d circle back after the holidays to talk.  I responded that would be fine.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-14 13:58:17', '2021-12-14 13:58:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, '12.10.21:  Emailed Amy I would definitely look into their Autism program with Rod as well as our other services that would be appropriate for this and let them know, most probably after the holidays.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-14 13:56:43', '2021-12-14 13:56:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713058', 'Dena Conine', 'Drop a family member from plan', 'Returned call regarding membership change.  Sending email for member update form.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-12-14 13:44:41', '2021-12-14 13:44:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132148', 'Rhoda Goff', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that he wanted to change his IUA.  I will send out  Member Change form to him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 13:43:00', '2021-12-14 13:43:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082041023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062877001', 'Kyle Butler', NULL, 'Kyle called because his rep told him that we could find him a urology specialist that specializes in pain.  I told Kyle that HCBB, might not have a category for Urology pain specialist''s and if they didn''t I would send him what they have for Urologist''s.  I even checked healthgrades.com, they do not have a urology pain specialist category either.  I sent him a list of Urologist''s from HCBB and the fair price for a visit. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-14 13:10:49', '2021-12-14 13:10:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082017009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081381002', 'Bren Frisch', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Cari', 'Visit ID : 1127 Question : iS THIS A BOT?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-12-14 12:50:27', '2021-12-14 12:50:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082009091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489034', 'Nancy Harris', NULL, '12-14-21 Nancy is self-employed, single, healthy, no meds, no tobacco. Income is usually over the limit for APTC. Paying $450 now even with subsidy that she may have to pay back. She got lucky last year bc the gov forgave all penalties for anyone who earned more than expected. She was overwhelmed by my description of the membership. I will send her video and email overview for SECURE.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-14 12:45:33', '2021-12-14 12:45:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082048002', 'Maginel Galt', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 12:44:28', '2021-12-14 12:44:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081878009', 'Linda Pearce', NULL, '12.13.21:  Recvd. call from Linda. Interested in a MCS type of plan.  Has been researching the ministry-based groups but doesn''t want a faith-based membership w/constraints.  Explained all the plans and she chose Care Plus for herself.  Linda is age 54 and a smoker.  Told her she would have to pay an extra $50/mo. to which she agreed.  Said she intends to quit smoking.  I also told her about the limited sharing for certain smoking-related illnesses, so she is aware.  Her fiance, David, has diabetes and takes meds. for it and has no other pre-x conditions, non smoker.  He is age 63 and is considering taking this plan as his insurance is very expensive. She decided to enroll, which I helped her do today. I, then, explained what she should expect during her membership on-boarding process, including, signing up for a Welcome Call.   Sent her a "thank-you" email.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-14 12:44:04', '2021-12-14 12:44:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082047001', 'Mitchell Kirsch', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 12:41:09', '2021-12-14 12:41:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082617', 'Melinda Kadinger', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to cancel.  I put them in touch with Wiley Long (advisor).', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 12:39:20', '2021-12-14 12:39:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082009086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029266240', 'Diane Kelly-Lokocz', NULL, '12-14-21 Diane wants to drop the MEC, so I shared CARE+ with her. The network is worthless in ME in her area. They are currently paying $704/$1500 a month now with PSDHC. If move to CARE+ they will pay $550/$1000 and simply pay for preventive cash on own. This will save them $1800 a year for wellness that they can''t access anyhow with the limited PHCS network. They are all healthy, no pre-x. Make sure to mention pre-x clause starts over! I explained added benefits of CirrusMD and Life Care as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-14 12:30:16', '2021-12-14 12:30:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082042010', 'Liana Carboni', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 12:28:01', '2021-12-14 12:28:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082041018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080702012', 'Jonathan Bill', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-14 12:21:18', '2021-12-14 12:21:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082009081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919419', 'Leo Goodman', NULL, '12-14-21 Leo has acid reflux since his 20''s and finally is ready to go get an endoscopy. He''s supposed to get one every 2 years and hasn''t done so. He takes Prilosec to manage it now and tried to ween himself off and that failed miserably. So, he''s ready to do so. I''m not sure if this is a scenario where Sedera would want a 2nd opinion or not. I told him to ask them. He was also not aware of the CirrusMD or Life Care. I just resent him the information and asked Jennifer to send him the invite to get signed up for that. He was psyched to learn about that and Life Care since he didn''t understand the difference between MPB and Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-14 12:15:23', '2021-12-14 12:15:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442169', 'Philip Lucchese', NULL, 'Member called in to speak with someone about cancelling.  I transferred to Traci .', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 12:14:45', '2021-12-14 12:14:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076991106', 'Nicole Doroski', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel in file &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 12:08:19', '2021-12-14 12:08:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082009066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082367009', 'Robin Swanson', NULL, 'called phone picked up no one responded
Sent follow up email', 'Kevin Rebal', 'Kevin Rebal', '2021-12-14 11:53:22', '2021-12-14 11:53:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081882001', 'Richard Whalen', NULL, 'Member called in asking about the Verification of 1099 document.  I went through instructions with him, he will send pic of business license.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 11:47:11', '2021-12-14 11:47:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082009061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082413228', 'Michael Christenberry', NULL, '12-14-21 Michael called to change his income to $68,787.11 minus school tuition of $23,329. Chose Anthem Silver Mountain Enhanced X HMO 5000 Silver/HMO for $1,016.56 and APTC of $780.57. All set. Kids on school insurance. He includes one child on his taxes and other child goes on mom''s taxes. Both on school plans. He takes 3 drugs, levothyroxine, atorvastatin and cerelta.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-14 11:21:30', '2021-12-14 11:21:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082041013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808001', 'Glen Markham', NULL, 'Stephanie called because she lost track of the HIPPA form that Zion Health had sent her to fill out, I transferred her to Zion Health. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-14 11:14:26', '2021-12-14 11:14:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082028053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080053002', 'John Macauley', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-14 10:46:50', '2021-12-14 10:46:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082028048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080072002', 'James Romano', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-14 10:42:21', '2021-12-14 10:42:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082028043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080103002', 'Rodney Pelham', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-14 10:39:33', '2021-12-14 10:39:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082009046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366030', 'Veljko Ilic', NULL, 'Nancy had a representative from Cooper Health call in regarding her recent breast cancer diagnosis and any coverage for the diagnosis, this representative also spoke with Zion. I explained that Nancy is part of a cost sharing community, I explained the self-pay process and submitting needs to Zion Health. Per the notes, Nancy did speak to Kelly Anne yesterday regarding this diagnosis and Nancy DID NOT follow Kelly Anne''s instructions. I believe having the hospital representative call Zion health made this a very confusing situation for Nancy as the representative was told that any pre-existing condition does have a 24 month wait period before it is eligible for sharing. Nancy states that this is not a pre-existing condition and that she is very disappointed that she wasted her money. I explained that she did not waste her money, but that she does need to speak with Zion to clarify everything for her understanding. I warm transferred Nancy to Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-14 10:39:22', '2021-12-14 10:39:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082041008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029266240', 'Diane Kelly-Lokocz', NULL, 'Diane called because she had spoken to RCI and they are going to send her a list of providers that are in the PHCS network.  She complained that they were 3 hours away from her house.  I told her that she must see PHCS provider''s for her preventative care services.  She also asked if she just did a colonoscopy as a self pay patient, if it would be shared with Sedera, I told her only if it was a diagnostic colonoscopy. -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-14 10:35:07', '2021-12-14 10:35:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082028038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080558002', 'Christopher Kwon', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-14 10:25:40', '2021-12-14 10:25:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082028033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080553001', 'Garrett Luther', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-14 10:21:16', '2021-12-14 10:21:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082028028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080095009', 'Robert Martines', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-14 10:18:53', '2021-12-14 10:18:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082028023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080092002', 'Jesse Tavenner', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-14 10:15:08', '2021-12-14 10:15:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082042002', 'Christel Scomparin', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam  $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 10:02:39', '2021-12-14 10:02:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082041003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'Heather called because John is trying to use the CirrusMD app and it is pulling up his ex-employees email address rather than his own.  He needs to speak to a doctor right away.  But cannot because of this, he gave me an updated email address and also for another one of his employees Steven Robinson.  I reached out to CirrusMD requesting that these changes be made.    I told them it usually takes 24-48 hours to get a response from CirrusMD. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-14 09:55:35', '2021-12-14 09:55:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082009026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066564305', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, '12-14-21 Rob said he accidentally removed me and then added me back with the help of C4 yesterday. He never understood the income is MAGI and thought their income was $149,703 but when looking at MAGI it''s $69,500! They get a $1418.16 APTC! They chose Anthem Bronze Mountain Enhanced X HMO 7050 for HSA for their cost $0. The Silver plans weren''t including CSR, so not worth paying $350+ for plans that aren''t much better. Chose HSA to fund that and get the tax benefits. I let him know next year will likely not be such huge subsidies. They are blown away and may donate some money locally to help others!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-14 09:41:06', '2021-12-14 09:41:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082009021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076991106', 'Nicole Doroski', NULL, 'Member called to cancel. I transferred the member directly to Mr. Masters. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-14 09:34:53', '2021-12-14 09:34:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081920010', 'Daniel Minerva', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 09:29:23', '2021-12-14 09:29:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082028018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079754001', 'Catherine Engelman', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-14 09:29:08', '2021-12-14 09:29:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082009013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758269', 'Michael Pennavaria', NULL, 'Member''s wife called in due to her son going to the ER a few weeks ago. I advised member''s wife that they should upload any bills to Sedera ASAP (sent instructions on how to upload a need) and that anything after they $2500 IUA is eligible for sharing. I also sent a member change form link because she will be added to the plan as of Feb. 2022. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-14 09:29:00', '2021-12-14 09:29:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082028013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079840001', 'Eric Lindsay', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-14 09:26:08', '2021-12-14 09:26:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081982043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081968001', 'Curtis Freeman', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 09:25:33', '2021-12-14 09:25:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082028008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885017', 'Sue Massie', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-14 09:22:43', '2021-12-14 09:22:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000082009008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005534005', 'Christie L. Cadwell', NULL, '12-14-21 Looking at plans and possibly wants to switch but also may stay put. She''s going to look a little more now. My email response confused her. She now understands she has until tomorrow to make a change.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-14 09:22:10', '2021-12-14 09:22:10');
