  ('zcrm_1579374000081982003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081880002', 'Joshua Koen', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care + + Tobacco', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 08:52:47', '2021-12-14 08:52:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081969003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080304002', 'Marcell Hetenyi', NULL, 'member called and wanted to discuss at what point he needed to submit his bills to Zion for sharing, I told him that he should start submitting the bills if he believes his medical need (further diagnostic testing/further doctor visits) will surpass his $1000 IUA- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-14 08:28:03', '2021-12-14 08:28:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081959013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028801034', 'Keith Lackman', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation for old Sedera plan.  Has re-enrolled in Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 08:03:16', '2021-12-14 08:03:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081959008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810120', 'James Treece', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation RCI &amp; Sedera &amp; Billing Cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 07:57:22', '2021-12-14 07:57:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081959003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation form citing the fact that she no has employer coverage I will notify Zion &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-14 07:31:18', '2021-12-14 07:31:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081844119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919740', 'Maria Hennessey', NULL, '12-13-21 Maria checked into see if they need to do anything moving forward. Eric is in the midst cancer treatments right now. So, they must stay put.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-13 18:56:11', '2021-12-13 18:56:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081877033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, 'David called.  His wife is having chest pains & they called CirrusMD who told them to go to the ER for an EKG.  He called asking if he could do that.  We went over ''cash-pay'', paying his $1k IUA, then submitting everything to Zion (sent him that template).  He was very difficult to work with which may have been the stress of the situation?  He wanted to know if he should go to an Urgent Care for the EKG being suggested instead.  I told him that was up to him, however if the CirrusMD doctor said ER, I would follow their advice (that''s why they are there).  He asked me to look up preferred ERs in his area, but nothing pulls up.  While looking it up, I was just talking & letting him know he has access to this anytime he needs it & that upset him.  I told him I am looking it up, just letting you know in case it''s after hours or something sometime in the future.  I think he was ok when we got done, but I found him challenging...    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-13 17:16:59', '2021-12-13 17:16:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081844111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, '12-13-21 She is getting coverage through her employer now and doesn''t love MPB. It worked until now but she''s more comfortable with traditional insurance. Son will get plan through work now that he''s 18.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-13 17:03:53', '2021-12-13 17:09:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081844106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, '12-13-21 I updated her income to $13,200 judging from her income she showed Medicaid for Oct 2021. They had her on Medicaid already. So, we updated the income and cancelled out her Friday Health plan. When her income improves she''ll update it. But, she''s happy to be on Medicaid for now to avoid any cost whatsoever.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-13 16:59:00', '2021-12-13 16:59:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081844101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105661034', 'Aaron Ingalls', NULL, '12-13-21 Aaron and Juana Rincon Ingalls may get divorced in 2022 but still together and will get a subsidy of $580.19 and their cost is $137.93. Probably will choose RMHP Colorado Doctors Plan Silver 3 Free Visits 4000 $3 Walgreens. The 3 Free visits are telehealth.  They don''t have any real health concerns. Network looks reasonable in Boulder for them.  Juana wants dental, so I sent her some dental options to choose from.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-13 16:56:25', '2022-02-07 17:18:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081877028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073555182', 'Bradley Cook', NULL, 'tt Bradley, he''s talking w/Zion & they''ve been super helpful.  He talked to his advisor Melissa Blatt who was concerned because she thought we (the concierge) were not answering his questions.  But, it''s his MD office that is not cooperating = just not sending records to Zion so he can get reimbursed.  This MD office misdiagnosed him, so now he''s thinking maybe that''s why they are dragging their feet.  We talked & I suggested a quick letter from his law office (which they might not chg much for) might be helpful, so he''s going to call them right now.  It sounds like he has paid > his 1k IUA, so we went over how to proceed as well.  He seemed very grateful.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-13 16:43:31', '2021-12-13 16:43:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081877023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081883004', 'Adriana Lopez', NULL, 'Adriana let me know she''s decided to go w/FL Blue.  She seemed happy with the information I provided.  She will keep us in mind for the future.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-13 16:11:12', '2021-12-13 16:11:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081844096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', NULL, '12-13-21 Andi might get an Anthem plan until her dermatology appt to make sure all is well! She will also enroll in SECURE for her and two kids to make sure they are all set bc they are still in school and or earning very little.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-13 16:06:27', '2021-12-13 16:06:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081844091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, '12-13-21 From Josh Koen''s account.  "Josh is Tina Koen''s son. Josh is 25 and married. He''s a tobacco user and is one month into quitting. No other pre-x issues. Tina is helping through the entire enrollment process and such. Tina is S. African and she''s going back all of the sudden bc her dad isn''t doing well right now. Josh is enrolled in CARE+ $1000 $215+$50= $265."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-13 15:49:14', '2021-12-13 15:49:14'),
