  ('zcrm_1579374000081844065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081870092', 'Jennifer Stewart Fueston', NULL, '12-13-21 Jennifer wants Cigna now and it''s the only carrier that accepts her doctor. Account #8049909700. Cigna Connect HSA Bronze 6500 Bronze/EPO at $337. She checked to make sure he dr. is in the network. She''s getting a divorce now and doesn''t have the brain power to look into CARE+ anymore at this point. She will look into that for the future but went with what she knows for now.  Enrolled successfully.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-13 14:09:23', '2021-12-13 14:32:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081818058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061317', 'Patricia Barnett', NULL, 'Patricia called in because she was having a hard time finding any actual laboratories for her annual wellness bld wrk.  I explained to her the Quest Diagnostics and Labcorp are not listed but are in network and sent her a list of facilities that were showing in her area as well as an explanation straight from the PHCS network that they are in fact in network. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-13 14:00:41', '2021-12-13 14:00:41'),
