  ('zcrm_1579374000081818048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366030', 'Veljko Ilic', NULL, 'PLEASE NOTE TO MAKE SURE THAT WHEN YOU ARE EMAILING NANCY THAT YOU ARE USING HER NAME AND NOT VELIKO (HER HUSBANDS NAME)  SHE GOT VERY OFFENDED THAT I USED HIS NAME INSTEAD OF HERS AS SHE WROTE "He''s not involved."- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-13 13:14:16', '2021-12-13 13:14:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081824173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080585002', 'Cannon Winkler', NULL, 'Was informed by Jennifer that members mother called in concerned that they did not get any of the email.  Jennifer realized that the email was put in wrong and corrected it.  I resent all the emails and let Zion know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-13 12:49:18', '2021-12-13 12:49:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081844060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165404', 'Kathryn DiFrank', NULL, '12-13-21 Kathryn and Nicholas had another child and moved to Carbondale from Longmont. Their expected income will be $185K in 2022 which gives them a $260 APTC. Sending them samples of traditional insurance and SECURE. They are healthy, no pre-x other than Kathryn takes thyroid meds, NP Thyroid 60 mg which is $15-$21 on GoodRX. No tobacco. They want to see provider options in area to find docs. LHS renews for Feb. 1st, so looking to make a change for Feb. 1st start date and will reach out in early Jan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-13 12:48:32', '2021-12-13 12:48:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081818043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497146', 'Jon King', NULL, 'Jon called in to ask an obscure question about his HSA, that not even his rep could answer.  I told him that we are not tax professionals and that he should call his HSA bank with his questions.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-13 12:40:46', '2021-12-13 12:40:46'),
