  ('zcrm_1579374000081824123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, 'Per John I refunded this member $80 X 2 due to us not informing her of price increase.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-13 11:46:21', '2021-12-13 11:46:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081818033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001608001', 'Carlos Matamoros', NULL, 'Carlos called to ask if he needed pre-approval for a prostate procedure he is going to have done.  I told him that Zion only required pre-approval for alternative medical care, I also went over the pre-x conditions clause with him and he said it wouldn''t be pre-existing.  I went over HCBB Care Connect process, he is going to ask his doctor how much the procedure will cost and if it is over $5000 he will give us a call back so that we can put him through the HCBB process.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-13 11:16:26', '2021-12-13 11:16:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081844034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081872009', 'Dante Chupek', NULL, 'full presentation given scheduled a call back at 4pm 12/13/2021', 'Kevin Rebal', 'Kevin Rebal', '2021-12-13 11:14:47', '2021-12-13 11:16:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081856033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081697010', 'Yolanda Morales', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail to reschedule welcome call after start date of January 1, 2022. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-13 11:05:18', '2021-12-13 11:05:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081818028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406017', 'Patricia Nard', NULL, 'Patricia called because she said her husband was being billed for a colonoscopy.  I asked if he had presented his RCI card, and he said that he had, I told her that for any questions regarding billing, that they needed to contact RCI directly.  I told her that their phone number would be on their RCI card. She thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-13 10:58:24', '2021-12-13 10:58:24'),
