  ('zcrm_1579374000081818018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366030', 'Veljko Ilic', NULL, 'Nancy called in because she was diagnosed with breast cancer by her primary dr., she wanted to know if she could go to the same hospital and group that her daughter did for her own double mastectomy in New Jersey.  Or if there was a network.  She told me that there weren''t any major hospital''s or reputable surgeons in her area.  I told her that she could go to any provider that she liked, that there was no network.  She wants to go to her daughter''s oncologist, and breast surgeon, but didn''t have the names of them to give me so that I could send that information to HCBB, she will call us once she has their names and info.  I told her that she needs to start submitting her bills to Zion and sent her the Zion Needs Submission form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-13 09:49:37', '2021-12-13 09:49:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081824043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065580074', 'Carrie Todd', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form I will change in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-13 09:43:06', '2021-12-13 09:43:06'),
