  ('zcrm_1579374000081818013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006092', 'Nicole Mata', NULL, 'member called because she is upset that her plan does not include preventative care services- I went over the Secure plan with her and told her that if she is interested she needed to reach out to Analisa.  She told me that she was confused as to why Jennifer had sent her PHCS network doctors.  I told her to disregard what Jennifer had sent her.  That she would only have to worry about PHCS doctor''s for her preventative care on the Secure plan, and the plan that she is on now...she doesn''t have to worry about a network, she can go anywhere she''d like and went over the self-pay process. I sent her a link and instructions on how to find in network doctor''s so she could see whether or not she wants to go to the Secure plan.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-13 09:17:04', '2021-12-13 09:17:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081856008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081677010', 'James Benjamin', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online after his start date of January 1, 2022. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-13 09:05:27', '2021-12-13 09:05:27'),
