  ('zcrm_1579374000081775003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081762001', 'Michael Gaffey', NULL, 'Spoke with Renee Gaffey and Husband Michael, Will sign up on Monday 12/13/2021 for Secure plan, Member + Spouse, $5000 IUA.  Michael has Zion Health Direct....Instructed him to dis-enroll and re-enroll through our plan.  Waiting on Michael to complete that dis-enroll.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2021-12-10 17:18:26', '2021-12-10 17:18:26'),
