  ('zcrm_1579374000081750018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816206', 'Josephine Guarneros', NULL, '12-10-21 Hi Wendy,
I just wanted to send you an email as I''m canceling my membership and wanted to give you an explanation. After quite some time, I''ve finally been able to be added to my partner''s health care plan through his work. This will be a little cheaper for me in the long run and is a plan I have previously been a part of.

Please let me know if there is anything further I need to do aside from filling out the cancellation form.

Thank you so much,
Josephine', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-10 16:29:50', '2021-12-10 16:29:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081750013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082060001', 'Shannon Cleary', NULL, '12-10-21 Shannon is 32, in Boulder County. She''s dating a woman and inquiring about fertility assistance. I read the guidelines to her and shared fertility is not shareable.  She is only considering this for 3 years from now. She is self-employed and W2 employee. She earns too much for subsidy. Her biggest health expenses are for mental health counseling. Her counselor is insanely expensive, so she''s considering using a new person if her person is not in the network. She takes a number of meds all of which are for mental health and one for cold sores. Takes Adderall (generic version), lamotrigine 200 mg, buproprion, valcyclovir and one or two other meds I didn''t write down. She knows about GoodRX and gets many that way. None seem to be crazy expensive. She wants to keep her gyno, PA Alison Moore. Dr. Christine Abair is showing in the network and she''s at the same location as Alison.  She''s a horseback rider and just wants to make sure protected in case of falling of the horse. She likes SECURE $275/$1000. She also likes the HSA compliance. She got help from an agent who is recommending Friday Health for the $0 ded and free mental health counseling. Price is nearly the same but will lose the tax benefits and virtual health benefits. She''s leaning towards SECURE.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-10 16:12:58', '2021-12-10 16:12:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081763013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816206', 'Josephine Guarneros', NULL, 'Josephine called.  She''s getting benefits through work starting 1/1/22 &amp; req''d a cancellation form.  She sent Wendy notice while we were on the phone, so Wendy will know why she''s cancelling.  I sent the cancellation template to her confirmed e-mail address.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-10 15:56:53', '2021-12-10 15:56:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081763008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162017', 'Lucas Klinkhammer', NULL, 'Lucas called.  He cancelled months ago, but we''ve continued to pull his monthly contribution.  I put him directly into Patti''s VM since it''s after hours and let him know she''s really good about getting back to people.  He''ll call me back Monday evening if he hasn''t spoken to her yet.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-10 15:39:54', '2021-12-10 15:39:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081763003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072673163', 'Joshua Fisher', NULL, 'A gal called looking for a cancellation request form (she pays her son''s membership).  He got a job that has benefits now, so she wants to cancel.  But, it looks like we have a different e-mail for him than she provided.  Due to his age and privacy laws, I gave her Patti''s contact information so she can call during business hours Monday to get this taken care of.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-10 15:37:45', '2021-12-10 15:37:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081710007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072673163', 'Joshua Fisher', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Cari', 'Visit ID : 1115 Question : Hello, Where can i find a cancellation form. We currently pay for our sons policy and he recently got a job that offers insurance benefits. He needs to cancel his policy.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-12-10 15:18:32', '2021-12-10 15:18:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081740013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107134002', 'Thomas Beaudin', NULL, '12.10.21:  Texted Thomas, reminding him of deadline to enroll of 1/1/22 and asked if he is ready, to let me know.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-10 15:07:20', '2021-12-10 15:07:20'),
