  ('zcrm_1579374000081723003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001042108', 'Mark Nowak', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel plan in file.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-10 13:06:07', '2021-12-10 13:06:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081722003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080558020', 'Laura Murphy', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC  I was unable to send anyone in the family their CirrusMD invites so I reached out to CirrusMD support and requested from them that they be sent to the entire family.  Got all individual emails and updated admin123. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-10 13:05:52', '2021-12-10 13:12:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662166', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, '12-10-21 John showed me the pricing for MPB Direct is actually an obsolete product that should have ended when we moved all members to Access+. The price used to be $230 for that product but it no longer exists. The $305 price I saw was for tobacco users $230+$75= $305, so not relevant to her. Sedera no longer has discounted rates for DPC showing anywhere on their site for individuals. The correct price at her age is $310. Since nobody with MPB notified her of the price increase, John/Rod are willing to refund her the $80x2 months= $160. BUT, she must be billed at the correct amount moving forward at $310. She can get through her open Need and move to DIRECT when she''s able to. I just left her a vm to explain.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-10 12:57:36', '2021-12-10 12:57:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081673013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064873042', 'Matthew Shostek', NULL, 'Matt called in with some questions about a CT scan his doctor did during his physical to check for plaque build-up, he paid out of pocket for this service. Matt was curious as to how to submit a need, I sent him instructions via email. He is a great member and asks all of the right questions! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-10 12:35:45', '2021-12-10 12:35:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081707002', 'Christina Johnson', NULL, '12-10-21 Christina totally prefers to do the SECURE over traditional ins and not worry about her income level. Also she truly believes in the concept of how and why this works and the protections while traveling and such. Enrolled $1000/$275. She''s also interested in LTC and I mentioned Living Benefits with life insurance. Told her I need her expected monthly living expenses to work backwards to determine amount she will need in case of something bad happening.  She''s also working with a therapist and is hoping she can continue to use her with Life Care. She will find out when becomes member and can reach out to Mazetti and Sullivan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-10 12:28:24', '2021-12-10 12:28:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081706003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001042108', 'Mark Nowak', NULL, '12.10.21:  Mark called to cancel his plan. Said he''s moving on to something else but refused to tell me what type of plan.  When I asked him to let me know if there was anything about the plan that wasn''t meeting his needs, he said he didn''t use the plan.  Would not divulge anything else, even upon my inquiring and letting him know it would help us to improve.  Sent him the link to the cancellation form.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-10 12:12:07', '2021-12-10 12:12:07'),
