  ('zcrm_1579374000081668093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080568001', 'Mark Tom', NULL, 'Mark called because he thought that he needed his Zion Membership ID (which he hasn''t received yet) for his wife to use CirrusMD, I explained that CirrusMD was a completely separate entity from Zion Health and that she wouldn''t need her ID number to access their benefits. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-10 09:56:12', '2021-12-10 09:56:12'),
