  ('zcrm_1579374000081662106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082367009', 'Robin Swanson', NULL, 'Robin''s husband called to get information on the plans.  She is interested in the SECURE plan because she is looking for annual check ups.', 'Kevin Rebal', 'Kevin Rebal', '2021-12-09 19:02:00', '2021-12-09 19:02:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, '12-9-21 I forgot that Gail mentioned Tina has a DPC membership with Cloud Medical already! I need to make sure she has it for the whole family. I just sent the DIRECT information as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-09 16:21:22', '2021-12-09 16:21:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011910001', 'John Singleton', NULL, '12-9-21 Ann has an Open Need for sleep apnea and she''s met her IUA already. She had gotten an "Elite" insurance plan for John and the kids for $1100 with no ded, no co-pays, etc. and includes wellness. But, when I mentioned I could move them to SECURE she was thrilled! She can cancel the regular insurance at any time. Just when she called last year they wouldn''t let her remove the rest of the family and keep her on the membership. I let her know they''ve become more lenient now and we can put them onto SECURE for $1000/$495. I told her I''d let her know how we need to handle her membership moving forward once we get a response from Sedera. She loves her membership and is happy to keep it and happy to have John and kids on SECURE with new sharing organization.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-09 16:07:47', '2021-12-09 16:07:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081696003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081509011', 'Tammy Goen', NULL, 'Tammy called needing help changing her PW.  I sent her the membership change form thinking Patti will be able to get the request to the right person (= ?).  I''ll also check w/Kelly Anne tomorrow to learn the proper procedure on this.  Tammy was gracious and seemed okay with this solution.  I had offered to call her tomorrow and she liked the form idea better.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-09 16:04:48', '2021-12-09 16:04:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066564305', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, '12-9-21 Robert just booted me from the C4 Account. Not sure if this is on purpose or not. I just called and talked with Maggie Fleming first and she said to talk with Rod as she''s not the one dealing with it. I just left a nice vm for Rob to see how I can help. We will see...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-09 15:46:30', '2021-12-09 15:46:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073598040', 'Jennifer Hushka', NULL, '12-9-21 Renewed Anthem Link Silver Pathway X HMO 2500 for $1107.15 and no APTC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-09 15:09:06', '2021-12-09 15:09:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081505001', 'Kristen Schulz', NULL, '12-9-21 Talked with Denise Schulz again, her mom and she decided to leave her account alone with Medicaid acceptance. Now that she understands her dr. accepts Medicaid and there aren''t co-pays or anything she''s feeling more comfortable with it. Her income is just about $17K working PT at Petsmart doing grooming and on feet for 8 hours a day for 3 days a week at $14 an hour.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-09 15:04:28', '2021-12-09 15:04:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, '12-9-21 Tina and husband are both 50 and kids 22 and 25. 25 year old is married! He''s also quitting tobacco as of 1 month ago. I told her about the $50 surcharge. I also explained how to get that removed once he''s quit for 1 year.  For him, I mentioned CARE+ and SECURE since he doesn''t necessarily do his annual wellness visit. He''s self-employed so he can choose what''s best. For the Tina and her husband and 22 year old, they are looking at SECURE. Husband is self-employed. Tina has overactive thyroid and takes levothyroxine. Also has high cholesterol that she manages with diet and no meds. Husband has sleep apnea and I let her know he will have to pay for all devices for that and repeated the pre-x clause. They are also interested in vision and dental. I''ll send some options and let her know dental may not be worthwhile. She comes from S. Africa and has a great accent!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-09 14:48:36', '2021-12-09 14:48:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081668088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081693001', 'Jill Roberts', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-09 14:14:14', '2021-12-09 14:14:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081668083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899604', 'Arnold Rasker', NULL, 'In going through all the statements the Raskers sent us &amp; comparing it with the payment history John and I determined that the Raskers account had been charged in error 11 times. for $259  I had previously refunded $1295 on 10/22/21 (5 pmts).  I refunded the remaining 6 pmts ($1554) today.  This will close out the matter.  I emailed Rosann Rasker explaining this.  Letter in CRM.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-09 14:10:20', '2021-12-09 14:10:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081668078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081692002', 'Sara Baal', NULL, 'Member Only $$2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-09 13:42:25', '2021-12-09 13:42:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081668073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081634019', 'Carol Scott', NULL, 'Member $ Sp $1000 IUA OPD Complete', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-09 13:30:27', '2021-12-09 13:30:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081674008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '12-9-21 State Farm was trying to sell him some Aflac type insurance to cover his $1000 IUA. I told him it''s not worth the money and to simply fund his HSA to cover the $1000. They needed proof of major medical insurance which this isn''t ins. So, won''t qualify anyhow. He agreed that it''s not worth it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-09 13:26:06', '2021-12-09 13:26:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081684018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062935002', 'Bonnie Geier', NULL, 'Bonnie called for help because of a pre-x condition that will require her to have some sort of hand surgery.  She hasn''t yet seen a doctor, but one of her thumbs is locked in place.  I told her that I would get her a list of physical therapy doctor''s and hand specialist''s off of HCBB and send her the fair price for visits.  I was able to get a list of physical therapists, but not hand specialist''s in her area, for that I used healthgrades.com.  She also wanted to know how to get a mammogram under her plan, I explained that it would need to be scripted out by an in network provider and that she would have to go to another in network provider to have it done.  I sent her the link and instructions on how to find providers in the PHCS network.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-09 13:11:34', '2021-12-09 13:11:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081673008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, 'Spoke with Michele today and explained that with her plan she is a self-pay patient (be it preventative or diagnostic). She still has not heard back from CirrusMD and neither have I regarding her and Rick''s accounts so I will be shooting them another email today. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-09 13:10:18', '2021-12-09 13:10:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081787002', 'Brian Peterson', NULL, 'sent email for link to my page', 'Kevin Rebal', 'Kevin Rebal', '2021-12-09 13:06:56', '2021-12-09 13:06:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081684013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078592091', 'Alan Fraughton', NULL, 'missed welcome call.  left detailed message on vm, and sent an email with a new scheduler link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-09 13:02:53', '2021-12-09 13:02:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077287065', 'Maxwell Brown Abbott', NULL, '12-9-21 Max is auto renewed for Bright Health Silver 4200 EPO. Full cost is  $260 47. His cost is $11.54. $0 ded and $1000 mop. Delta Dental of Colorado Plains Plan  $13.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-09 12:56:17', '2021-12-09 12:57:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054542379', 'Michael Vactor', NULL, '12-9-21 Lisa called and she won''t tell me what they are doing moving forward. She was very secretive. She said maybe they''ll be back in the future if this new plan doesn''t work for them. It felt strange. Not sure what she''s up to. She was hoping for backdating on the payment. I told her it was billed on Nov. 20th for the month of Dec already. She will have to cancel for Jan. 1st 2022 and she agreed. Sent her the instructions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-09 12:48:55', '2021-12-09 12:48:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054542379', 'Michael Vactor', NULL, '12-9-21 Lisa Vactor called to cancel quickly. I left her a vm just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-09 12:31:45', '2021-12-09 12:31:45'),
