  ('zcrm_1579374000081668068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060050020', 'Adele Paxton-Miezejewski', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel Zion &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-09 12:24:05', '2021-12-09 12:24:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105661034', 'Aaron Ingalls', NULL, '12-9-21 Aaron has a complex household. He is legally married to Juana but they are currently separated and living a different addresses. But, they file taxes as married filing separately. He has a previous x-wife, different woman, who has been claiming the 2 kids as her dependents. He needs to find out what they plan to do for 2022 with claiming the kids. He and Wanna are both self-employed. His guess is $40K for him and $20K for her. His Bright Health already auto renewed for 2022 but he''s not getting a subsidy bc he removed Wanna. So, we may need to add her back so they can get a subsidy and possibly choose different plans for each of them. Depending on APTC we might want to explore MCS as well to simplify all of this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-09 12:22:34', '2021-12-17 16:42:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081787002', 'Brian Peterson', NULL, 'called left voicemail', 'Kevin Rebal', 'Kevin Rebal', '2021-12-09 12:12:42', '2021-12-09 12:12:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001853007', 'Scott Swannie', NULL, '12-9-21 Hi Wendy it''s Monica Swannie. Just wanted to get back to you and let you know I ran all the info by my husband and he wants to stay with liberty at least another year. Hope it goes ok for us but please track out again for 22-23. Thx for your time   

My response, Hi Monica! Thanks for the heads up. I suspect you will be seeing a huge rate increase upon your renewal in March of 2022. In that case, you might want to consider making a change at that time. Let me know if/when you get that notification. Cheers!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-09 11:33:22', '2021-12-09 11:33:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081662028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654099', 'Jennifer Avery', NULL, '12-9-21 Left vm for Jennifer letting her know her membership will end soon and to call me about other options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-09 11:30:31', '2021-12-09 11:30:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081661047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055771107', 'Marcy Oppenheimer', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-09 11:24:44', '2021-12-09 11:24:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081684008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032033', 'Cheryl Cuozzo', NULL, 'member called and wanted to know if she needed pre-approval for alternative medicine services through Zion Health, I told her that she did and sent her the Zion needs submission form link, and explained that she can use that link to either submit bills to Zion Health, or request pre-approval for alternative medicine services.  She thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-09 11:19:52', '2021-12-09 11:19:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081668063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081677010', 'James Benjamin', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-09 10:05:19', '2021-12-09 10:05:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081684003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', NULL, 'Hillary called because she wanted to know if Wake Radiology was in the PHCS network, I told her that I couldn''t find it.  She said that she was pretty certain that they were, I told her that she could simply just ask the provider if they are currently participating in the PHCS network, if they say yes, then all she needs to do is present her Planstin card at the time of service, if they say no she must go to an in network facility to receive this benefit.  I told her that I would send her a link and instructions on how to find other PHCS network providers.  She was happy with this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-09 10:01:33', '2021-12-09 10:01:33'),
