  ('zcrm_1579374000081661008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081238002', 'Joseph Scaturro', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail to reschedule welcome call after start date of January 1, 2022. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-09 08:17:33', '2021-12-09 08:17:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081661003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080401002', 'Brent McNeese', NULL, 'Spoke to Kimberly will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-09 08:12:01', '2021-12-09 08:12:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081621003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035426019', 'Ernest Bernet', NULL, 'Sent email again for Guy.  Member could not open the email sent from Guys''s Outlook', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-12-09 06:12:54', '2021-12-09 06:12:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081594023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023028', 'Amy Whelan', NULL, 'Amy called.   We went over a lot:
     - She wants to have an annual physical done.  We went over Planstin, how it works, etc.  I sent the temp for prev and walked her through everything:  Network, Gvmt Cov, etc.  Also req''d via Slack (because we haven''t rec''d the Teams invite yet) a pdf & hardcopy of her Planstin card.  She may not get the hard copy in time if she decides to chg to ins, but she wasn''t 100% sure.
    -  She''s needing to chg to reg ins due to a longterm RX that''s ~ 30k (annually?).  We talked about our worldwide shopper, but, she wasn''t really interested.  After talking, she will talk w/her advisor Michael Montes before making the final decision (I sent Michael an e-mail notification to contact her).  However, due to the time sensitive nature & the next draw date  (she cannot have our EFT draw pull!), she req''d the form now.  BUT, she is planning to wait at least until middle of next week hoping to talk w/Michael first    - CA.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-08 18:01:09', '2021-12-08 18:01:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081597021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081870092', 'Jennifer Stewart Fueston', NULL, '12-8-21 Jen is 43 and getting a divorce now. Her x is a medical dr. so she''s had to find all new drs. now. Her currently plan with him is $519 for her portion of Anthem Silver PPO.  2022 she will not qualify for a subsidy. She was referred to me by Amanda McCracken. Jen wants to keep her Behavioral Health Specialist who is also her PCP. She takes anti-depressants and anti-anxiety meds. Otherwise, healthy, no issues, no other pre-x. She does get her annual wellness pap and mammogram. She might get the mammo through her current ins now and not need another one for 2 years. She''s going to call doctor and find out the cost for pap and mammo. She also wants VSP. She''s PT teacher at 2 places, both as W2 employee. So, CARE+ is only option. She''s looking for Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-08 16:04:12', '2021-12-08 16:05:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081594018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, 'Michelle called w/questions.  The first is in regards to CirrusMD &amp; she thought I should ck w/Jennifer since they are already working together on that account.  The second is something in the follow-up e-mail.  I sent an e-mail to Jennifer so I can learn the answers too.  Michelle knows either Jennifer or I will call her back tomorrow to follow-up.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-08 16:00:07', '2021-12-08 16:00:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081597016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077459001', 'Regina Ludolph', NULL, '12-8-21 She called twice for help with understanding difference in memberships, how to research provider network. She''s looking to get herself and husband enrolled ASAP. They are currently LHS members and are still waiting for reimbursement 8 months later and totally frustrated with them. Wanted to understand how this works differently and better. She was struggling with docs that she was reading as well.  She thinks she got it figured out now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-08 15:55:07', '2021-12-08 15:55:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081594013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838096', 'David Sailer', NULL, 'David called,   10-years ago David had issues that surgery corrected.  He hasn''t taken medicine or anything for it since.  But, he called the Dr & thinks he may need to look at this issue again.  I went over that if the Dr has notated anything in his records in the last 24-mos they could consider it pre-existing. 
Because of what''s happening, he''s going to call Zion and make sure they will not consider it pre-x, because it''s super expensive & he can still sign-up for ACA since open enrollment is ongoing.  That way, he can be sure.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-08 15:24:43', '2021-12-08 15:24:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081597008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503016', 'David Mandell', NULL, '12-8-21 Talked with Joanna, David''s wife. She had a very hard time understanding the wellness visit network vs accident, injury, illness scenario where this is no network. She gets it now and will talk it over with David. Kids are at school in CA and Boston, MA. She pays for their insurance through the school too it sounds like, but it''s not expensive. I''m not sure if that''s true or not. Dr. Jill Kamon is showing in the PHCS network. Dr. Coco Dughi doesn''t show up but Boulder Medical Center shows they accept PHCS/Multiplan. I told her to call them and ask before they go in.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-08 15:23:38', '2021-12-08 15:25:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081589031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '12.08.21:  Called - l/m to c/b.  Also asked if the provider she asked me to research for the PHCS network was the one she needed and if the instructions I gave her to search in the Multi Plan network were satisfactory.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-08 14:49:48', '2021-12-08 14:49:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081533093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974269', 'Randi Futey', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after 2 mos on the plan.  I will let Zion know and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-08 14:42:34', '2021-12-08 14:42:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081597003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096331001', 'Darrell Porter', NULL, '12-8-21 Mat Piasta and Darrel work together and are considering offering this to their employees. Mat has a DPC membership that he will keep. I explained SECURE for the rest of the company. They have a few W2 employees and a bunch of 1099 contract workers. They want to offer this to all of them and are good with the List Bill option and will payroll deduct the cost. They are also curious about the Health Matching Accounts and possibly other benefits such as Living Benefits in the future. They might have 1 or 2 workers who use tobacco. I told them about the tobacco clause for 50+ and $50 for all tobacco users.  Darrel lives in Stowe VT! Many of their workers are in the Philly area.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-08 13:54:44', '2021-12-08 13:54:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081533088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081593002', 'Heather Bacchus', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-08 13:08:25', '2021-12-08 13:08:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081533083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-08 13:04:24', '2021-12-08 13:04:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081583005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713058', 'Dena Conine', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1102 Question : I need to change members on my plan.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-12-08 12:54:34', '2021-12-08 12:54:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081594008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, 'Spoke w/Catherine again since, while she was out-of-town, her husb called Patti last week.  She said we are on the same sched &amp; we''ll send in the application for Zion mid-Jan.  We also discussed the info Sedera is sending out Fri (&amp; she''ll let her husb know), but they don''t need to panic.  Our curr plan of action will take care of her.  We did discuss PA''s current environment for healthsharing, but she knows I will let her know should Zion make the same decision to pull out of PA.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-08 12:52:15', '2021-12-08 12:52:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081580013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654099', 'Jennifer Avery', NULL, 'Sent a TEAMS message regarding Sedera no longer selling in the state of PA', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-12-08 12:04:52', '2021-12-08 12:04:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081580008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, 'Sent TEAMS message regarding Sedera sending out notification to all members in the state of PA that they will no longer be selling in that state.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-12-08 12:02:52', '2021-12-08 12:02:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081533078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, 'Nelson called in and was looking for labs that are in the PHCS Network for blood work from his annual physical he had or is having. I walked him through how to navigate the Multiplan website and nothing was coming up in area except for up to 100 miles there was 4 results. Nelson then said there is a Quest that is right down the street and I told him to call them directly and ask if they participate in the PHCS Network. He called and whomever he spoke to didn''t know and said to call his insurance company.  Nelson called back and I told him to call PHCS directly and speak with them. After hanging up I saw something about labs on the Multiplan website and I clicked what I saw and it pulled up a page stating ALL Quest''s and LabCorp''s participate in the PHCS Network and as long as the members card shows the PHCS logo everything is all set. Nelson called me back after speaking to PHCS directly and he was calling to tell me the exact same thing I just found. He is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-12-08 11:27:56', '2021-12-08 11:27:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081533068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073555113', 'Angela Boyd', NULL, 'Angela called in and wanted to check to make sure that her provider was in network for a preventative physical. I let her know with her plan she has Care+ and that does not have coverage of preventative appointments and there is no network she needs to stay in with her provider.  She said what her confusion is then is what the Zion card is for and if she presents that, etc. I told her not to present the Zion card and explained what Zion is for and when she would need to present the card to get a discount on Injury/Illness ONLY. She is all set and understood. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-12-08 10:51:05', '2021-12-08 10:51:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081533063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081509019', 'Sameera Reddy', NULL, 'Member Ony $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-08 10:44:02', '2021-12-08 10:44:02'),
