  ('zcrm_1579374000081558008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080568001', 'Mark Tom', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Will send out QR Life code cards to these members once are cards are back in stock. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-08 10:13:26', '2021-12-08 10:18:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081533038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912002', 'John Sepede', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I have notified Planstin and cancelled billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-08 10:03:51', '2021-12-08 10:03:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081533033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480158', 'Margaret Weaver', NULL, 'Margaret called in and stated that she will be going onto Medicare next month and wants to take care of not being paid after that time. I put her through to Patti. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-12-08 09:56:57', '2021-12-08 09:56:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081543008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081762001', 'Michael Gaffey', NULL, 'Provided full presentation with Secure Product, Husband on Zion Directly, will need to cancel ZION product and sign up with MPB Health.  $5000 IUA Member + Spouse.   Set up follow up call on 12/10/2021 at 4:30pm.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2021-12-08 09:44:18', '2021-12-08 09:44:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081533028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080966002', 'Dale Clemons', NULL, 'The $125 Enrollment fee &amp; 1st months Share Amount declined.  I contacted Dale on 12/3 he advised that he had to contact the bank to authorize charges.  I followed up on 12/7 left VM also left another VM 12/8.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-08 09:30:54', '2021-12-08 09:30:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081558003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079594002', 'Swati Patel', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-08 09:23:48', '2021-12-08 09:23:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081533018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091884', 'Brian Sullivan', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I have notified Planstin and will cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-08 09:01:09', '2021-12-08 09:01:09'),
