  ('zcrm_1579374000081449068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006191153', 'Marjo Curgus', NULL, 'Per email I will cancel this members subscription.  I never received any cancellation from her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-08 08:01:56', '2021-12-08 08:01:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081449063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462355', 'Karen Martorana', NULL, 'Wayne called in and stated that his wife had a stroke and is still in the hospital. The bills are starting to come in and he has already started a Need but wanted to know more in depth about the process. I told him that would be something he has to contact Sedera about and provided him with their phone number which he did not have. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-12-08 07:36:43', '2021-12-08 07:36:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081449058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077745013', 'Dustin Boone', NULL, 'Finally received Pmt Update form from this member I will update &amp; rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-08 07:32:21', '2021-12-08 07:32:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081504039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081634027', 'Julia Bolz', NULL, '12-7-21 Julia is Carolyn Glah''s sister. Julia just moved from WA state to WI. WA actually allowed for alternative treatments to be covered by regular ins, but WI does not. She chooses nearly all naturopathic solutions for wellness such as thermography, lymphatic massage, colon cleanses, etc. She understands she will still pay for those on her own. She''s working now on substantial pro bono as a human rights lawyer but does not have any licensure since working mostly internationally. Otherwise, she''s pseudo retired and doesn''t have any proof of income. She Might want/need a colonoscopy since it''s been 5 years. She wasn''t aware they are typically every 10 years, not 5. She will find out what is required for her.  She''s in good health, no meds, no tobacco, no pre-x. Last time she visited Functional Medicine Dr. for anything was Sept. 2019, so outside of pre-x clause. She wants a Jan. 1st start date.  CARE+ $215/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-07 19:48:34', '2021-12-07 19:48:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081504034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081505052', 'Tyler Dockstader', NULL, '12-7-21 Tyler is a tobacco user!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-07 19:40:16', '2021-12-07 19:40:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081504026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081707002', 'Christina Johnson', NULL, '12-7-21 Christina is self-employed, healthy, no meds, no tobacco, does wellness and prefers alternative choices such as acu, chiro, herbalist, PT, etc. She does have numbness in left thumb and index finger. Lyn recommended a neurokinetic practioner that she plans to see. She even sees an alternative dentist! She does have reading glasses and wants vision plan. She''s less concerned about dental plan.  Discussed SECURE $1000/$275 and VSP, Jan. 1st start date.  Currently has BCBS in VT. She is going to try to determine her best guess at income to see if subsidy an option as well.  Remember to tell her how to use wellness component!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-07 19:35:03', '2021-12-07 19:35:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081510011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, 'Sent Jayne 3 coupons for the Albuterol Inhalers (1, 3, or 6 inhalers at a time).  Price drops pretty substantially by the time you get to 3 inh at once.  However, Vons does chg diff prices for anticipated days supply.  I believe it''s Alexa that will be using these in Long Beach.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-07 17:48:14', '2021-12-07 17:48:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081504021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011910001', 'John Singleton', NULL, '12-7-21 Ann left me a vm and says she had made a change for Nov. 1st that I know nothing about but still being billed for the whole family. Sounds like she thought she had removed some family members? I just called her back to find out.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-07 17:07:25', '2021-12-07 17:07:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081510003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073555128', 'Raphael Joly', NULL, 'tt Nathalie (Raphael''s Mom) in depth.  Was careful what info I gave out due to his age.  She gave me info (so I could confirm) in any sensitive areas.  We setup a plan of action, incl starting a doc of what they know, remember, & have done.  Then:  
     1) They will get letter from driver''s  insurance comp showing his ins was exp & therefore they will not be paying anything.  
     2) They will contact Raphael''s auto ins comp to see if he has any coverage on his policy.  (Often times, whether you are in your vehicle or not, you auto policy will cover you some.  This way, they can get a jump on what other insurance payments may be available before the healthsharing would kick in).  Then will submit any information they receive on these 2 items to Zion in the need.  
     3) I sent the how to submt a need to Zion template.  They have probably already spent a little more than the $1k IUA with the FL appointments.  She will make sure they submit proof-of-pymt with the detailed invoices.       - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-07 17:07:01', '2021-12-07 17:08:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081504013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081505052', 'Tyler Dockstader', NULL, '12-7-21 Tyler chose Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO 5000. Full cost $522.98, APTC $318.50 and his cost  $204.48.  He has to pay directly with Anthem bc system wouldn''t accept his payment bc it was an out of state zip code from PA. He''s getting his address changed with the bank ASAP to set up his payment directly with Anthem. He was very appreciative of my help. He has thought he had already selected a plan but he hadn''t. His mom was helping him but didn''t get that far.  We also had Brandon from C4 help his change is password and select me as his agent. He''s all set now once he pays Anthem. Also chose Cigna pediatric dental for $0 which I couldn''t remove. So, I left it alone since no cost. Income set at $29K for 2022.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-07 16:59:37', '2021-12-07 17:01:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081504008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489118', 'Darrin Levy', NULL, '12-7-21 Darrin will find out tomorrow if his dr thinks his condition will turn into a large enough hernia to have surgery that is covered by insurance. If not, then he''ll wait 1 year to have the surgery with MCS if it comes to that point.  His Cigna Bronze HSA 6500 has already auto renewed for 2022 for $497. So, he will need to cancel that if he chooses MCS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-07 16:31:50', '2021-12-07 16:31:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081507003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! I will be reaching out to CirrusMD support on behalf of this member for log-in issues. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-07 14:57:36', '2021-12-07 14:57:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081449053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', 'Additional Dependent', 'Riley Stevens DOB 5/22/2014 SS#191659364 Male', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-07 14:39:03', '2021-12-07 14:39:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081472036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060856035', 'Maia Toll', NULL, 'Maia called because she wanted to know how to submit her bills to Zion, I sent her the Zion Needs Submission link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-07 14:24:03', '2021-12-07 14:24:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081504003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081505001', 'Kristen Schulz', NULL, '12-7-21 It appears that Kristen has qualified for Medicaid.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-07 14:15:53', '2021-12-07 14:15:53'),
