  ('zcrm_1579374000081472013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031295146', 'Keith Marshall', NULL, 'Keith called because he wanted to know why his ER bill of $1000 wasn''t covered, I explained to him that he is a self pay patient up until his $2500 IUA with Sedera.  He asked if he would need to pay the bill and explained that yes, he would need to, as he is responsible for the first $2500 of any medical incident.  He wanted to know how to submit his bills, I sent him instructions on how to submit his bills to Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-07 10:11:06', '2021-12-07 10:11:06'),
