  ('zcrm_1579374000081432003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491714', 'Douglas Bush', NULL, 'Member emailed us asking about the $25 yearly renewal fee for him and his daughter.  I looked into this and he was in the group that was migrated into Admin 123.  Per John we had to re figure payment # and manually re-run', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-07 07:40:03', '2021-12-07 07:40:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081245031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, 'Jayne''s daughter is living in Long Beach near 90803 and needing her Albuterol inhalers.  I priced up multiple sources and ck''d w/Reid.  GoodRX is curr best price, but I''m not sure which RX so e-mailed her the info &amp; asked her to call so we can send the appropriate coupon.  Also need to confirm which strength she needs when we send that.    - CA

Jayne wrote back at 6:59pm.  Wants Vons coupon.  Wrote her back, confirming 8.5g strength?    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-06 18:57:33', '2021-12-06 19:07:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081382058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035426019', 'Ernest Bernet', NULL, 'Sent email to client after several calls went unanswered to explain increase....waiting on email response or call back from client.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2021-12-06 18:51:53', '2021-12-06 18:51:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081245026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361908', 'Paula Ward', NULL, 'Wendy sent an e-mail from Paula regarding lab work she''s having done tomorrow and questions regarding what is and is not covered on Planstin. Sent her a very lengthy e-mail with Network Info, the ACA MEC coverage link &amp; details, Fair Pricing on most of what she listed from HCBB, as well as Quest Labs showing as fair priced in HCBB near her.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-06 18:50:10', '2021-12-06 18:50:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081245018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079936002', 'Peter Spong', NULL, 'Peter called &amp; I sent him the temp to sched your ''Welcome Call''.  He''ll try to get that done.  Gave him a bit of info.  He''s already downloaded CirrusMd, went over setting up spouse &amp; 18-yr old son &amp; how/when to use = free w/his plan.  tt him about Planstin, prev vs diag, cash-pay, IUAs x 3/yr, etc.  Encouraged him (them) to have their welcome call.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-06 16:44:20', '2021-12-06 16:45:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081372052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798150', 'Robin Smith', NULL, '12-6-21 Robin got insurance through her husband''s work now moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-06 16:13:25', '2021-12-06 16:13:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081245013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, 'Eliz called.  She''s needing further lab work after her appt &amp; wanted to find out a good lab near her.  But, she decided she''s sitting &amp; waiting for a friend &amp; might hit the hosp''s lab across the street.  Let her know to price ck first!  So, we were able to find several of the tests listed on HCBB so she''d know fair pricing in her area.  She''s aware this will be self-pay.  She seemed to appreciate the effort!    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-06 15:44:49', '2021-12-06 15:44:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081372041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081352008', 'Daniel McMillan', NULL, '12-6-21 Dan is 46, self-employed, healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, just worried about protecting himself for accidents. Was looking at Cigna Gold for $435 until I mentioned MCS SECURE $1000/$275. He''s thrilled about this bc his friend just got screwed when she broke her wrist in Breck and then saw a dr. up there but her residence is down in Boulder and they doctor was not accepting the C4 plans. She now has to drive 2 hours for all of her appointments to remain in network to continue getting service for her wrist. He''s thrilled not to worry about the networks when doing his activities, etc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-06 15:40:32', '2021-12-06 15:50:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081382038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081302002', 'David Pearson', NULL, 'Called and left message for Lisa Pearson to request her SS number....waiting on call back from Lisa Pearson.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2021-12-06 15:27:15', '2021-12-06 15:27:15'),
