  ('zcrm_1579374000081372036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '12-6-21 Michelle called to find out break down of cost for her vs the kids. $275 EO, $495 ES, therefore the kids are $220 and she''s $275.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-06 14:43:01', '2021-12-06 14:43:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081359098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061880001', 'David Hinz', NULL, 'Member will be cancelling this membership and has re-enrolled in the Direct plan since they have DPC Coverage.  the will be adding spouse Danna.  Spouse a former member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-06 14:36:12', '2021-12-06 14:36:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081298076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091884', 'Brian Sullivan', NULL, 'Brian called to cancel his plan, I direct transferred him to Jonathan Master''s telephone number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-06 14:34:56', '2021-12-06 14:34:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081372031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990073', 'Danna Hinz', NULL, '12-6-21 Danna is joining the family membership now that she''s had her back surgery and feeling better than she had in all of her adult life! She knows of the pre-x clause. She''s deciding to cancel her Friday Health plan since the ded is $7K and won''t do much for her at this point. The entire family is already members of Nextera, so we are switching the family to DIRECT. The cost on the Worksite Bridge plan would have gone up to $796 with Danna as EF. So, instead we switched them to DIRECT for $1000/$635. With Nextera she can get a mammogram for $140 at Touchstone. She can also get an affordable colonoscopy. She will be turning 50 this year in Sept. She knows of the 6 month wait for wellness and it will not be a problem. We cancelled David current membership but it will be backdated to his and Shayna''s original start date of Jan. 1st 2020.  Danna is a realtor looking for referrals. We also cancelled her Friday Health plan for Dec. 31st, 2021. All set for Jan. 1st, 2022!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-06 14:33:24', '2021-12-06 14:33:24'),
