  ('zcrm_1579374000081359058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079921029', 'Ryan Padwe', NULL, 'I determined that the acct # was 1 digit off I corrected in A123.  Wendy emailed member and he gave ok to re-run.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-06 13:05:48', '2021-12-06 13:05:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081298066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079839002', 'Richard Goecke', NULL, 'Richard called and wanted to ask some questions before his Welcome Call scheduled tomorrow.  He asked about the process for preventative care- I went over and sent him a link and instructions on how to find providers in the network.  He also told me that his wife needs a mole looked at- so I went over the self pay process with him.  Two of his children see therapists, and at times on a weekly basis.  I went over the MAP program therapy and how it works.  He also wanted to know if CirrusMD could replace his children''s psychiatrists for medications- I told him that CirrusMD will only be able to script them out medications for a month maybe two, but they are not a substitute for a regular psychiatrist.  I told him that it would be an out of pocket expense as Zion Health doesn''t share for mental health.  He told me that he had spoken to Guy, and that Guy told him that CirrusMD would be able to do this.  He sounded a bit disillusioned as to what I was telling him, as he swore Guy told him otherwise.  He is looking forward to his welcome call tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-06 13:00:01', '2021-12-06 13:00:01'),
