  ('zcrm_1579374000081372013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081361011', 'Dave Wagner', NULL, '12-6-21 Dave is life and health ins licensed. He is already appointed with Zion but there are some hurdles with Zion that MPB has taken care of. Dave is in CA and needs the memberships to be ACA compliant. He can market SECURE. Zion also won''t pay agents until they''ve sold 9 memberships! So, that will halt many agents for even starting. G has sent Dave the instructions to get onboarded and Dave is eager to work his way through it today to start sharing this with his clients. Most clients are small biz owners and he''s thrilled to offer this. He believes we have the best options on the market! He also found us through HSA for America.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-06 11:55:19', '2021-12-06 11:55:19'),
