  ('zcrm_1579374000081298028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489007', 'Matthew Claudel', NULL, '12-3-21 Matthew is 30 and wife 38. Both are self-employed, not familiar with HSA. Live in OR and came via Jay Liddell. Both are healthy, no tobacco, no meds. They have bad coverage now for $850 with BCBS and high ded and they don''t like their plan. Interested in SECURE $1000/$500. They know of the Dec. 20th deadline and will call me if interested in moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-03 16:37:44', '2021-12-03 16:38:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081348008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061413040', 'Carmel Brantz', NULL, 'Carmel Brantz called Zion to CE &amp; they transferred her to us.  Sent Carmel the cancellation req template &amp; sent e-mail immediately to the Advisor:  Misty Berryman regarding the request.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-03 16:11:59', '2021-12-03 16:21:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081348003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924034', 'Scott Robinson', NULL, 'Cheryl is going for her annual screening mammography (they just started in 2/21 so, this is the first once since they''ve had Planstin).  Her facility is listed, but went over confirming they are on PHCS, making sure the MD bills, etc.  Sent her the Prev temp for reference and we talked about being a cash-pay patient if it moves from the preventative coverage.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-03 15:52:44', '2021-12-03 15:52:44'),
