  ('zcrm_1579374000081298023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091208', 'Cheryl Yeary', NULL, '12-3-21 Cheryl has a new employee with ES that will join. I sent her their own new Click Funnel  -http://dakota.mpb.health/ to educate the employee and she will put them in touch with me. She also has the direct link to enroll them into Nextera. All set on that front.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-03 13:40:40', '2021-12-03 13:40:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081280021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078409064', 'Maria Blaettner', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  She was very confused with her plan because she tried to do a lot of research herself off of Planstin''s and Zion''s websites.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-03 13:18:16', '2021-12-03 13:18:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081298018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001107434', 'Lauren Peterson', NULL, '12-3-21 Lauren is super nice! We will leave her income alone even though she lost one source of income. But, she definitely doesn''t want Medicaid. She will keep her Friday Health for $666.03 with PTC of $618.76 and her cost is $47.27. I cancelled her Anthem Dental for $9.85.  She''s interested in Delta Dental and I told her I''d send Spirit Dental as well. May or may not be worth it. She had good teeth and no imminent needs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-03 13:16:03', '2021-12-03 13:16:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081280016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079059075', 'Jon Hancock', NULL, 'Welcome call complete, he did not have Sarah''s email to give me to send her an invite, but I sent him the link to where she can register. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-03 12:42:45', '2021-12-03 12:42:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081338003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063804100', 'Roger Gaudreau', NULL, '12.03.21:  Patti sent Amy an email notification that Amy''s son, Tyler has been added to their SECURE membership for a 1/1/22 start date.  I emailed Amy offering to give Tyler a Welcome Call if she would like to schedule one for him to learn the plan.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-03 12:31:02', '2021-12-03 12:31:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081298013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489118', 'Darrin Levy', NULL, '12-3-21 He''s now setting up a C4HCO account. We''ll see what he''s interested in moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-03 12:24:13', '2021-12-03 12:24:13'),
