  ('zcrm_1579374000081276013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063804100', 'Roger Gaudreau', 'New Plan eff 1/1/2022', 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-03 11:34:49', '2021-12-03 11:34:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081298003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503016', 'David Mandell', NULL, '12-3-21 David has a family of 4 and healthy, no tobacco except for 21 year old son who uses it sometimes! Son also has ADHD and some meds. David is terribly disgruntled by traditional insurance and is paying $1700 a month now! He knows paying cash is best. Already has an HSA that they fund. He wants to run this through the company he owns jointly with Ari Newman. Right now it''s just Ari and David. They might bring on a 3rd person sometime in the future. But, for now it''s just the two of them. Ari is paying less for PSDHC bc of his age. So, not worth moving him. Therefore, just set up David on own and pay through their company banking.  SECURE $1000/$685+$50= $735.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-03 11:33:52', '2021-12-03 11:33:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081293003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079750002', 'Carlos Furlow, Jr.', NULL, 'No response. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-03 11:24:33', '2021-12-03 11:24:33'),
