  ('zcrm_1579374000081237008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912002', 'John Sepede', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. The plan is not for this member. He will contact Karen for traditional insurance. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-03 11:21:18', '2021-12-03 11:21:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081280003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467454', 'Michelle Oftedahl', NULL, 'Michelle called because her husband Erik is in need of his R shoulder ligament needing repair.  I got all of the information I needed from her, and told her that I would send it all to HCBB, and that they will call Eric probably on Monday as they normally take 24-48 hours to respond.  I told her to make sure that she is uploading her bills to Zion Health for sharing and sent her a Zion Needs submission link.  I told her that once she has proof that they''ve paid for their $2500 IUA amount that she could either call or email Zion Health, let them know that they went through HCBB and ask them whether or not they will get their $1000 discount. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-12-03 11:16:44', '2021-12-03 11:20:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081276003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, 'Got the ok to charge additional $285 to add newborn to membership.  I ran pmt.  Etta wanted to change the email on the account to hers so she get the receipt every month.  She will submit change form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-03 11:13:32', '2021-12-03 11:13:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081241003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503008', 'Timothy Schaewe', NULL, '12-3-21 Lisa and Tim are both self-employed. They are currently on Cobra which is $1200 and going up to $1600 in Jan! They don''t qualify for a subsidy since they are offered Cobra at the moment.  They are both relatively healthy with stuff more than 24 months ago. Tim had hernia surgery 10 years ago and polyps removed 3 years ago. Lisa had a hysterectomy 4 years ago and then intestine surgery Aug. 2019 due to abscesses and infection which she believes was from the hysterectomy.  That is all in the past and outside of the 24 month pre-x clause. She take a number of meds for hormone replacement and thyroid issue. They will send me the list of meds to determine cost of them as self-pay.  Looked up Dr. Jose Delgado at Boulder Medical Center. He''s not showing in the search But BMC shows that they accept the PHCS/Multiplan PPO network.  Dr. Christensen is showing in the network for Lisa''s doctor. Told them to call and ask before they go in to make sure the dr. is still in the network.  SECURE $1000/$500!  They are Very interested in this option. They will also review the traditional options a little further. Then have Anthem now and the lowest Silver is $1600!  They are not in a rush. They might want a Jan or Feb 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-03 10:54:23', '2021-12-03 10:54:23'),
