  ('zcrm_1579374000081225011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307015', 'Kathryn Clemen', NULL, '12.03.21:  Called Kathryn (Kate).  Left message explaining cancellation situation (Patti sent her a cancellation form but never got it back but Kate stopped payment on the Dec. payment.  Didn''t let us know if she wants to cancel for Dec. 1 or Jan. 1.  I asked her husband about this on 12/1 and he said he would talk w/her and let me know, but he hasn''t.  I asked her to contact me and let me know what she wants to do or Patti will have to cancel her membership for Dec.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-03 09:08:52', '2021-12-03 09:08:52'),
