  ('zcrm_1579374000081144046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081107338', 'David Sepac', NULL, '12-2-21 I was reconnected to Andy via the Big Wave Lead System! I didn''t even recognize his name. He wants insurance again. He''s a healthy 53 year old now and was lifting weights in the gym when I called him. He''s open to different options. But, seeing that he was with us before, I have no idea why he cancelled. We will see tomorrow.  He''s expecting $140K and works for Remax for past 7 years or so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-02 16:58:34', '2021-12-02 17:26:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081144041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826048', 'Trent Mullikin', NULL, '12-2-21 Mandy called about what to do with all of their annual wellness visit bills. She forgot she was supposed to give a card for this part only. She has not paid the bills. She will go back and give them her card.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-02 16:29:24', '2021-12-02 16:29:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081144036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '12-2-21 Carolyn is thinking of not getting dental with Spirit since she thinks it will be a wash financially, until we realized she will also be getting her cleanings for free. She will look at it closer. She also asked if her Census pay stub from 2020 will work for her new membership as proof of self-employment. I told her no. But, she actually does have a small business that she registered years ago. She will make sure that is up to date and will use that EIN.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-02 16:21:22', '2021-12-02 16:21:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081144031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674005', 'Deborah Pyles', NULL, 'tt Deborah, she needs to have a text for the surgeon.  We tried to look up the facility for how it''s graded.  But even per her, super small area &amp; nothing came back on that particular one.  She''s going to call her Sedera ''Need'' Counselor because this is part of that need as a double ck.   She appreciated my looking.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-02 15:41:38', '2021-12-02 15:41:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081144026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067333056', 'Joe Werne', NULL, '12-2-21 Auto renewed for 2022 KP CO Silver 3500/20%/HSA. $761.73, APTC $568.44. Delta Dental of Colorado Summit Plan $33.50. He''s fine keeping it the same.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-02 15:37:41', '2021-12-02 15:37:41'),
