  ('zcrm_1579374000081144008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082413134', 'Nathan Knecht', NULL, '12-2-21 Nathan came via Big Wave. He''s getting about a $1000 APTC but will still pay $400-$600 a month for some terrible plans with $17,400 mop.  They have Cigna now but shared SECURE with him after I saw the plans offered to him on C4 at his income level. He totally understood about SECURE and said they must be actually putting the money towards benefits!  He owns his own businesses which he is then an employee of, assuming as an S-Corp likely.  He can show proof of ownership. Family is all healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco.  Wife just wants some cosmetic stuff done which I suggested the HMA. He''s very intrigued by that as well.  They might choose a higher amount instead of the $40 level. Wife wants to deal with vericose veins, dry skin patches and fungus under toes perhaps with HMA, since insurance won''t cover them, deeming them cosmetic.  SECURE $1000/$685. Also wants dental for just kids which I will send Spirit Dental.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-02 12:49:31', '2021-12-02 12:49:31'),
