  ('zcrm_1579374000081141003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885002', 'Pamela DeVos', NULL, '12.02.21:  Brian emailed - said he hasn''t received any emails from us yet, only a card (Planstin?).  Told him I would check into this and found the following:  In the CRM there are 2 profiles - in Leads, Pamela is the Primary and in Contact, Brian is the Primary. Pamela is Primary in Admin123. Brian used a different email on his enrollment:  health@the devosfamily.net; in Admin123 I found 2 emails that were sent on 11/18/21 to that email - a confirmation of the enrollment and a request for proof of bus. I.D.  No Welcome email was sent.  I spoke w/Patti and she merged both CRM profiles w/Pam as Primary Contact. I spoke w/Kelly who said she will send the Welcome email today. She didn''t send the letter w/card yet because she''s waiting for new QR Life Code cards to come in (in a few weeks).  Emailed Brian this information along w/copies of the emails he said he didn''t receive to both his email addresses to see if he gets them.
