  ('zcrm_1579374000081001056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762009', 'Lori Keller', NULL, '12-1-21 Lori is super healthy, no pre-x and paying about $409 total now for HES/LHS. She''s self-employed and wants SECURE for $275/$1000. She will happily fun the HSA. She''s doesn''t typically do the annual wellness visits. Super nice and enrolling now. Lives part time in Arvada and some time in Longmont. I will instruct her to cancel HES/LHS now as well. All set and easy!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-01 16:29:18', '2021-12-01 16:38:16'),
