  ('zcrm_1579374000081001046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081054002', 'Stephanie Foo', NULL, '12-1-21 They know they will have pay for Joey''s colonoscopies and any of the pre-x. Joey had a mole removed. Stephanie now realizes she hasn''t been to a doctor for acid reflux in about 3 years and hasn''t needed the endoscopy either. She fully understands she''s responsible 100% for any pre-x.  They are saving $1500 a month! This can easily allow them to pay for any small pre-x stuff, plus the HSA they want to fund. Finally, they want to join the HMA as well. But, Joey just left the room to teach his class and she wants to talk with him first to figure out the level they choose. She''ll set up another time with me for that. SECURE $500/$1000 complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-01 15:11:28', '2021-12-01 15:11:28'),
