  ('zcrm_1579374000080993048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603167', 'Farhan Malik', NULL, 'Member submitted change request to update Address.  Sedera has been notified.  Changed in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 12:21:39', '2021-12-01 12:21:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081001028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, '12-1-21 John has explained the following re unexpected price change from $230 to $310!
"Yes, there is a discount for DPC. It is reflected in the attached price sheet. It is a price based on a specific product - The DPC Product. The MPB Care Plus was built by Sedera using their Access Plus product pricing. This is based on what Sedera charges us. We then add our profit margin and the commissions we pay out. The Vendor Cost on the MPB Care Plus product is $260. There is no way to "apply a discount" to that vendor cost. It is product specific. The Vendor Cost on the "Provider Directed Healthcare" (obseleted pricing) is $205. Not to be difficult, but the product you sold doesn''t exist." None of this makes sense to me.  She signed an agreement at the lower rate and had no knowledge of price change. Rod will look into it and let me know by Friday, Dec. 3rd.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-01 12:12:46', '2021-12-01 12:12:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080993043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050084', 'Stephen Zawada', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation as his 12/1/pmt declined.  I will cancel with Sedera &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 11:56:09', '2021-12-01 11:56:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081001023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462166', 'Tammie Smith', NULL, '11/30/21:  Julia rec''d VM &amp; asked me to call her.  ILM
12/1/21:  Hadn''t heard back, so called her again.  She said she''s all set now.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-12-01 11:55:36', '2021-12-01 11:55:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081001018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165453', 'Alison Burchell', NULL, '12-1-21 She is still stuck on C4 at age 68 bc IRS has her associated with wrong SS# and they haven''t fixed it for 4 years! She even got Joe Neguse to call IRS on her behalf and it did no good. She wants her knee surgery done this year at Steadman''s if possible. They haven''t decided who they will accept yet for 2022. She will call them again tomorrow to see if they can give her some insight immediately to make a decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-01 11:26:13', '2021-12-01 11:26:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081004008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, 'James called in and said that he is pretty new to this and just wants to know what his steps are. He said starting the day after Thanksgiving he went to eat at Wendy''s and thinks he got a bad burger and all weekend long he has had very very bad stomach pains, throwing up, etc. He said come Monday he was fine it went away but now it is starting up again. I told him he can start out with using his Telehealth with CirrusMD, I checked and he is registered and he stated he remembers registering as well. I told him if CirrusMD recommends for him to go to an actual doctor to get checked out then he is a cash pay up to his IUA of $1000. Keep all bills and receipts because if this turns into multiple visits and whatnot then he needs to get in contact with Zion and start a Need with them and show proof of payment of his IUA amount. He said he understands and will contact CirrusMD now and go from there. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-12-01 11:24:36', '2021-12-01 11:24:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081012018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078716002', 'Jack Sevison', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-01 11:07:13', '2021-12-01 11:07:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081012013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080015002', 'Betsy Muller', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail to reschedule welcome call after start date of January 1, 2022. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-01 11:04:26', '2021-12-01 11:04:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080993038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514500', 'Johnnie Harriman', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 11:01:08', '2021-12-01 11:01:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081001013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, '12-1-21 Jennifer got info from KC and suggested to call Apex/RCI directly since they couldn''t find anything within 100 miles radius. Vail Health is telling Julie they accept PHCS. I told her to still double check with Apex before she goes to make 100% certain. 1-800-795-7772.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-01 11:00:34', '2021-12-01 11:00:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080993033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990158', 'Loren Jinkins', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I have cancelled w/Sedera and cancelled billing in FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 10:57:37', '2021-12-01 10:57:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081012008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079409010', 'Julie Macki', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-01 10:50:23', '2021-12-01 10:50:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080993028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964393', 'Michele Thome', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 10:44:26', '2021-12-01 10:44:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081001008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, '12-1-21 Julie called to see if the other options are suitable for her such as SECURE that I mentioned. But, she has some pre-x issues that she expects will take 3-6 months to resolve.  She knows of the price difference for SECURE $495/$1000 vs now at $578/$1000. She also needs to get her mammogram done again and doesn''t want to run into the same challenge as before with the radiology part out of network while the doctor is in network. Some segments of Valley View Hospital are showing up in the network. I told her to call and ask them about radiology and any place she goes the doctor and radiologist both need to be in network. Jennifer will call me back after talking the KC as well to see if we found a place in that area that works for mammograms.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-01 10:40:44', '2021-12-01 10:40:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081012003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080107001', 'Lorna Mulkey', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-01 10:31:55', '2021-12-01 10:31:55'),
