  ('zcrm_1579374000081004003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964393', 'Michele Thome', NULL, 'Michele called in and stated that come Jan 2022 she will be going a different way for Insurance and wanted to know what the process was to cancel her membership. I explained what she needs to do and sent her the cancellation form via email. She is all set and will get that in asap. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-12-01 10:21:40', '2021-12-01 10:21:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080993013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362002', 'Deb Bear', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 10:13:26', '2021-12-01 10:13:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000081001003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798150', 'Robin Smith', NULL, '12-1-21 Left vm for Robin letting her know I might be able to help her with a more affordable option!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-01 10:13:07', '2021-12-01 10:13:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080993008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410215', 'Ann Medina', 'Redirect Term:', 'Tracking #12517455
Sent by Patti Baron on 12/1/2021.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 10:06:55', '2021-12-01 10:06:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080959022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '12.01.21:  Called - no answer - l/m to c/b.  Recvd. a text message fro Jenny. Said she found she doesn''t have time today for a call and asked if I could send her the information to look over. She added the other plans she is reviewing don''t seem to be a complicated as ours and she doesn''t feel she has time to spend learning about our plan.
I responded that the other plans don''t seem as complicated because they only deal with catastrophic care and don''t offer all the services we do.  Ours may seem more complicated at first view, but they are, in fact, simple to use.  Furthermore, normally, the member will only use certain services for a particular need and our Concierge will guide the member through navigation of any need they have.  I told her I will email her my website so she can review the plans and pricing.  We can, then, discuss any questions she may have.  Emailed link to my site and Zion Guidelines.
Jenni called with questions, which I answered.  Asked me to look up in the PHCS network a PCP she knows (Dr. Goelzer) and also send her the link the the PHCS directory.  Sent these to
her. Also asked if there were any dental and vision discounts.  I responded we offer dental and vision plans and discount programs.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-01 10:06:36', '2021-12-14 14:16:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080993003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410215', 'Ann Medina', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will cancel Redirect &amp; Sedera &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 10:04:38', '2021-12-01 10:04:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080969041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659598', 'Christina Bremner Anderson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will notify Zion &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 09:46:28', '2021-12-01 09:46:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080973008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006092', 'Nicole Mata', NULL, 'Nicole called with many questions regarding her plan. I explained the self-pay process to her, sent her a link of PHCS network docs (even though she didn''t really need them) and emailed her member portal information. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-01 09:44:12', '2021-12-01 09:44:12'),
