  ('zcrm_1579374000080969028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419076', 'Dana Michie', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will notify Sedera &amp; cancel billing in FTNI &amp; cancelled Apex', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 09:26:28', '2021-12-01 09:38:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080952018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082111037', 'Jackie Ewing', NULL, 'Left Message regarding inquiry', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-12-01 09:20:51', '2021-12-01 09:20:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080941013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881027', 'John Dooley', NULL, 'John called and stated that he wants to cancel his membership due to getting a new job with benefits. I sent him the cancellation form via email and he will be getting that in as soon as he receives it. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-12-01 09:16:22', '2021-12-01 09:16:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080973003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, 'James called with questions regarding dermatology and whether it is a covered preventative service. I explained that it is not, I explained the self-pay process, and to keep all detailed bills in the case that this goes over his IUA. James is a GREAT candidate for his plan and asks all of the right questions. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-12-01 09:04:54', '2021-12-01 09:04:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080969023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768292', 'Corinne Cooper', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 08:58:08', '2021-12-01 08:58:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080969018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906167', 'Pamela Tuck', NULL, 'Sent in cancellation request to Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 08:49:21', '2021-12-01 08:49:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080959014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080972002', 'Atalie Troutman', NULL, '12.01.21:  Enrolled Atalie.  Explained what she should expect during the on-boarding process and to keep me posted as to her progress.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-12-01 08:42:25', '2021-12-01 08:42:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080952013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162245', 'Rhonda Savage', 'Cancellation Issue', 'Spoke with Rhonda regarding the details of what happened.
-On Oct 12 , 2021 - Member was in Las Vegas for a speaking engagement. Member woke up early on the morning of Oct 12 and was unable to walk or move from the waist down. Member also stated that her legs had been cramping since about 1100pm
-Member called 911 for an ambulance
-Member was taken to Sunrise Hospital in Las Vegas ER
-IV Fluids were given
-Member left hospital due to lack of care because so many CoVid Patients were being made a priority over her needs
-Member went to her doctor when she got back to her home and was diagnosed with Electrolyte Imbalance
-Member had husband call Sedera to set up a NEEDS
-Member was informed that she did not have coverage and had been cancelled
-Member''s husband call MPB Health and spoke to Patti to find out what had happened
-Member''s husband was told that she was cancelled due to a declined payment and that an email was sent to her stating as such.
-Member stated that she never received the email
-Member has  been charged with her monthly membership fee  even though she was cancelled from the plan so Member has never questioned whether she has coverage or not.
-Member is now faced with a hospital bill of $5600 that she negotiated on her own from $11000 plus the ambulance ride
-Member was asked what she needed to happened to help her out in this situation
-Member wants  a better system in place when it comes to declines.  A follow up phone call and a physical letter would have been helpful and would have circumventive this entire situation
-Member would also still like to be a member with a different plan until she ages up
-Member was informed that I would review this with options to see what we could come up with to help clear up this matter.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-12-01 08:30:59', '2021-12-01 08:30:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080969013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027220137', 'Deoni Levy', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will notify Sedera &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 08:30:47', '2021-12-01 08:30:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080969008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521236', 'Laura Chasko', NULL, 'Received VM from member &amp; advisor saying that member wanted to raise IUA to $5000.  I asked if she know the price.  She gave me the number of $185 when it should be $209 asked why the difference in price.  I outlined all extra services and that she was on "Bridge: plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 08:05:45', '2021-12-01 08:05:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080959008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094002', 'Theresa Stratton', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-12-01 07:51:25', '2021-12-01 07:51:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080969003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072869001', 'Julie Basque', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel and notify billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-12-01 07:20:32', '2021-12-01 07:20:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080957037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939370', 'Dave Sutton', NULL, '11-30-21 Dave wanted to cancel bc he watched John Oliver''s segment where he slammed MCS! Unbelievable. I told Dave I have upwards of 800 clients using MCS and I''ve had far better success with it than with insurance. Told him I use it as well. Once I said that, he was excited again. He asked me if I ever had problems with getting reimbursed. I told him I have not. I also let him know our company has worked with different HCS/MCS companies over the years. When we saw red flags, we immediate went out and found better solutions to offer to our members. Told him I''m super confident in these companies and memberships now. Told him I have access to their Dr. and CEO if problems arise. He was thankful for my call and he will stay onboard!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-30 17:03:37', '2021-11-30 17:03:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080957029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939370', 'Dave Sutton', NULL, '11-30-21 Left 2 vms for Dave bc Jennifer said he called to cancel his membership for Dec. 1st! His membership begins Dec. 1st, 2021. Not sure what''s happening. I''m sending him the instructions to cancel and we''ll see what happens. Patti has been notified as well. Sending him cancellation instructions. Today is deadline to cancel.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-30 16:28:57', '2021-11-30 16:31:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080963008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055112303', 'Scott Yarian', NULL, 'Scott called.  He would really like to sched his Welcome Call (he''s meant to do it).  Sent him the temp w/the sched link.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-30 15:46:21', '2021-11-30 15:46:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080957024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059474061', 'James Pendleton', NULL, '11-30-21 Linda Pendelton/Johnston called to find out how to deal with Jim''s wellness visit bill that turned out to be $2046.15! He paid $500 of it already. Linda will go back to doctor to ask them to re-code it ALL as wellness. Part was coded as wellness but then part as diagnostic. So, for some reason they didn''t cover ANY of the cost of the visit. It managed to all turn into diagnostic. There was a TSH test that was run for no known reason and an unspecified atrial fib test run. Weird. She will go back to them and also have them resubmit the bill to Planstin.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-30 14:51:20', '2021-11-30 14:51:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080901013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603167', 'Farhan Malik', NULL, 'Farhan called with a request for new MPB.Health cards (sent request to Kelly F.), an address change request (sent form via email) and his MPB.Health member portal login information (sent via email). -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-30 14:36:31', '2021-11-30 14:36:31');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000080963003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491891', 'Brenda Pepin', NULL, 'Brenda called and wanted to know how to schedule a Welcome Call- I emailed her a Welcome call scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-30 14:07:24', '2021-11-30 14:07:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080957019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001670007', 'Linda Lach', NULL, '11-29-21 Linda Lach called to see about options for Reid Inouye but he''s already 65, almost 66 in Jan. 2022. LHS allows him to remain and they are currently sorting out his taxes and such to be able to get Medicare. Until then they''ll stay with LHS. Linda is also now on her own insurance plan through work.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-30 13:56:32', '2021-11-30 13:56:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080957011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002207005', 'Reid Inouye', NULL, '11-30-21 Linda Lach called to see about options for Reid Inouye but he''s already 65. LHS allows him to remain and they are currently sorting out his taxes and such to be able to get Medicare. Until then they''ll stay with LHS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-30 13:55:24', '2021-11-30 13:55:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080959003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822273', 'Daniel DuBois', NULL, 'Member will be aging into Medicare I will email member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-30 13:44:33', '2021-11-30 13:44:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080957003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001853007', 'Scott Swannie', NULL, '11-30-21 They are very interested in SECURE! Looks like annual renewal date is March 1st. No pre-x other than some bumps on foot which she can hold off on dealing with, if she ever even chooses to do something about it. That''s no problem for her. LHS looks to be going up to $649 for couple upon renewal. Dr. Bryce Lunt is showing up in the PHCS network. They like him and can go to someone else if need be. But, he''s showing up.  She is partially retired but still owns/runs a cleaning business as proof of self-employment. She''ll let me know when Scott has looked it over as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-30 13:35:59', '2021-11-30 13:36:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080883052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939033', 'Tal Diamant', NULL, 'Member will be turning 50 I will notify member &amp; advisor &amp; update billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-30 13:33:26', '2021-11-30 13:33:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080925023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075571098', 'Garrick Dorn', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-30 12:49:51', '2021-11-30 12:49:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080925018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'JoAnna called to update her husbands address, I sent her a member change form to the topaz email address as requested. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-30 12:49:22', '2021-11-30 12:49:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080952008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080943010', 'Gaia Marrs', NULL, '11-29-21 Gaia and girls are enrolled in SECURE $1000/$495. All set for Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-30 12:34:15', '2021-11-30 12:34:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080883047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080943010', 'Gaia Marrs', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-30 12:26:21', '2021-11-30 12:26:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080925013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075338242', 'Cathy Watson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-30 12:20:19', '2021-11-30 12:20:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080946008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '11.30.21:  Recvd. quote request from Jennifer.  Interested in Care Plus w/$2500 IUA for herself and her family.  Has 6 children but 4 who would be on the plan; non-smokers.  
Called - spoke w/Jenny (?) Found us through researching the internet to compare MCS plans.  No pre-x; no meds.  They have an HSA and would like to keep it, so I explained SECURE and she''s interested in it.  She couldn''t find any other plan that offered an HSA.  Wants a 1/1/22 start date.  Gave her pricing for Care Plus and Secure.  Explained differences of our 3 plans, the MEC plan, Telehealth, QR code & medical vault.  Started explaining Concierge and Zion I.U.A. when she had to go.  We scheduled a call to continue discussing plan services for SECURE tomorrow at 11 a.m. EST (10 a.m. CT).', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-30 11:54:14', '2021-12-01 08:46:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080952003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082413161', 'Wayne Marrs', NULL, '11-30-21 Wayne has some pre-x and already has dr appts coming up in Jan.  I think their income is showing at $164K. We successfully set up their account. Just need to choose plan next.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-30 11:53:56', '2021-11-30 11:53:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080925008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601439', 'Chelsie Dawydiuk', NULL, 'Chelsie''s husband Eddie called because his son fractured his arm.  He wanted to know the process of what he should be doing, I went over the self pay process with him and sent Chelsie instructions on how to submit bills to Sedera.  I also told him that if his son is recommended for sx, then Sedera will want them to go through the 2nd MD process and he will need to call to speak to them about it.  He declined to be transferred to Sedera, but I told him that I would be emailing Chelsie their phone number if they need it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-30 09:49:42', '2021-11-30 09:49:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080941008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937123', 'Tracey Nauright', NULL, 'Mad River hospital called to verify benefits for Tracey''s son. The date of the visit was in October 2021, prior to her start date. I did also let the hospital know that for this instance, an ER visit, Tracey is a self-pay patient until she meets her IUA of $1000. But again, this ER visit was in October 2021, prior to her start date of November 2021. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-30 09:48:13', '2021-11-30 09:48:13'),
