  ('zcrm_1579374000080847021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080863002', 'Zachary Lung', NULL, '11-29-21 Zach is son of David Lung who referred him to me. Joan passed him back to me. Zach is 27 and wife is 27. Both are super healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. Both are self-employed. Live in Windsor, CO. Also referred by Mindy Grabau too. He wants SECURE $500/$1000. He''s enrolling now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-29 14:47:36', '2021-11-29 14:47:36'),
