  ('zcrm_1579374000080847003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '11-29-21 She hates her Bright Health bc it doesn''t cover anything. She has to spend her Ded first and feels like it''s not worth the cost. She''s also not worried about sleep apnea bc she already had to buy the machine herself. The mold intoxification is now pretty well handled through Dr. Carnahan. She''s open to  SECURE and worked for census bureau this year and can show proof of payment for that as 1099. Her daughter also needs oral surgery for teeth extractions. She has 2 baby K-9 teeth that need to be pulled and her adult teeth need to be pulled up. It''s called an exposed bond. She also has to wisdom teeth that needs to be pulled. She has an appt on Dec. 23 to get it all done. She''s already paid a ton of money so far. Any help from insurance would be great! Looking into Spirit Dental for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-29 12:30:49', '2021-11-29 12:30:49'),
