  ('zcrm_1579374000080730008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061571018', 'Randy Sherer', NULL, 'Randy called because he is having difficulty getting into his portal, even after Jennifer had given him his user name and password.  I explained that the only thing that he would need to go to the portal for is to update his address or billing information, and if he still cannot login we can send him forms to update that information.  He said that now he knows what the portal is for, he''s not worried about logging into it, and thanked me for my time.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-29 09:13:28', '2021-11-29 09:13:28'),
