  ('zcrm_1579374000080701003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411196', 'Jeremy Stollings', NULL, 'Mom, Jennifer called.  Andie Stollings is needing a sonogram.  Jennifer says she called last week early 9:30 eastern (but, they live in Central time zone) & was told someone would call back, but she hasn’t heard anything.  I''m not seeing anything in the notes either, so have no idea who she might have spoken to.
