     Their card says xrays & diagnostic $50, Catscan/MRI’s $200, lab/bloodwork $10, off visits $20, specialists $50, Urgent Care $50.  The facility is telling her these rates do not apply to a sonogram, but in her mind it should be a network price as described on their card.  She’s trying to get an answer early Monday so they know what to expect for their Tues appt.
     Since I don’t work until 5pm Eastern Monday, sending a Teams chat to Kelly Anne & Jennifer.  Hoping one of them can check and let her know at: 806-570-2368.  [Then, teach me on the backside!]', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-26 15:57:40', '2021-11-26 15:57:40'),
