  ('zcrm_1579374000080571018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462166', 'Tammie Smith', NULL, 'Tammie called.  Husb Brent needs an EKG & they won''t do it without prior approval of pymt.  (Mon this wk, he went to Dr w/swollen foot.  Doc prescribed gout meds.  Didn''t help, so Urg Care MD told him to immed go see his doctor & that''s who''s wanting to order the EKG.)  We went over sub a need to Sedera, but w/Thanksgiving being tomorrow, I''m having her call Sedera right now.  We''re hoping she can catch them before they close.  Maybe since it''s so time sensitive they can help her push things thru quickly.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-24 17:04:47', '2021-11-24 17:04:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080590003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, 'Jacqueline called in regarding a screening mammogram and it being denied by Planstin. I asked Jacqueline if she verified with her provider that everything was coded correctly as preventative services and she said "I was NEVER told to do that". She then got very frustrated because I stated that she does need to verify with her provider that everything was coded correctly. I did warm transfer her over to Planstin to get some assistance with this issue as well with a name change in their system. -JTS

**UPDATE** Jacqueline called back to thank me for my patience with her today. She recently experienced a hit and run with 5 children in her car and was having a bad day. We had a great conversation and I reached out to Zion on her behalf because she is very confused about an email she received asking for information about her claim. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-24 14:45:48', '2021-11-24 15:00:29'),
