  ('zcrm_1579374000080571013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, 'tt Catherine.  She remembered our conversation and the 2/1/22 date we are planning.  She''s good w/that plan and we anticipate moving her for that eff date.  Possibly to Secure as she thinks she''s on their registered bus.  Husb is on VA, so it''s only her.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-24 11:35:34', '2021-11-24 11:35:34'),
