  ('zcrm_1579374000080554029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '11.24.21:  Was notified Denise got a 2nd notice re: her c.c. decline.  Called Denise - she told me she informed Patti to resubmit the new card and let Denise know if she had any trouble with it.  Patti told Denise to call her back at 1 p.m. today.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-24 10:59:53', '2021-11-24 10:59:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080533068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497146', 'Jon King', NULL, 'Jon called in asking about this months billing, turns out he was charged the Family price for the MEC.  I refunded him the $30.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-24 10:40:41', '2021-11-24 10:40:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080554024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107134002', 'Thomas Beaudin', NULL, '11.24.21:  Saw a voicemail from Thomas - not sure if it was made before or after our conversation of yesterday.  Called him to ask if he''d like to talk about any questions he may have. Recvd. a text from Thomas - he didn''t call a second time and has no new questions yet. His wife seems to be on board so they need to finish out Medishare and make the switch.  I responded that I''m glad to hear his wife is in favor of our plan and I''m always available for questions.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-24 10:21:14', '2021-11-24 13:39:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080533063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050084', 'Stephen Zawada', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to make a payment over the phone as his card was compromised.  I advised that I would send him the form he did not want to do that and will cancel. (was going to anyway in a month).', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-24 10:17:06', '2021-11-24 10:17:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080554016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080972002', 'Atalie Troutman', NULL, '11.24.21:  Called Atalie. Explained all plans - focused on Care Plus - seems like best plan for her needs.  Working now as a medication tech. at a nursing home.  Going to nursing school starting Jan.  Will have insurance w/her job until 12/31/21 when she leaves to start school, so wants to enroll for a 1/1/22 start date.  Scheduled enrollment for 12.1.21 at 10 a.m. Emailed my link to site and Zion guidelines.  She said her father (John Troutman) spoke very highly of me.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-24 10:08:37', '2021-12-01 08:41:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080533058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091694', 'Dee Schultz', NULL, 'Spouse Nicole called ina nd said that they were going to cancel.  I will send them Cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-24 09:41:06', '2021-11-24 09:41:06'),
