  ('zcrm_1579374000080533023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068022001', 'Justin Breaux', NULL, 'member left VM re: address update.  I sent him the Plan Change link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-24 08:20:02', '2021-11-24 08:20:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080533018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026874248', 'Dylan Thomas', NULL, 'Dylan called in letting us know that he was in a car accident.  It was a hit and run.  I advised him that his car insurance would be primary and that until that was exhausted could he open a need w/Sedera.  I advised him to contact Sedera at that time and that they would step him through the process of opening a need.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-24 08:14:44', '2021-11-24 08:14:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080538008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026874248', 'Dylan Thomas', NULL, 'Dylan called in and stated that he got into a car accident and has whiplash, etc and has been going to the doctor for his injuries. He wanted to start a Need. I stopped him before he got further into everything and told him that anytime something happens that involves a car accident or automobile injuries, etc, the auto insurance always come into play first for everything. Once all of that has been used up on both ends of people with their auto insurance, the member and or the at fault driver. If there are still injuries that need to be taken care of AFTER the auto insurance payment has been used up then Zion will come into play and help out after all of that. I put him back to Patti because he started saying that he has a 20/20 co-pay or something like that with his auto insurance and asked about that. I am not familiar with what that is and don''t know a lot of wording when it comes to auto accidents and us being involved. Patti does as I have heard her talk to several people about this kind of thing. Transferred to Patti and Dylan is all set now and knows what to do. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-11-24 08:11:36', '2021-11-24 08:11:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080538003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419076', 'Dana Michie', NULL, 'Dana called in and stated that she wanted to cancel as of 1/1/22. Due to the fact that she is turning 65 so going on Medicare. She said that she loved the plan with the programs and services that she got, she tells people all the time about us and to sign up or look into it, and would love to continue to stay on it but due to her aging out that''s not possible but just loved it so much. I sent her the cancellation form to her email. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-11-24 08:03:12', '2021-11-24 08:03:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080533013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080496010', 'Wendy Plambeck', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-24 07:59:17', '2021-11-24 07:59:17'),
