  ('zcrm_1579374000080506003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080544007', 'Lisa Smith', NULL, 'Appointment Set for 11/24/2021 at 12 noon....full presentation on Care+ product', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2021-11-23 17:50:27', '2021-11-23 17:50:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080459042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022038331', 'Ari Newman', NULL, '11-23-21 Talked with Ari bc he was being told by providers that they don''t take the Apex card. Coached him about the PHCS network and they are in the network. Also told him to call Concierge for help and he will call them to get a new card since he doesn''t have one. Also coached him on continuing as cash pay and telemedicine. He did use telemedicine once which worked well. He looked at traditional ins and saw how crazy expensive it is for nothing. He will stay the course. He''s paying around $625 he thinks now. So, not worth moving him at this time since it will cost more.  Wife went to Urgent Care and they spent about $500 total for the visit which was obnoxious. So, he''s excited about the HMA to help pay for that type of stuff that happens.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-23 16:54:37', '2021-11-23 16:55:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080459031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076713079', 'Staci Wiley', NULL, '11-23-21 Staci was treated with ivermectin and HCQ for covid last week and felt better within 3 hours! She felt horrendous until she took it and it saved her life, in her opinion. Husband is doing really now as well.  Finally got application through after many tries!!! She will send me an email and include Dave Abajian to remove her from his group membership and I will send to Sedera requesting cancellation for Dec. 1st, 2021.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-23 16:31:47', '2021-11-23 16:41:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080473013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080972002', 'Atalie Troutman', NULL, '11.23.21:  Called - l/m to c/b. Also texted.  Said I know her dad, John Troutman, who referred her. 
Cari chatted w/her on Sales IQ yesterday - found out the following:  wants to start 1/1/22; Rx =0; pre-x, none in detail more than 3 years.  CARE PLUS - $215, DIRECT? $245 + DPC fee.
Atalie texted me back, apologized for not responding to my calls, emails and texts. Said she was anxious and she doesn''t know about health plans but, then, realized it''s my job to help her. She''s excited to move ahead with the enrollment process.  I responded to her text and asked her if she wants to chat tomorrow. She texted back yes and gave me times she''d be free.  I suggested 11 a.m. tomorrow.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-23 15:59:12', '2021-11-24 07:17:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080459023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076713079', 'Staci Wiley', NULL, '11-23-21 Staci got over covid-19 recently with in-home oxygen. Husband has a pulled achilles and is going to PT now. They understand both are pre-x and will pay costs surrounding achilles. Enrolling in SECURE $1000/$500 and waived $100. They want a Dec. 1st effective date. They want to be removed from the Group plan with Big E Commerce and Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-23 15:54:31', '2021-11-23 16:10:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080459018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906068', 'Sue Lepping', NULL, '11-23-21 Sue''s response, "Hi Wendy,
Thank you for your message. I have decided to go with another plan starting the 1st of the year. 
Have a nice Thanksgiving!
Sue"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-23 15:35:27', '2021-11-23 15:35:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080459013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, '11-23-21 Nanci''s price went from $230 to $310/$1500 IUA in October, 2021. She''s 54, so it wasn''t due to an age change. She also has Cloud Medical for $119 a month, so she should be getting a discount for the DPC. Without Cloud Medical the $310/$1500 IUA looks accurate for the $50-59 age category. But, she has the DPC, so she should be getting a discount which she is not. I can''t find the pricing for MPB Care Plus CV with DPC anywhere.  I sent Patti a message to find out. 
Nanci currently has 2 open need. 1 is for chronic neck and shoulder issues and the other is gut issues. She should not change her membership due to her pre-x. But, he cost should be lower with the DPC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-23 15:27:11', '2021-11-23 15:27:11'),
