  ('zcrm_1579374000080476013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064530083', 'Jake Smithknecht', NULL, 'Jake emailed me and let me know that he would not be updating his pmt info and wanted to cancel.  I sent him the cancellation form.  However will cancel him proactively', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-23 14:27:11', '2021-11-23 14:27:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080476008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080401002', 'Brent McNeese', NULL, 'Mike called in and asked to change start date to 12/1/2021.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-23 14:24:19', '2021-11-23 14:24:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080476003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048122121', 'Adam Grochowsky', NULL, 'Member called in to ask about how to cancel.  I will send out link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-23 14:21:00', '2021-11-23 14:21:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080473003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307015', 'Kathryn Clemen', NULL, '11.23.21:  Dan Clemen (Kathryn''s husband) called. Said Kathryn and the children and going on her company''s health care program so she needs to cancel for January 1.  Dan wants to enroll himself in a plan.  Told him I would send him my link to my site for him to review the plans and watch the video, then we will discuss his needs.  Emailed him my link and the Zion guidelines.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-23 14:10:27', '2021-11-23 14:10:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080470003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974189', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, 'Jennifer called because she wanted to know how to go about seeing a dermatologist.  I went over the self pay process and offered to send her a list of doctors from HCBB along with a fair price for an office visit.  She also wanted to know how to submit her bills to Zion if this visit turned into a medical incident so I sent her Zion''s needs submission link, she also wanted to know how to go about getting her preventative care benefits, so I sent her the preventative care template with a link and instructions on how to find providers in the PHCS network.  I told her that once she has found a provider she must confirm with them that they are currently participating in the PHCS network.  Jennifer was thrilled to speak to an actual person and said I was very helpful. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-23 13:46:14', '2021-11-23 13:46:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080459008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061092044', 'Charles Kinne', NULL, '11-23-21 Charlie''s C4 site is broken with Page Not Found for both of us. We browsed outside of his account and decided to go with the Anthem Bronze Pathway X HMO 7050 for HSA for about $94 with income set at $40K. They already have an HSA and will fund it for any possible health issues. They only need a colonoscopy for Linda and a Stress Test for Charlie. He knows colonoscopy must be coded as wellness and stress test is not part of ACA compliant annual wellness items, so he will have to pay for that. Their dr. for colonoscopy sounds great and made sure to code as wellness for him. Hoping the same for Linda but she is going in for 5+ year visit, not 10 since has family history.  He knows it may be diagnostic. They can cover the ded if necessary.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-23 13:29:59', '2021-11-23 13:29:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080465003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584056', 'Lynda Wright', NULL, 'Lynda called for her RCI card; I warm transferred her to RCI so she could request that from them. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-23 13:18:39', '2021-11-23 13:18:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080459003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061092044', 'Charles Kinne', NULL, '11-23-21 "My displeasure with Bright is: (1) they listed UC Health’s Dr Zimmerman as in their network for this year, and I learned he has never been in their network. (2) they took six months to process the bills from my March colonoscopy, in in that time, I received bills for the whole amount (I did not pay them). (3) Then, when they finally processed the biggest bill from my colonoscopy, they did it wrong and told me my co-pay was more than half the total. Luckily, the colonoscopy doctor’s office intervened immediately, and the bill has been resubmitted. But it is still pending, more than 8 months after the colonoscopy. (4) more than one health care professional has told me Bright is not well respected."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-23 12:59:30', '2021-11-23 12:59:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080396033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307015', 'Kathryn Clemen', NULL, 'Spoke to members husband who was interested in the fact if the prices was going to go up.  Said that Katheryn had a new job and was going to cancel her &amp; children.  I told him if he wanted to stay he would have to re-enroll and directed him back to Joan', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-23 12:43:13', '2021-11-23 12:43:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080407028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076713079', 'Staci Wiley', NULL, '11-23-21 Staci wants to remove herself from the employer group membership and be on their own through their own company. She''s choosing the SECURE membership $1000/$500 for a Dec. 1st start date. She will call me back in 2 hrs to complete enrollment. She will call Dave to remove herself from the group membership. I will probably need to assist in that process. We looked up Dr. Seabolt in Boise and she is showing up the network. I told her to still double check with them before she goes. She prefers to see Dr. Jessica Seick for PCP needs but rarely ever goes to doctor. Had Dr. Seick for 20 years already. Also likes to see homeopath for rest of her preventative stuff and willing to pay cash for that as well!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-23 12:42:44', '2021-11-23 12:42:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080396028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080401002', 'Brent McNeese', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-23 12:29:15', '2021-11-23 12:29:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080396023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080311001', 'Nancy Johnson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-23 12:26:31', '2021-11-23 12:26:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080396018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080304002', 'Marcell Hetenyi', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-23 12:23:27', '2021-11-23 12:23:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080428003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974099', 'Nancy Spurgeon', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-23 12:17:40', '2021-11-23 12:17:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080407023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906068', 'Sue Lepping', NULL, '11-23-21 Left vm for Sue to see if I can help her with trad ins or other MCS options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-23 11:57:55', '2021-11-23 11:57:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080407018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746174', 'Tamra Dalle Molle', NULL, '11-23-21 I called Tamra and she was Super Nice! She''s very appreciative of our services and membership. Her husband just got a new job with full benefits with Cigna including dental and vision with very little reduction in his pay. She was very happy with MPB. Her husband is 54 and looking to retire in the next few years possibly. She will come back to me for sure if they need help in the future. I also let her know she will be reimbursed for Dec. pay that was already taken out once Patti completes the cancellation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-23 11:53:53', '2021-11-23 11:53:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080396013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746174', 'Tamra Dalle Molle', NULL, 'member submitted cancellation I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel &amp; refund billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-23 11:52:33', '2021-11-23 11:52:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080407013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004876167', 'Coreen (Cory) Nickerson', NULL, '11-23-21 "We do not have to migrate until March 2022.  We do have some continued health issues and so our pre-existing continues on.  Peter has persistent elbow pain has has had multiple procedures for the past year or more. Mike just had shoulder surgery 2 months ago. So all of those events keep us dependent on maintaining our pre-existing.  

While it can be a pain to wait LHS customer card is good. And they do an awesome job making sure we don’t overpay on the long run (ie balance bills). 

If you do have clients working with LHS I recommend they put together a spreadsheet to track everything.  It’s the only way I can do it successfully !

Best,

Cory"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-23 11:42:50', '2021-11-23 11:42:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080407008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410215', 'Ann Medina', NULL, '11-23-21 Dorothy Ann called and said Dr. Bickerman''s office won''t accept any HMO''s but he is showing up in the search. She will call Anthem to see what they say. But, that means Dr. Bickerman won''t accept any C4HCO plans at all. So, it won''t solve the problem to switch plans. Dorothy will look into it further.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-23 11:35:43', '2021-11-23 11:35:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080407003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489118', 'Darrin Levy', NULL, '11-23-21 Met Darrin in person and he''s paying $500 a month now with Cigna. Earns too much for APTC. Self employed. He''s interested in SECURE or DIRECT. He has an acid reflux issue he''s been dealing with and it''s getting worse now. Says it''s an anatomical issue that hasn''t been helped with supplements via his functional medicine doctor.  Cigna won''t cover the surgery. He''s looking to see if Anthem will cover it. Otherwise, he''s finding out the cash price to see if he can just pay cash and be done with it. He''ll save $225 a month to put towards the surgery. That''s $2700 a year. He''s going to also meet with one of the DPC drs. I found for him that is super close to where he lives. He''ll keep me posted. He watched the video. He''s had tons of questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-23 11:30:28', '2021-11-23 11:30:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080396008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007637033', 'Nancy Elgie', NULL, 'Member submitted Pmt update I will update in Admin 123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-23 11:00:57', '2021-11-23 11:00:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080396003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079572002', 'Clark Sehon', NULL, 'Per Karen this member needs to push their start date to 2/22 as one of their children now has a "fracture".  I asked for a change from since they have already paid their 1st months share amt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-23 10:46:04', '2021-11-23 10:46:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080364014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057206236', 'Diana Eames', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel with Sedera &amp; refund 12/1 share amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-23 09:40:45', '2021-11-23 09:40:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080364009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073159147', 'Steven Thomas', NULL, 'member submitted payment update form.  Changed in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-23 09:38:11', '2021-11-23 09:38:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080366013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107134002', 'Thomas Beaudin', NULL, '11.23.21:  Recvd. quote.  Called - l/m to c/b to schedule time to talk.
Thomas called. Explained the SECURE plan.  He found us through internet search.  Wife''s name - Rachel - had a benign breast lump removed this year.  No other pre-x. No meds. Bus. owner. Start date - 1/1/22.  Currently using Medishare - $8000/yearly deductible fee and co-pays.  Not thrilled w/Medishare at this point. Tom has 2 issues to solve:  wants an HSA  and wants to pay for this through his business.  
Emailed Tom my link and guidelines.  told him & his wife to watch video on the site and call me with any questions.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-23 09:16:03', '2021-11-23 10:38:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080366008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107134002', 'Thomas Beaudin', NULL, '11.22.21:  Thomas submitted quote request.  Interested in SECURE for himself &amp; family, with a $2500 IUA - 3 children, non-smokers.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-23 09:14:54', '2021-11-23 09:17:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080366003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885002', 'Pamela DeVos', NULL, '11.23.21:  Brian emailed today.  Said he hasn''t heard from the Concierge yet - how long will it take after they''ve enrolled.  I told him he will not hear from the Concierge until after the 1st of the month when he is a member and he has his Welcome Call.  I asked if he recvd. any MPB communiques yet.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-23 09:03:17', '2021-11-23 09:03:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080348003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881429', 'Robin Emond', NULL, 'Robin called before 10:00 a.m.  she was trying to get a hold of Planstin because for some reason her husbands surgery billing is going through them.  I explained that Planstin wasn''t open yet because they are MST.  I also told her that it might be wise to call the providers and tell them to bill her rather than Planstin, so that there is no lag as she''s describing with their billing.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-23 08:08:40', '2021-11-23 08:13:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080326008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079422002', 'Aaron Handler', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online welcome call after start date of December 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-23 08:03:12', '2021-11-23 08:03:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080326003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077745013', 'Dustin Boone', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-23 07:47:34', '2021-11-23 07:47:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080310008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906068', 'Sue Lepping', NULL, 'Member emailed request to cancel I will send link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-23 06:55:22', '2021-11-23 06:55:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080310003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746174', 'Tamra Dalle Molle', NULL, 'member emailed request to cancel.  I emailed link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-23 06:52:52', '2021-11-23 06:52:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080232062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004876167', 'Coreen (Cory) Nickerson', NULL, '11-22-21 "Hi Wendy,

We talked to LHS last week and can peel the kids off onto their own plans in March 2022.  Anna will be  graduated and employed and on her own company plan by August 1 so her plan will be temporary.  Peter (19) be on his own high deductible plan.   

For us the sticking point is we just don’t want to give up our pre-existing conditions “credits” we have earned over the years and start all over with another health share provider.   We don’t mind waiting for LHS to reimburse us. I know it must sound odd.  Still cheaper and better coverage than any other plans for self employed folks like us :)"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-22 19:51:22', '2021-11-22 19:51:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080232057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077866084', 'Judith Snyder', NULL, 'Judy called.  She cut her hand tonight trying to cut a spaghetti squash &amp; needed guidance.  She asked me to look up a specific Urgent Care &amp; I read the one review of a doctor I could see at the facility.  She understands how to proceed as a cash-pay patient.  However, in case this were to go past this inital appt for stiches, to get a detailed invoice, &amp; she may want to start a ''need''.  She understands she is resp for the first 1k IUA.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-22 18:23:18', '2021-11-22 18:23:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080232052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191497', 'Michael Rust', NULL, '11-22-21 Micki and Michael responded that Michael must remain with LHS because of his pre-x stuff. They hope LHS gets better at reimbursements moving forward. Super nice as always!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-22 16:43:31', '2021-11-22 16:43:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080232047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924034', 'Scott Robinson', NULL, 'Scott called.  
-  He went for his prev appt & saw a PHCS Network doc.  Some of the labs were uncovered & even w/the cash pay discount they are $1600!  He''s going to ck because he thinks the doctor''s office just sent him to the hospital, instead of a PHCS Network lab & that''s why they are so expensive.  He''s going to at least look into that.   Sent him prev template so he has search tool & gvmt site to see what''s covered.
-  Doctor wants him to go for a colonoscopy.  We went over making sure he stays in the PHCS Network, present his Planstin card & he knows if they pull polyps, the whole thing moves to his Zion Healthshare.  Sent him temp for submitting ''need'' to Zion if that happens & he''s aware of the 1k IUA if that happens.
-  Doctor also wanted to give him his shingles shot but was out.  He knows to stay in the PHCS Network & is planning to get at least his flu & shingles shots at the same time.  He''ll make sure they do not charge anything for giving him his Covid booster & get that elsewhere if they do.

He seemed far less confused & understood his plan of action when we got off the phone.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-22 16:36:51', '2021-11-22 16:36:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080232042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006191087', 'Drew Tarkington', NULL, '11-22-21 Brittany said they are paying just around $685 now for EF but looks to me like cost for same membership will be $1239 upon their renewal in Feb. of 2022. She mentioned they changed things so they will now have to pay a co-share amount as well. So, they must be moving them to a lower membership if they were to stay. Brittany owns a small biz and has 1099 contract work, plus some W2. Her husband is starting a new W2 job soon too. But, they don''t know if he''ll be offered benefits that are worthwhile. She watched the 10 min video. They have an HSA already so they understand the benefits. Dr. Saskia Thompson and Dr. Alice Antonescu are both showing up the PHCS network. Looking at SECURE $1000/$685 and I told her I can waive $100 of the $125. If they move they will do so for Feb. 1st 2022. She knows the Jan. 20th deadline. All set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-22 16:22:16', '2021-11-22 16:22:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080232037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084651019', 'Nicole Sylvestre', NULL, '11-22-21 Nicole and I went through the Mind and Body section of Whole Health Living and I shared with her the number of practitioners and locations for each of the categories and that pleased her that there are plenty of options for each one. The discounts ranged from 10%-30% for the most part.  Her partner is more well versed in insurance stuff and will likely reach out to me next. They know of the Dec. 20th deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-22 15:11:45', '2021-11-22 15:11:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080232032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005862047', 'Kimberly Goodrich', NULL, '11-22-21 Kimberly requested Unsubscribe. Done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-22 14:51:08', '2021-11-22 14:51:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080142207', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080239001', 'Candece Niss', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-22 14:01:50', '2021-11-22 14:01:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080176013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, 'Adam called regarding a recent mammogram his wife had done. 1 year ago she had a screening mammogram and they had found something that required a secondary diagnostic mammogram. She had gotten the COVID-19 vaccinated about a month prior to her diagnostic mammogram and did not want the vaccine to affect her mammo so she did not get the 6 month diagnostic mammo done. She went in recently, last week, to have another screening mammogram done and they informed her at that time that she could not have a screening mammo because she did not have her diagnostic mammo done. Adam feels she was forced into having the diagnostic mammo done and was wondering if there was anything that can be done. I warm transferred Adam to Zion Health because it definitely does not hurt to ask if Zion can assist. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-22 13:44:43', '2021-11-22 14:23:21'),
