  ('zcrm_1579374000080232008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877120', 'Andrea Thomas', NULL, '11-22-21 Annie is enrolling now in CARE+ for Jan. 1st start $215/$1000. All set! Enrollment took less than 8 minutes!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-22 12:03:56', '2021-11-22 12:08:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080142092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476142', 'Michael Dee', NULL, 'Member''s 12/21 payment declined 1st notice sent -11/22 2nd notice sent-11/24', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-22 12:01:05', '2021-11-24 09:07:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080232003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002095005', 'Dustin Spencer', NULL, '11-22-21 Just pushed Dustin re-enrollment through for 2021. Cigna Connect Flex Silver 4500 Rx Copay for Full cost $341.55 and APTC $307.39 his cost is $34.16. All set for 2022!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-22 12:00:31', '2021-11-22 12:04:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080142087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811028', 'Michael Massarelli', NULL, 'Michael called in because he is getting billed for a surgical procedure that was done late last year, he wanted to know what bills we already had and needed to submit more.  I explained that he never submitted the bills to us, we wouldn''t know that information, he needed to speak with Sedera.    Since he no longer has an active account with Sedera to be able to upload his bills, I transferred him to Sedera so they could give him some guidance. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-22 11:19:37', '2021-11-22 11:19:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080142082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678021', 'Kirsten Casner', NULL, 'Member''s 12/21 payment declined 1st notice sent 11/22 11/23-member submitted new Pmt info', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-22 11:10:19', '2021-11-23 09:05:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080142077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, 'Member''s 12/21 payment declined - 1st notice sent 11/22 2nd notice sent -11/24', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-22 11:06:30', '2021-11-24 09:03:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080160021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078901002', 'Kristina Coffey', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to rescheduled welcome call after start date of December 1, 2021. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-22 11:01:42', '2021-11-22 11:01:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080142072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056140001', 'Betsy Green', NULL, 'I read Wendy''s note and noticed that she used a different spelling then what I thought Betsy had given me.  I looked up Dr.  Bhagavan and found her in network.  I called Betsy back to tell her that her doctor was in network, I had just used the wrong spelling.  I told her that she just needed to confirm with her provider that she is currently participating in the PHCS network. Betsy  thanked me for the call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-22 11:00:57', '2021-11-22 11:00:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080142067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050084', 'Stephen Zawada', NULL, 'Member''s 12/21 payment declined - 1st notice sent 11/22 2nd notice sent-11/24', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-22 11:00:04', '2021-11-24 08:59:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080142062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009926276', 'Jaime Raaj', NULL, 'Member''s 12/21 pmt declined 1st notice sent 11/22 2nd notice sent-11/24 Member elected to cancel I will refund the payment that was processed yesterday.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-22 10:54:39', '2021-11-30 07:29:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080142057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056140001', 'Betsy Green', NULL, 'Betsy called because she was at Dr. Bhagvan''s office for her preventative care benefits, she wanted to know if they were in network.  I looked the name up on Multiplan and could not find it.  She asked "what to do?"  I told her that I could send her a link and instructions on how to find in network doctors.  She thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-22 10:46:18', '2021-11-22 10:46:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080142052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079841002', 'Cynthia Ramain', NULL, 'Member''s  12/21 payment declined - 1st notice sent -  11/22', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-22 10:43:03', '2021-11-22 10:43:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080176008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065153667', 'Margaret Petersen', NULL, 'Sent a new QR Life Code Card per Vanessa''s request. Address was verified and new card assigned and mailed today. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-11-22 10:41:24', '2021-11-22 10:41:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080160013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065153667', 'Margaret Petersen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly F to send out a another QR Life code card. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-22 10:27:37', '2021-11-22 10:29:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080160008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065153667', 'Margaret Petersen', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-22 10:02:44', '2021-11-22 10:02:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080142038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, 'Julia called because she wanted to know when we "switched" from being able to go any provider you''d like, to having to go to an in network provider.  I explained that there has ALWAYS been a network for her preventative care benefits, that it is for all other care that she may go anywhere she''d like and present herself as a self pay patient.  She understood and thanked me for the clarification, she asked me to transfer her to Planstin about her bill, and I did so. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-22 09:38:07', '2021-11-22 09:38:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080142033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, 'Julia called because she had a lab bill denied by Planstin, I explained that Planstin only denies bills for 1 of 2 reasons, either it wasn''t coded as preventative, or it was out of network.  Julia admitted that she did not try to find an in network lab.  She wanted to know if she submitted it to Zion if they would pay for it...I reminded her of her IUA and told her that the bill would only count towards her IUA if she has bills that would exceed her $2500 IUA. She said that she doesn''t have a medical need from this.   I gave her Planstin''s phone number so she could discuss with them why the bill was denied. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-22 09:26:49', '2021-11-22 09:26:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080142028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839147', 'Ashleigh Bechtel', NULL, 'member called to change her billing information, I sent her a payment info update form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-22 08:34:58', '2021-11-22 08:34:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080176003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862056', 'Scott Petrone', NULL, 'Scott called regarding his CirrusMD account. It appears that his information is not found in the CirrusMD system so I have reached out to the CirrusMD support staff to aid Scott. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-22 08:29:02', '2021-11-22 08:29:02'),
