  ('zcrm_1579374000080131048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080972002', 'Atalie Troutman', NULL, '11.17.21:  Called - l/m to c/b.  Mentioned deadline for a 12/1 start date.  Also left a text.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-22 07:09:06', '2021-11-22 07:09:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080037037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, 'I had in my notes that Catherine &amp; I would touch base before Thanksgiving to make sure we are on track.  Sent her an e-mail 11/20/21.  Had expected she might reach out due to her conversation w/Patti, but never heard from her.  Was paying $486, w/corr now at $534.  In my e-mail told her we could re-evaluate waiting for Feb and we should discuss her options.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-21 12:40:20', '2021-11-21 12:40:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080037032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, '11.20.21:  Sean texted me that he and Amy enrolled.  Said he wasn''t sure it went through.  I called him and he said they got an email confirming the enrollment.  He said they will be sure to schedule their Welcome call when they get the link to the scheduler.I asked him to keep me posted re:  their on-boarding process.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-21 08:40:18', '2021-11-21 08:40:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080025008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '5TH QR Life code for Drew: H0BU6.', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-11-20 14:23:21', '2021-11-20 14:23:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080089014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092041003', 'Peggy Franco', NULL, 'Sent follow-up e-mail re: 1/1/22 eff date &amp; that we can submit app now for that date.  We''ve done most items, but have a bit more to go over.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-20 13:21:38', '2021-11-20 13:21:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080097003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034128004', 'Nancy Warburton', NULL, 'Member cancelled prior to billing for 12/1.  Never received cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-19 21:03:26', '2021-11-19 21:03:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080090003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079839002', 'Richard Goecke', NULL, '5TH QR Life Code for Thomas: H0CB4. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-11-19 17:14:19', '2021-11-19 17:14:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080089003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073297065', 'Lance Logsdon', NULL, 'Lance sent in a chat.  He does not seem to understand his membership.  I hope he''s okay.  I tried to find out what he''s trying to do so I could help him and did not get responses.  Because I''m concerned about him (is he at the ER?), I sent his advisor Analisa Cleland an e-mail and let her know he''s not understanding his plan.  Rod beat me to adding the chat (see above).  Lance seems to think he has insurance and says "they want his insurance policy #".     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-19 17:00:51', '2021-11-19 17:06:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080037024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740100', 'Rossana Johnston', NULL, '11-19-21 They decided to move forward with SECURE to save money and to have the insurance to show proof of ACA compliant plan for immigration purposes. $1000/$500 IUA.  All set and cancelled current membership as well for Dec. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-19 16:29:11', '2021-11-19 16:47:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080037016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427074', 'Fox Marie Magdovitz', NULL, '11-19-21 I just talked to Fox and helped her further. She''s getting the run around with the Billing Dept at UC Health and RCI. I coached her a little more. I know UC Health Billing Dept is notoriously super frustrating and not helpful. I told her to make sure the entire bill has all Z codes which indicate wellness. I think you mentioned Vitamin D and Lipid Panels are the only labs covered under the ACA. However, the ACA doesn''t list all the labs covered because the ACA allows for doctor discretion on many labs. The doctor has the choice in whether or not to code them as wellness. 
After more coaching, she will try again. Also sounds like she''s getting billed for a doctor that she never even saw. This is another one of their dirty little tricks. She''s also reached out to their financial aid dept to get help with this visit that was supposed to be at no cost for her annual!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-19 16:15:31', '2021-11-19 16:15:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080028008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073297065', 'Lance Logsdon', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Cari', 'Visit ID : 1065 Question : i have your insurance already... do i have a policy # ?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-11-19 15:52:09', '2021-11-19 15:52:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080037011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082413287', 'Blaire Speaker', NULL, '11-19-21 Blair is pregnant and her current Bronze Friday plan isn''t covering anything for her until she meets her ded. We reviewed other Friday and Cigna plans. She wants to keep Dr. Paul Wexler and Dr. Gloria Oberbeck. Dr. Oberbeck is not showing in the Cigna network but site says accepts Cigna. So, Blair will call to make sure she accepts the EPO Connect plans. She''s likely choosing between 3 Gold plans and will keep me posted. They are both self-employed and make $112K MAGI. Super nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-19 15:30:28', '2021-11-19 15:30:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080047003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080072002', 'James Romano', NULL, '11.19.21:  Recvd. quote from James.  Called, spoke w/James.  Interested in Care Plus at a $2500 IUA, MO, Healthy, no Rx, no pre-x,  Explained all plans including Care Plus.  Said he wanted more info. to review.  I told him I was sending him my click funnel for that and to watch the video on it.  He may enroll tomorrow.  I told him to call me to assist him.  Emailed my link 
and guidelines.
Recvd. a text from James.  He enrolled and got a confirmation. Said he would schedule a welcome call when he got his Welcome email.  I responded and thanked him for his enrollment. Told him to keep me posted about his on-boarding process.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-19 15:23:02', '2021-11-21 15:52:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080037003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410215', 'Ann Medina', NULL, '11-19-21 Checked to make sure cancellation is for 1/1/22. It''s all set.  Dorothy Ann called and left vm to check on this and I left her a vm response.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-19 15:16:46', '2021-11-19 15:21:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080025003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162245', 'Rhonda Savage', NULL, 'spoke with Rhonda.  Setting up a meeting with her to discuss her situation for Dec 1 at 930am.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-11-19 14:40:05', '2021-11-19 14:40:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079950033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056556027', 'Rikki Mor', NULL, 'Rikki Mor called in because Analisa told her to contact us regarding HCBB''s care connect team regarding her daughter''s surgery for L torn foot tendon this coming Wednesday.  I explained that the surgery date was just too soon for HCBB to do anything at this point.  She understood.  I told her that she needed to submit the  bills that she has to Zion health, and that I would send her a Zion needs submission form, I also transferred her to Zion since the surgery date is so close so that they can go over with her what to expect. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-19 14:36:51', '2021-11-19 14:36:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079947128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079936017', 'Nicole Smith', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure + Tobacco', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-19 14:24:48', '2021-12-10 10:56:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079950028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937091', 'Brandi Nelson', NULL, 'missed welcome call, called both numbers and left detailed messages.  Sent online welcome call scheduler to reschedule.  I am only doing this Welcome call before the Dec 1 start date because Brandi is on the Care Plus plan now and I would be able to help her set up the rest of her family with Cirrus''s  services.  Brandi is showing as already registered with CirrusMD. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-19 14:22:01', '2021-11-19 14:22:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079947123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080019012', 'Salvador Sajuan', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-19 14:15:53', '2021-11-19 14:15:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080009008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079849335', 'Brian Lorch', NULL, '11-19-21 Bright Health Peak Bronze 5300 HSA $1,298.41, APTC $1,217.49,  their cost is $80.92 for 2022 with $60K estimated income.  I think there''s an extra $7 per member, per month for Peak Health Alliance. I read it to them but not sure they really heard that part.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-19 13:30:24', '2021-11-19 13:31:51'),
