  ('zcrm_1579374000080014008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427074', 'Fox Marie Magdovitz', NULL, 'Fox called in very rude and frustrated with the fact that RCI is not paying her preventative well woman''s visit due to the coding being incorrect. I tried to explain politely to Fox that there are certain preventative services/bloodwork that are covered by her MEC. She then told me that I was giving her the run around and she''s sick of not getting this visit paid. I explained the 2 bloodwork panels that are included with her MEC and offered to send her the list of ACA services. She then got belligerent with me and would not let me finish helping her. I explained that I couldn''t assist her if she was not going to let me finish my sentences to her so that I could thoroughly explain her plan. She hung up on me. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-19 12:40:52', '2021-11-19 12:40:52'),
