  ('zcrm_1579374000079992016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, '11.19.21:  Spoke with Amy &amp; Sean. Amy had several questions which I answered.  She wasn''t ready yet to enroll.  Needs a few more days to let it sink in, she said.  They will enroll over the weekend.  Sean started filling the enrollment platform in as we spoke.  He is leaving on a trip but I told Amy she could enroll.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-19 12:26:24', '2021-11-19 12:26:24'),
