  ('zcrm_1579374000079992011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, '11.17.21:  Called. Sean wants to enroll but didn''t yet discuss it with his wife, Amy.  Scheduled enrollment for 11/19/21, at 1 p.m. EST, due to the deadline.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-19 12:23:54', '2021-11-19 12:23:54'),
