  ('zcrm_1579374000080014003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271543', 'Thomas Kiley', NULL, 'Thomas called in to cancel because his company has recently received traditional insurance. I sent Jane an email privately letting her know to reach out to Thomas regarding his cancellation. I also did CC Jane on the cancellation link email sent to Thomas. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-19 11:57:17', '2021-11-19 11:57:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000080009003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019634002', 'Colleen Mangeot', NULL, '11-19-21 Colleen is 59 and healthy, just small aches and pains that she sees a PT for. She''ll talk with the PT to see what the records show to decide if its a concern.  Also takes bioidentical hormones, no tobacco and otherwise healthy.  Might possibly get a new 1099 contract work, has W2 job that she might drop down in hours or quit altogether. She''s looking towards Feb. 1st start date. Also interested in HMA.  Husband owns rental property LLC but her name''s not on it and he''s going on Medicare.  She now works for Cincinnati Children''s as W2.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-19 11:10:19', '2021-11-19 11:10:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079947033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003195011', 'Camille Leon', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will let Zion know and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-19 10:25:30', '2021-11-19 10:25:30'),
