  ('zcrm_1579374000079950023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041616032', 'Gregory Gibbons', NULL, 'Greg called to tell me that his RCI cards are expired, he was trying to get a Covid vaccine.  I explained that the Covid vaccine is not a mandated preventative care item.  I also told him that the Kroger store where he was at was not in network.  He would like to get his flu shot, but I told him that it needed to be with an in network provider, so I sent him a list of pharmacies/internists/family medicine providers that he can choose from, I told him that he must confirm with the provider that they are currently participating in the PHCS network.  I also reached out to Patti and asked her to request PDF and hard copies of his cards. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-19 09:37:33', '2021-11-19 09:37:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079950018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522092', 'Nancy Allawos', NULL, 'Nancy called because she changed her last name, and email address.  I sent her a member change form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-19 08:24:46', '2021-11-19 08:24:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079947018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075349002', 'Candis Fonooni', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she was offered Employer coverage and needed to cancel. I sent out link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-19 08:09:16', '2021-11-19 08:09:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079947013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030348722', 'Tamara Orebaugh', NULL, 'Member called in after hours and said that they would be cancelling eff 1/1/22.  I will send them the link and advise to submit after 12/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-19 07:59:01', '2021-11-19 07:59:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079950013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079686002', 'Ronald Flake', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of December 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-19 07:57:40', '2021-11-19 07:57:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079950008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206276', 'Carol Hyjek', NULL, 'Carol called because she wants a specific covid saliva test that needs to be scripted out by a doctor, she told me to not bother looking up free covid testing for her because that test is never an option.  Because she hasn''t yet used her preventative care services I sent her a list of in network PHCS doctors, just so that she can start a relationship with them.  She knows for this service she needs to present herself as a self pay patient.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-19 07:51:35', '2021-11-19 07:51:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079947008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003195011', 'Camille Leon', NULL, 'Per email &amp; conversations w/Paul this member will be and enrolling in a Covered CA plan.  Per request from Paul I sent her out the cancellation link also bcc''d Paul.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-19 07:24:12', '2021-11-19 07:24:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079950003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079839002', 'Richard Goecke', NULL, 'sent email asking to reschedule Welcome call sometime after his membership start date. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-19 07:14:37', '2021-11-19 07:14:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079947003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035379141', 'Christopher Jackson', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update.  I will update in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-19 07:12:49', '2021-11-19 07:12:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079853126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410215', 'Ann Medina', NULL, '11-18-21 We just enrolled Ann is Anthem Silver Mountain Enhanced X HMO 5000 for $974.98, APTC $888.50 and her cost is $86.48.  Her income is now $29,874 down from $50K bc her husband Jerome is retired now.  We also made sure Dr. Susan Vickerman is in the network for this Anthem plan. I told her daughter who helped with the entire app to check with provider to make sure she''s truly in network. She''s friends with the woman in the Billing Dept and will do so. :-) Took us a very long time. But, she''s all set and we cancelled MPB as well. It was too complicated for her and now too expensive.  Ann doesn''t even have a computer but has an iPhone.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-18 17:21:15', '2021-11-18 17:21:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079853121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079921029', 'Ryan Padwe', NULL, '11-18-21 Ryan is family of Stephen Padwe and 50/50 business owner of Elite Trial Lawyers. They are Trial Consultants. They see the crazy increased rates of healthcare costs in trials. So, they both totally understood the value of the cash price vs insurance prices. He''s totally healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. Hasn''t been a to dr. in years. Doesn''t do wellness visits but might start. Willing to fund HSA for tax benefits. Chose SECURE $$275/$1000. Interested in HMA for both of them. Ryan might want to get Lasik surgery in a year or two. HSA and HMA can help for that. He lives in Lakewood area. I waived the $100 fee since Stephen already paid it for their company of two. I just had them enroll separately since no list billing now anyhow. Kristy Barber will earn her $100 referral fee from Stephen Wadwe''s membership enrollment. All set for Dec. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-18 16:12:59', '2021-11-18 16:12:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079853116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079897013', 'Shawn Weiman', NULL, '11-18-21 He called C4 to cancel their plan for Dec. 1st and was sent in circles between carrier and C4 to cancel. So, he will just stay with them until Jan. 1st. He will still have to update his account to just keep his son on the C4 account and remove both adults. He''s enrolling in SECURE for Jan. 1st, 2022 start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-18 15:13:05', '2021-11-18 15:13:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079926018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009525007', 'Jill Suarez', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will cancel billing &amp; notify Zion', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-18 14:31:17', '2021-11-18 14:31:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079853105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079849335', 'Brian Lorch', NULL, '11-18-21 Brian and Kathy put in $5000 income for Dec. 2021 onward which annualizes to $60K. This gives them an APTC of $1115.44 for the final month of Dec. They chose Bright Health Peak Bronze 6850 HSA. They would like to renew it for 2022. We are waiting for the removal of Sarah (daughter) from their account to get the account to work properly. We will meet tomorrow to choose the plan for 2022. Same plan ideally. His income might increase later in year, but he can change it at that time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-18 14:28:25', '2021-11-18 14:28:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079853100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912017', 'Stephen Padwe', NULL, '11-18-21 Stephen is enrolling in SECURE EC $1000/$495.  All set for EC. Next I need to talk with Ryan Padwe, his partner and family to get him enrolled as EO as well in SECURE. Ryan will pay from same biz account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-18 14:20:06', '2021-11-18 15:01:17'),
