  ('zcrm_1579374000079874030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912009', 'Stephen Wetterling', NULL, '11.18.21:  Enrolled Liz w/her husband Stephen as primary member.  Liz is interested in Dental &amp; Vision for her family.  Told her I would get the info. and get back to her.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-18 13:45:12', '2021-11-18 13:45:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079894008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068243080', 'Erik Allen', NULL, 'Erik called in regards to a recent biking injury. I advised Erik to present himself as a self-pay patient and went through the process. I also sent him the link to his Planstin account, a list of PCP''s in his area, and instructions on how to upload his bills to Zion and how to search the PHCS network. I also adviser Erik to contact us if he needs any imaging done or it results in surgery. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-18 13:30:46', '2021-11-18 13:30:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079919008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055920063', 'Lady Fuller', NULL, 'Lady called for copies of her Planstin card, I reached out to Planstin''s team via Slack and requested this on her behalf. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-18 12:39:25', '2021-11-18 12:39:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079853095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165340', 'Frederick (Rick) Dellenbaugh', NULL, '11-18-21 I pushed his auto renewal through and discovered his wife Pamela was still showing on the plan but she''s 66. So, I went back and removed her from needing health insurance and the cost is now $883.58 minus APTC of $184.23. Let him know if he doesn''t want the tax credit he will need to increase his expected income for 2022. We''ll see his response via email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-18 12:35:18', '2021-11-18 12:35:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079853090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006071083', 'Karen Miller', NULL, 'Spoke to member to f/u on Cancellation.  She told me she sent an email prior to me sending template.  I will resend link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-18 12:24:24', '2021-11-18 12:24:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079853085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006191087', 'Drew Tarkington', NULL, '11-18-21 "I reached out last year in regards to moving away from Liberty Health Share to MPower (j believe you originally set us up with LHS, along with my aunt Traci Hoops) although at the time I was pregnant and we decided it was best to stay with LHS until I delivered. Well our little guy is now 4 months old and our membership year is up with Liberty in February, so we are looking at different health share programs/health insurances.

Can you give us more information for MPower?  It would be myself, my husband, and our son on the plan. My aunt switched over and she has been very happy with the company.

Look forward to hearing from you!

Thank you,
Brittany Tarkington"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-18 11:44:59', '2021-11-18 11:44:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079853077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912009', 'Stephen Wetterling', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-18 11:41:18', '2021-11-18 11:41:18'),
