  ('zcrm_1579374000079853067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079920002', 'Rusty Shelton', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-18 11:35:40', '2021-11-18 11:35:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079853053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885009', 'Julie Hauser', NULL, '11-18-21 She learned that her current membership with Clearwater Benefits out of Idaho includes Zion as well. But, they are increasing her rate substantially because she "used up her funds" last year for her colonoscopy and mammogram. This doesn''t make sense because she also had Planstin. She says her Rep was hard to reach even though they said they have a Concierge Team as well. She''s choosing SECURE $1000/$275 and price won''t increase bc of usage or age at this point. She has many more benefits through SECURE and more support at a lower rate.  Enrolled and all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-18 11:30:27', '2021-11-18 11:44:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079919003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002724127', 'Paul DeFelice', NULL, 'Paul called to ask if Thermography was a covered expense, I explained that it was not, that his plan only covered screening mammogram only. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-18 11:03:49', '2021-11-18 11:03:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079853048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009525007', 'Jill Suarez', NULL, '11-18-21 Jill just called and let me know she is definitely covered for Dec. 1st. I have no idea what type of ins she got since it''s outside of open enrollment for special start date of Dec. 1st. She was super nice and will call if she needs anything in the future.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-18 10:51:50', '2021-11-18 10:51:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079853043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084651019', 'Nicole Sylvestre', NULL, '11-18-21 Nicole is 36 and owns small biz and does contract work. Earns about $60K, healthy, no tobacco, no meds. She''s mostly interested in holistic care. She does her annual wellness visit. She''s super curious about the Whole Healthy Living program and I''m trying to figure out how to show her since you have to be a member to access it. She was asking if she could have her partner join but she lives separately from Nicole, they do not file taxes together or anything. She then asked if they were to get married and live separately if that would work. I believe if they are married then they can have a membership together. Doesn''t really seem worth it to save $50 a month. Mostly interested in SECURE for Nicole and CARE+ for her partner who is 42, W2 employee and has asthma. They don''t have ins now either. But, this all sounds too good to be true. Wants a Jan. 1st start date. Dec. 1st they have to decide too quickly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-18 10:44:29', '2022-02-03 14:23:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079916003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079300001', 'Melissa Adams', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after state date of December 1st.  Sent email to do so.Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-18 10:40:26', '2021-11-18 10:40:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079853038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912002', 'John Sepede', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-18 10:37:49', '2021-11-18 10:37:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079853033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937091', 'Brandi Nelson', NULL, '11-18-21 Brandi has now chosen to downgrade her membership to CARE Only for the time being while money is tight. They want the virtual healthcare app at least and the medication assistance. They chose CARE for the EF for $49 monthly and Patti was able to waive the $25 fee.  Submitted request via email. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-18 10:32:51', '2021-11-18 10:32:51'),
