  ('zcrm_1579374000079874004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079409002', 'Blake Sieck', NULL, '11.17.21:  Called Blake re:  our discussion and follow up. Said he enrolled a few days ago himself and he has been receiving their on-boarding materials.  He did not schedule a Welcome Call, so I told him it is important to do and where to find the link or to call the Concierge to schedule that Call.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-18 07:49:17', '2021-11-18 07:49:17'),
