  ('zcrm_1579374000079853003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937091', 'Brandi Nelson', 'Care + membership', 'from 11/1/2021 - 11/30/21', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-18 07:24:12', '2021-11-18 07:24:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079824044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, 'James called & wanted to verify he presented his preventative stuff properly for Planstin to pay.  Now doing telehealth appointment w/nurse from doctor''s office as follow-up on preventative w/$125 charge.   Explained that if it''s same doctor & part of that preventative appointment, then doctor should submit & code this as prev too.  That since part of same appt, submit to Planstin under same PHCS MD.  I mentioned his MPB Memb includes a telehealth that is free for other times he needs help and that it''s best to get that setup on your phone & computer before you need it.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-17 17:31:50', '2021-11-17 17:31:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079829047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', NULL, '11-17-21 Andi and husband own their own catering business. Andi turns 55 in Dec. 2021, husband is turning 63 in April 2022. He has pre-x with a vascular condition. 1st treatment was 6 years ago. He just got a treatment recently and it should be fine for at least 2-4 years from now. Even if he needed another treatment it''s laser and should only be about $10K max. He broke his femur many years ago which has caused hip issues now. He''s going into a dr. early Dec. to see what his outlook is for his hip in the next few years. He received a cortisone shot recently and might need hip surgery in the next many years. However, he''ll be on Medicare in 2 years. So, he will find out how good or bad his hip is before moving forward with anything. They might keep him on traditional ins and put Andi and 22 and 24 year old kids on MCS.  They want a Jan. 1st start date. Kids in MT and NY.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-17 16:38:08', '2021-11-17 16:38:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079824033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575309', 'Corrie Black', NULL, 'Corrie called back.  She''s been paying all the bills and hasn''t started a need yet.  Sent her the temp for starting/submitting a need with Sedera.  She thought she had to pre-pay everything before she could do that.  I told her no, get your need submitted.  She''s going to attach proof of payments too because she''s already paid > than her IUA per her.   Told her once she has that done they will assign a ''need'' coordinator who can help with that ''need'' specifically.  She sounded very relieved to know she can start the need & quit pre-paying for everything ... it''s getting expensive!    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-17 16:35:46', '2021-11-17 16:35:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079824025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072471089', 'Anita Fisher', NULL, 'Anita ''chatted'' on SalesIQ (see attachment).   She had questions about her effective/anniversary date & IUA  level = 1k (but at times seemed to confuse and IUA with how a deductible works).  Other times seemed to understand.  I req''d new hardcopy of their Zion card per her request.  Her husb needs a cortisone shot to his shoulder (which she says he needs occasionally), but she said she & Diane discussed it and it shouldn''t be pre-existing.  I assume due to time, etc., but at least they discussed it.  Sent her the temp on how to submit a ''need'' to Zion.  She seemed pleased at the conclusion.    - CA

PS This Secure plan doesn''t show any added product, so sent Teams chat to see if it should have the MEC-Planstin attached.  Per Patti:  "Hi Cari, the products are only separated in the Conversion. It''s a "bundled" product in the memberships sold after 11/20, so therefore 1 product."    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-17 16:15:15', '2021-11-17 17:30:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079829042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '11-17-21 Eric and Karen are struggling to get Redirect to respond to pay for their annual wellness visits and shots. They are using the new Spruce App and they''ve gotten the run around without success. They asked for the cash price and now Redirect is trying to use the PHCS network all of the sudden. This is annoying. I instructed the to submit their issues here - https://www.redirecthealth.com/extrahelp/. Thew will do so. If that fails, I''ll forward their information onto Mike Bechtol and see if he can solve the problem. Karen is afraid to get her mammogram after having so many struggles with the kids stuff. They are tolerant and will work it out.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-17 15:48:28', '2021-11-17 15:48:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079769006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072673163', 'Joshua Fisher', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Cari', 'Visit ID : 1058 Question : I thought I had set up an account, but now I am not able to locate it. How can I find it?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-11-17 15:41:12', '2021-11-17 15:41:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079829037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009525007', 'Jill Suarez', NULL, '11-17-21 She wasn''t comfortable with Zion and was too worried whether or not they''d pay her back. She found something else but now isn''t sure if it starts Dec. or Jan. 1st. I asked her to call me back to let me know before they cancel her with MPB. She agreed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-17 15:17:49', '2021-11-17 15:17:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079829029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079827006', 'Ritesh Prajapati', NULL, '11-17-21 Ritesh chose Oscar Bronze Elite- $0 Ded (Choice) ($0 Virtual Care + $3 Drugs) for $303.28. His father in law who''s a dr. instructed him to do this instead of MCS. Price is close for him at this point. Plus he has a $0 ded choice. So, works for him and there looks to be a sizable network in Boulder now. He''s all set for Jan. 2022. Payment wasn''t allowed on C4 and he knows to contact Oscar to set up ongoing payments moving forward. All set! 
