  ('zcrm_1579374000079799058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689144', 'Lori Altman', NULL, 'Lori called in asking what her price would go up to if she added her daughter.  Advised her of price asked when she could go on I told her 12/1 she  asked if she could go on any sooner, told her no all changes take effect 1st of the month.  She to let me know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-17 13:41:38', '2021-11-17 13:41:38'),
