  ('zcrm_1579374000079829016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410215', 'Ann Medina', NULL, '11-17-21 Ann talked with a guy selling a plan through National Association of Preferred (or Preserred?) Providers for $352 and signed up yesterday. He told her Marketplace plans are $400-$500 for her. But, with her income at $29K she can get silver plans for $45! We are going to talk tomorrow and help her through this process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-17 13:03:42', '2021-11-17 13:03:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079799053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670004', 'Holly Hill', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add spouse to plan eff 12/1/2021.  I will notify Planstin and add to file to be sent.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-17 12:36:39', '2021-11-17 12:36:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079799048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079686010', 'Sylvestre Dongmo', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation because spouse is pregnant and they will be going a different direction with coverage', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-17 12:19:08', '2021-11-17 12:19:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079784013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689471', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, 'Melissa called in to state that she is upset that we told her that her OBGYN was an in-network provider. Upon reading my emails between Kelly C., Melissa, and myself there was no where stated that this particular provider was in-network. It was relayed to Kelly C by Melissa that she found this provider in-network, which she did not, and she is now upset that she has a bill to pay because she did not listen to our instructions. I have informed Wendy of this situation. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-17 12:15:02', '2021-11-17 12:15:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079829011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689471', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, '11-17-21 Melissa is livid bc her doctor is not accepting the PHCS network now. I had looked it up for her and the doctor was showing. I told her to double check and make sure she''s in the network still. She said she already did but when she went they are now billing her for $700+ and say they aren''t in the network anymore. I suggested she call Planstin to see if they will become part of the network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-17 11:52:08', '2021-11-17 11:52:08'),
