  ('zcrm_1579374000079829003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740100', 'Rossana Johnston', NULL, '11-16-21 Rossana is possibly immigrating to Portugal but needs proof of ins to do so. We looked at ins and the lowest price is $1000+ and Kaiser $1100+. That was shocking to her. I then described SECURE and she can keep her business and still earn some money to maintain compliance. Explained the MEC and ACA compliance and also the sharing guidelines verbiage about overseas protection. She will talk with her immigration people to see if this will work for her. They also plan to sell a property and this will put them over any threshold to gain a subsidy. She had a torn ligament from painting and she thinks it well healed now with no further problems or symptoms. She''s not worried about it with the pre-x clause.  Looking at SECURE $1000/$500. I can waive the $100 of $125 since already a member.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-17 11:42:15', '2021-11-19 16:17:27'),
