  ('zcrm_1579374000079824003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887032', 'Jared Goldsmith', NULL, 'Jared called -- he called &amp; LM w/receptionist because we weren''t open???  that he wanted to CE.  Let him know I cannot see anything in our notes &amp; transferred him to Patti.  He wanted it CE''d immed &amp; was frustrated we didn''t have anything from his "prev call".    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-17 11:15:38', '2021-11-17 11:15:38'),
