  ('zcrm_1579374000079818003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083258001', 'Jonathan Atwell', NULL, '11-17-21 Jonathan went on a last minute road trip to Moab or somewhere like that and hasn''t had time to research everything yet. He''s focusing on a Jan 1st start date. He''ll reach out next week and we can talk after Thanksgiving.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-17 09:40:28', '2021-11-17 09:40:28'),
