  ('zcrm_1579374000079799008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079758002', 'Charles Federspiel', NULL, 'I spoke to this new member who realized that Secure might not be for him.  He will be starting his own business however in the future.  I tried to steer him toward the Care+ plan however he just wanted to cancel.  I sent him the link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-17 09:01:30', '2021-11-17 09:01:30'),
