  ('zcrm_1579374000079799003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049932024', 'Jared Willmore', NULL, 'Former PSD member from 5/1/2020 to 12/1/2021. Member has re-enrolled in Secure.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-17 08:17:55', '2021-11-17 08:17:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079784003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990450', 'Douglas Holderread', NULL, 'Douglas called to cancel his plan and was belligerent when I told him that I could not do it for him. He was also belligerent when I advised him to have his cancellation turned in before the 20th, he said good luck because there will be no money in the account for us to take. I sent the cancellation email to Doug. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-17 07:56:39', '2021-11-17 07:56:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079743031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047526542', 'Mehr Rahmatullah', NULL, '11-16-21 Joan has called Patient Point 3x and completed form to get response from them about adding info to the video marketing materials showing in office. I sent an email to Johanna to get her help now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-16 16:58:52', '2021-11-16 16:58:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079743026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079897013', 'Shawn Weiman', NULL, '11-16-21 Shawn wants to try to cancel him and wife from C4 plan first and see it that goes smoothly before enrolling in SECURE. This will also give him an idea of cost for son plus SECURE. We are meeting again on Thursday to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-16 16:14:41', '2021-11-18 15:02:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079749008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003195011', 'Camille Leon', NULL, 'Camille called with lots to do:
    - Wanted to know about mammograms & pap-smears.  Confirmed w/Kelly Anne this gal''s plan has no MEC, no preventative or mammograms.  Camille wanted to know if we have diff plan that includes preventative.  We discussed Secure = she is a business owner (& has employees, but she''ll deal with that part later) & knows she would have to provide proof of being a business if she goes that route.  Sent her temp on prev so she can make an educated decision w/note that it''s for education purp only & only on the Secure Plan.
    - She moved.  Prev add:  9750 Peace Way, Apt 2003, Las Vegas, NV  89147.  Updated CRM, but sent her membership change form.  She will fill-out & submit so back office can change on all records.
    - We discussed $5,000 IUA as well.  She wanted price difference.  Since we were discussing Secure let her know what the price diff would current be w/that plan.  Curr contribution = $209, Secure 1k IUA Ind = $275, but also let her know she may not be able to chg until her anniversary date.  Told her to use the ''membership change form'' again and tt that contact person, Patti, to get the exact details on chging (when she could change plans &/or IUA amts for future ''needs'', how Zion would look at any pre-x, etc.).  
    - She seemed happy when we got off the phone.  She will also talk w/her advisor Paul Cholak so he know what''s going on if she decides to make any changes to her membership.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-16 15:18:39', '2021-11-16 15:18:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079743018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079754001', 'Catherine Engelman', NULL, '11-16-21 Other notes in Quentin Green''s account. Cathy is enrolled in SECURE for Dec. 1st, 2021. She takes meds for spastic bladder and otherwise healthy. $1000/$275. She was about to have to pay $2300 for just her in FL going up from $1900! INSANE. She was eager to join this and save tons of money!
I forgot to offer OPD to her! Ugh! But, Quentin originally told me he figured she''d want to keep her doctors.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-16 14:58:55', '2021-11-16 15:00:01'),
