  ('zcrm_1579374000079694028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132121', 'Inga Hughes', NULL, 'Inga called for help with her son''s new injectable Abilify prescription, I told her that I would reach out to Reid to ask him this, as you cannot find a coupon for it online.  I emailed Reid and tagged Inga asking him if this is something he can source for these members. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-16 13:45:50', '2021-11-16 13:45:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079749003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017815001', 'Monica Rankin', NULL, 'Monica is planning to have a screening colonoscopy.  We went over Planstin as preventative & that it transfers to Zion & a healthsharing need if they pull polyps or it becomes diagnostic w/1k IUA.  She already knows how to submit a need to Zion.  Ordered her both pdf & hard copies of her Planstin card via Slack because she doesn''t know where her card is.  Let her know she must present this card & have MD bill Planstin.  Also sent her PHCS Template as well as the few facilities (5) in her area.  She''s very disappointed at how difficult this process is... too many hoops.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-16 13:28:03', '2021-11-16 13:28:03'),
