  ('zcrm_1579374000079694018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Marc called wondering about a price decrease that he heard about from Paul Cholak- I told him that I wasn''t aware of the decrease but that I would be more than happy to transfer him to Patti Baron to discuss.  He declined and wanted Patti''s direct line instead.  He wanted a list of pricing- I told him to go to MPB.Health that his plan was the most similar to the Secure plan...but again told him for concrete pricing to speak to Patti. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-16 12:44:46', '2021-11-16 12:44:46'),
