  ('zcrm_1579374000079694013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077566050', 'Michael Baker', NULL, 'Michael called wanting to add his son to the plan, I sent him a member change form and transferred him to Patti so she could tell him how much more a month it will cost. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-16 12:16:28', '2021-11-16 12:16:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079743008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238273', 'Jennifer Bradfield', NULL, '11-16-21 Deciding still if they want to stay or move. Not pursuing HMA now. They joined his wife''s dental plan through employer for wife and kids. They like the lower IUA but not sure the change is worth it since they do get high cost mammo and colonoscopy through Sedera. Also the pre-x might be a concern waiting the 1 year to be protected.  I forget what the issue was or perhaps he didn''t reveal. It''s not in my notes but just mentioned it. He''ll let me know what they decide.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-16 11:20:58', '2021-11-16 11:20:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079690053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594002', 'Guy Ralfe', NULL, 'I contacted Belinda as they put their routing in twice.  I sent the Payment update form out to her to fill out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-16 11:11:36', '2021-11-16 11:11:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079690048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529151', 'Sherry Marriner', NULL, 'Members $25 enrollment fee declined.  I left VM for her and will send her out the payment update form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-16 11:09:15', '2021-11-16 11:09:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079743003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079737009', 'Kari Riley', NULL, '11-16-21 Kari almost enrolled in Cigna again until she saw the $17,400 mop for the family and hit the panick button. She then went back to the CARE+ option and agrees that''s much better even though she will be paying about $100 more per month but will save thousands if something bad happens. She was also referred by Christina Bremner who is very happy with her membership. She is not self-employed so CARE+ best. She has to get a special sonogram and ultrasound every year which is above and beyond mammogram bc of dense breasts. She had to pay for $400 of it on her own last year bc anything beyond the mammo is considered diagnostic. She was forced to get the mammo first before she can get the other tests. With CARE+ she can likely skip the mammo and go straight to the extra tests since she will be paying for it on her own at the cash price. I instructed her to get help from the Concierge Team before she goes in to get the highest quality care at the best price locally. She will. She also wants Premarin Cream which Cigna wouldn''t cover and it costs about $400. Through WorldMedRX its about $105 incl shipping for 1 tube. She can make it last for 2 months if needed to bring cost down to $50 a month. She''s been using more natural cream instead for the past year and it''s working ok.  Otherwise, no other pre-x. Just kids are climbers, skiers, etc. So, mostly worried about a sporting accident than anything. Paying $1000 instead of $8550 is much better! She is enrolled for Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-16 10:57:16', '2021-11-16 10:57:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079694008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442111', 'Sarah Getzelman', NULL, 'Sarah called for help finding a facility in the PHCS network- I found it listed in the network and told her that she needed to confirm with the provider that the provider is currently participating in the PHCS network. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-16 10:33:11', '2021-11-16 10:33:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079690043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079737009', 'Kari Riley', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-16 10:28:33', '2021-11-16 10:28:33'),
