  ('zcrm_1579374000079690013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079660001', 'Janice Higgs', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-16 08:47:11', '2021-11-16 08:47:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079690008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809288', 'Therese McCarthy', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request citing the fact that there are no participating providers in her area in HI.  I will notify Zion &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-16 08:02:08', '2021-11-16 08:02:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079694003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118192', 'Charlotta Sakers', NULL, 'John called to get a summary of his plan, I told him that the only summary available was the one that was sent to him after he had his Welcome call with Vanessa, and that I would be happy to resend it again.  He thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-16 07:46:24', '2021-11-16 07:46:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079690003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937091', 'Brandi Nelson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel her after less than a month.  Notify Zion and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-16 07:36:12', '2021-11-16 07:36:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079646073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714162', 'Christine Lair', NULL, 'Christine called for help finding a family medicine or internist doctor''s in her area.  I sent her links from healthgrades.com and went over the self pay process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-16 07:20:27', '2021-11-16 07:20:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079646068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937123', 'Tracey Nauright', NULL, 'sent prescription quote results as member requested. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-16 07:03:47', '2021-11-16 07:03:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079646063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740100', 'Rossana Johnston', NULL, '11-15-21 Rossana thinks she wants to get out of the health sharing options and go back to regular ins. We are talking on Wed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-15 18:14:56', '2021-11-15 18:14:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079662013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065731070', 'Carolyn Whitus', NULL, 'Carolyn called with mult questions:  

1)  Her reg ck up thru Planstin, the dr sugg she see a cardiologist for testing.  They sugg a  dr & we looked on HCBB, the dr is listed as high quality, but using most exp facilities (but she lives in a small town & they have very little available, so she understands why they are expensive). 

 2)  We went over how to handle the ''need'' should it go over her $2500 IUA & to submit both detailed invoices and proof of pymt before 6mos from orig diag last week..  Sent her template for submitting ''needs'' to Zion.  

3)  We also discussed changing from cc to EFT for their mo contribution to save the cc charge.  Sent her Patti''s chg in pymt templated.  

4)  & finally we discussed going to 1k IUA for FUTURE ''needs'', pricing difference, & that may not be available until her anniv date (but call to start process end of March 2022) & would only be on future items.  She was unaware of how the IUAs work.  That w/an ongoing ''need'' you only pay once, not annually, etc.    

She seemed very happy when we got off the phone.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-15 17:04:04', '2021-11-15 17:04:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079646052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912017', 'Stephen Padwe', NULL, '11-15-21 Stephen and 3 kids want to join plus biz partner Ryan as single member. They are 50/50 partners in LLC and soon to be S-Corp. No pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. Stephen did price out for a family of 5 not long ago and it was $2500 per month with UHC! So, SECURE $1000/$495 EC is delightful. He understands the true cost of service bc of litigations he''s involved in for his work. He wants to set up a group of 2. But, since we''re past the group deadline and there''s no difference in price, he''s fine with paying both separately through biz account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-15 17:03:46', '2021-11-15 18:05:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079662008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, 'Aine called.  She wanted to know how to submit items to Zion from her Urgent Care visit for her back.  Sent her the ''Submitting a need to Zion'' template.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-15 16:22:16', '2021-11-15 16:22:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079646047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079827006', 'Ritesh Prajapati', NULL, '11-15-21 Ritesh was ready to enroll in Oscar Bronze but he hadn''t taken the time to look into CARE+. He decided he should ask his Father-In-Law to look at that part too since he''s a doctor. I told Ritesh he may not have heard of it but it would be good for him to learn and get his opinion. He forwarded the rest of the information I sent along. Instead of $8550 exposure he''s only have $1000 per Need plus other benefits. We are meeting again on Wed. to finalize this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-15 16:20:16', '2021-11-15 16:20:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079662003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974189', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, 'Phone rang briefly, then stopped.  Called back the # (it is linked to Jennifer Rulon) and the gal said, thanks for calling back, but I realized I didn''t mean to call and laughed.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-15 16:10:34', '2021-11-15 16:10:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079646039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010760035', 'Amanda McCracken', NULL, '11-15-21 I am recommending KP Select CO Gold 2000/20 for Amanda  at $600.35. The Silver plans aren''t better and they are more expensive weirdly this year. "My situation is this: Dave and I will sign the marriage license (FINALLY) the first of January. He got a full time job that started this week. I will remain on a Kaiser plan *if* I can find a comparable Kaiser plan (that includes both Moorea and me) to the one I''m on now that costs less than $878/month. That''s how much extra it will cost Dave each month to add Moorea and me to his Cigna insurance plan. Otherwise, I''ll switch to Cigna." She just takes on occasion generic version of Adderall.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-15 15:38:02', '2021-11-15 15:40:55'),
