  ('zcrm_1579374000079646029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079653027', 'Danielle Brossart', NULL, '11-15-21 Completed enrollment for Cigna Connect Flex Gold 2250 $926.26 and paying full cost. Planning for maternity this year and prefers to do so with regular ins. Then they will explore MCS next year after the hopeful birth of a new child. All set for 2022! Also chose Cigna Dental Family + Pediatric for $63.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-15 14:45:50', '2021-11-15 14:45:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079617093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060856001', 'Jerry Dodge', NULL, 'Jerry called to do his Welcome Call. I gave him some information but also advised him to schedule a welcome call to get more in depth information about his plan. I sent him a new welcome call scheduler. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-15 14:44:30', '2021-11-15 14:44:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079617088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079659002', 'George Hasrouni', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-15 14:27:43', '2021-11-15 14:27:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079592033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077989104', 'Heather Strazinsky', NULL, 'Heather called to request copies of her Planstin card, I requested these on her behalf her via Slack. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-15 14:21:22', '2021-11-15 14:21:22'),
