  ('zcrm_1579374000079592023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590075', 'Jason Adams', NULL, 'Dawne called upset that she couldn''t submit bills to Sedera for sharing- I explained that she hasn''t had Sedera since last year, explained that she has Zion Health and sent her their needs submission form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-15 13:29:59', '2021-11-15 13:29:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079646024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004455005', 'Carleen Andersen', NULL, '11-15-21 Carleen''s income will be about the same in 2022. So, we left her account alone and she was happy with her current Cigna Connect Flex Silver 5500 with $0 ded due to CSR. Full cost is $331.70, APTC is $258.06 and her cost is $73.64. All set for 2022! She said, "This is the first time it pays to be poor!" :-)  She''s happy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-15 13:07:53', '2021-11-15 13:07:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079592018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032070', 'Danielle Hatch', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-15 12:42:19', '2021-11-15 12:42:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079617078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079652001', 'Murvedete Fort', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-15 12:33:26', '2021-11-15 12:33:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079646016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045454012', 'Laura Hanssen', NULL, '11-15-21 Laura chose to stay with Athem after I let her know the RMHP/UHC network for Individual plans is different and far more limited than for Group plans. She chose to stay with their Anthem Bronze Pathway X HMO 7050 for HSA at $1890.72 with APTC of $840.24. Their cost is $1050.48. I auto-renewed their plan for 2022. She will keep an eye on their payments into 2022. All Set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-15 12:29:25', '2021-11-15 12:30:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079617073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072471025', 'Diane Wagner', NULL, 'Member called with questions about cancelling.  She will be going on employer coverage and want to ask about just keeping husband and 1 child on.  Told her they would have to re-enroll since she (primary)was cancelling.  Advised her that Pre-ex would start over if they re-enroll. I will send her out Cancellation request.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-15 12:27:21', '2021-11-15 12:27:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079592013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007369033', 'James Sorensen', NULL, 'James called for help in knowing how to use his plan- he has a few needs going on now and I encouraged him to submit the bills to Zion Health for sharing.  I sent the Zion needs submission form, a welcome call scheduler, and a link and instructions on how to get set up with HCBB. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-15 12:21:25', '2021-11-15 12:21:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079617068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595009', 'Michael Sanford', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-15 12:10:30', '2021-11-15 12:10:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079592008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077830054', 'Rocco Fana', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-15 12:09:18', '2021-11-15 12:09:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079617063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, 'Julie called because she had questions regarding her billing of her well woman''s visit and why RCI did not pay the bill. She then submitted the bill to Sedera because she thought that Sedera would pay it instead of RCI. I warm transferred Julie to RCI to discuss this matter. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-15 12:07:56', '2021-11-15 12:07:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079617058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078805002', 'Vicki Delgado', NULL, 'received cancellation request.  I will notify Zion &amp; refund $125', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-15 11:19:03', '2021-11-15 11:19:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079646011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079897013', 'Shawn Weiman', NULL, '11-15-21 Shawn will try to get names of prescriptions from his wife for me to price out for them. They cost about $200 total but she''s not eager to share what they are or what they are for. He will work on it and get back to me in a day or so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-15 11:09:15', '2021-11-15 11:09:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079646003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066564382', 'Gregg Wurtz', NULL, '11-15-21 Gregg is confident with his back issues as resolved. He had a back fusion done 1 year ago and no further problems, no treatments since. He''s 80%-90% healed. He understands it''s considered pre-x and no sharing in the first year. He''s willing to take the risk because his current ins is $819 a month with around an $8500 ded and mop $8500 which is useless in his mind. Plus he can''t use it in MT or Mexico. He and Holly file taxes together now. They live in MT 50%, Boulder 10% and Mexico 40% of the time. I told them if/when they do a colonoscopy to do it here in Boulder with with the card in the network.  Holly will get her NP to join the network for her next annual wellness visit. She didn''t understand that part and paid cash on her own for wellness. Greg also had a skin thing removed and I told him to check his records and ask dr. to clear it as best as possible for anything in future. Told him my own experience with dermatology. He wants to be added to Holly''s membership for a Dec. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-15 10:56:56', '2021-11-15 10:56:56'),
