  ('zcrm_1579374000079592003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737213', 'Debra Leech', NULL, 'Debra called to update her payment information- Jennifer sent her a payment info update form because my CRM wasn''t working. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-15 08:45:52', '2021-11-15 08:45:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079580003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937273', 'Amy Ruggeri', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-15 07:41:11', '2021-11-15 07:41:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079517028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176659017', 'Candace Lucas', NULL, '11.12.21:  Recvd. 2 emails from Candace. Concerned about pre-x conditions and catastrophic care.  Answered her questions.  Told her she doesn''t need an extra catastrophic plan with MCS.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-14 11:19:57', '2021-11-14 11:19:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079558028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064401013', 'Sarah Nolan', NULL, '11-12-21 I spoke with Vanessa on 11-8-21 to get Sarah and Kris connected to me as Broker with BOR form I sent back last Jan. of 2021. I spoke with Bree today and she confirmed they received all of the paperwork needed to process it. They were originally working towards a resolution by Dec. 1st commission. But, now she says it takes 2-4 weeks, meaning I will not likely see the commission adjustment until Jan. of 2022. I sent BOR for both Sarah and Kris bc they had separate memberships even though one family. The ZenDesk email they sent to me earlier this week did not arrive. She asked her supervisor to resend it. The email tkt # is 147514. Both Reps were super nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-12 16:06:14', '2021-11-12 16:06:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079558023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050129', 'Xavier Nogue', NULL, '11-12-21 I wasn''t notified of this cancellation. I just found the cancellation form. He says he found something cheaper. He was paying $203 with SDHC. I can''t beat that price. CARE+ at $215/$1000 or $175/$2500 is best. Guessing he got a subsidy. Sent him an email just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-12 15:58:27', '2021-11-12 15:58:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079558018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081505001', 'Kristen Schulz', NULL, '11-12-21 Denise is helping Kristen to enroll for 2022. Kristen might qualify for Medicaid. Denise will let me know when she completes the application.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-12 15:37:51', '2021-11-12 15:37:51'),
