  ('zcrm_1579374000079512028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206164', 'Dena Traxler', NULL, 'Dena called in because she had not received her Planstin cards that Kelly Anne had requested on 10/19/2021. I reached out to Desiree and Jordan via slack and come to find out there was an issue on their end regarding Dena''s file. All should be good per Desiree and Dena''s cards are on their way. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-12 14:17:15', '2021-11-12 14:17:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079512023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670268', 'Andrew Braudis', 'New Plan eff 12/1/2021', 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-12 14:11:16', '2021-11-12 14:11:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079512018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670268', 'Andrew Braudis', NULL, 'Member requested plan upgrade from Care + to Secure eff 12/1/2021. I emailed signature page to member to complete process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-12 14:10:30', '2021-11-12 14:10:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079558013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079827006', 'Ritesh Prajapati', NULL, '11-12-21 Ritesh is 32, healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, no meds. He doesn''t do annual wellness visits and he''s a W2 employee. His wife is almost 30 and somehow on her dad''s ins still which doesn''t make sense. Household income is $200K, so not APTC.  He used to work for Home Depot and still paid $360 mo for ins. DOB 10/2/89 and Kayla is 06/17/92. I sent him samples of Bronze and Silver $0 ded plans and Gold plans. Also sending him video for CARE+ and overview to educate him. He wants to share it all with a doctor friend who will help him.  Meeting again on Monday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-12 14:08:16', '2021-11-12 14:08:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079512013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075397002', 'Scott Tallman', NULL, 'Member submitted change request  to remove dependent Nelson eff 12/1.  I will notify Zion no price change.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-12 13:58:42', '2021-11-12 13:58:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079505033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-12 12:42:35', '2021-11-12 12:42:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079505028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079409010', 'Julie Macki', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-12 12:36:52', '2021-11-12 12:36:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079505023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '11.12.21:  Enrolled Jim today in SECURE.  Explained next steps.  Advised him to schedule a Welcome Call. Sent a "thank-you" email.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-12 12:24:43', '2021-11-12 12:24:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079558008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, '11-12-21 Sandra has $1000''s of dollars of bills bc she accidentally poured pot of coffee on her and was treated improperly at BCH! She then went to CU Anschutz and is getting treated better. She also had an excema issue earlier. She was told she qualifies for Medicaid which she was surprised about. But, earning less than $1400  a month at the moment bc she lost some clients. She is vaxxed but open to those who aren''t. She may be getting more clients soon bc she believes in freedom  of choice. We cancelled her Friday plan for 2022 since she believes Medicaid will accept her and pay all of her outstanding medical expenses which she''s thrilled about. She still wants to move back to MCS and is doing everything in her power to have a clean bill of health to do so!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-12 11:41:42', '2021-11-12 11:41:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079512008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808001', 'Glen Markham', NULL, 'Spoke with Stevie regarding the injection she is being required to receive by her doctor. We ended up agreeing that she will be speaking to Zion regarding this injection and whether or not it is shareable if it goes above her IUA. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-12 11:40:29', '2021-11-12 11:40:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079558003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079849335', 'Brian Lorch', NULL, '11-12-21 Brian and Kathy have endless questions... They need to decide what they want. They are leaning towards trad ins which is fine. Also hearing Bright Health is taking too long to get reimbursed. They keep focusing on Anthem. If they move to Western Slope we can change their plan at that point. They''ve always had group health ins and this is a brutal awakening for them. They seem too nervous to bother with SECURE.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-12 11:35:46', '2021-11-12 11:35:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079517023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078467032', 'James Fontenot', NULL, 'Spoke to member rescheduled his welcome call  for Friday, December 3, 2021 at 4:30 p.m. EST. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-12 11:19:39', '2021-11-12 11:19:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079517018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937066', 'Margaret Tiscornia', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-12 10:52:50', '2021-11-12 10:52:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079540003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, 'Member called again to say that she ended up paying almost full price for labs.  Dr. wanted to have her do additional test that she wants to wait on until all the labs come back.  She wants to know what she should do next.  

Member was instructed to reach out to the facility that will being doing the additional test and to find out what it is going to cost as a Cash Paying patient.  Once she has that figure, she was encouraged to call Zion to see if this could possibly turn into a NEEDS.  

Member was feeling relieved to at least know what direction she needs to go. (MR)', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-11-12 10:09:44', '2021-11-12 10:09:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079517013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078240001', 'Samuel Haefner', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-12 09:53:23', '2021-11-12 09:53:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079505018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '11.12.21:  Recvd. email from Cindy thanking me for following up. Said she had a few more questions but couldn''t remember them.  Responded to her email telling her not to worry, as she remembers them to email or text them to me.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-12 09:39:12', '2022-09-01 13:43:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079517008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005666920', 'Rachel Brandon', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after her start date of December 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-12 09:10:27', '2021-11-12 09:10:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079517003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032273', 'Kari Reed', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-12 08:54:03', '2021-11-12 08:54:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079512003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', NULL, 'Caterina called regarding her mammogram she had back in July. She did not call us prior to her mammogram and is now wondering why she is stuck in collections with a bill for a breast ultrasound. I explained that Planstin only covers the screening mammogram and that the ultrasound would be an out of pocket expense. Caterina was displeased and stated that these plans are way too confusing for her to bother with. I stated she would need to speak with Planstin regarding the ultrasound bill. Transferred member to Planstin. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-12 08:35:44', '2021-11-12 08:35:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079488003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212047', 'Luther Setzer', NULL, 'Luther called with MANY questions regarding prescriptions, the difference in plans. He''s very curious and asks a ton of questions, but he''s very knowledgeable about cost sharing and health insurance! He''s very satisfied with his concierge service. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-12 08:06:19', '2021-11-12 08:13:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079362043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176659017', 'Candace Lucas', NULL, '11.11.21:  Candace emailed me with more questions.  Responded to her questions and reminded her of the deadline to enroll.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-11 19:23:07', '2021-11-11 19:23:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079362038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066878165', 'Donavin Roberts', NULL, 'Kelly F let me know she sent replacement card today, so I e-mailed Stasha with the news.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-11 16:39:18', '2021-11-11 16:39:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167696', 'Rachel Weitz', NULL, '11-11-21 Rachel and Dan are set for 2022. Their 2021 didn''t show on the enrollments page until I clicked deeper and it shows up. It''s Friday Bronze Rx Copay X  at $368.01. We got them on the same Friday Bronze Rx Copay for $212.22 for 2022!  They know to make their payments ongoing and are all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-11 16:36:03', '2021-11-11 16:36:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079362033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810025', 'Kellie Stafford', NULL, 'Kellie called, they are going  to move to TX.  She wondered if she needs to change plans due to the state.  We went over everything &amp; I let her know except changing her mailing/physical address &amp; banking if that changes, she''s fine.  She will call her advisor Ronald Patterson though so he''s aware.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-11 16:24:28', '2021-11-11 16:24:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079367073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, 'Tania called in and stated that she spoke with Wendy and about labs that she needs to go to for some stomach issues that she is having. Wendy told her that she can call into here and the Concierge will help her with finding the best pricing for her.  She emailed me 2 pictures of the documents that were given to her from her provider stating what she needs to have done and what I assume the type of place she needs to go to. I let her know that it is the end of the day and I need to lock up as I am the last to leave here at the home office. But I am the very first one to get in the office in the morning and have saved her documents and will pull them up first thing when I sit down and get settled. She will be the first person I get with and send her the results she is looking for from HCBB with a green fair price facility. I will post the results and put a note about what was found and if there is anything else needed to be done.  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-11-11 14:59:02', '2021-11-11 14:59:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584125', 'Brian Schiller', NULL, '11-11-21   I explained DIRECT to Julie Wilson for her husband Brian Schiller. I sent them both the DIRECT overview email. He hasn''t had any health issues in the past 24 months. He could benefit from switching.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-11 14:17:46', '2021-11-11 14:17:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650042', 'Julie Wilson', NULL, '11-11-21 Julie is just submitting to Needs to Sedera. She has PT for a shoulder and neck pain. She''s also having sacral clicking pain in her lower back. She needs to get past those issues before we even consider making a move for her. I explained DIRECT for her husband Brian Schiller. I sent them both the DIRECT overview email. He hasn''t had any health issues in the past 24 months. He could benefit from switching.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-11 14:16:55', '2021-11-11 14:16:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079371068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079422002', 'Aaron Handler', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-11 14:11:18', '2021-11-11 14:11:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079371063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125098', 'Vaughn Stevens', NULL, 'Member submitted updated Payment info.  I will change in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-11 13:55:49', '2021-11-11 13:55:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, '11-11-21 I talked with Tania and calmed her down. She hates CirrusMD bc they couldn''t help her. Apparently she already went to a PCP and was given instructions to get an ultrasound and labs, etc. She thought she had to see a specialist to get this done and the specialists she called are months out to get an appt. I told her to call Concierge and they will help her access these tests locally at the best quality and price. No need to wait. That made her happy.  She will call them after she has all of the tests in hand that she needs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-11 13:52:36', '2021-11-11 13:52:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079371058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041664048', 'Akihito Ishiwatari', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Sedera &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-11 13:48:52', '2021-11-11 13:48:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079411013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '11.11.21:  Emailed Cindy to let her know I contacted Patti to have her husband''s name changed and Patti told me Cindy called her yesterday about the name change and Patti took care of it.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-11 13:45:36', '2021-11-11 13:45:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079367068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752138', 'Michelle Nault', NULL, 'Michelle called regarding a needs request she submitted to Zion that she just received a collections bill for. I explained to Michelle that unfortunately we do not get to see this information due to privacy laws and that she would have to speak with Zion directly. They are closed today (11/11/21) but will be open tomorrow. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-11 13:16:08', '2021-11-11 13:16:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019634002', 'Colleen Mangeot', NULL, '11-11-21 Appt set to talk with her on Nov. 19th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-11 13:12:44', '2021-11-11 13:12:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047499232', 'Varesh Patel', NULL, '11-11-21 Sent email #3 and the embedded video email separately. I think she should have all of the emails now to get her up to speed!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-11 13:05:38', '2021-11-11 13:05:38');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073002142', 'Leonard Ott', NULL, '11-11-21 Christopher (Topher) Wong just cancelled his membership bc he got a new job with ins. He''s referring his brother Clement Wong to me who drives a FedEx truck. Wife''s name is Jennifer Wong.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-11 12:58:03', '2021-11-11 12:58:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079371053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033577031', 'Margaret Thoreson', 'New Plan eff 12/1/2021', 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-11 12:28:33', '2024-07-02 12:18:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079371048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033577031', 'Margaret Thoreson', NULL, 'Member previously enrolled in PSD from 5/1/2019 to 11/30/2021.  Cancelled and re-enrolled in Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-11 12:27:54', '2021-11-11 12:27:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047577309', 'Aashiv Hari', NULL, '11-11-21 Still having email problems. I am just sending them through gmail now until system is fixed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-11 12:21:04', '2021-11-11 12:21:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062699001', 'Hilary Remacle', NULL, '11-11-21 I just auto-renewed Hilary''s Friday Bronze HSA for $394.85. She had great success with her hip surgery. She still needs a rt hip surgery and possibly another replacement in 2-5 years. She''s holding off a little to get past this one. Her cost went down this year. She''s happy. I also re-explained SECURE to her for Michael and kids. They were showing the Planstin card for everything and paying the ins price instead of the cash price. She''s going to go back to ask for cash price for some of the visits. Michael at least paid cash for a heart test and all was well.  She didn''t know about the mental health benefit and her daughter Lauren could have used it! They paid thousands of dollars for therapy bc of broken foot and covid was depressing to Lauren.  She now knows the value of MPB and Concierge service as well. Feeling better about the membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-11 12:15:51', '2021-11-11 12:15:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047499232', 'Varesh Patel', NULL, '11-11-21 Resent email # 1 with Customized Site link and separate Enrollment Platform link with my signature at end.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-11 11:46:07', '2021-11-11 11:46:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056557001', 'Anders Rasker', NULL, '11-11-21 Anders went to ER for cut to lip and stitches. Zion instructed them to show Zion card for the PHCS network discounts but now it''s creating a bigger mess. They have multiple statements and bills from Planstin and Zion. They haven''t paid their $1000 yet but they don''t know who to pay and how it works. Zion has been a pain for them. This happened in Aug. and they are getting pissed. But, I don''t think they were advised well. They are getting ins rates instead of the cash price first of all.  They will send me the statements and I''ll inquire with Zion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-11 11:39:36', '2021-11-11 11:39:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047499232', 'Varesh Patel', NULL, '11-11-21 I walked Laurie through the process to review their Patient Roster. She revealed she hadn''t received any of my other emails. I am re-sending them now, Email 1-3. This will get her up to speed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-11 11:25:17', '2021-11-11 11:25:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079371043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919591', 'James Jordan', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form.  I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-11 10:25:06', '2021-11-11 10:25:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079371038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716823', 'Rae Wayne', NULL, 'member submitted cancellation as she will be turning 65.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-11 10:17:02', '2021-11-11 10:17:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079371033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079410001', 'Christopher Duncan', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-11 10:04:07', '2021-11-11 10:04:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079371028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079409002', 'Blake Sieck', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-11 10:01:10', '2021-11-11 10:01:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670268', 'Andrew Braudis', NULL, '11-11-21 Rachel completed Change Form to upgrade to SECURE for Dec. 1st start. They also added their son who is now Eliot and formerly Leah. Working towards changing his name to Eliot.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-11 09:59:26', '2021-11-11 09:59:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079371023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079397012', 'Elizabeth Williams', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA OPD Complete', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-11 09:49:20', '2021-11-11 09:49:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079411003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '11.11.21:  Recvd. email from Jim - ready to enroll.  Emailed him asking to schedule a call either today or when he is available.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-11 09:46:36', '2021-11-11 09:46:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079403046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078467032', 'James Fontenot', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail to reschedule welcome call after start date of December 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-11 09:34:17', '2021-11-11 09:34:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079403038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078805002', 'Vicki Delgado', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of December 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-11 09:28:31', '2021-11-11 09:29:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079371018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921682', 'Terry Prindiville', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will notify Zion &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-11 09:23:09', '2021-11-11 09:23:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079362028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362002', 'Deb Bear', NULL, 'Deb called and will be aging into Medicare in January. I sent her a cancellation form via email. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-11 09:04:10', '2021-11-11 09:04:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079371013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055019', 'Tim Sessler', NULL, 'Retried $25 fee with bank info provided by member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-11 08:51:15', '2021-11-11 08:51:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079403033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032313', 'Colette Krasnow', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-11 08:46:39', '2021-11-11 08:46:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079403028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076535942', 'Luanne Werstler', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-11 08:24:09', '2021-11-11 08:24:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079403023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077233034', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-11 08:16:29', '2021-11-11 08:16:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079362023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, 'Tania Dibbs called the concierge team this morning frustrated with her plan. She tried to use CirrusMD to get a referral to a GI Specialist, which is not something that they do in severe stomach issues such as Tania’s. She was very belligerent stating that this “insurance” does absolutely NOTHING for her and that she doesn’t understand why she is paying for this plan. I tried to help Tania navigate her plan, but she is insistent that she should be able to just get a referral from CirrusMD and not have to go to any PCP because she does not want to pay any money out of pocket. She is going to be reaching out to Wendy regarding changing plans and would not take any further assistance from me, stating I had no idea what I was talking about. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-11 08:16:25', '2021-11-11 08:16:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079403018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077566038', 'Todd Lesnett', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-11 08:12:50', '2021-11-11 08:12:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079403013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077623046', 'Nicholas Onken', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-11 08:08:51', '2021-11-11 08:08:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079403008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689015', 'Erica Hough', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-11 08:05:43', '2021-11-11 08:05:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079403003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077745013', 'Dustin Boone', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-11 08:01:00', '2021-11-11 08:01:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079371008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055019', 'Tim Sessler', NULL, 'I received the $25 enrollment fee back from the bank.  I spoke to member, I will send Payment update email out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-11 07:46:37', '2021-11-11 07:46:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079849335', 'Brian Lorch', NULL, '11-10-21 Spent 2 hours with them! They are interested in C4 and SECURE. They get a $1053 APTC but will still pay $500+ - $1000+ for crappy C4 plans. Brian recently lost his job and he has Cobra $2700 until the end of Nov. So, needs Dec. 1st start date. They have family of 3. He and wife are both currently 1099 contract workers and his income is very uncertain. They made about $110K in 2021, but perhaps only $5K in Dec. after lost job.  They are both generally healthy. But, Brian has an irregular heartbeat. They both sleep with oxygen bc live at 10,000 feet. Kathy has sleep apnea. She has artificial hips which were done in 2013 and 2015. No problems since. His daughter was in an accident last year and is still doing PT and chiro to help heal. She goes to school in MT now. She also needs some mental health care. I explained the pros and cons for MCS vs ins. They will decide and read everything carefully. I also discussed the HMA with them and need to send Spirit Dental also. Their eyes are good.  Brian is 62 and Kathy is 64.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-10 20:14:50', '2021-11-10 20:44:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067089037', 'Doug Durgee', NULL, '11-10-21 Doug requested to renew his plan. I was able to do so with Bright Health Bronze 5300 HSA. Full cost is $778.72 and APTC is $484.22.  They are all set moving forward. Reminding him to keep making payments ongoing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-10 19:50:10', '2021-11-10 19:50:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022969020', 'Madisen Abbott', NULL, '11-10-21  My email to Madisen per her request, "I just auto renewed it for you. You can view your enrollments and see the Bright Health Silver 5000 Rx Copay for $308.38 minus your APTC of $284.64 equals your cost at $23.74. Just make sure to continue paying from here on out. Check your account to make sure you''re successfully billed into the new year.  Otherwise, you''re all set!"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-10 19:37:40', '2021-11-10 19:37:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001696029', 'Keila Hoover', NULL, '11-10-21 Keila''s cost is $116.44 and full cost is $384.43 for Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO 200 S06. Account #1300036225.

"Thank you for enrolling!!

HOWEVER, YOUR PAYMENT INFORMATION WAS NOT ACCEPTED BY THE INSURANCE COMPANY.Please allow 48 hours for your insurance company to receive your ENROLLMENT information. You will need to contact your insurance company within 7 to 10 days to make your initial payment TO BEGIN YOUR COVERAGE and to set up ongoing payments. Please save your enrollment id: 388460280

If you want contact your carrier(Anthem Blue Cross and Blue Shield/HMO Colorado)for further assistance, please call: (855) 453-7031. Please allow at least 24 hours before calling.

An email confirmation has been sent to keila.hoover@gmail.com.

Click here to get information about vision plans.

Click here to get information about other resources including consumer protection, voter registration and other assistance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-10 17:47:50', '2021-11-10 17:49:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079367063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'Missy, yet again, e-mailed me instead of contacting her Sedera ''Need'' Coordinator asking if pymt on her colonoscopy hospital bill had been paid.  Sent an e-mail to Metzli Sanchez @ Sedera and included Missy on it as well.  Letting them both know who needs to be contacted and asking status of the pymt.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-10 16:54:03', '2021-11-10 16:54:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '11-10-21 Bobbi wants to keep her Cigna Connect Flex Gold 900 Rx Copay Gold/EPO.  Her cost $1,533.37/mo, Full Cost $1,656.08, APTC $122.71.  Enrolling now bc it didn''t give her the option to auto-enroll.  Told her to make sure she sets up payment again with Cigna. She''s inputting initial payment now. Her daughter is finishing school this year and will be starting a new job in Aug. 2022 where she will have ins. Bobbi will call me then to remove her daughter from plan.   COMPLETE now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-10 16:05:36', '2021-11-10 16:22:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079367058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066878165', 'Donavin Roberts', NULL, 'Stasha called following-up on her ''Welcome Call''.  Wanted to confirm she rec''d the Planstin card in error.  Confirmed, yes they accidentally sent that card to you inadvertently.  She also said they misplaced one of the QRCode cards.  Sent Kelly F an e-mail req a replacement w/a pict of the QRCode they do have.  Helped Stasha get into HCBB &amp; encouraged her to make sure they get CirrusMD setup for both of them, including having it on their smartphones for emergencies.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-10 16:00:59', '2021-11-10 16:00:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885009', 'Julie Hauser', NULL, '11-10-21 Julie is turning 55 soon. She''s healthy. Just going through menopause and had a rash on hand last year. Did her colonoscopy as well. She was paying $365 and price just increased to $525 moving forward. This is a self-funded plan through Clearwater Benefits and it included Planstin. BUT, her colonoscopy and telemedicine visit for the rash used up all of the funds she paid in last year which is what increased her price to $525 now moving forward. She never understood how it all worked either. Lives in Longmont, CO. She''s a realtor and SECURE is best option at $1000/$275. She just wants to talk it over with her husband and we will confirm/enroll next week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-10 14:58:24', '2021-11-18 11:34:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079337031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002724127', 'Paul DeFelice', NULL, '**please keep an eye on this member** Paul called to let me know he was told by another concierge team member in July that his urology appointment would be covered under his preventative services but that he just received a $275.00 lab bill that was not covered. This is obviously not the case, as he spoke with Kelly Anne regarding this urology appointment and she explained the reason it WAS NOT a covered preventative service. He then stated that he has NEVER spoken to anyone regarding his July urology appointment and when I stated that I was reading the notes from his conversation with Kelly Anne he backtracked. He then asked if I could call and negotiate the $275.00 bill down for him and I explained that unfortunately we do not do that, but we could have found him the best pricing in his area prior to his appointment. He is going to talk to his urologist about the bill. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-10 14:38:15', '2021-11-10 14:38:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058247082', 'Anne-Marie Marron', NULL, '11-10-21 Patti called me bc she and Jennifer were concerned since Anne-Marie wanted help with submitting a recent mammogram to Zion. They forgot that the Connected plans have some wellness visits included. The doc I have shows cap of $600 for mammogram. So, she should be fine to submit this directly to Zion and let them process it. Jennifer will instruct her to do so per Patti letting Jennifer know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-10 14:14:22', '2021-11-10 14:14:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079391003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079653027', 'Danielle Brossart', NULL, '11-10-21 We spoke with Allen at C4 to help fix her account showing 2 groups. The problem was 2 addresses showing on the account which Allen was able to push it through again and it removed the problem. Danielle is looking to get pregnant this year and prefers traditional insurance to go through the pregnancy and then possibly switch next year to MCS. It''s just a comfort level thing for her. She will let me know when she completes enrollment if she does it on her own. Looking at Cigna only with 2 gold plans or an HSA Bronze plan. She will find out the cost of pregnancy through her ob/gyn to see what makes the most sense.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-10 14:12:25', '2021-11-10 14:12:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079337026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171447', 'Dorian Merrill', NULL, 'Dorian called in regarding a screening mammogram that turned into diagnostic mammogram. She states that she was not given an order for the screening mammogram but when she called to schedule the diagnostic mammogram, she was told by the facility that she need to have an order from a PCP. She wanted to know if CirrusMD could provide that order for her and I told her that I was unsure of that but I would be happy to get her started with CirrusMD. We both agreed that her being transferred to Planstin for this answer would be the best bet. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-10 13:42:42', '2021-11-10 13:42:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079337021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061950028', 'Khrystyna Chekhlata', NULL, 'Khrystyna called regarding opening an HSA account, I advised her to speak with Michal Montes about this since that is his expertise. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-10 13:10:14', '2021-11-10 13:10:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079367053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165317', 'Melody Fairchild', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-10 11:46:49', '2021-11-10 11:46:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079367048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032092', 'Gurmit Kaur', NULL, 'Left a message with daughter. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-10 10:58:44', '2021-11-10 10:58:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079367043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032126', 'Rebecca Schiff', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-10 10:53:09', '2021-11-10 10:53:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079367038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032273', 'Kari Reed', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-10 10:49:37', '2021-11-10 10:49:37'),
