  ('zcrm_1579374000079337016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809288', 'Therese McCarthy', NULL, 'Therese called in and wanted to cancel and asked about the process and what she needs to do along with when the cancellation need to be submitted. I explained all to her and then she let me know the whole reasons on why. She is really frustrated because if she had known ahead of time before paying a few thousand dollars for this plan that NO ONE for ANY type of Preventative doctor''s are actually participating in the PHCS Network anymore or there are just none in the area that she lives in. While I was talking with her I pulled up PHCS website and looked up GP''s in her area, 0 came up, I looked Internal Medicine and 6 came up. She told me that yes she already went through this process and all 6 of them or so are not actually accepting either new patients or they no longer work with PHCS anymore. Then for OBGYN 13 came up and she said it was the same situation. She let me know that Hilo on the other side of the volcano is a no go for being able to go to a provider over there if that is an option. So that was only 1 of the 13 for the OBGYN list. Therese also let me know that she has also called Planstin and spoken to several people BUT the one girl Desiree over there was absolutely wonderful and she did a bunch of work and told Therese that she would call her back with some answers and results but that was about 2 or 3 weeks ago and Therese hasn''t gotten the call back. So all in all Therese feels like she has just thrown a lot of money away and has not been able to use any of the services that she needs to with this plan because nothing or no one participates in the network through PHCS with Planstin. That was that whole huge reason she signed up with this plan it doesn''t work for her. So I told her that I will personally call the list of 6 people for the Internal Medicine and the 12 people for the OBGYN list and get some definitive answers on making 100% sure the providers and facilities are indeed participating in the PHCS Network for her. She said to make sure I call Desiree first before I go ahead and do all this work if Desiree already has, speak with her first and see what she has found out. But Therese thanked me a lot and said that is absolutely incredible that I am willing to do this for her but she still just wants to have me send her the cancellation form. She won''t submit it (I don''t think, I didn''t get a straight answer from her if she is just going to submit it anyway) until I get back to her. Which I will TODAY 100% 11/12/21/. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-11-10 10:24:51', '2021-11-10 10:24:51'),
