  ('zcrm_1579374000079371003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079737009', 'Kari Riley', NULL, '11-9-21 Kari chose me as her agent after two bad experiences with 2 other agents. I came highly recommended. Kari wasn''t able to upload her documents/death certificate. I was able to upload it. We spoke with Michael at C4 and he told us to wait 3-5 business days to see change effective. We will meet in one week to proceed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-10 09:32:41', '2021-11-10 09:32:41'),
