  ('zcrm_1579374000079337011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171242', 'Paige Cox', NULL, 'Reached out to Paige per Julia''s request. Paige had requested a virtual consultation via the website, so I reached out to answer any questions Paige may have. I did have to leave a vm. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-10 08:34:28', '2021-11-10 08:34:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079337003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811415', 'Nancy Coveleskie', NULL, 'Nancy called in regarding cardiologists in her area. She seems very confused for not only a member, but an active advisor, when it comes to the plan and how it works. Nancy wanted me to tell her how the tests work and the details of what the tests that were ordered consisted of because "she has never had to do this before". I was unfortunately unable to give her that information, as I do not know what tests the doctor ordered nor does she. I sent her a list of cardiologists in her area + a 25 mile radius. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-10 07:56:35', '2021-11-10 07:56:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079297008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442111', 'Sarah Getzelman', NULL, 'Sarah says she tried calling, but it never rang here.  I found her ''Missed Chat'' on SalesIQ and called her back.  We went over colonoscopies, preventative = Planstin, PHCS Network, present card, MD must bill & if moves to diagnostic = Zion, start a need (sent her the template), 1k IUA, etc.  Went over 3x IUAs per membership/yr.  She''s going to move her colonoscopy to Jan in case they rem polyps since her husb will also go for a colonoscopy & have his shoulder looked at in Jan = 3 IUAs if they have to do everything (she says nothing is important to get done right away.  We went over they enter their 2nd yr 1/1/22 & how pre-x step-up works (for her husb shoulder).  She knows we need time to get a possible package together for surgery if they decide he''ll need that on his should.  I suggested at least 4 weeks.  I think she was very glad I was able to walk her thru everything.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-09 18:38:12', '2021-11-09 18:38:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079293053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650042', 'Julie Wilson', NULL, '11-9-21 She''s interested in learning about new memberships.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-09 17:05:15', '2021-11-09 17:05:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079293048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001696029', 'Keila Hoover', NULL, '11-9-21 Spoke with Victoria at C4 and she suggested the zip codes might be different and turns out that was the problem. Keila will call C4 tomorrow and update her address and hopefully select Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO 5000 with $200 ded/ $700 mop with around a $116 APTC. I asked her to call or email me when finalized or if needs help. Correct zip is 80012 and old is 80210.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-09 16:54:33', '2021-11-09 16:54:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079293043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079231033', 'Beth Sanders', NULL, '11-9-21 Beth is enrolling now in SECURE $1000/$275. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-09 16:12:14', '2021-11-09 16:12:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079293038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001696029', 'Keila Hoover', NULL, '11-9-21 Changed Keila''s income to $25K. It might be more like $40K-$50K as she succeeds in 2022, but for now it''s super low. She knows to update it if/when her income increases at that point. She also needs a hysterectomy and her current Anthem Pathway x Essentials no longer includes her doctor. But, he''s still in the Anthem Pathway X HMO just not Essentials. So, she wants Anthem Pathway X Silver HMO 5000 for around $116 her cost with a $200 ded and $700 mop. But, C4 system shows the plans in the Estimator system but not in her actual account. All Pathway X plans not showing up. Must call C4.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-09 14:55:02', '2021-11-09 14:55:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079236058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068780009', 'Scott Swain', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will inform Zion &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-09 14:49:27', '2021-11-09 14:49:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079227016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042073115', 'Mailan Boris', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Andrea', 'Visit ID : 1031 Question : Hi, It''s Jane Kassel,', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-11-09 14:27:42', '2021-11-09 14:27:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079236053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, 'Spouse called in and advised me that Lowell always goes by the name "Dale" medical bills, Tax Returns etc. I spoke to Jordan @ Planstin to ask how to change this. He changed it on his end and advised when I change it and the file gets sent over it would update. I will change in Admin 123. He will also be re-sending new cards.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-09 14:12:43', '2021-11-09 14:12:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079293033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073555128', 'Raphael Joly', NULL, '11-9-21 Sent Need instructions to them and let Redirect woman know Raphael does not need to be added to any membership. His membership is different that Nathalie''s.  I talked with her and they are all set now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-09 14:02:56', '2021-11-09 14:02:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079236048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065014004', 'Carrie Ballas', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-09 13:44:38', '2021-11-09 13:44:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079256041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052659223', 'James Julian', NULL, 'Stephanie called, she would like to see a doctor to get a referral for an xray- I went over the self-pay process.  She will be contacting her old PCP for this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-09 13:26:48', '2021-11-09 13:26:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079256036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714162', 'Christine Lair', NULL, 'Christine called for help in getting her CirrusMD invitation.   I was able to send her one.  She thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-09 12:30:05', '2021-11-09 12:30:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079297003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974301', 'Gerardo Garcia', NULL, 'Talked w/Jessica.  First her husband is having back issues.  She doesn''t think he''s ever talked to a dr about it, but knows it could be pre-x since they just started 10/1/21.  Went over how it works if it is pre-x.  Then, he was curious about alternative care for it.  Let her know all alt care requires pre-approval & helped her find the blog for a July post on Alternative Care: what you need to know.  She understands a qualified ''need'' must be part of the scenario for any form of sharing.    Next, they are looking at getting pregnant in the next year or two.  Let her know there is a required waiting period of 60-days, but she said it should be further out than that.  Sent her curr Maternity Guidelines, then helped her find them online since they could chg between now & when they decide to have a baby.    She was very happy when we got off the line.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-09 12:15:35', '2021-11-09 12:15:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079256031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029337149', 'Michael Taylor', NULL, 'Amberlee called wanting to know how to submit her bills to Zion- I sent her the Zion needs submission form, also added her email address. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-09 12:12:53', '2021-11-09 12:12:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079256026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811415', 'Nancy Coveleskie', NULL, 'Nancy called because she isn''t feeling well and suggested that she go to an urgent care to get an ekg done.  I went over the self-pay process with her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-09 12:05:35', '2021-11-09 12:05:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079293028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659598', 'Christina Bremner Anderson', NULL, '11-9-21 I called her and she''s joining her boyfriend''s plan through his company now as a domestic partner. She says she''s referred a lot of people to me, but I haven''t seen them. I told her to send a 3-way email to me and her friend and she can earn $100 if they join! She was psyched and appreciates all of my help. She likes MPB but sounds like his ins is decent.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-09 11:43:36', '2021-11-09 11:43:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079293023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238273', 'Jennifer Bradfield', NULL, '11-9-21 They are considering SECURE or CARE+ and possibly HMA or just fund HSA. He read the 58 pages of the Sharing Guidelines and will read the ACA compliant wellness items from gov site as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-09 11:30:14', '2021-11-09 11:30:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079293018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030990050', 'Michael Fargano', NULL, '11-9-21 Michael used the auto-renew feature to keep his plan Cigna Connect Flex Silver 5500.  Full cost is $876.23 and his APTC is $795.66. His cost is $80.57. He''s all set for 2022.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-09 11:25:22', '2021-11-09 11:25:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079236043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, 'Cindy called in and asked about changing husband Lowell''s name on the membership to Dale after she received Planstin/Zion cards.  I sent her out the Change form and asked her to note in the "Comments" section the change of name.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-09 11:17:13', '2021-11-09 11:17:13'),
