  ('zcrm_1579374000079293008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047499232', 'Varesh Patel', NULL, '11-9-21 I sent Laurie the instructions to login to Admin123 since I just enrolled my first OPD member into Family Practice of Winter Park with Dr. Varesh Patel.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-09 10:44:00', '2021-11-09 10:44:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079236038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068780009', 'Scott Swain', NULL, 'Member called in letting me know that he will be getting medical in eff 12/1.  I will send out Canc link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-09 10:41:11', '2021-11-09 10:41:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079236033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 OPD Complete', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-09 10:35:46', '2021-11-09 10:35:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079293003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '11-9-21 Quentin happily signed up for OPD at $299/$1000 down from his Bridge Worksite of $344. He''s been trying to get into a primary care dr for 1 1/2 years now and they always try to charge fees for his annual wellness visit, so he''s done with them. He''s thrilled to have unlimited access to Dr. Varesh Patel for wellness and same day or next day visits. He''s healthy, no pre-x, just wants to get his annual physical done. He lives in Maitland which is just north of Winter Park, FL. He joined Family Practice of Winter Park. There was nowhere to indicate the Advisor working with the client. I have a call into John.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-09 10:28:54', '2021-11-09 10:28:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079256021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059281121', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, 'Laura called, she wanted to know if a dermatology visit was a covered expense with her Planstin card, I explained that dermatology visits are not mandated by the ACA, therefor not covered by her Planstin card.  I went over the self-pay process.  She is going to cancel her dermatologist appointment because she thinks it''s "ridiculous" that we do not cover something that should be preventative. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-09 10:07:14', '2021-11-09 10:07:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079256016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066507023', 'Michelle Halligan', NULL, 'I gave Michelle a call because Julia had told me that she was reaching out for help via SalesIQ.  She just wanted to know if she needed to go to any doctor in particular- (in-network)  I explained that she only needed to adhere to the PHCS network for her preventative care.  For everything else I went over the self-pay process.  I sent her the preventative care template so she could have the PHCS link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-09 09:35:03', '2021-11-09 09:35:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079236028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079197021', 'Kristyn Galey', NULL, 'I received a email from Karen Torsoe explaining that prospect input the wrong last name "Palmer" asked if I could change.  I change the last name , however we will have to monitor Planstin/Zion invoice for correctness.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-09 09:34:14', '2021-11-09 09:34:14'),
