  ('zcrm_1579374000079201054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167696', 'Rachel Weitz', NULL, '11-8-21 Rachel and Dan are happy with Friday and want to renew. Their plan can''t auto renew. It looks like Emunah may qualify for CHP+ but there are a few more questions to answer that I can''t answer. Setting up call with them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-08 19:46:57', '2021-11-08 19:46:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079150083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257237', 'Ken Bechtel', NULL, 'Kenneth called wanting to know what is &amp; is not cov on his prev Planstin plan.  Asked specifically about labs.  Sent him the Prev Care template that includes the link to see what''s included.  Also mentioned that if labs not on list, good to have dr include on invoice coded as prev as it often comes back at a discounted rate.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-08 18:42:41', '2021-11-08 18:42:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079150078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079422002', 'Aaron Handler', NULL, 'Long conversation with Aaron.  Sent him e-mail with Memb Guidelines &amp; Principles, 9.5 min video, etc.  He just dropped-off his Cobra and it sounded like he wanted coverage right away.  Asked him about 12/1/21 though.  We have plans to talk again after he watched the video.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-08 18:39:58', '2021-11-08 18:39:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079201044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079897013', 'Shawn Weiman', NULL, '11-8-21 Shawn is 53 and wife CJ is 60. Both are healthy, no pre-x, except wife takes one med for something non-critical. No tobacco. Shawn is self-employed and wife W2. They are paying $900 now with a small subsidy and high ded/mop. They like SECURE $1000/$500. Thinks this sounds really good especially since they don''t know their income for 2022 as self-employed. He will look it over and we are meeting on Thursday to finalize.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-08 17:14:29', '2021-11-15 11:05:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079201036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073555128', 'Raphael Joly', NULL, '11-8-21 Nathalie called on Friday late and left vm that Raphael was in the hospital after getting hit by a car!!!  She wanted to understand if they were protected and what to do. I just left her 2 vms to give her instructions as to how to handle it as a self-pay patient. A social worker was on her way to meet with them. 
UPDATE! I talked with Nathalie and Raphael was in Chicago for a 3-day weekend with his friends for Halloween. He was crossing the road to get some tacos when a car hit him at about 100 MPH! They first thought he''d have to have both legs amputated but fortunately not the case. He has an iron rod in the bottom of his rt leg. The tibia was sticking out through the skin. He broke his collar bone but they are recommending to let it heal on its own. His face hit the concrete on his left side and needs tons of stitches outside and in his mouth. Left eye is offset and now he''s seeing double or blurry. He lost 4 teeth at the root. Also, having memory shortages that may be weeks or months. They believe he will get his memory back. He''s young. OMG! I coached Natahlie and I''ll send her the instructions to submit a new Need.  She was calm and I''m thankful she pressed Raphael to finally sign up. If it wasn''t for her, he wouldn''t have any protection. He''d be without ins or MCS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-08 15:53:26', '2021-11-08 16:04:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079201031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, '11-8-21 Dave forwarded his proof of cancellation with LHS for Nov. 30th 2021. He''s all set moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-08 15:16:11', '2021-11-08 15:16:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079201026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064873001', 'Sherry Marriner', NULL, '11-8-21 Sherry emailed me. She was a member previously and is now self-employed again and wanting a membership again. 

"Hi Wendy,
I am writing to you in regards to my past insurance policy with MPowered (see below0 , which I cancelled on June 1, 2021, when I was unemployed and able to obtain a lower priced insurance policy.  I am now once again an independent contractor with Frosch Travel Agency, and am in need of an individual insurance plan again.  I am looking to find insurance coverage that would start January 1, 2022, and am hoping that you can help me.  Would it be possible for you to get in touch with me, and let me know what policies would be available through you, and what their coverages and rates would be. These past few months I had Dr. appointments to make sure that my health is on track, and also had a colonoscopy, which was recommended since I turned 60.  All of my tests and colonoscopy came out excellent, which I can provide for you if necessary.
Thank you for your assistance, and I look forward to hearing from you (either by email, or by phone contact at 303-915-9660).
Kind Regards,
