  ('zcrm_1579374000079150073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060844042', 'Roland Doucette', NULL, 'I am currently working on a script quote for Rhonda but I am waiting for her verification on one of the medications as I could not find the dosage on any site. I emailed Rhonda on 11/8/2021, once I receive her verification I will be reaching out to Reid for quotes on 2 of her 4 medications as they are quite expensive in the states. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-08 14:23:41', '2021-11-08 14:23:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079201013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049144002', 'David Rubine', NULL, '11-8-21 We were able to renew their Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO 5000 for $704.18 for 2022. Income expected to be similar.  Just slight increase  cost to them. David will be aging into Medicare in Nov. of 2022. They are all set and happy to be keeping plan now with APTC of $1376.38.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-08 14:17:55', '2021-11-08 14:17:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079150068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075243056', 'Elizabeth Baker', NULL, 'Elizabeth is having issues logging in to her CirrusMD account. She reached out to CirrusMD support and has not heard anything back as of yet. I reached out to CirrusMD support on her behalf and let her know that as soon as I hear back from them I will reach out via email. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-08 13:56:46', '2021-11-08 13:56:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079204021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885002', 'Pamela DeVos', NULL, '11:08.21:  Brian emailed.  After researching all the features of all the plans, he feels he and his wife (who wants to keep her own PCP, will be best suited for CARE PLUS.  Emailed him back and agreed. Suggested he enroll at his earliest convenience, as it is busy during Open Enrollment and he will not want to wait until the deadline of the 20th.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-08 13:42:41', '2021-11-08 14:41:09'),
