  ('zcrm_1579374000079201008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083258001', 'Jonathan Atwell', NULL, '11-8-21 Jonathan lives in Grand Junction area and is getting a divorce now. He has his ins through soon to be x-wife. He''s healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco, self-employed with own handyman biz. He can play with the amount of income he shows with his write-offs, etc. But, needs to show enough to get a loan for house, etc. So, MCS may be better to avoid problems on that front. He''s interested in SECURE for HSA compliance and might do wellness. Will send CARE+ too to see cost difference. Guessing he will make $40K in 2021 and more likely $60K in 2022.  DOB 5/28/81, 81507.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-08 13:23:57', '2021-11-08 13:23:57'),
