  ('zcrm_1579374000079150043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073951215', 'Gayle Johnson', NULL, 'Gayle called in with concerns regarding the second part of her torn retina surgery. She stated that she has not heard anything back from Zion besides wanting a letter from the doctor deeming it medically necessary. She then asked if we and Zion are reputable companies and I explained that we are and offered to warm transfer her to Zion since I cannot explain the reasoning for their decision. I warm transferred Gayle to Zion. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-08 10:47:23', '2021-11-08 10:47:23'),
