  ('zcrm_1579374000079064049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '11.06.21:  Emailed Cindy thank you and got responses to her questions about the HSA and membership cards.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-06 14:38:24', '2021-11-06 14:38:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079064043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, '11.06.21:  Got lead from my click funnel.  Sean is looking or info. about plans for himself, wife and 5 children.  He and his wife started a business.  Getting out of COBRA and wants a non-insurance-based plan.  Likes SECURE because they can use their HSA.  Daughter is going for physical therapy for shoulder pain - nothing diagnosed.  3 years ago had an injury to her elbow from basketball.  Explained SECURE plan.  Said he''ll discuss all w/his wife, Amy, and schedule another mtg. w/me to ask questions and asked what next steps were to enroll - explained the process.  Emailed Sean my link and guidelines.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-06 14:34:32', '2021-11-19 12:21:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079022131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069438001', 'Beth Blacker', NULL, '11-5-21 Renewed her plan on C4 with simple renew system. Full cost is $817.98 and APTC is $323.88. Cigna Connect Flex Gold 900 Rx Copay Gold/EPO. All set moving forward. Her cost is $494.10.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-05 17:12:29', '2021-11-05 17:12:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079022126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, '11-5-21 Elizabeth and Dan both have some health things now. She has a lung issue that had been dormant for 15 years and now with the smoke from the fires and possible exposure to covid something has flared up. She just has some tests which cost about $1400 and she will do 2x moving forward. Dan has a possible shoulder surgery. Did an MRI and is trying PCP which I think she meant PRP. But, likely to need surgery soon. They will remain on PSDHC. Never used it before and will call Concierge for assistance in submitting Need and knows now to ask for Super Bill.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-05 16:28:00', '2021-11-05 16:28:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079022121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '11-3-21 Quentin Green called to ask questions about his retired female friend who is paying $2200 a month now for her health ins! She does have a design biz on the side and is licensed as a wholesale reseller. She might be able to qualify with this. Quentin will send me docs to see if it will work. We also priced out Myrbetriq 50 mg 30 tablets which was expensive on GoodRX. BUT, it turned out to be about $81 a month with World MedRX! I sent him that information.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-05 16:04:09', '2021-11-05 16:04:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079064038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530449', 'Emily Jaynes', NULL, 'Abrazo Campus = Hosp in Scottsdale, AZ?  Gal called saying the man gave her a card w/our # & wondered if he has coverage for his hernia operation.  He orig gave them his RCI card, which they called & found out surgery is not on that plan.  Because of privacy:  I asked her to call Sedera (& told her the member should have or might need to start a ''need'' for them) to look at his surgery.  Gave her their # & suggested she try them.  This member obviously does not understand his program at all!    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-05 15:34:24', '2021-11-05 15:34:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079022116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937091', 'Brandi Nelson', NULL, '11-5-21 Brandi wants to cancel her own membership, her Active Advisor status and E&amp;O after only one month! I am asking if she wants to become a referring member. She might be in a financially bad situation. She wants something even cheaper! We played phone tag and I sent her a long email now...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-05 15:25:05', '2021-11-05 15:25:05'),
