  ('zcrm_1579374000079022106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '11-5-21 Enrolled in SECURE $1000/$685 EF and waived $100 for already a member with MPB. Cancelled Co-Pay Plan as well that was $799.  Kristen is incredibly appreciative about our company and membership! She''s a huge healthcare researcher and has been self-employed since 2010 and went through the whole ACA process which was a nightmare. They were going to have to pay $2200 a month for their family for a family who is healthy. She''s thrilled to have the stability of the MCS solution and loves MPB!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-05 12:34:10', '2021-11-05 12:34:10'),
