  ('zcrm_1579374000079046042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078963251', 'Denise Schulz', NULL, '11-3-21 Chose Bright Health Silver 3000 for 2022. She wants wellness plus possible ENT visits and testing for allergies. She gets a $565.97 APTC with $29K income. She was paying $425/$2500 for SECURE EC. But, she will remove her 21 year old daughter who will file her own taxes and likely qualify for Medicaid now as well.  She''s happy to have co-pays for specialist visits now. She will cancel MPB between Nov. 20th and Dec. 20th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-04 16:28:46', '2021-11-04 16:28:46'),
