  ('zcrm_1579374000079064028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078467032', 'James Fontenot', NULL, '11.04.21:  Barry emailed and called.  Told his employer about SECURE and she is interested in it to offer her employees and she is going to pay some of Barry''s monthly share fee.  Tell Barry he would be able to select SECURE if he gets this plan through his employer.  She currently has Samaritan, so she is familiar w/MCS.  She asked Barry for info. on SECURE. I told him I would like to schedule a call w/her to discuss her needs.  He said he would relay the message.  I emailed him to give her my click funnel link so she could watch the video and read about the plans before we talk.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-04 16:27:31', '2021-11-04 16:27:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079046029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079231033', 'Beth Sanders', NULL, '11-4-21 Beth is with Kaiser now and hates regular insurance, doesn''t qualify for subsidy this year and already self-pays for everything since ded''s are so high. She does annual wellness visits and is self-employed photographer. SECURE $1000/$275 looks best. She wants to watch video one more time and review information I send and she will connect with me at 4:00 on Nov. 9th to enroll. She''s thrilled for this option. Healthy, no meds, no tobacco.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-04 16:18:21', '2021-11-04 16:18:46'),
