  ('zcrm_1579374000079064008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005605277', 'Diane Harper', NULL, 'Diane called to ask what the $50 charge every month was from us. I explained everything that is included that she gets and said said that she hasn''t ever used any of that before and doesn''t think she will and wants to cancel. I explained the process and sent her the cancellation email with the link to the online form. I told her to get that back into us today as the payment is set to come out tomorrow as it is the deadline. She said she definitely will, as she had to cancel the credit card that is on file because she got fraudulent charges on her account and she saw the $50 charges every month for the last 6 or 7 years so that is why she called to find out what it was all about and what was included. Email is sent just waiting for it back and Patti will cancel her out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-11-04 13:06:07', '2021-11-04 13:06:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079046021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047526542', 'Mehr Rahmatullah', NULL, '11-4-21 Johanna and I logged into their Patient Portal to view their Patient Roster. She''s all set on that front and PWD is MPower12345. They will gladly display the 3-minute video on their monitor if we connect with Patient Point who puts the content on their screen. Joan was working on this at the end of Aug. and it looks like it got dropped. I''ve emailed Joan to revisit this to complete. Johanna says they don''t have their own website so they can''t put the badge or link anywhere. She will send out the3-minute video to potential clients. They are getting questioned about options for ins from their patients now that it''s open enrollment. I''m sending them business cards now as well. Plus I will send email #3 to give them the additional links, videos and flyers.  They also sent me their employee roster with name and title and they want the OPD name tags! I just sent that off to Ali to work on making.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-04 13:02:11', '2021-11-04 13:17:12'),
