  ('zcrm_1579374000079001018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075438002', 'Christopher Brenner', NULL, 'member called for a list of homeopathic doctor''s in his area, I sent him a list from healthgrades.com. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-04 12:41:25', '2021-11-04 12:41:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079064003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '11.4.21:  Cindy called me.  Found my name and click funnel through Facebook reviews by member Pamela (Brian) DeVos.
Interested in SECURE for M&F - has an HSA - is self-employed - has a farm.  Currently insured w/a high deductible plan for her family - of 5, boys from 9 -25 but it got much too expensive.  Has some pre-x conditions:  had thyroidectomy 7 yrs. ago - no issues, controlled w/medication; had a diagnostic mammogram in Oct. - no major issues but recommended to go again in 6 mos.  Has the beginnings of cataracts.  Cindy is ok with these conditions to sign up w/our plan.
Cindy may want to convert this plan to a group plan when her son is not eligible as a dependent any longer.  She enrolled with me today.  I made a full presentation and emailed her the guidelines. Also told her what materials to expect and to schedule a Welcome Call.
Once their membership starts Cindy want to find out if she can get either of the following meds which are very expensive:  Wegovy (just approved in June), offered at a higher dose - for diabetics but acts as an appetite suppressant; or Ozempic.  I told her we could look into World Meds or Prescription Bliss possibly.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-04 12:38:46', '2021-11-18 12:38:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079030023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919089', 'Nancy Hoglund', NULL, 'Product was updated from MPB CareZ - Worksite - Bridge (30445) to SECURE (31119', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2021-11-04 12:31:19', '2021-11-04 12:31:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079022040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-04 12:28:58', '2021-11-04 12:28:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079022035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, 'Liberty members frm 12/1/2016 to 11/1/2018', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-04 12:26:44', '2021-11-04 12:26:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079022030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078817002', 'Matthew Amelino', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-04 12:19:38', '2021-11-04 12:19:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079022025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009790025', 'Rosalynde smith', NULL, 'left VM re:cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-04 12:06:37', '2021-11-04 12:06:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079001013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005929297', 'Lana Meell', NULL, 'Lana called because she really isn''t feeling well, I told her that she could go to any provider she liked and went over the self-pay process.  I sent her the Zion needs submission form link just in case she needs it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-04 12:05:30', '2021-11-04 12:05:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079022020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065246087', 'Ann Wiley', NULL, 'Left Final VM for member re: 11/21 decline.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-04 12:03:41', '2021-11-04 12:03:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079046016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079737009', 'Kari Riley', NULL, '11-4-21 We rescheduled our appt for Wed. next week. She had her doctor visit and her scare with her health turns out to be an accessory spleen that apparently 30% of people have. It''s absolutely no issue. Therefore, she''s healthy! She started a  new Part-Time job 2 weeks ago.  Her anticipated income is $50-$60K which includes sons survivor''s benefit income.  I told her the system will calculate it and determine if it''s included in the total or not, but she will have to reveal it on the app. She thinks she wants C4, but I''m not convinced yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-04 11:53:47', '2021-11-04 11:53:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079041021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078122033', 'Lynn Ward', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco
Physical address: 957 Primrose Alley ,Telluride, CO. 81435', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-04 11:09:09', '2021-11-04 11:30:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079041016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078122033', 'Lynn Ward', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-04 11:05:07', '2021-11-04 11:05:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079040016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808001', 'Glen Markham', NULL, '**Update** Spoke to Stevie. She is reaching out to her Orthopedic Surgeon for the exact name of the surgery she is having. Once I receive that info I will reach out to HBCC on her behalf. -JTS

Tried to reach out to Stevie today regarding HCBB and her upcoming knee replacement surgery. I called the number that is on file but unfortunately there was no answer. If Stevie calls back, please transfer her to Jennifer. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-04 11:04:33', '2021-11-04 13:04:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079001008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069192234', 'Nathan Love', NULL, 'Nate called because he hurt his hand in a bicycle accident, I went over the self-pay process with him.  I sent him the Zion needs submission link so that he would have it if he needs it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-04 10:24:33', '2021-11-04 10:24:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079040011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059112004', 'Salt Garrison', NULL, 'Salt called in regarding some questions about his plan and some issues he''s been having. He would like to see a specialist and I advised Salt to speak with Zion Health because this will be something that goes over his IUA and he should open a need ASAP. Salt was very pleased with his service. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-04 09:55:24', '2021-11-04 09:55:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079046003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078459001', 'Schaana Wetzelberger', NULL, '11-4-21 Schaana is moving from PSDHC $322/$1500 to SECURE $275/$1000. She just sold their medical transport company and has a nursing license. She will register a new business with the Dept. of State for proof of self-employment. She''s super healthy, no pre-x other than high cholesterol that runs in family. Treating with medication and no problems!  Enrolled and then cancelled PSDHC. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-04 09:51:59', '2021-11-04 10:00:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079041011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077371001', 'Linda Blake', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Added secondary email as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-04 09:23:13', '2021-11-04 09:23:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079041003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078309004', 'James Skurski', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Changed secondary email as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-04 08:00:35', '2021-11-04 08:01:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079040003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005112003', 'Nathan Kemble', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  Cancelled subscription', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-04 06:25:41', '2021-11-04 06:29:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079030018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, 'John is going in for a colonoscopy (preventative) and I walked Diana through how to handle Planstin, the network (sent her the template) and what happens if it moves to diagnostic = rem of polyps.  Then went over Zion (sent template for sub need), IUA, etc.  

She is having brain fog and the dr thinks it''s due to a sinus infection.  They are deciding on course of action.  She asked about naturopathic approval, we discussed req to get alternative options pre-approved by Zion & to call them for details (they''ll need Dr plan, etc).  They also may do antibiotics, or scan her head for diagnosis ...  went over 1k IUA applicable again for this ''need'',  

Daughter also needing to discuss an IUD, her Dr not in PHCS, can she nominate the Dr for that? (told her to ck w/PHCS as they would know if/how to do that).  

They also had questions about Diana''s Dr who is changing and now charging them with a mo fee/person.  DPC?  They like having a HSA qualified plan.  

Went over a lot.  I won''t be surprised if she/they need to call again for direction.  She was very nice & asked if she needs to talk with someone again, how would she get me.  I gave her my normal evening hours.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-03 18:58:01', '2021-11-03 18:58:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079029039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881315', 'Allisyn Martin', NULL, '11-3-21 Allisyn is looking to pay for all of 2022 in 2021. I''m asking Patti about process to do so. Also asking about what happens if price increases in Oct. of 2022.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-03 16:40:38', '2021-11-03 16:40:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079029034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939370', 'Dave Sutton', NULL, '11-3-21 Dave is 55, healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco and no ins now bc it''s too expensive. He''s planning to do his annual physical as self-pay in next week or so. Therefore, he won''t need SECURE since already paying for it on own. Choosing CARE+ for the year and may upgrade next year. $1000/$215 CARE+ enrolled for Dec. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-03 16:09:07', '2021-11-03 16:09:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079029026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058609163', 'Denise Schulz', NULL, '11-3-21 Chose Bright Health Silver 3000 for 2022. She wants wellness plus possible ENT visits and testing for allergies. She gets a $565.97 APTC with $29K income. She was paying $425/$2500 for SECURE EC. But, she will remove her 21 year old daughter who will file her own taxes and likely qualify for Medicaid now as well.  She''s happy to have co-pays for specialist visits now. She will cancel MPB between Nov. 20th and Dec. 20th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-03 15:48:59', '2021-11-03 15:49:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079036003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077371001', 'Linda Blake', 'HSA Information', 'Member called the Concierge number to inquire about what documents she needed to have to set up her HSA.  Jennifer transferred over to me.  I was unable to take her call but did return her call as a follow up.  A message was left for her to call me back.  I also called a left a message for Leslie - her agent- to reach out to her as well since Leslie works for HSA America and may have already sent her the link to set her up.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-11-03 14:56:33', '2021-11-03 14:56:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079029021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078634001', 'Jennifer Johnson', NULL, '11-3-21 Jennifer Johnson is working with her agent Ginger regarding a group option. Jennifer wants to know how to complete the census and do a side-by-side comparison.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-03 14:50:50', '2021-11-03 14:50:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079029016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077643040', 'Tina Reno', NULL, '11-3-21 Email #3 sent. Platform login shared and how to use platform call complete. Open to putting video on TV in front lobby!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-03 14:05:24', '2021-11-03 14:05:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079030008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713058', 'Dena Conine', NULL, 'Hailey called.  She''s living in the dorms in Lansing & hurt her back.  Sent her a list from HCBB of Fam Med MDs in her area.  She says she has ins thru the Univ & possibly the state too.  We discussed that there is a hierarchy of how they will pay.  I told her I believe her school insurance will be considered primary, but not sure.  For her memb w/us:  say you are a cash-pay pt to the 1k mark.  If some paid by other ins, but not all, then can submit once over the 1k for a need with Zion to see if they then can share the balance.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-03 13:44:58', '2021-11-03 13:44:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079030003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, 'Kimi called back re: mammogram &amp; the PHCS Network.  She cannot find a PHCS provider within 100-miles of her home &amp; wondered what she should do.  I transferred her to Planstin so she could discuss with them.  [Note:  she lives near Vail in the CO Mtns, so there isn''t much available up there &amp; what is available is usually super expensive.]    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-03 11:27:08', '2021-11-03 11:27:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079029008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, '11-3-21 Kimberly just had a mtn bike crash on July 1st but never reached IUA and all set with PT. No further issues and not worried at all.  She had her colonoscopy this year and Chris will have his coming up next year or so. First one for both of them, no issues. No pre-x. SECURE $1000/$500 down from $574/$1500 for PSDHC.  Dec. 1st, 2021 start date. Enrolled and cancelled PSDHC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-03 11:21:04', '2021-11-03 11:23:04');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000079022013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077830004', 'Angela Coy', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-03 10:54:27', '2021-11-03 10:54:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079029003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '11-3-21 Suzanne was able to renew to Bright Health Silver 4200. Her cost $64.34 and full cost $658.59. APTC $594.25. She found new Dr. Desha Secrest that she really likes within Rocky Mountain Primary Care. They accept all major carriers as well as PHCS network and Bright Health. They do not exclude EPOs or HMOs judging from their own site and C4 doctor search.  Suzanne is taking clobetasol and estradiol vaginal cream. Both appear to be affordable and possibly generic. Looked them up on GoodRX and they are around $30 is pay cash. We left her income at $24,400 for 2022. Submitted renewal and she just needs to make sure she pays invoice moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-03 10:36:24', '2021-11-03 10:36:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079022008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077322076', 'Colin McCarthy', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-03 09:57:40', '2021-11-03 09:57:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079022003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078817002', 'Matthew Amelino', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online welcome call after start date of December 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-03 09:08:31', '2021-11-03 09:08:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000079001003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082373', 'Lawrence Sampson', NULL, 'Member cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-03 08:46:45', '2021-11-03 08:46:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078967003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077830054', 'Rocco Fana', NULL, 'No response. Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-03 08:03:21', '2021-11-03 08:03:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078899018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447191', 'Johnnie Hharriman', NULL, '10/29/21:  I must not have save my note! Jacqueline called in &amp; we couldn''t get her into  CirrusMD. 
 I sent a req to their support.

11/1/21:  Luis @ CirrusMD replied that he sent a ''reset'' pw because she is already registered.

11/2/21:  I sent Jacqueline an e-mail to make sure she knows to look for the ''Reset PW'' e-mail.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-02 17:16:53', '2021-11-02 17:17:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078899013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808001', 'Glen Markham', NULL, 'Stevie (=Stephanie) needs to have knee surgery and wanted to talk to someone about looking at negotiating the pricing.  I sent an e-mail to Kelly Anne with a time Thursday, Nov 4th, 1pm eastern, but let Stevie know to watch her e-mail &amp; phone because I don''t know Kelly Anne''s availability Thursday and she may need to adj the time, etc.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-02 16:51:04', '2021-11-02 16:51:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078899008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068022001', 'Justin Breaux', NULL, 'Michele contacted me confused because Justin is already on autopay.  Maybe he doesn''t realize it?  She''ll reach out to him tomorrow.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-02 16:48:21', '2021-11-02 16:48:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078899003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104032', 'Clove Berger', NULL, 'Clove called.  She lost her laptop &amp; needed a reminder of how to start a ''need'' for her husband.  I sent her the template for submitting a ''need'' to Zion.  She''s not sure if she already started it, so I let her know Zion would be able to see that &amp; let her know their # is also in the e-mail (plus they may still be open if she wants to try them soon).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-02 16:14:18', '2021-11-02 16:14:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078896008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041217015', 'Carl Ross', NULL, 'Member called about adding newborn daughter to plan.  I will send him out link.  Also will tell Guy to f/u with hi re: flipping to Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-02 15:18:57', '2021-11-02 15:18:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078896003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, 'Member called in to ask why her price went up.  I left VM explaining aging up &amp; email notification back on 3/10.  I gave her the option of calling in for other options', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-02 15:10:13', '2021-11-02 15:10:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078870023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032492', 'Jani Osborne', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-02 14:42:04', '2021-11-02 14:42:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078826023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076954787', 'Christopher Megroz', NULL, 'Christopher called in asking for instructions on submitting needs to Zion. I sent him the info via email. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-02 14:41:37', '2021-11-02 14:41:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078870018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032001', 'Kyle Robinson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-02 14:15:58', '2021-11-02 14:15:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078870013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838059', 'John Huie', NULL, 'John called for help in understanding his preventative care plan, I went over the process with him and sent him the preventative care template. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-02 13:25:20', '2021-11-02 13:25:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078876013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004833209', 'KayLynn Hanson', NULL, '11-2-21 Dr. Carl Hanson called me and thanked me for all of my help, time and effort! He''s on Medicare and they moved his wife to Freedom Life with a PPO. She didn''t qualify for SECURE and needed all of the wellness visits. They found Freedom Life and believe they are all set for the duration. I clicked on the Opt Out for email, so I don''t keep sending him emails that they don''t need. He was super nice! They are all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-02 13:20:22', '2021-11-02 13:20:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078826018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937123', 'Tracey Nauright', NULL, 'Tracey called in with some questions about her plan. She has never had to take care of anything that had to do with their health insurance as her ex-husband handled everything. I went over the MAP program and how to get her and her daughter''s set up along with the CirrusMD program. I also explained how to present her MEC when she finds an in-network doctor for her mammogram. She was highly satisfied with her service and asked if she could leave a 5-star review. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-02 13:08:01', '2021-11-02 13:08:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078870008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925007', 'Rani Reichow', NULL, 'Rani called to ask how to submit bills to Zion for sharing, I sent her the Zion needs submission link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-02 12:37:19', '2021-11-02 12:37:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078826013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062877001', 'Kyle Butler', NULL, 'Kyle called regarding his issues he has been having stemming from a vasectomy done in August 2021. He was also wondering why his need was denied. I explained to Kyle that I am not sure why his previous needs submission for his vasectomy was denied and that I would be happy to transfer him to Zion. Upon warm transferring Kyle to Zion, T from Zion let me know that Kyle''s need has NOT been denied and that they were actually waiting on records from Kyle''s doctors office in order to pay and close the need. I switched over to explain this information to Kyle, which he stated was a lie and that they refused to pay this need. I then recommended that I transfer Kyle over to Zion so that he can get this straightened out once and for all. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-02 11:48:46', '2021-11-02 11:48:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078826008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925007', 'Rani Reichow', NULL, 'Rani called in asking for her member number and some information as to why her preventative well woman''s visit was not covered by Planstin. I made sure that Rani verified that the visit and all services were coded preventative and she said that they were. She believes that her physicians office has the wrong member number. I warm transferred Rani to Planstin so that she could receive this information. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-02 11:45:09', '2021-11-02 11:45:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078888003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570104', 'Douglas Lynne', NULL, 'Received update Bank info I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-02 11:36:21', '2021-11-02 11:36:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078886003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077866084', 'Judith Snyder', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-02 11:25:05', '2021-11-02 11:25:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078876003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, '11-2-21 Dave and Elsa are enrolling now. I waived the $100 fee since previous clients.  They asked many great questions and are confident now. Choosing SECURE $685/$1000 and will fund the HSA.  Dec. 1st start date. We will cancel LHS now as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-02 09:38:39', '2021-11-02 09:38:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078870003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212047', 'Luther Setzer', NULL, 'Luther called in for some general questions about his preventative care and the PHCS network. I answered all of his questions and he thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-02 09:05:54', '2021-11-02 09:05:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078829003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072179049', 'Krista George', NULL, 'emailed member to clarify that Zion Health has a 60 day waiting period for Maternity benefits, not 6 weeks as her rep Zach Master''s told her.  I also sent Zion''s Maternity Guide. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-02 07:19:02', '2021-11-02 07:19:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078826003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257594', 'Emily Taylor', NULL, 'Emily emailed in to Wendy regarding the flu vaccine. I advised Emily that the flu vaccine is a covered service and that she must find and in-network provider (I attached a list to the email) and present her RCI card prior to receiving the flu vaccine. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-02 07:15:13', '2021-11-02 07:15:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078795028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068022001', 'Justin Breaux', NULL, 'Justin called.  As I understand it: he wants to put his List Bill on autopay.  I sent him Patti''s template for change of payment, but cc''d both accounting and Michele because I think they take care of those.  I did let Justin know they would be the one''s carring for this, but, also Patti''s out until the end of the week in case she needs to help.  We updated his CRM w/his new mailing address.  He''ll also request that on his List Bill too.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-01 18:13:23', '2021-11-01 18:13:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078815013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078817002', 'Matthew Amelino', NULL, '11-1-21 Matt called our main # and Joan passed him back to me. He came to me via Nate Love. He''s newly working with Nate as a 1099 contractor. He''s young, no pre-x, no tobacco and doesn''t want to pay the extra $ for wellness to be included in membership. He''ll just pay cash if he goes. He watched the video and I quizzed him. He was well versed in how it works as cash pay and chose CARE+ $1000/$215 for Dec. 1st start date. He wished to join sooner but we can''t. He also asked about dental but teeth are good and only gets cleanings 2x year. Told him to pay cash for that as well. He agreed. Total time on call was 11 min. including enrollment! DOB 4/21/92. Lives in Denver area. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-01 17:24:33', '2021-11-01 17:24:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078815008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670268', 'Andrew Braudis', NULL, '11-1-21 Rachel called and they want to add their son who is going to college in MA. He''s transgender and going through hormone therapy now. He has an Anthem plan and they will keep that. They may add him to their membership as backup since he''s out of state. They also want to upgrade to SECURE. Andy is self-employed. They are both hitting age to get colonoscopy and Rachel needs mammogram. Kids also get their annual wellness visits done. They want the change effective Dec. 1st. I am waiting to hear back from Patti as to what the process is to upgrade if we need to cancel or simply make the request via email and complete change form to add son?', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-01 17:16:05', '2021-11-01 17:16:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078795023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024193001', 'Mike Montes', NULL, 'Called Mike Re: no one answering concierge line last Thurs.  LM we are investigating why he didn''t at least get answering srvc.  We are unsure what happened...  Plez call if questions.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-01 17:07:12', '2021-11-01 17:07:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078795018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, 'Joy called to let us know she''s having surgery &amp; wanting to go thru the negotiation process.  I explained that takes longer than overnight &amp; is for times when the scheduled surgery is not such an emergency.  She understood.  Went over paying first $1,000 when bills start coming in &amp; submitting proof of pymt along with her detailed invoices once they come in (sent her template for submitting claims to Zion).    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-01 17:02:53', '2021-11-01 17:02:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078815003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077287065', 'Maxwell Brown Abbott', NULL, '11-1-21 Laura tried to pay Bright Health today for the ongoing payments. They put in their payment/banking information into C4 system for the initial payment. When she called Bright Health they told her the policy was voluntarily cancelled. Spoke with Rachel at C4 and she can''t get into their system right now due to a system update. I can see on my end that Maxwell''s plan shows as active with Bright Health and payment is $4.62. They can see that the initial payment was not yet taken from their bank account. Rachel suggested Laura calls tomorrow when system''s back up and running. Rachel gave us Tkt # 211 101-001 927. This shows proof of her call in immediately on Nov. 1st to submit ongoing payment. Laura will call tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-11-01 16:38:29', '2021-11-01 16:38:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078812011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176659017', 'Candace Lucas', NULL, '11.1.21:  I texted Candace a response to one of her questions I needed confirmation about - Secure for her employees being allowed.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-01 16:05:25', '2021-11-01 16:05:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078812003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079409002', 'Blake Sieck', NULL, '11.1.21:  Recvd. Quote Request from Blake.  Called - l/m to c/b. Blake returned my call.  Interested in SECURE for him, his wife; age 30 and 2 children age 5 & 2.  Non-smokers, no pre-ex.  Owns ST Insurance Group (Property & Casualty).  Their traditional insurance just expired and they''re looking for something different.  He likes the idea of an HSA.  Explained SECURE and DIRECT.  Prefers SECURE for his needs.  Said he will discuss this w/his wife.  There is one other plan they are considering but he likes ours. Emailed him my click funnel and guidelines.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-11-01 15:54:20', '2021-11-18 07:45:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078795013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Ryan called regarding why his wife cannot see his child''s information when she signs into her CirrusMD account. Ryan originally signed his son up underneath his CirrusMD account but is not happy that his wife cannot see their sons info and that she cannot schedule an appointment on CirrusMD for him because he is not signed up under her. I explained to Ryan that he would have to schedule a CirrusMD appointment for his son under him for now, as I did not know if there was a way for CirrusMD support to help with this matter. I offered to reach out to CirrusMD on his behalf but he insisted on contacting their support team via the app. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-01 14:51:44', '2021-11-01 14:51:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078796051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993542', 'Deborah Smith', 'New Plan eff 12/21', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-01 14:37:41', '2021-11-01 14:37:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078773048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078716002', 'Jack Sevison', NULL, 'sent email asking to reschedule welcome call for sometime after Dec 1. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-01 14:25:22', '2021-11-01 14:25:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078796046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078805002', 'Vicki Delgado', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-01 14:24:07', '2021-11-01 14:24:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078796038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049932024', 'Jared Willmore', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add daughter Vivian (born 9/1/2021) to plan.  They were added to the Sedera portion however never notified us.  RCI will not add her without a Qualifying event.  I let Jared know what was going to happen with Sedera and advised him to reach out to Jane to go over options out there proactively.  Vivian on Sedera not RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-01 14:14:16', '2021-11-01 14:14:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078773043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065477509', 'Stephanie Cwirn', NULL, 'Stephanie''s husband called to get information about his wife getting a mammogram through the plan.  I explained that she could either present her Zion card and have the provider call to get payment, or she can pay for it and submit it to Zion Health for reimbursement. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-01 14:13:56', '2021-11-01 14:13:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078773038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032216', 'Suzanne Morgis', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-01 14:10:25', '2021-11-01 14:10:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078795008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032122001', 'Eileen Fagan', NULL, 'Patti had Eileen contact the concierge team regarding a prescription for Ozempic. I did send Eileen the discount coupon I found, but I am also reaching out to Reid to see if he can find this at a lower price point. I will let the member know as soon as I hear back from Reid.  -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-11-01 13:41:44', '2021-11-01 13:41:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078773033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871160', 'Katie Roth', NULL, 'Katie called for her Zion member number, I told her that I didn''t have it on this end but that I would transfer her to Zion for it, and I also requested PDF and hard copies of her Zion cards via Slack. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-01 13:26:12', '2021-11-01 13:26:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078773028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076954036', 'Teresa Fox', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-01 13:18:29', '2021-11-01 13:18:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078796033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078746176', 'Lisa Humphreys', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA  Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-01 13:11:18', '2021-11-01 13:11:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078796028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209150', 'Lisa Humphreys', NULL, 'Member has submitted cancellation and will be flipping to Zion.  I have cancelled with Sedera &amp; RCI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-01 12:59:48', '2021-11-01 12:59:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078796023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051715135', 'Sylvia Theisen', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she was not going to have the money for the December pmt and if she canceled could she re-instate.  I told her that we were not placing anyone with Sedera anymore however Wendy had some other options.  I gave her Wendys number and will send her the cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-01 12:57:32', '2021-11-01 12:57:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078796018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078716002', 'Jack Sevison', NULL, 'Member &amp; Children $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-01 12:41:21', '2021-11-01 12:41:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078796013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078714002', 'Kathryn Rowden', NULL, 'Member Only  1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-01 12:37:25', '2021-11-01 12:37:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078773023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067828010', 'Luke Seamans', NULL, 'Luke called for help setting up his therapy appointments with the MAP program, I gave him their phone number and transferred him to MAP. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-01 12:35:12', '2021-11-01 12:35:12'),
