  ('zcrm_1579374000078773018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072179049', 'Krista George', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-01 12:21:55', '2021-11-01 12:21:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078773013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212047', 'Luther Setzer', NULL, 'Luther called for help getting his CirrusMD account reactivated, I emailed CirrusMD support and tagged Luther in the email requesting this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-01 11:30:15', '2021-11-01 11:30:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078796003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893285', 'Gina Hodgson', NULL, 'I just received a call from Jordan @ Zion letting me know that this member falsified Medical Records relating to a need.  So they will be cancelling her eff 10/31.  I will cancel her out in Admin 123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-01 11:19:49', '2021-11-01 11:19:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078795003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092041003', 'Peggy Franco', NULL, 'Talked w/Peggy.  She seems to understand OPD better than most new people.  We discussed a good deal of the nec info then I sent her an e-mail.  They want a 1/1/22 eff date, we discussed  disadvantages of waiting &amp; she seems ok with the gamble in case a pre-x item pops up.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-11-01 11:10:29', '2021-11-01 11:10:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078762013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937123', 'Tracey Nauright', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-11-01 11:03:55', '2021-11-01 11:03:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078773008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075870199', 'Jennifer Voigt', NULL, 'member called because they wanted to get a flu shot, I explained that it was not covered by the plan and went over the self-pay process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-01 10:28:55', '2021-11-01 10:28:55'),
