  ('zcrm_1579374000078704006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, 'member called to update her payment information, sent online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-11-01 07:53:45', '2021-11-01 07:53:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078695023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816274', 'Karen Jones', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel eff 11/1.  I let Zion know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-01 07:39:42', '2021-11-01 07:39:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078695018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918001', 'Stephanie Cordel', NULL, 'I received VM from this member wanting to cancel prior to starting.  Since she called after hours 10/29 I will cancel her and notify Zion.  I will request a cancellation from her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-11-01 07:17:51', '2021-11-01 07:17:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078678046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176659017', 'Candace Lucas', NULL, '10.30.21:  Candace called.  She is age 46 - husband is 48 - attorney.  They own a business but don''t need group insurance for their staff as they all have insurance w/their spouse''s cos.  Their current insurance is  too expensive and they''re looking into health sharing to maybe try.  I suggested SECURE, since they are candidates for it.  Candace wants to keep her P.C. physician (Keith Johnson, M.D. - Venice), so if he is in the network, she would consider SECURE.  Her husband has ulcerative colitis, but it is under control w/medication. Told her this would be considered a pre-x condition. She is ok w/it.  Emailed her the Zion Guidelines and my click funnel.
Candace texted me 8 more questions she and her husband came up with during their discussion, which I answered.  Also, I found that her provider, Keith Johnson, M.D. is in the PHCS Multi Plan network and let her know.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-10-30 10:34:23', '2021-11-19 12:47:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078678041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176659017', 'Candace Lucas', NULL, '10.29.21:  Candace called - found us on line while doing search for open enrollment.  Called - l/m to c/b.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-10-30 10:27:24', '2021-11-19 12:31:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078712008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918001', 'Stephanie Cordel', NULL, 'Stephanie called on Fri, 10/29/21 at 4:00pm AZ time.  She''s concerned about starting their plan 11/1/21 because she may have an unknown possible pre-x item.  She called to see if they could move their start date to 1/1/22, but Patti''s already gone for the day & some/all of next week.  She had some bloodwork done & they don''t know what the liver levels mean, so she thought maybe getting through this would be important so they can make a more educated decission.  I put her into Patti''s VM, but Patti is at the Parrot Head Fair next week, so she''ll ask Patti to call back as soon as she''s back in the office.  We also discussed going to the 1k IUA for better protection since she''s concerned about being a first time self-pay patient.  I let her know I''d document all this in her file so Patti would know she''d tried to call prior to her effective date.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-29 17:25:26', '2021-10-29 17:25:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078712003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670066', 'Luisa Lobo', NULL, 'Luisa called & does not seem to understand her plan.  She kept saying the doctors are telling her they don''t accept her "insurance".  We went over Planstin = prev only, sent her the PHCS Network template, discussed presenting her Planstin card to MD & they must bill & code everything as preventative, & be in the PHCS Network.  The Planstin card has ph# on it to get help find Pediatrician too.  Asked her about CirrusMD & she was clueless, sent her CirrusMD Registration template. Suggested good place to start with son''s ringing in his ears, but don''t get the impression she will.  tt her about Zion, qualified needs, being a cash-pay patient to 1k IUA on a qualified, specific need.  Turning in detailed invoices, etc. if it looks like the need will be ongoing and go over the 1K...  She seemed happy when we got done, but I don''t think it''s sinking in since I can see she''s been over some of this before.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-29 16:09:32', '2021-10-29 16:09:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078678026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080972002', 'Atalie Troutman', NULL, '10.29.21:  Emailed Atalie - asked to contact me to schedule a phone call to discuss CARE PLUS.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-10-29 16:07:18', '2021-11-23 15:59:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078678021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080972002', 'Atalie Troutman', NULL, '10.27.21:  Recvd. quote request from Atalie for Care Plus; IUA - $1000, non smoker, age 26; for herself.  Called - l/m to c/b.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-10-29 16:06:33', '2021-10-29 16:06:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078695013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871160', 'Katie Roth', NULL, 'Katie called and wanted to know how to submit her bills to Zion Health, I sent her a Zion needs submission link.  She also gave me an update on her son Benjamin, she says he is doing well after his accident, she reports he is "healthy and running around" now!  I thanked her for the update. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-29 14:43:39', '2021-10-29 14:43:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078708003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, 'Carlos called regarding using his MSEAP services. States that MSEAP is going to be reaching out to a few therapists for him and wanted to know if this will be at cost for him. I let Carlos know that MSEAP will explain everything to him when they call him back with a recommended therapist but that it should be at no cost to him.  -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-29 14:38:14', '2021-10-29 14:38:39'),
