  ('zcrm_1579374000078697008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047577309', 'Aashiv Hari', NULL, '10-29-21 Sent email # 2 and need to set up time to discuss Admin123 Platform next. Will wait for her response.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-29 11:17:06', '2021-10-29 11:17:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078697003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096555046', 'Anastazia Laubert', NULL, '10-29-21 Anastazia is waiting for her accountant to call her back to complete the C4 enrollment for Anthem Pathway X HMO 7000 for HSA for $73.47 (?) with APTC $429.93. She will complete the enrollment today for a Nov. 1st start date. I also sent her Vision VSP plans to review, HMA to review and Spirit Dental to review. She has some crowns she needs replaced. She previously paid about $500 with insurance for each and thought maybe they cost $800. So, she will run the numbers to see what makes sense. The HMA might be best for her down the road, just not ideal to help her now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-29 11:05:22', '2021-10-29 11:05:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078665020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810902', 'Michelle Chavez', NULL, 'Per email Accounting received we charged this member because even though bank information was put there it reverted back to List Bill.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-29 10:38:04', '2021-10-29 10:38:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078695003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918001', 'Stephanie Cordel', NULL, 'Stephanie called for some general questions about how her plan works, she is a bit nervous being a first time self- pay patient.  I answered all of her questions, she thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-29 10:28:57', '2021-10-29 10:28:57'),
