  ('zcrm_1579374000078665015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058535020', 'Mindy Wolf', NULL, 'Member''s 11/21 payment declined 1st notice sent - 10/27 3rd notice sent - 10/29', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-29 09:07:58', '2021-10-29 09:07:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078640003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078638002', 'Claudia Nanino', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-29 08:21:08', '2021-10-29 08:21:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078637003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885002', 'Pamela DeVos', NULL, '10.29.21:  Brian emailed to ask why DIRECT is $60 more for a couple than CARE+.  Responded that DIRECT offers mammography, colonoscopy and child immunizations (6 mo. wait) w/no I.U.A. cost.
Brian called - he wanted to compare our plans w/Zion''s plans and their guidelines.  I tried to clairify Zion''s guidelines are for their own plans.  MPB has included any differences in our plan features as reflects Zion''s guidelines.  Emailed Brian Zion''s Preventive Care Guidelines that is more detailed.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-10-29 07:29:04', '2021-10-29 11:25:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078636008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032001', 'Kyle Robinson', NULL, 'sent email to reschedule Welcome call for sometime after his membership start date. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-29 07:10:39', '2021-10-29 07:10:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078636003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078592001', 'Jeffrey Summerville', NULL, 'sent email to reschedule Welcome Call sometime after Dec 1, - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-29 07:05:48', '2021-10-29 07:05:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078624044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096555046', 'Anastazia Laubert', NULL, '10-28-21 Anastazia 11/3/1969 wants Anthem only. Her Dr. Mikyong Searcy Hand, Dr. Nuzhat  Iqbal are both in the Anthem Pathway X network NOT the Essentials network. She''s leaning towards the HSA plans. She has some gastr issues she needs to deal with and might need an upper endoscopy. She thinks that may easily exceed at $7K ded. Willing to wait until 2022 to dive into this to meet her ded one time, not two times. She''s pondering plans and we will enroll her tomorrow. We also called C4 and spoke with Adriana who helped select me as her agent! All set for now. Income put at $30,757 for now while she figures out what she might earn as self-employed. Lost coverage as of Nov. 1st.  Has mailbox in Louisville and permanent address in 80516 but mail gets lost there All the time. So, needs to keep Louisville address.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-28 17:00:03', '2021-10-28 17:00:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078624039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257470', 'Claudia Nanino', NULL, '10-28-21 Claudia is self-employed. No pre-x. She did have some labs run recently and they found no issues at all! Cost $915 which she was shocked about. She will call them again and speak to the billing person. She talked to the front desk person and they told her no discount. She will try again and her dr. is trying to possibly recode it as well to bring the cost down since it''s all below her IUA as well. She''s happy to save some money by switching to SECURE $1000/$275 vs PSDHC at $296/$1000. I waived the $100 fee and she was already using CirrusMD but had no knowledge of Life Care. I educated her about that now as well. All set for a Dec. 1st start date and cancelled PSDHC in the process. Good to go. Nice and appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-28 16:24:44', '2021-10-28 16:24:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078624034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521350', 'Shane Michael Sorensen', NULL, '10-28-21 Shane and Trudi were thinking with their income est at $58K it would be worth switching to C4. They could pay next to nothing $2.87 for lowest bronze plan with $1688 APTC, but then will lose pre-x protection if move back to MPB. Also MOP is $17,400 for both of them instead of $3K. So, after I explained that they realized it might be better to stay with MPB. Even gold plans the lowest I can get MOP is $10K for both of them and still paying $573 or so. Plus in 2023 costs will likely go up significantly when ARP is done. So, putting them in a bad situation before reach Medicare. They decided to stay put and understand to use in-network for wellness and cash for all else.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-28 15:26:44', '2021-10-28 15:26:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757021', 'David Mellinger', NULL, 'Member submitted payment info update via the Member change form.  I will update in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-28 13:39:49', '2021-10-28 13:39:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078623008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023159', 'Max Rebel', NULL, 'Max called in with many questions since his wife is staying with her mother and she has done everything with this plan up until now. I sent Max the following info in his email: Address change form, how to present his MEC, How to search the PHCS network along with a list of PCP''s in his area, and the link to upload needs to Zion Health. Max will be calling back if he has to have some fluid drained from his elbow. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-28 13:38:09', '2021-10-28 13:38:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078624029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '10-28-21 To Kristen, "If you use the Concierge for your meds you can get the NP Thyroid, 90 tablets for $42-$52. You can also get the Adderall XR generic form, 90 capsules for $70-$85. They might find even better pricing. I only checked 2 of the options that they have access to."  She''s been using the prescription plan through Apex which isn''t very good. She''s excited to convert to SECURE and also get better med prices with Concierge.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-28 13:11:42', '2021-10-28 13:11:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078624024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171447', 'Dorian Merrill', NULL, '10-28-21 Dorian actually had some gut issues in Jan. 2020 where she went to a Functional Medicine doctor and they ran a bunch of blood tests to find root cause. Nothing was diagnosed and it was deemed environmental and age related. Nothing since.  She suggested I follow up with her in Feb. to possibly consider a move at that time when outside the pre-x clause window. A March 1st 2022 start could protect her from any pre-x issues. She also plans to get her annual wellness visit pap screening asap but can''t find anyone who will simply take her as a patient without charging her a separate new patient fee. She called tons of PCP/Family Practice places and they all want to charge her a fee.  She will try some ob/gyns now as well.  Current membership PSDHC $278/$1500 and if moved it would be $275/$1000 for SECURE. She''s self-employed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-28 12:43:49', '2021-10-29 17:12:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058609163', 'Denise Schulz', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update address I will notify Zion', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-28 12:29:24', '2021-10-28 12:29:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064705055', 'Douglas Whitney', NULL, 'Member submitted Cognito form to update Pmt info.  I will update in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-28 12:24:00', '2021-10-28 12:24:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078624019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967035', 'Margaret Randolph', NULL, '10-28-21 Called bc wants a covid test and wants to know how to get it and what to say when they ask for insurance card. Told her to call Concierge to see if they can find free testing place and to pay the cash price and no ins. She also wants help to set up wellness visit, etc. Told her to have Concierge help her with all of it and gave her the #. She couldn''t find her MPB.Health card.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-28 12:17:26', '2021-10-28 12:17:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990158', 'Loren Jinkins', NULL, 'Loren called to cancel because she is aging out of the plan, sent online cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-28 12:16:15', '2021-10-28 12:16:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049472206', 'Kiani Harriman', NULL, 'Member updated payment information', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-28 12:16:01', '2021-10-28 12:16:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049472193', 'Tihana Harriman', NULL, 'Payment method updated', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-28 12:14:10', '2021-10-28 12:14:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514500', 'Johnnie Harriman', NULL, 'Member submitted Pmt Update from updated in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-28 12:00:37', '2021-10-28 12:00:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078624008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '10-28-21 Kristen has hypothyroid and takes MP Thyroid 120 mg 1x daily for 6 of 7 days a week. She and daughter also take Adderall XR generic version 15 mg 30 capsules. Paying $799/$1500 for Co-Pay Network plan now and likes the idea of the Virtual Healthcare and Life Care, plus the mental health visits for $100 less per month and lower IUA. They have been super happy with Sedera when they had to deal with precocious puberty for Mitiksha. That has been resolved and no further concern. She totally appreciated the people she worked with at Sedera to get the crazy high cost meds paid back quickly every time. Now  daughter sees dr. every 3 months for Adderall prescription refill and Kristen has blood work every 6 months plus dr. visit to refill meds. She loves the idea of virtual healthcare to solve most of their doctor visits without pay or wasting time. Both Kristen and husband are self-employed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-28 11:49:55', '2021-10-28 11:52:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947150', 'Gretchen Reeves', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-28 11:25:45', '2021-10-28 11:25:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947150', 'Gretchen Reeves', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-28 11:03:33', '2021-10-28 11:03:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078592091', 'Alan Fraughton', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-28 10:50:59', '2021-10-28 10:50:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078467032', 'James Fontenot', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-28 10:37:39', '2021-10-28 10:37:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078624003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, '10-28-21 Dave and Elsa are current LHS members. They do have some outstanding bills they want to make sure will get paid still. Elsa has had spotting lately and recently diagnosed with osteoporosis. She wants to know if that will be pre-x always moving forward. Daughter has a newly diagnosed genetic disorder called Ehlers Donlos which also caused TMJ. They aren''t too worried about long term repercussions of this since there''s not really much to do for it that should ever exceed the $125K cap.  Their docs are all in-network, Dr. Susskind, Dr. Kamon, Dr. Stanley Jack and one more with a weird name I forget. SECURE $1000/$685. They mostly do their annual wellness visits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-28 10:29:27', '2021-10-28 10:29:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078592001', 'Jeffrey Summerville', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-28 09:56:24', '2021-10-28 09:56:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072471064', 'Rosalyn McHenry', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-28 09:53:51', '2021-10-28 09:53:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078623003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737053', 'Angelina Kalianda', NULL, 'Xavier called to cancel their plan due to receiving insurance through employer. Sent cancelation link via email.  -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-28 09:39:32', '2021-10-28 09:39:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885002', 'Pamela DeVos', NULL, '10.28.21:  Spoke w/Brian.  Completed full presentation. He is interested in the DIRECT plan.  He called a DPC provider near him, spoke with the provider and liked this medical model very much.  Is considering this plan for him and his wife.  Needs to take her to see this provider to see if she is willing to change PC providers.  He is an engineer by profession and has worked in corp. setting.  His son just got engaged.  Will discuss all w/his wife and get back to me.
Emailed him my click funnel link.
Brian is also considering becoming an MPB Advisor. Told him I would be his upline.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-10-28 08:38:03', '2021-10-28 09:37:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078592001', 'Jeffrey Summerville', NULL, 'This member called in on the morning that he enrolled and questioned what the request for 1099 was.  I explained the eligibility and determined that he was not eligable.   I informed Leslie and she will follow up. I will also send enrollee cancellation request.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-28 07:44:50', '2021-10-28 07:45:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078309004', 'James Skurski', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of November 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-28 07:38:24', '2021-10-28 07:38:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885002', 'Pamela DeVos', NULL, '10.27.21:  Returned Brian''s call.  Found us in Google Search for medical cost sharing. Researching health care plans.  Age: 58, wife age: 62.  Has an HSA but is unemployed and ending his COBRA.  Looked at ACA plans but they''re too expensive.  Had Sx for prosthetic shoulders 4 years ago w/no problems since. Takes meds. for hypertension and cholesterol; wife takes med. for cholesterol; no pre-ex except for sagging bladder that does not need tx - maybe in 3 - 5 yrs. but by that time she will be on Medicare.  Would like to keep his HSA but is not a business owner or 1099 contractor.  Began discussion about our plans w/Brian but had to end the call an hour later for another mtg. for an enrollment.  Scheduled another call to finish our discussion at 9:00 a.m. tomorrow.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-10-28 06:40:39', '2021-10-28 06:40:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078566003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078467032', 'James Fontenot', NULL, '10.27.21:  Enrolled Barry and children in to Care Plus w/ a $1000 I.U.A..  Sent email to thank him and let him know he will be getting several emails, etc.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-10-28 06:11:48', '2021-10-28 06:12:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078545018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058609163', 'Denise Schulz', NULL, '10-27-21 This is all a bit too complicated for her. She wants regular insurance and he income is expected to be $30K in 2022 and will no longer claim daughter. She gets about a $565 APTC with plans starting at $0 or Silver at $73. We will explore those for her and her daughter will make about $17,472 on cusp of Medicaid vs APTC. Daughter is 21 and PT job at $14 hr. for 8 hours day, 3 days week.  Denise needed blood work that is not part of wellness. If she paid cash the cost was $1300 but she said she''d see if covered by ins and they billed her $2700! She now understands she should have told them she doesn''t have ins and would pay the cash price. She will go back now and ask for $1300 price and get refund of $1400 since no ins!  What a crime the ins system is!  This all feels complicated to her and she thinks ins will solve the problem. Now with the huge APTC she can give it a try.  Wants to keep Dr. Hefti Breed who is in the Centura system.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-27 16:26:31', '2021-10-27 16:26:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078545013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171447', 'Dorian Merrill', NULL, '10-27-21 Dorian is possible candidate to move to SECURE or CARE+. She doesn''t have any pre-x. I left her a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-27 15:48:01', '2021-10-27 15:48:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078545008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489171', 'Caroline Cowden', NULL, '10-27-21 Caroline''s son and wife referred her to me. DOB 11/21/1957, therefore about to turn 64. BUT, she  is trying to quit smoking and then would need to wait another year for tobacco restrictions to be removed. She takes meds for cholesterol and anxiety - venoflaxine and propenalol (usually for blood pressure but using it for anxiety as well). She an an AFLAC cancer only policy to protect her on that front, but nothing to protect her for heart attack, stroke, COPD. Has significant oil and gas money coming in as residual income so doesn''t qualify for subsidy. She is retired. She could tell my significant concern so she will look elsewhere. I also gave her my site name to explore it further. But, she knows it''s not a good idea. She is paying $1000 per month now with BC BS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-27 15:32:28', '2021-10-27 15:32:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078545003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '10-27-21 Robin is on PSDHC and we discussed possible move to SECURE. But, her daughter has possible celiac disease that they discovered last year. They''ve simply changed to GF diet and that has mostly resolved the problem. Son has something similar to scoliosis called something like rectus cartedum. They are giving him a compressive brace to straighten it out. They will be going in for office visits to adjust pressure for about 1 year.  So, I recommended they stay with PSDHC for another year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-27 15:10:35', '2021-10-27 15:10:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078531008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356758', 'Joan Tekula', NULL, 'Spoke with Joan regarding her colonoscopy and medications she would like to open a need for. I explained to Joan that there was no way that I could see if her need for her upcoming colonoscopy is still approved and that for the medications/treatments she was receiving for her hormones I would have to transfer her to Zion. So, I transferred her to Zion. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-27 15:00:27', '2021-10-27 15:00:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078529008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065477526', 'Richard Bausch', NULL, 'Richard called in and stated that he never got his Zion card in the mail. He said he got all of his other cards from us and Planstin. I let him know that in the meantime all the info on his Planstin card would be the same because Planstin and Zion work together in the same building and the account number would be the same along with his info obviously. So if he has to use it for something he can use the Planstin card and give them Zion''s phone number to call and verify. To order him a new one I told him to give Zion a call and they will verify his info and send a new one to him in the mail. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-10-27 14:36:19', '2021-10-27 14:36:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078489058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078533002', 'Candy Rogers', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-27 13:53:53', '2021-10-27 13:53:53'),
