  ('zcrm_1579374000078489023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361480', 'Michelle Crissey', NULL, 'Member will be aging up to the 60 age band.  I will notify Member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-27 12:51:05', '2021-10-27 12:51:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078531003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080943010', 'Gaia Marrs', NULL, '10-27-21 Gaia and Wayne are healthy, no tobacco, no pre-x other than Wayne has sibo/gut issues. They are used to paying cash for many services. They were pondering getting rid of health insurance altogether. So, they are totally open to SECURE $1000/$685. They do their annual wellness visits. I forgot to mention the HSA compliance! They use Dr. Jennifer Harr and she shows up in PHCS network. Looking at Jan. 1st start date. Looked at regular insurance and sent her sample of Bronze plans which were pretty crappy. Best guess at income is $150K with a new business Wayne is setting up. Not really interested in trad ins.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-27 12:19:23', '2021-10-27 12:19:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078529003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091116', 'Gregory Vassie', NULL, 'Greg called in and just wanted to know if there is anything else he needs to do in regards to his colonoscopy that he is getting done. He already called PHCS and got a list in his area. He picked out a provider and sent over his referral from his doctor for the colonoscopy to be done, the facility he picked out from PHCS already verified Planstin and he is scheduled for Feb. His concern was his family history and the fact that his grandfather passed away from Colon cancer. I told him that would be something he should speak to Planstin about since they are the ones covering the procedure and whatnot. He is all set and had no further questions. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-10-27 12:08:57', '2021-10-27 12:08:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078487043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077830004', 'Angela Coy', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of November 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-27 11:06:42', '2021-10-27 11:06:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078487038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838046', 'Brian Dotson', NULL, 'Brian called to nominate his therapist for the MAP program. I gave Brian the information to log into the MAP program and their direct phone number so that he can find out if he can nominate his therapist. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-27 10:57:55', '2021-10-27 10:57:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078487033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820256', 'Lori Mower', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-27 10:46:56', '2021-10-27 10:46:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078489013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047282132', 'Amanda Hoskins', NULL, 'Member will be aging up into the 30 age band eff 12/21.  I will email member &amp; advisor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-27 10:25:39', '2021-10-27 10:25:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078487028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032114', 'Vernon Hee', NULL, 'Vernon called to get directions on how to present his plan for his Jan. 2022 doctor''s appointment. I let Vernon know that I would be happy to go over that information with him, but that he will also be doing a welcome call about a week after his start date and that will also give him some clarification into his plan. He said he was absolutely good to wait until his welcome call, he feels he may have prematurely called us to go over this info but I assured him that we love his enthusiasm. He will be awaiting his welcome call email. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-27 10:22:32', '2021-10-27 10:22:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078487023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165317', 'Melody Fairchild', NULL, 'Melody called in because she was having issues with the welcome call scheduler telling her that there is no availability until December 2021. I told her that I would be happy to schedule her welcome call on my end so we did. Melody is SUPER excited to learn more about her plan. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-27 10:19:16', '2021-10-27 10:19:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078489008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808001', 'Glen Markham', NULL, 'Member left me a VM asking about the price as she was quoted a much lower price by Zion.  I explained all of the services that she gets through us.  She also said that her and her husband might need to have surgery in the winter.  I went through the Health Care BB &amp; opening a need with Zion after she satisfied her IUA.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-27 09:52:14', '2021-10-27 09:52:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078487018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, 'Robin called explaining that she had her well woman''s visit in Feb. 2021 and would like to have the blood work for that visit done now. Since I was unsure what ASI''s guidelines were regarding this instance, I did transfer Robin to ASI for guidance. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-27 09:12:35', '2021-10-27 09:12:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078487013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032070', 'Danielle Hatch', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after her start date of November 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-27 08:39:16', '2021-10-27 08:39:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078487008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065580074', 'Carrie Todd', NULL, 'Carrie called and was on her way to the ER. I explained the self-pay process and will be sending her an email on how to submit her bills to Zion in case this goes over her IUA. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-27 08:28:28', '2021-10-27 08:28:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078489003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009790025', 'Rosalynde smith', NULL, 'Member''s 11/21 payment declined 1st notice sent-11/27 3rd Notice sent -10/29', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-27 08:06:14', '2021-10-29 09:02:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078487003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055771107', 'Marcy Oppenheimer', NULL, 'Marcy called with questions regarding COVID rapid testing. She was upset that neither testing or the inoculation are not a covered expense and that we should be ashamed of ourselves. I explained to Marcy that it is something that is determined by the government and that we unfortunately do not have control over what is on the ACA list of preventative services. I offered to run a search on COVID rapid testing facilities and she said no, that she would call around. I realized she does not know anything about her plan and asked if she''d had a welcome call yet and her answer was no. She said that she was never offered a welcome call, which I find very hard to believe due to Kelly Anne''s notes, so I sent her a welcome call scheduler and advised for her to do one ASAP. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-27 08:05:32', '2021-10-27 08:05:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078447031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096043', 'Melisa (Lisa) Levitt', NULL, 'Melisa called frustrated.  She sent several e-mails trying to get information to info@mympb.com and hadn''t heard back after a few days.  I was able to help her resolve most of her issues: How to get into MAP, where their phone # is, how to get into HCBB, How to get into the WHLC, she had questions about Planstin, Urgent Care, etc.  We went over ''cash-pay'' pt, submitting a need to Zion, etc.  She is going to call Planstin re: getting a shingles shot at their OptumRx pharmacy since that''s on her Planstin card, but she''s good w/calling them.  She''s also going to be caring for her mom in NY since she has cancer & wondered if she could get her preventative checkup there instead of WA.  Told her as long as it''s a PHCS doc, billed & coded as prev, & the MD bills, sb fine.  She was far happier when we got off the phone than when she first called.  It sounds like she does a good deal of figuring things out on the weekend, so that''s why the e-mails would have been best for her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-26 18:43:04', '2021-10-26 18:43:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078447026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165317', 'Melody Fairchild', NULL, 'Wendy sent me a request to send Melody an e-mail for scheduling a ''Welcome Call'' = done.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-26 15:58:44', '2021-10-26 15:58:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078447021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, 'Eric called thinking he had not rec''d the e-mail Kelly Anne sent.  But, together we found it.  He sb all set.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-26 15:54:05', '2021-10-26 15:54:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078447016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080006001', 'Rachel Fe', NULL, 'Rachel wrote back that they''ve decided to go w/another healthsharing company.  I asked if she''d be willing to share', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-26 14:52:26', '2021-10-26 14:52:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078408040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078409064', 'Maria Blaettner', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-26 14:33:41', '2021-10-26 14:33:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078455016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009525007', 'Jill Suarez', NULL, 'Jill called with many questions about her plan and a request for her Planstin card. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-26 14:33:35', '2021-10-26 14:33:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078425026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820032', 'Ottis Fausett', NULL, 'Suzanne called for help setting up her CirrusMD account, I sent CirrusMD an email and tagged Suzanne in it requesting that an invite be sent to her.  I also sent her the preventative care email template. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-26 14:18:52', '2021-10-26 14:18:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078455011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575309', 'Corrie Black', NULL, 'Corrie called in with regards to starting a need due to an ER visit that landed her in the hospital. I warm transferred her to Sedera so that she could speak with them about opening a need. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-26 13:51:05', '2021-10-26 13:51:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078408035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034209013', 'George Jones', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation form.  I will notify Sedera, cancel w/RCI &amp; refund &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-26 12:07:21', '2021-10-26 12:07:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078455003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820032', 'Ottis Fausett', NULL, 'Suzanne called in with some questions regarding her plan. I explained what she uses her Planstin card for and I also had to explain to Suzanne that just because she thinks something should be a preventative service does not mean that it is. I let her know that for preventative services she should be checking the ACA list and I gave her the site address per her request. She said this plan is confusing and I reassured her that she can always call the concierge line with any questions and that once she learns her plan it will be worth it. I then transferred her to Zion with regards to a condition that I think is pre-existing but advised her to speak with Zion. -JTA', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-26 11:44:24', '2021-10-26 13:42:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078425021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, 'Eric called to submit a need to Zion, I sent him the Zion needs submission link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-26 11:14:57', '2021-10-26 11:14:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078425016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947103', 'Holly Hildreth', NULL, 'member called to be reminded of the self-pay process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-26 11:09:34', '2021-10-26 11:09:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078425008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078467032', 'James Fontenot', NULL, '10.26.21:  Recvd. an email from Barry.  He''s ready to enroll on 10/27 at 7 p.m.  for a 12/1 start date.  Emailed Barry confirming this date and time.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-10-26 10:46:51', '2021-10-26 10:46:51'),
