  ('zcrm_1579374000078391018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842149', 'Abigail Vick', NULL, 'Member''s 11/21 payment declined 1st notice sent 10/26 2nd notice sent-10/28', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-26 07:56:17', '2021-10-29 13:50:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078391013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, 'Member emailed in and told us to rerun her card as she straightened her issues out.  She was on of the Sedera CC members that we could not import CC information from FTNI.  So I am having her re-submit her CC info so I can put it into A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-26 07:51:16', '2021-10-26 07:51:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078391008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063771010', 'Katherine Pettit', NULL, 'Member Payment method updated.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-26 07:37:46', '2021-10-26 07:37:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078391003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034209013', 'George Jones', NULL, 'Member emailed wanting to cancel I will send out cancellation via email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-26 07:32:50', '2021-10-26 07:32:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078388008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078309046', 'Jack Weber', NULL, '10.26.21:  Recvd. email from Jack.  Thanked me for following up and said he initiated the plan.  Called Patti.  Said he enrolled on the 23rd and she will designate me as his advisor.  I emailed him to explain how we normally conduct the process of educating our members and guiding them through their enrollment and set-up process.  Jack is a DC & ND w/Functional Medicine fellowship.  Has a practice with his wife Melissa in Cary, NC.
Jack emailed. Thanked me for emailing the info. and was happy to schedule a call to discuss his membership.  Also interested in possible collaboration w/MPB and in putting our brochures in his office for his patients. I emailed him back acknowledging all and asking to set a call for Friday, 10/29/21 at 2:00 p.m.  Recvd. an email from Jack, confirming Fri., 10/29/21 at 2 p.m. for an advisor call to discuss his SECURE plan and membership and on-boarding process.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-10-26 07:28:53', '2021-10-27 08:18:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078388003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691127', 'Stephen Scharf', NULL, 'sent Stephen a script coupon as requested. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-26 07:07:00', '2021-10-26 07:07:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078357046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080006001', 'Rachel Fe', NULL, 'Rachel &amp; I have been going back &amp; forth via e-mails.  Have asked to setup a time to chat.  No luck in getting a # from her.  Sent a new e-mail "Touching Base..."', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-25 17:38:41', '2021-10-25 17:38:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078357041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081883004', 'Adriana Lopez', NULL, 'Sent follow-up e-mail.  Rec''d hardcopy flyer?  Can we setup time to talk?', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-25 17:32:41', '2021-10-25 17:32:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078357036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040810067', 'Jennifer Hammer', NULL, 'Jennifer asked Wendy for more info.  So, I looked up 2D &amp; 3D Imaging Mammograms in her area, the fair price of both, facilities, &amp; resent the guidelines with an excerpt showing how they handle them.  ILM re: screening?  diagnostic?  Sent ''screening'' info.  Went over 1k IUA &amp; screening well below that price.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-25 17:22:42', '2021-10-25 17:22:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078375010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078467032', 'James Fontenot', NULL, '10.25.21:  Recvd. an email from Barry (see emails attached).  Checked w/Aliya at Zion about his pre-x condition question re:  hIs daughter.  Pain not considered pre-x , as providers didn''t find any cause.  He is discussingwith his wife tonight  our findings re; his duaghter''s pain issue not being diagnosed as a pre-x condition.  Will email me and let me know when he''ll be available to enroll.  Needs to do it at 7  p.m. - told him not a  problem.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-10-25 16:14:53', '2021-10-25 16:19:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078357031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, 'Jillian called.  Her preventative colonoscopy turned diagnostic when she had polyps removed, so Planstin denied her submission (we talked about the Dr needing to do the billing, but since it''s now diagnostic, it doesn''t really matter this time).  Sent her Zion template for submitting needs, but she realized she has that info.  I let her know Zion has a 6-mos waiting period on colonoscopies, but that may just be for preventative.  Since this is now diagnostic, she''s submitting the $5k in bills to Zion & will call to make sure they rec''d them (she might have prev submitted them, she cannot remember).    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-25 15:49:41', '2021-10-25 15:49:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078357026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171447', 'Dorian Merrill', NULL, 'Dorian called  (back).  She wanted to confirm she had the correct card for her preventative items.  She has the RCI card, so we went over making sure she presents that card at her appt &amp; that the Dr''s off bills everything as preventative.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-25 15:25:15', '2021-10-25 15:25:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078355023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171447', 'Dorian Merrill', NULL, 'Dorian called to ask if IUD''s were covered by her plan, I explained that they were with her RCI card and as long as she remained in the PHCS network.  She thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-25 15:01:54', '2021-10-25 15:02:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078360021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, 'Kimi called regarding a mammogram and the PHCS network. She was confused because she did a search and found an in-network facility, but then a week later did the same search and that facility was not on the list. I explained to Kimi that providers/facilities do drop in and out of the network all of the time and the best practice is to call the provider/facility directly to verify that they are still in the PHCS network. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-25 14:54:49', '2021-10-25 14:54:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078376008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '10-25-21 Suzanne called bc her Bright Health Plan is not renewing and she wants to start looking for options. We set an appt for next week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-25 14:31:15', '2021-10-25 14:31:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078355018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055920063', 'Lady Fuller', NULL, 'Lady called and wanted to know how to submit bills to Zion, I sent her Zion''s needs submission link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-25 14:27:08', '2021-10-25 14:27:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078357021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078316052', 'Cary Jerdine', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-25 14:14:55', '2021-10-25 14:14:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078375005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078309046', 'Jack Weber', NULL, '10.25.21:  Recvd. quote request from Jack (submitted on 10/22).  Interested in SECURE for his family w/$5000 IUA.  Nonsmokers.  L/m to c/b to schedule time to speak. Also emaied that I left a phone message.  Asked him to call to schedule a phone mtg.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-10-25 14:03:16', '2021-10-25 16:49:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078360016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063771010', 'Katherine Pettit', NULL, 'Ron called to change their payment information. Emailed Ron the payment update form. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-25 14:00:33', '2021-10-25 14:00:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078355013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065477509', 'Stephanie Cwirn', NULL, 'Stephanie called to ask if the Covid vax was covered, I explained that it was not and went over the self pay process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-25 12:46:37', '2021-10-25 12:46:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078376003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061317', 'Patricia Barnett', NULL, '10-25-21 We just chatted and reminded her of the name Super Bill for when she collects bills. She has chosen Not to change her IUA now.  She decided it didn''t make sense and doesn''t want to wait the 2 months waiting period if she were to make a change. Leaving it all alone.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-25 12:21:49', '2021-10-25 12:21:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078357013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359241', 'Ramiro Peru', NULL, 'Member submitted address change.  I notified RCI &amp; Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-25 12:17:59', '2021-10-25 12:17:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078360008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071646064', 'David Jones', NULL, 'Amy called, very unpleasantly, regarding a refill on a prescription. She was told that Planstin could approve refills on maintenance medication, which I explained to Amy that she would need to use her CirriusMD services to do this. She then stated that this was bullsh!t, that she shouldn''t have to use anyone BUT Planstin to get this f''ing refill. I explained that I understood her frustration, but that using the CirrusMD app is the most effective way to get a refill on her maintenance medication. I verified that she was, in fact, set up with CirrusMD and she stated that she didn''t remember her passcode. When I offered to send her a link to reset her passcode, she grew very hostile and said that she didn''t need my help messing anything up. She continued to be volatile throughout the entire interaction (swearing at me and speaking to me aggressively).  She was able to get into CirrusMD and is currently waiting for an answer on a refill for her maintenance medication. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-25 12:13:28', '2021-10-25 12:13:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078338008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075438002', 'Christopher Brenner', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-25 11:19:53', '2021-10-25 11:19:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078355008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330064', 'Diane VanWeelden', NULL, 'Diane called because she needed to submit a need to Zion Health, I sent her the Zion needs submission link. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-25 11:11:53', '2021-10-25 11:11:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078360003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', NULL, 'Hillary called in regarding CirrusMD and a sinus infection she is currently battling. CirrusMD told her that she needed to go in to be seen for this sinus infection so she is going to to a telehealth appointment with her doctor. I explained that in this instance she needs to present herself as a self-pay patient and ask for the best cash price. She understood. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-25 10:53:20', '2021-10-25 10:53:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078357008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689144', 'Lori Altman', NULL, 'Member''s 11/21 payment declined 1st notice sent 10/25', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-25 10:22:11', '2021-10-25 10:22:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078357003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118245', 'Christopher Villinger', NULL, 'Member''s 11/21 payment declined 1st notice sent - 10/25 2nd notice sent - 10/28', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-25 10:15:00', '2021-10-29 13:48:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078355003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016721056', 'Susan Crocker', NULL, 'Susan called for help with prescription pricing, I sent her a coupon for Albuterol. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-25 10:13:01', '2021-10-25 10:13:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078338003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937123', 'Tracey Nauright', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after her start date of November 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-25 10:04:19', '2021-10-25 10:04:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078310013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610265', 'Julie A. Bekker', NULL, 'I spoke to member on Fri 10/22 and she said that she spoke to a gentleman who told her she was cancelled.  I had no record of a cancellation request nor a phone call.  I will cancel her with Zion &amp; refund the Nov/21 pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-25 09:31:03', '2021-10-25 09:31:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078306008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016721056', 'Susan Crocker', NULL, 'Susan called in regarding Teledoc services, I informed her that we have now moved on to CirrusMD. I attempted to send her a CirrusMD invite but it said that her information was not on file. Susan was going to attempt to use the "reset password" link to see if that would work for her. I advised Susan to call back ASAP if it does not work. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-25 09:18:43', '2021-10-25 09:18:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078310008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078309046', 'Jack Weber', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-25 07:50:03', '2021-10-25 07:50:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078303008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974269', 'Randi Futey', NULL, 'called to cancel her welcome call with Vanessa this morning, I sent another scheduler and told her to schedule sometime after Nov 1. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-25 07:49:35', '2021-10-25 07:49:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078310003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078309004', 'James Skurski', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-25 07:38:21', '2021-10-25 07:38:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078308003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689471', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail to schedule welcome call after her start date of November 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-25 07:35:01', '2021-10-25 07:35:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078306003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072471089', 'Anita Fisher', NULL, 'Sent script quote request for Alprazolam and Atorvastatin on 10/25/2021. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-25 07:12:28', '2021-10-25 07:12:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078303003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032216', 'Suzanne Morgis', NULL, 'sent email to reschedule Welcome call for sometime after Nov 1. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-25 07:05:41', '2021-10-25 07:05:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078248028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078309004', 'James Skurski', NULL, '10-22-21 James Skurski enrolled after the final hour. IF we can move him to a Nov. 1st start date, he would greatly appreciate it! His membership needs to be moved to the ASHI group. I should be the main Agent on it. Darius and I have agreed to split the sale. The lead came through me and I gave Darius the chance to put James onto traditional health ins, which James rejected. James needs to be refunded the $100 as an ASHI member. Darius didn''t realize the ASHI component and now understands he made a mistake in enrolling James the way he did. Jim apologized for missing the deadline due to other stuff going on in his life right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-22 17:17:38', '2021-10-22 17:17:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078248023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059281121', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, 'Laura called.  Her March 2021 Mammogram bills are just now arriving as rejected.  She is going to check with the hospital to make sure it''s coded as preventative.  They said something about the rejection letters saying Planstin only pays for preventative, but that is what this should be.  

She also is having hip issues and wondered about how to submit a ''need''.  She hadn''t realized they changed to Zion with the 1k IUA (but said maybe her husband had done that).   She''ll talk to Wendy if she still has questions on the change.  We talked about alternative care (chiropractic) generally needing pre-approval, a treatment plan from the doctor, etc.  She''s going to call Zion to see what her options are because she was just planning to submit things now that she''s had treatments and it''s getting expensive.  I sent her the template to submit to Zion in case she needs it.

She seemed happy with the help and guidance.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-22 17:02:56', '2021-10-22 17:02:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078242061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014743027', 'Jay Land', NULL, 'Jay submitted Change form to remove Abigail from the membership she has had employer coverage for 2 yrs.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 14:24:25', '2021-10-22 14:24:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078295003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, 'Accounting has processed a Referral fee of $100.00 for this member. They Referred Jacqueline Olivier .
Check was mailed to member on 10/22/21. Notified member by email and phone . KG', 'Accounting Office', 'Accounting Office', '2021-10-22 14:02:35', '2021-10-22 14:02:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078248018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563065', 'Petrus Timmermans', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-22 13:44:53', '2021-10-22 13:44:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078242056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899604', 'Arnold Rasker', NULL, 'Due to the fact that the Raskers continue to be charged erroneously I will be refunding the the $1295 we owe them.  John will stop payment for the other member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 13:33:36', '2021-10-22 13:33:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078248013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, 'Mitchell called with a handful of questions regarding his membership.  Went over IUA, and how he can open up an HSA account. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-22 13:22:09', '2021-10-22 13:22:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078242051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630114', 'Elgin MacMillan', NULL, 'Member updated banking info.  I will add to a 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 13:12:02', '2021-10-22 13:12:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078242043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670178', 'Bruce Ballet', NULL, 'Member has cancelled the Care + and has re-enrolled in the Secure option because was not aware that Care+ did not share in Preventative.  I will notify Zion', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 12:56:30', '2021-10-22 12:56:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078242038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078240094', 'Bruce Ballet', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 12:53:05', '2021-10-22 12:53:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078242033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670178', 'Bruce Ballet', NULL, 'Per Kelly C''s msg I called Laura she had many questions about 3D mammograms.  New providers so I sent her out the Provider search instructions and told her to verify w/provider prior to appt.  I also need a cancellation from them for previous Care + plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 12:43:18', '2021-10-22 12:43:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078242028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758269', 'Michael Pennavaria', NULL, 'Member''s 11/21 declined 1st notice sent - 10/22 Member submitted update CC I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 12:10:15', '2021-10-22 13:10:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078242023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, 'Member''s 11/21 payment declined 1st notice sent 10/22', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 11:53:03', '2021-10-22 11:53:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078248008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075397002', 'Scott Tallman', NULL, 'Tiffany called, her daughter needed to go to the hospital out of the country, I told her that she can submit bills to Zion as long as the bills are in English.  I sent her the Zion needs submission form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-22 11:11:32', '2021-10-22 11:11:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078260008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032492', 'Jani Osborne', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after her start date of November 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-22 10:24:13', '2021-10-22 10:24:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078242018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020015', 'Daniel Patterson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Zion &amp; refund Nov/2021 share amt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 10:21:53', '2021-10-22 10:21:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078260003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078122113', 'Travis Olsen', NULL, 'Not able to leave message. Mailbox not set up. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-22 10:03:31', '2021-10-22 10:03:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078242013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078240045', 'Leanne Feibush', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 10:00:11', '2021-10-22 10:00:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078255003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725151', 'Amber Halford', NULL, 'Amber was transferred to us from Planstin regarding her CirrusMD invitation. I send Amber her invitation but she doesn''t think her email is working properly. If she does not receive in by this afternoon she will be calling back. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-22 09:56:50', '2021-10-22 09:56:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078248003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670268', 'Andrew Braudis', NULL, 'Zion reached out to us saying that Rachel needed to go through HCBB because she is having surgery, but when I called Andrew this morning he says that Rachel is not planning on having surgery, but if she does need surgery they will reach out to us to go through the Care Connect program. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-22 09:47:08', '2021-10-22 09:47:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078242008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078240013', 'Debra Flick', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 09:44:15', '2021-10-22 09:44:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078242003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078240001', 'Samuel Haefner', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 09:36:56', '2021-10-22 09:36:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078143114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670178', 'Bruce Ballet', NULL, 'Laura called for questions about her upcoming Secure membership- I sent her the preventative care template.  She also had some questions about the MAP program for her daughter, I gave her the phone number and transferred her to them. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-22 08:54:59', '2021-10-22 08:54:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078220003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059494057', 'Randall Wilson', NULL, 'Angela called this morning regarding the same information from Oct. 20th. Only she states that I told her she could go anywhere for anything without having to be in a network. I again explained that for preventative services she does have to see an in-network provider and that she needs to verify with the provider that they are still in the PHCS Network prior to her visit. I also explained to Angela the self pay process for injury or illness. She seemed to understand a little better this time. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-22 07:51:14', '2021-10-22 07:51:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078218013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770071', 'Debra Flick', 'Redirect Term', 'Tracking #12322810
Sent by Patti Baron on 10/22/2021.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 07:46:12', '2021-10-22 07:46:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078218008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770071', 'Debra Flick', NULL, 'I received an email from Sedera Member Services that when John was added to the membership since he was older he became the primary on the plan.  So I had them cancel the whole membership Debra has re-enrolled in Zion eff 11/1/2021.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 07:44:04', '2021-10-22 07:44:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078218003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171223', 'Lori Hutchinson', NULL, 'Member emailed me saying that they have been being double billed since the transition to A123. I will refund $990 out of FTNI and cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-22 07:32:15', '2021-10-22 07:32:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078143109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, 'Whitney called for help finding a dermatologist for his son, I sent him a list from HCBB and a link from healthgrades.com. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-22 07:10:02', '2021-10-22 07:10:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078143104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689037', 'Dale Wondisford', NULL, 'Sent email to reschedule welcome call for sometime after membership start date. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-22 06:57:33', '2021-10-22 06:57:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078143099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689471', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, 'sent email to reschedule welcome call after Nov 1. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-22 06:55:00', '2021-10-22 06:55:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078207003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078467032', 'James Fontenot', NULL, '10.21.21:  Recvd. an email from Barry (James) re: if his daughter''s pain and seizure issue would be pre-existing and what are his options.  I responded yes to pre-existing and suggested that, in addition to his MPB family membership, he have his daughter added to his wife''s health insurance policy for the first year of membership.  Barry emailed back thanks, they will consider this option.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-10-22 06:23:27', '2021-10-22 06:23:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078143094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877120', 'Andrea Thomas', NULL, '10-21-21 Annie is moving to Tacumsah, OK in the new year or so with her boyfriend who will work a farm he''s starting. She will keep her business license and may or may not do some of her own work or help with the farm. She''s healthy, no meds, no pre-x, no tobacco. She did have cancer 11 years ago and no required follow ups and clean bill of health. She will want a Jan. 1st start date and we have time scheduled to enroll on Nov. 22nd. She will choose CARE+ since she doesn''t do the annual wellness visits. She''s interested in maternity care and knows she has to wait until March to begin trying or will not have maternity costs shared. She gets it! CARE+ $215/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-21 16:21:24', '2021-10-21 16:21:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078143081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078122113', 'Travis Olsen', NULL, 'Per Jane member wanted to change start date to 11/1/2021.  I billed him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-21 14:37:33', '2021-10-21 14:37:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078143073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014743027', 'Jay Land', NULL, 'Received notification from Planstin that Abigail will no longer be eligible to be on the membership eff 12/31/2021.  I will send out notification letter.  No change in price.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-21 14:26:08', '2021-10-21 14:26:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078143068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065246134', 'David Rubine', NULL, '10-21-21 David called bc he received a notice from Anthem telling him he can renew with a $2K+ monthly fee and he freaked out. It appears they did not include his APTC in their estimate. We are going to talk early Nov. when the prices are updated and ready to enroll. He feels better now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-21 14:21:58', '2021-10-21 14:21:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078143063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476142', 'Michael Dee', NULL, 'Per letter below dependent Hannah &amp; Nathan should have been removed eff 8/1/2021.  However letter was not shared nor was member advised to fill out a member change form.  I have notified Melissa @ Planstin and she will remove.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-21 14:13:46', '2021-10-21 14:13:46');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000078204003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072708018', 'Lara Forsyth', NULL, 'Delaney called for help getting set up with CirrusMD- I found that she was already registered and lmom explaining how to login to her account. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-21 14:11:12', '2021-10-21 14:11:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078160013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020015', 'Daniel Patterson', NULL, 'Daniel called to cancel, I sent him the cancellation link via email. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-21 13:44:52', '2021-10-21 13:44:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078143058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881563', 'Juan Tapia', NULL, 'Was notified by Planstin that Stephanie will be aging off the plan eff 11/1.  I have notified member &amp; Darius and will refund difference between Family price &amp; Member &amp; Spouse.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-21 13:09:19', '2021-10-21 13:09:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078143053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808001', 'Glen Markham', NULL, 'Was notified by Zion that Luke was no longer eligible as he turned 26 in Sept.  I will remove him from the plan.  Emailed member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-21 12:56:10', '2021-10-21 12:56:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078143048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024225', 'Jason Fishburn', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that his provider had just called him and said that they were unable to receive payment for his preventative appt back in May.  He did not have his Planstin card.  I gave him phone # and told him they will send out a digital card.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-21 12:49:24', '2021-10-21 12:49:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078143043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078122113', 'Travis Olsen', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-21 12:39:50', '2021-10-21 12:39:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078143038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396471', 'Chris Skavnak', NULL, 'Member''s 11/21 payment declined 1st notice sent - 10/21 10/25-member updated pmt info I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-21 12:23:08', '2021-10-25 13:46:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078160008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, 'Frances called in requesting instructions on how to go about using her services. I explained that her preventative services are covered by Planstin as long as it is listed on the ACA list. She was inquiring about a hip problem she is having and has never been seen for this issue in the past. I explained that at that point it would be an injury or illness and I explained the self-pay process and what happens after she has met her IUA for her hip issue. She asked for PHCS network lists of PCP''s and OBGYN''s. Prior to ending our call, Frances inquired about her $100 referral fee that she has yet to receive from months ago.  She stated that she has spoken with 2 people regarding this and has not received any fee. I was guiding her to accounting but the accounting department was out today, Frances was very unhappy with that and stated that she will NEVER refer anyone to MPB.Health again. She also stated that we are SO quick to take her money but we are not willing to give her the referral fee and she is sick of it. She then asked to be transferred to accountings voicemail. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-21 10:09:33', '2021-10-21 10:09:33'),
