  ('zcrm_1579374000078099003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078467032', 'James Fontenot', NULL, '10.20.21:  Emailed James re: 2 other ways to get a 1099 to be eligible for the SECURE plan. Told him to schedule a call to discuss.  (1) referral; (2) network marketing rep.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-10-20 15:58:42', '2021-10-20 15:59:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078082018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578042', 'James Forro', NULL, 'James was very confused as to why I reached out to him regarding a surgery  he doesn''t even know if he is having yet. I let him know that this was just a courtesy call to inform him that we are here to help him find the fair pricing in his area when he is ready for surgery. He was very grateful that I reached out but advised that we wait for our members to reach out to us first before jumping the gun and reaching out to them. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-20 14:55:25', '2021-10-20 14:55:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078048116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032492', 'Jani Osborne', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-20 14:53:37', '2021-10-20 14:53:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000078082013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122744', 'Kimberly Payes', NULL, 'Tim Hirsch reached out about Kimberly via slack. Kimberly has been recommended for meniscus and ACL surgery but is currently not having any pain and is not sure if she is going to have it done right away. She is hoping to avoid surgery and take the holistic route. I did advise Kimberly that if she is going to take the holistic route, she needs to have prior authorization through Zion and she understood. After having a wonderful conversation about how much she LOVES MPB.Health and Zion Health we both agreed that she had questions directly for Zion. I transferred Kimberly over to Zion. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-20 14:44:07', '2021-10-20 14:44:07'),
