  ('zcrm_1579374000078094003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043013154', 'Jani Osborne', NULL, '10-20-21 Jani is switching to SECURE to remain compliant in CA moving forward. She is self-employed. She has No pre-x. Only had pink eye or tiny issues like that.  We will cancel her SDHC next which increased to $274 from $230. With SECURE it''s $275.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-20 14:33:50', '2021-10-20 14:33:50'),
