  ('zcrm_1579374000078029003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '10/19/21: Emily called in a major panic re: her bunion surgery at 4:47pm & very upset.  She has surgery at 8:30 am tomorrow and doesn''t know for sure if it will be pd for ($18k I think was the price).  She talked w/Redirect and Sedera, but is confused on who would pay.  Waited all day Mon (I''m assuming yesterday) for a call back from Sedera, but never heard from them.  Now is totally panicked, crying, and not sure what to do.  We talked for a few quick minutes, but due to the time decided I would do a warm transfer to Sedera.  I spoke to a Chris (male) that answered and he said he could help her.  Never heard back and hope she was able to get the help she needs.  This is so 11th hour, I wasn''t exactly sure how we''d help her.  I did my best and at least when I transferred her to Sedera, it felt like the right track.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-20 08:57:17', '2021-10-20 08:57:17'),
