  ('zcrm_1579374000077970011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080865054', 'Donna Johnston', NULL, '10-19-21 Donna came via Mike and Kristy Dee who highly recommend me and this membership! Donna is a family of 4. They home schools their kids. They have an LLC via rental properties. She has Medishare now for just her at $222.90 and no wellness but can add it for a fee. They only go to naturopaths and seek alternative care! Son is in college now. They already have an HSA with Elevations Credit Union. They are all super healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. Husband is on employer plan and I think kids too. But, she might move them to this and possibly even husband to this membership. Considering SECURE $685/$1000.  Likely want a Dec. 1st start date. Not sure they can do it in time for Nov. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-19 16:48:32', '2021-10-20 16:51:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077976003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063894027', 'Kristine Nicoletti', NULL, 'Kristine called re: flu shots for the family.  She''ll confirm, but their pediatrician is listed for the kids.  She''ll look for herself &amp; her husband too.  We went over presenting the Planstin Card, MD billing all as prev, etc.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-19 15:20:04', '2021-10-19 15:20:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077968008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, 'Emily called in anxious that she has not heard back from Redirect regarding her upcoming bunyon surgery on 10/20/2021. She called the concierge team stating that Redirect told her that John was working on her need and she needed to speak with him. After speaking with John K., I let her know that she must have been speaking to John from Redirect. She then said that she thought maybe it was John from Sedera. So I reached out to Sedera and they stated that there is not a John or  Paulette on their team and that it must have been someone from Redirect. I warm transferred Emily to Redirect after letting her know that I was #3 in the que. She said she could take it from there so I transferred her to Redirect. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-19 14:54:54', '2021-10-19 14:55:21'),
