  ('zcrm_1579374000077936023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, 'Member called in letting me know that she would be cancelling son Breavitt due to him goin on his college coverage.  After I cancel him she wants me to write confirmation for the college that he is no longer on plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-19 14:19:57', '2021-10-19 14:19:57'),
