  ('zcrm_1579374000077968003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691127', 'Stephen Scharf', NULL, 'Stephen seems very confused about his plan. He stated that he was very confused by all of the cards that were sent to him. I explained each card  and each company and the roles they are playing in his medical cost sharing experience, twice. I explained that he needs to find an in-network doctor and present his Planstin card at his annual physical. I sent him information on how to present his MEC, a list of PHCS Network providers in his area, along with instructions on how to search the PHCS Network to Stephen. I also reached out to John Kach on Stephens behalf because we both had issues trying to log into his member portal. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-19 14:12:24', '2021-10-19 14:12:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077922008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069918014', 'Mark Sommers', NULL, 'Ulrike called, she just wanted to make sure that she uses her Planstin card for her daughter''s flu shot, I confirmed that this was correct. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-19 13:22:44', '2021-10-19 13:22:44'),
