  ('zcrm_1579374000077793013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075870059', 'Vanessa Lavoie', NULL, 'Vanessa called to cancel, I sent the online cancellation form and told her to fill it out by the 20th so that she is not charged again.  I also BCC''d Zach Masters. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-19 07:06:30', '2021-10-19 07:06:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077855016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770021', 'Sarah Sumner', NULL, 'Sarah called wanting to know why Sedera had not yet pd for her Aug 2021 colonoscopy saying they approved pymt after she submitted the bills to Sedera.  Let her know I cannot see Sedera info like that, so she''ll call them tomorrow to talk w/her needs counselor.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-18 18:00:04', '2021-10-18 18:00:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077855011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049472219', 'Guy Travis', NULL, 'Guy called looking to get into his CirrusMD.  I sent an invitation, but we struggled.  Sent an e-mail on his behalf asking them to help him.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-18 16:44:12', '2021-10-18 16:44:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077855003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887044', 'Jack Pardo', NULL, 'Karen called to verify which acct her pymt will be pulled from this mo.  She''ll call during business hours tomorrow to tt Patti.  She also wondered if we ever call and say "Client Srvcs" using a 613 #.  Told her I didn''t see that we''d called per our notes.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-18 16:22:18', '2021-10-18 16:22:18'),
