Gerald.Steele@ma.c4hco.com', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-18 15:39:42', '2021-10-18 15:39:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077818035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821700', 'Judith Snyder', NULL, '10-18-21 Judi called bc she''s frustrated with Redirect since now they stopped using the debit card to pay for visits and they want the provider to bill to them. She sees mostly alternative primary care docs who do not bill to anyone. They expect payment up front so it means one more step for her to pay and submit the get reimbursed, etc. So, she has hypothyroidism and Jeff is healthy, no pre-x. She does see chiro and has a visit on Wed. She knows she will now pay for that on her own as cash pay bc it will be pre-x. But, they will save $460 a month! She''s happy to have the insurance MEC too for bill directly and gain HSA compliance. She''s thrilled!  She will also join VPS Plan B for vision for her and Jeff. Dr. Patricia Llewellyn is in the network and Bay Care is in the PHCS network as well for mammo imaging. All set for SECURE $1000/$500 and I waived the $100 since already clients. We cancelled PDHC as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-18 15:36:31', '2021-10-18 15:36:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077793008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862096', 'Edward Christopher Wiencek', NULL, 'Rosemary called in asking about the COVID-19 booster, Flu and Shingles vaccines. I explained that currently the COVID-19 shot and booster are not on the ACA list and those will be an out of pocket expense. I relayed to Rosemary that for her Flu and Shingles she would need to go to an in-network provider. She then asked if she could go to a OBGYN or Endocrinologist to get her vaccines and I explained that I believe she would have to go to a Primary Care doctor for those. She wants to skip any steps with a PCP and move directly on to the specialists. She also wanted me to find facilities over 150 miles from her zip because she wanted to "try something different". She does understand that she has to find and in-network provider and present her Planstin card in order for her Flu and Shingles vaccines to be paid. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-18 14:17:12', '2021-10-18 14:17:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077818030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '10-18-21 I called and texted Nan again and she finally responded via text saying she made her payment successfully and her account is working. I assume she was able to go to her Dr. visit on Friday without any trouble. Gerry will close out the C4 ticket. Yay!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-18 14:15:47', '2021-10-18 14:15:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077833011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811278', 'Sheri Bowes', NULL, 'Robert called for help getting set up with CirrusMD, I sent him an invite. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-18 14:03:55', '2021-10-18 14:03:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077799028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842692', 'Michael Chavez', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel w/Sedera &amp; RCI &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-18 14:00:22', '2021-10-18 14:00:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077818019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, '10-18-21 Kerek is without ins again at a new job. He has no pre-x, super healthy. Since he''s W2 he needs CARE+. He''s paying with a cc since he''s currently setting up a new banking account. $1000/$215 and I waived the $100 since he''s been a member already.  He''s a pilot for JEM Air Holdings.  He also thanked me for helping his significant other Mary Sundblom. She just got into an accident and hurt her knee. She''s working through that process it sounds like. Bummer! He''s very appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-18 13:51:15', '2021-10-18 13:54:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077841003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059650127', 'Karen Guptil', NULL, 'Spoke to  Planstin.  They are going to find out why she is still on the invoice.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-10-18 13:45:06', '2021-10-18 13:45:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077799023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842692', 'Michael Chavez', NULL, 'Member emailed into Accounting to cancel plan.  I will send link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-18 13:44:07', '2021-10-18 13:44:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077818014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034085232', 'Richard Wilkinson', NULL, '10-18-21 Richard is healthy, no pre-x. He did a  colonoscopy 5-6 years ago and is on the 10 year plan.  So, he doesn''t need that before hits 65. He''s 63 now. He works for an employer. He did a little bit of contract work in 2021 but planning to end it for 2022. Best to put him on CARE+ at $215/$1000. He could also get employer coverage with his rate at aroung $215 with $1000 and not sure MOP.  Then he''d pay 20%-30% thereafter up to MOP.  He''s not certain the job will remain stable bc of supply issues right now. Likes CARE+ since his employment doesn''t matter. He also has the option to go back to Canada for 3 months and then he can get Canadian version of Medicare at no cost to him lifelong. It''s not great but better than nothing. We will talk tomorrow at 2:00.  He''s also currently paying $419 for SDHC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-18 13:25:22', '2021-10-18 13:25:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077833006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091836', 'Amber Donnell', NULL, 'Amber called for help finding doctor''s in the PHCS network, I helped her find both of the doctor''s she was looking for in network, she thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-18 13:22:21', '2021-10-18 13:22:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077799018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162245', 'Rhonda Savage', NULL, 'Member''s spouse Jim Stevens called in and said that they had called Sedera and found out that I had cancelled Rhonda eff 9/20.  This was for non payment.  However the FTNI CC pmt did not get cancelled and has been drafted since.  Since they have a CC on file we will have to cut them a check.  Jim still interested in moving forward with Sharing, I directed him back to Wiley Long and told him about Zion.  He will be getting in touch with him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-18 13:09:41', '2021-10-18 13:09:41'),
