  ('zcrm_1579374000077765008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077745035', 'Deborah Stoffel', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-18 09:41:15', '2021-10-18 09:41:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077764008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811278', 'Sheri Bowes', NULL, 'Last week I noticed Sheri opened her "Sched a Welcome Call'' e-mail, but I don''t see that she''s ever done one.  This am, she e-mailed me stating that we ''scammed'' her because she tried "Planting" and they tell her to call "telehealth".  Sent her an e-mail letting her know it''s ''CirrusMD'' she needs to access for telehealth & that the concierge service sent her an invite [that in a ''Welcome Call'' this would have been done prior to her urgent need.]  She then wrote back saying all sorts of horrible things.  Resending her the details I''ve prev sent re: IUAs, etc.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-18 09:36:19', '2021-10-18 11:56:58'),
