  ('zcrm_1579374000077678073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809288', 'Therese McCarthy', NULL, 'Sent a PHCS MD Kelly Anne found.  According to Therese, she call this doctor &amp; they are no longer practicing there.  Says Planstin is supposed to get back to her regarding options.  Still cannot seem to get her into HCBB.  Will get help &amp; get back to her.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-15 18:20:45', '2021-10-15 18:20:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077734008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918048', 'Bryan Schiff', NULL, 'Looking for himself, wife, &amp; 2 of their 3 children = still college students.  One daughter out of the country thought, so will be dad, mom, &amp; 1 child.  Ready to move according to our conversation.  Walked through the application with him.  Sb 11/1/21 eff date.
Also, referring his brother: Bobby Schiff', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-15 18:05:20', '2021-10-15 18:05:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077734003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362044', 'Therese Antonino', NULL, 'Mark called -- wanted to know how to start a new need with Zion.  Sent the template for submitting a need.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-15 16:18:06', '2021-10-15 16:18:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077725026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '10-15-21 Emily needed a little hand holding. She just got back to town after a cycling trip in Europe with 50 people. She said that everyone should just turn off the tv and forget about covid. She was back to living a normal life for the weeks she was there. Nobody had any problems, except one person tested a false positive to return home. They did a 2nd test and it came out negative. She''s doing a bunyon surgery next week and it will cost $18K. Redirect is in communication with Sedera. Someone named John is working her case and Paulette is helping her as well.  She''s committed to paying the $18K on her cc and is hoping Sedera will reimburse her before the bill is due. She''s fine that. She also had a dermatology visit that is likely right around $1000-$1500 which she didn''t submit. She had something removed from her leg successfully. She is also referring her friends Rhonda Swanson and Deb Ford who were both complaining about their health insurance. Rhonda lives in Boulder and owns Crimson and Clover clothing store/line.  She plans to have bunyon on other foot removed too shortly after the first so she''s not out of commission a ton longer. It''s a 3 month recovery and she wants to be able to mtn bike and ski, etc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-15 15:51:12', '2021-10-15 16:00:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077725016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '10-15-21 Spoke with Gerry today and he said again that Anthem is showing her account correctly finally and she just needed to make payment to activate it all successfully. I let Nan know via email yesterday. I left her a vm and sent a text to her now as well. She had an appt today that she should be all set for finally. Hopefully she''ll respond and we''ll close out ticket.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-15 14:57:51', '2021-10-15 14:57:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077725011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002887157', 'Trevor Mickelson', NULL, '10-15-21 Trevor and Julia are interested in the HMA and they have a DPC membership which can be paid for from the HMA as well. They agree this is better than dental insurance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-15 14:35:32', '2021-10-15 14:35:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077678068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020307072', 'Janet Winkelman', NULL, 'Member called in asking why her price went up.  I told her about the age band increase that she hadn''t been paying.  She did not receive a RCI card.  I advised her that there were some changes coming to Sedera and that she should be in touch with Jan to go over new options.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-15 14:15:03', '2021-10-15 14:15:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077692023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, 'Martha called very confused about how her IUA''s work, I went over and over, she had much more specific questions so I transferred her to Zion. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-15 14:04:23', '2021-10-15 14:04:23'),
