  ('zcrm_1579374000077692018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191450', 'Terese McGroarty', NULL, 'Terese called and wanted to know how to submit her husbands hospital bills to Zion, I sent her the Zion needs submission form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-15 13:45:51', '2021-10-15 13:45:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077678058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066423014', 'Asya Bangiyeva', NULL, 'Member called in on a 3 way call to cancel her membership. I explained that I would send her the cancelation link email right away and make sure it is filled out completely and submitted BEFORE the 20th in order for her not to be charged again. She then assumed that I was filling out the form for her and when I explained that it is something she will have to fill out electronically she got upset. The person she had on the phone with her had no idea how to use the internet, let alone fill out this form, so I told Asya that I would be happy to stay on the line while they were filling out the form in case they had any questions. She said no, have a good day, and hung up. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-15 13:37:43', '2021-10-15 13:37:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077678053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689471', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-15 12:05:47', '2021-10-15 12:05:47'),
