  ('zcrm_1579374000077725003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005173170', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, '10-15-21 Melissa is super healthy! She did get covid and is totally fine now and tested negative. That''s the only thing she''s had in many years. She has done some contract work as a yoga teacher for yoga Source. Not working much bc FT grad student right now.  She cancelled PSDHC and moved to SECURE for $275/$1000 instead of $375/$500.  She''s happy to get her cost down and will follow through on welcome call. She has her annual wellness visit set in Nov. She''s been trying to do that visit since Aug. but doctor has cancelled on her 4 times bc she''s an obgyn and births come first. So, I told Melissa to keep an eye on getting the digital card for her wellness visit since she probably won''t have the hard copy card in time. She agreed.  She also recommended I reach out to Richard Wilkinson to possibly switch his membership as well bc he''s paying a lot now bc in 60''s and on SDHC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-15 11:34:24', '2021-10-15 11:38:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077692013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206016', 'Jacqueline Olivier', NULL, 'Jacqueline called to be reminded of the self pay process, I sent her Zion''s needs submission link, and both preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-15 11:21:56', '2021-10-15 11:21:56'),
