  ('zcrm_1579374000077659023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081883004', 'Adriana Lopez', NULL, 'OPD Lead -- Husband John Martin called.  Ph # &amp; e-mail are his.  He''s aging into Medicare in 3/22.  They are currently on COBRA from his old job, but she''s very healthy and he''s looking for something for her due to the expense of their current cov.  Live in Clermont, but she does not care for his PCP: Dr Mediratta.  Sent him e-mail w/other close options &amp; per his req mailed hard copy of 5 pg OPD Memb Benefits brochure.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-14 23:12:20', '2021-10-14 23:12:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077659018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072038127', 'Tamara Granada', NULL, 'It looks like Tamara called in while I was stuck on the phone w/another member.  Called back &amp; LM.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-14 19:21:35', '2021-10-14 19:21:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077659013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809288', 'Therese McCarthy', NULL, 'tt Therese.  She spent the last 2 days trying to find a PHCS MD for her preventative (talking w/Planstin I think).  There are none where she lives.  She''ll let me know what Desiree finds out regarding her getting a preventative ck-up.   /  We spent time discussing an ankle issue, MRI centers near her, fair pricing on the 3 options for an ankle MRI, which I sent in an e-mail.  We went over her $2500 IUA, how it wks and I sent the submitting a need to Zion template.  She may contact her advisor Diane Border to take her IUA to 1k for FUTURE needs.  She understands it will not help w/the current ankle issue.  /  Sent her the template to update her pymt to EFT (to save on the processing fees).    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-14 19:07:48', '2021-10-14 19:07:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077642069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075035001', 'Rajeev Sood', NULL, '10-14-21 First practice I connected with. Sumita Sood is Dr. Sood''s wife and manages the practice. I met them in person. Their office was very quiet when we were there. They are super nice. I had Ali send them a thumb drive with the 3 or 9 minute video to put on their screen. I''ve been in communication with them a bunch. But, I''m going to send the next emails now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-14 16:33:24', '2021-10-14 16:33:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077659008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899022', 'Lisa Nicholls', NULL, 'Russell called - he never rec''d the e-mail I sent on 10/12/21.  Sent a copy of the 1st e-mail from my Outlook &amp; he confirmed he did rec it this time.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-14 16:05:52', '2021-10-14 16:05:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077659003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'Maurine called from her ob-gyn office.  Bridgette in the Dr''s off called Planstin &amp; was told Maurine has a 3k ded she must meet before any coverage.  I called Planstin and tt Brian.  He proceeded to call Bridgette at the Dr''s off: 415-923-3123 &amp; let her know how preventative, in network, etc., would work.  ILM for Maurine that should sb all set, but to let me know if she needs further assistance.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-14 15:25:39', '2021-10-14 15:25:39'),
