  ('zcrm_1579374000077642041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047526542', 'Mehr Rahmatullah', NULL, '10-14-21 Johanna Medina is the practice coordinator and is super nice and easy to work with. Met in person on trip to FL in late Aug.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-14 14:23:28', '2021-10-14 14:23:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077642033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012051083', 'Nancy Gentry', NULL, '10-14-21 Nancy said she''s really impressed with Zion! Her son went into the ER this year and he was immediately approved for $25K sharing. Nancy worked very hard to get the hospital to give her the discounted rates and get the bills ASAP. They were tough to work with but finally gave her the proper bills and set a deadline to get the best rate. Zion was Great to work with and appreciated her strong efforts. They were easy to reach and paid the bill on his behalf right away. She''s also super happy that this works anywhere in the country for when they travel and such.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-14 14:14:42', '2021-10-14 14:15:19'),
