  ('zcrm_1579374000077642018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077643079', 'Audriana TBD', NULL, '10-14-21 Audriana is the Practice Coordinator for Advanced Family Practice. Maxine is also involved as the Practice Manager. I should get her email address too!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-14 12:54:08', '2021-10-14 12:54:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077622008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Marc called because he was having a hard time getting a hold of anyone at Planstin, I tried warm transferring him but there was a message stating that they would be out of the office until 1:30 MST, Marc is going to call them back later. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-14 12:39:27', '2021-10-14 12:39:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077642013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077643040', 'Tina Reno', NULL, '10-14-21 Email 1 Sent.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-14 12:31:46', '2021-10-14 12:31:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077642008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077643040', 'Tina Reno', NULL, 'Met in person in Fl during trip. Tina was super great and easy to work with. She''s eager to get this going and assist however she can.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-14 11:08:06', '2021-10-14 11:08:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077642003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, '10-14-21 I just sent Jeff a text trying to get him to take action on his Need which is $800K+!!!  OMG! This was incurred on his first day of membership. They will need to look into it as pre-x. He doesn''t respond to email and his vm isn''t set up so nobody can leave a message. I''ll email him as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-14 10:41:19', '2021-10-14 10:41:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077615008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820161', 'Tammy Bertolette', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-14 10:22:53', '2021-10-14 10:22:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077625008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', 'Redirect Term:', 'Tracking #12282916
Sent by Patti Baron on 10/14/2021.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-14 09:20:16', '2021-10-14 12:07:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077625003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation request.  I will notify Redirect &amp; Sedera &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-14 09:17:39', '2021-10-14 09:17:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077622003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, 'Zion Health reached out to us this morning because they still can''t get a hold of Jeffery.  I tried calling, but no answer and vm isn''t set up.  Then I emailed him and tagged Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-14 09:14:42', '2021-10-14 09:14:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077615003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075689424', 'Jason Redman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-14 07:53:09', '2021-10-14 07:53:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077614003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056653025', 'Sara Bollmann', NULL, 'Wendy cc''ed me on an email from Sara who was wondering how to submit her needs to Zion Health. I sent Sara the Zion Needs Submission instructions and cc''ed Wendy on my email to Sara. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-14 07:51:54', '2021-10-14 07:51:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077593011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058319043', 'jordan batchelder', NULL, 'Sydney called.  She had her preventative ob-gyn appt and wanted to know how to get reimbursed (the doctor''s front desk told her she pays &amp; gets reimbursed).  We went over Planstin, CirrusMD, &amp; Zion.  Sounds like the pap came back as somewhat off, so we discussed the colposcopy and other items, IUA, etc.  Sent how to submit a need to Zion template.  She''ll let us know if she needs something more.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-13 18:20:49', '2021-10-13 18:20:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077593003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811189', 'Bryan Droznes', NULL, 'Brenda called in:  she cannot hear & has decided she must go see a doctor immediately about the situation.  It''s already 3:48pm.  She says it''s just wax in her ear.  I sent her a list of ENT MDs to 20-miles from her home, but she wanted to know how to handle going to the urgent care.  Went over cash pay, which she seems fine with.  Told her she should also schedule her ''Welcome Call'' so she can learn better how the plan works.  Bryan''s name was misspelled, so I corrected that.  & both e-mail addresses on file were his so  Brenda had me delete the ''bleeker'' address & add hers as the secondary.    - CA

Brenda called saying she hadn''t rec''d the e-mail.  Resent info from mympy Outlook directely.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-13 15:56:12', '2021-10-13 16:09:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077565023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077566050', 'Michael Baker', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-13 12:45:21', '2021-10-13 12:45:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077565018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077566038', 'Todd Lesnett', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-13 12:38:01', '2021-10-13 12:38:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077572008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071572039', 'Mara Simoneau', NULL, 'Mara called regarding fair pricing on mole removal. I sent her the HCBB fair pricing for mole removal in her area. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-13 12:37:08', '2021-10-13 12:37:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077572003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212027', 'Kristen Henry', NULL, 'Kristen called in requesting a welcome call scheduler because she states that she never received one. But Vanessa did try to contact Kristen in Sept. regarding her welcome call. Kristen was also confused about her new cards so I explained those to her. She also had questions about getting the Flu shot and I advised her to present her Planstin card to her doctor and that flu shot will be covered. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-13 12:30:57', '2021-10-13 12:30:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077565013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077566026', 'MaiLan Boris', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-13 12:30:19', '2021-10-13 12:30:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077565008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042073115', 'Mailan Boris', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation to cancel this Sedera membership I will let Sedera know as well as RCI and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-13 12:11:50', '2021-10-13 12:11:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077565003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359289', 'Jorge Zatarain', NULL, 'Leah Garcia emailed in asking why the members Share Amount had gone down from $655 to $588.  I looked into payment history and when member changed their IUA Share amount was changed to the $1500 IUA instead of the $2500.  This resulted in a $67 per month difference.  I will refund 10 months to the member out of FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-13 12:00:41', '2021-10-13 12:00:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077564003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947103', 'Holly Hildreth', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Added secondary email as well.  Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-13 11:56:28', '2021-10-13 11:57:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077513013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, 'Kristy called Jennifer today per Wendy. I spoke with Kristy and decided to put her in contact with Blue Care Connect to see if they could offer any assistance for her upcoming surgery.  -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-13 11:00:23', '2021-10-13 11:00:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077513008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077408099', 'Linda Walshe', NULL, 'Rude agent to concierge team member Jennifer. States she is too busy to wait for the assistance she needs in order to do her training and that she does not have the time to deal with us. I transferred her to John. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-13 09:42:12', '2021-10-13 09:42:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077494008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072673163', 'Joshua Fisher', NULL, 'Put in request for cancelation effective December 1, 2021. For he got a new job that is offering benefits. Sent email with link to cancelation form to fill out. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-13 09:16:30', '2021-10-13 09:16:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077513003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008640041', 'Allison Adams', NULL, 'Allison called inquiring about the COVID vaccine being a covered expense. I explained to Allison that if it is not on the ACA list approved by the government then it will be an out of pocket expense. She continued to tell me that she has spent several thousands of dollars for a plan that will not cover a COVID vaccine. I reiterated to Allison that we have no control over the ACA list of approved items and that it is something the government oversees. She wanted to be transferred to Zion in which I told her that they would not cover her COVID vaccine and that her MEC would be the one to use for this but since it is not on the ACA list, it will be an out of pocket expense. She finally understood but she was not happy with this information and continuously used the term "insurance".  -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-13 09:04:32', '2021-10-13 09:04:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077494003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811415', 'Nancy Coveleskie', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-13 08:10:47', '2021-10-13 08:10:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077379013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899022', 'Lisa Nicholls', NULL, 'Russell called needing to change his pymt info.  Sent him Patti''s template.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-12 17:01:49', '2021-10-12 17:01:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077407058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, '10-12-21 I talked with Robin and she''s not aware of Covered CA allowing people to enroll outside of open enrollment as well. She''s going to ask her colleague. I shared that with Lori. I also told Lori the price she found with Kaiser is only valid for Nov and Dec. Then she will have to go through the enrollment process all over again Nov. 1st for Jan. 1st start date. She was not pleased but happy I told her! She''s already enrolled with Kaiser but might be putting herself into a jam.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-12 16:27:06', '2021-10-12 16:27:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077407053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, '10-12-21 Lori decided she''s not super comfortable as self-pay patient. She got too many questions every time she went to the doctor''s. She had challenges with Redirect taking too long to help her find place to get mammo and bone density tests. The provider she chose cancelled on her 3x!  That''s no fault of Redirect or MPB. But, she was able to get a small subsidy through Covered Cali and will pay $50 more per month to join Kaiser and have everything under one roof, which she prefers.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-12 16:16:15', '2021-10-12 16:16:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077407048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '10-12-21 Gerry called back and he''s still working with Anthem and letting them know she has been attempting to make her payments without success all along. At very least he will attempt to get Aug. affectuated and possibly not worry about the July payment. With Aug. start date, she still has time to make the payment and hasn''t been able to do so. He''s working on the back end and instructed not to bother calling Anthem anymore until he gives us a response. The front line folks can''t see what''s happening in the back end to solve the problem.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-12 14:39:13', '2021-10-12 14:39:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077428013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013046003', 'Juanita Kainrath', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation due to aging into Medicare.  I will cancel w/Zion and billing in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-12 14:07:09', '2021-10-12 14:07:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077407028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077374092', 'Dave Owens', NULL, '10-12-21 Dave completed app for him and son Maverick for CARE+ $1000/$390. All set for Nov. 1st start.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-12 14:06:55', '2021-10-12 14:06:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077428008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077374092', 'Dave Owens', NULL, 'Member &amp; Child $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-12 12:04:51', '2021-10-12 12:04:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077379008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, 'Aine called regarding going to Urgent Care today since she cannot get in with her doctor. I explained the self-pay process to her. She then asked about any of her Urgent Care expenses being reimbursed, I explained that the need must go above her $1000 IUA in order for her to receive reimbursement and that a member may be responsible for 3 IUA''s per year. I sent Aine a copy of Zion''s IUA guidelines along with leaving a detailed vm with that same info. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-12 11:51:06', '2021-10-12 11:51:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077428003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025217005', 'Kimberly Carpenter', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Sedera and RCI &amp; pmt in A123.  Member re-enrolling in Zion/List bill.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-12 11:37:20', '2021-10-12 11:37:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077413008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716955', 'Wes Richardson', NULL, 'Wes called because his son broke his ankle and is having surgery tomorrow, I went over his IUA and gave him Zion''s number so that he can let them know what''s going on. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-12 11:33:41', '2021-10-12 11:33:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077407008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, '10-12-21 Left vm for Lori bc rec''d email from KC showing she''s looking to cancel her membership. I''m not sure why.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-12 11:18:45', '2021-10-12 11:18:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077387008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974147', 'Mailys MM Nasrallah', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Updated address on file as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-12 11:17:15', '2021-10-12 11:21:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077413003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809288', 'Therese McCarthy', NULL, 'Therese called about her preventative care benefits- I sent her the preventative care template. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-12 11:08:55', '2021-10-12 11:08:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077407003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '10-12-21 Talked with Gerald in Escalations with C4. He sees that Anthem has responded/confirmed her enrolled many times. They already resent the file on Oct. 7th and she tried to pay on the 8th. It could be because the reps are thinking she''s trying to pay on the old plan for July $277.87. But, she''s trying to pay for Aug. $163.34 and onward. Jan. - June was $172.07. July was $277.87 and Aug. onward was $163.34. She needs to pay for Aug. onward. Gerald will send file again now. But, he recommends she tries to make the payment now since they should have it updated by now. Let Gerald know if that works on not.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-12 10:55:09', '2021-10-12 10:55:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077387003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974147', 'Mailys MM Nasrallah', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-12 10:36:41', '2021-10-12 10:36:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077379003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755459', 'Andrew Goldman', NULL, 'Andrew called regarding a screening colonoscopy his doctor has ordered. I explained to Andrew that this is a preventative service that is covered by Planstin. I sent him a list of Gastroenterologists and facilities that are in the PHCS network. I also advised Andrew to verify that they are in fact in the PHCS network when he calls to schedule his colonoscopy. Since Andrew has yet to have a welcome call and has no idea what his plan entails, I sent him a welcome call scheduler per his request. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-12 10:29:59', '2021-10-12 10:29:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077321028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077374001', 'Isaiah Scott', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-12 10:22:59', '2021-10-12 10:22:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077321023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077371001', 'Linda Blake', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-12 10:17:42', '2021-10-12 10:17:42'),
