  ('zcrm_1579374000077231008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294135', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, 'Josh, Ashley, and I got them moved to &amp; signed-up with SECURE &amp; waived the $100 fee.  Sent them Patti''s cancellation link, which they completed while I was on the phone with them.  The did select the 1k IUA on the new plan &amp; both cancellation &amp; enrollment eff dates of 11/1/21.  They confirmed waiting period for pregnancy is 60-days as well and know they must wait until after 1/1/22 to conceive.  They know to submit their proof of self-employment asap.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-11 08:07:50', '2021-10-18 16:24:40'),
