  ('zcrm_1579374000077218003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, 'Rec''d a call from Carlos'' #, but it sounded like he pocket dialed us.  Just in case I called the # back and LM.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-08 15:37:37', '2021-10-08 15:37:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077217003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974121', 'Maria Crompton', NULL, 'Maria called regarding her member portal log in and CirrusMD registration for her husband. I reached out to John to look into why Maria cannot log into her member portal, I tried with her log in credentials and it stated that they were invalid. She was also inquiring about her husbands CirrusMD invitation but upon looking into their account it seems as though they were never told that they had to have unique emails on file per person. I put Maria''s email on file and am currently waiting for CirrusMD to assist Maria. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-08 14:44:09', '2021-10-08 14:44:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077191013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, 'member called for help in getting set up with CirrusMD- I was unable to send her an invite, but reached out to CirrusMD for support and tagged Aine.  I told her that they usually respond in 24-48 hours, I went over the self pay process as she is thinking about going to an urgent care. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-08 14:40:34', '2021-10-08 14:40:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077182023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104296', 'Roland Jefferson Jr', NULL, 'As of 4:30 10/8 member has not been in contact with me after opening the follow up email that I sent this morning.  I will cancel this member with Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-08 14:25:35', '2021-10-08 14:25:35'),
