  ('zcrm_1579374000077194011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '10-8-21 I asked her if she had proof of trying to pay. Here''s her response, "The only proof that I would have is the last conversation I had  with the supervisor that advised my not to pay and said it could not be cancelled due to non payment within a 10 day period. How could a person have proof of attempting to make a payment? That doesn’t even make sense. You either make a payment or you don’t it’s not like I made a payment that was rejected buy them. The ticket number from that guy was 210929-000858. Maybe they can research that ticket and discover who I was talking to and listen to the recording of our conversation. I know that’s something they can do.

Nan Kushel', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-08 13:22:24', '2021-10-08 13:22:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077182018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084020', 'Linda Tornabene', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation request I will notify Sedera , RCI &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-08 12:31:10', '2021-10-08 12:31:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077182013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218132', 'Sandra Blanchard', NULL, 'Member emailed Wendy asking why she had been doubled billed for old amount of $486 &amp; $574.  Her payment in FTNI had not been deleted and she was being charged out of A123 as well.  I will refund her 2 pmts of $486 = $972.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-08 12:09:05', '2021-10-08 12:09:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077194003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '10-8-21 Email nan.kushel@gmail.com Phone 3038081236 Account # 5550910500. Christian with C4 called and said it was all submitted and ready to change but Anthem responded saying her acct was cancelled due to non-payment. She''s been trying to pay and not allowed. This problem began with C4 site issues back in June! I''m submitting an escalations message now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-08 11:07:07', '2021-10-08 11:07:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077191003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010342011', 'Marta Vera Wenokor', NULL, 'Marta called because she couldn''t find the script quote that Jennifer sent her the other day- I resent it and she received it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-08 10:52:02', '2021-10-08 10:52:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077182008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077181001', 'Andrea McDonough', NULL, 'Member called in prior to completing her application to ask some questions.  She was enrolling in the Care + plan after Leslie telling her that it would satisfy the In Mandate in MA. She also asked questions about the HSA and limits and if she could open it at her bank.  I went through the concept of a need &amp; IUA and how they work together.   This should have been covered with the advisor but it wasn''t.  Application came in under sales I changed to Leslie.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-08 10:39:59', '2021-10-08 10:39:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077184003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074214057', 'Anthony Spohn', NULL, 'Advisor called to say that Member was confused the Welcome that stated.... that Advisor received a text stating the following:              " Wow, what a bizarre intro call.... lots of misinformation ( told me I''m not part of Planstin), couldn''t answer even the most basic questions, ended up transferring me to ZIon, and they told me she is wrong, that I AM part of Planstin. Apparently this program just collects money from participants, then Dr Lee decides which occurrences to pay for based on subjective criteria he and the board consider AFTER an occurrence has happened. Very strange!!!!! I don''t know.... I need to do more research on this program .  Your " introductory call" person needs training. "                                                                
