  ('zcrm_1579374000077002043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076991106', 'Nicole Doroski', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book welcome call after her start date of November 1, 2021. Sent email to do so. Vanessa orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-07 07:34:09', '2021-10-07 07:34:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077074008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025370020', 'Patricia Druckman', NULL, 'Member emailed saying that someone from RCI logged into the Medicare account and changed her Primary Insurance from Medicare to RCI.  She asked if there was a hack and expressed that Medicare gave her a 45 day window to get this corrected.  I escalated this to Dave Shull @ Apex to look into.  I will notify this former member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-07 07:27:17', '2021-10-07 07:27:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077074003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974125', 'Gerard McHugh', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to cancel.  I will send him out link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-07 07:03:24', '2021-10-07 07:03:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077069013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, '10-6-21 Debra currently has a hospital indemnity plan for $227 a month. She now has a job and can afford better protection. She had emergency gall bladder surgery Dec. 28th, 2019. No other health issues. But, I''m recommending she waits until Jan. 1st 2022 start date to avoid any possible pre-x issues down the road. She''s in no rush and happy to wait. She is on blood pressure meds and uses synthroid for thyroid issues. Her current indemnity plan has the typical caps on everything. They also pay $250 for mammogram and $500 for colonoscopy.  So, she''d still wind up paying for most services she needs. She''s also learned to become very MPowered by going in as a self-pay patient! She loves the process now to see the discounts. She loved Sedera and more importantly her Needs Coordinator was excellent when she had the gall bladder removed. But, she''s happy to choose SECURE $1000/$275 and hopes for an equally positive experience.  We have a date scheduled on Dec. 1st for Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-06 20:17:46', '2021-10-06 20:17:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077069008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096033002', 'Carl Loven', NULL, '10-6-21 Carl is 57 and wife Mary is 61. Referred by Chris Loven from Power Earth, as he referred to him. Carl is retired and Mary retiring any time now. But, Carl receives rental income from multiple properties as 1099 and LLC. He also financed a small business. So, he has plenty of ways of showing self-employment. He is health, no tobacco, wife has thyroid meds and healthy otherwise. They use an eastern medicine doctor for all of their preventative measures to remain super healthy all the time. They have an HSA already. Wants SECURE since he believes they may need colonoscopies sometime soon and wife needs mammogram possibly. But, their eastern medicine dr. might not encourage some of the wellness items. They just follow guidance from eastern medicine dr.  They want the SECURE $1000/$500. He will find out what wife is paying now through company to determine their chosen start date soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-06 20:09:04', '2021-10-06 20:09:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077039009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299149', 'Grant Hudson', NULL, 'Grant called in re: an e-mail reminding him to use CirrusMD.  I walked him through downloading the app &amp; getting setup.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-06 16:54:42', '2021-10-06 16:54:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077002038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076991118', 'Shelly Theimer', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-06 13:53:20', '2021-10-06 13:53:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077002033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076991106', 'Nicole Doroski', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-06 13:38:31', '2021-10-06 13:38:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077069003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078309004', 'James Skurski', NULL, '10-6-21 Jim is finally working with Darius for trad ins for himself.  Wife Victoria has still not watched  the video. Her email is Skurshani@Gmail.com. He suggested I send and email and call her. I just sent her the email with the link to the video and told her I''d call her this afternoon. They need a Nov. 1st start date. She was hoping they could just keep their Cobra plan and pay on their own now that the 18 months will be complete. I told Jim that''s not possible since it''s a group plan only offered to the employer group, not to an individual. She''s a doctor herself, so he says she''s hard to get to act on anything.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-06 13:36:05', '2021-10-06 13:36:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077002028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006420311', 'Lori Stuart', NULL, 'Cancelled member eff 10/31.  Going on Medicare', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-06 13:30:18', '2021-10-06 13:30:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077002023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054820050', 'Michael Brisbane', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form.  I updated.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-06 13:25:04', '2021-10-06 13:25:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077002018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670178', 'Bruce Ballet', NULL, 'Member called into the concierge asking about Preventative.  Kelly told he that there was no preventative with the Care+ plan.  Member expressed that advisor told her she did.  I called Rick Willard and asked him to reach out to member and explain.  I asked Rick to contact me after he spoke to member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-06 13:08:29', '2021-10-06 13:08:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077021018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064873042', 'Matthew Shostek', NULL, 'Matt needed a list of providers in his area to go to for his prescription renewal. He tried CirrusMD first but apparently they wouldn''t refill that prescription. So I told him I would attach the list of General Practitioner''s in his area to an email that he asked for with instructions on how to search for providers in his area. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-10-06 12:53:21', '2021-10-06 12:53:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077021013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006420311', 'Lori Stuart', NULL, 'Called to cancel, sent cancellation email with link. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-10-06 12:02:34', '2021-10-06 12:02:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076993028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006092', 'Nicole Mata', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Requesting to Kelly F another QR Life Code Card mailed to member. Updated and Verified address as well.  Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-06 10:25:28', '2021-10-06 10:42:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000077021008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290256', 'Lynn MacRitchie', NULL, 'Lynn called to say that from CirrusMd that her daughter should go and get checked for Strep throat. She asked if she just goes anywhere she can find and present herself as a cash pay patient. I let her know that she was correct. She s all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-10-06 09:37:34', '2021-10-06 09:37:34'),
