  ('zcrm_1579374000076965101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, 'Martha called.  Still extremely confused.  Tried to straighten things out.  Discussed QR Codes, Planstin, Cards (requested new Planstin &amp; Zion digital and hard copies), how the IUAs work, decreasing to a 1k IUA (she understands, but not completely).  Quite a talker!  Hard to get off the phone.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-05 18:21:36', '2021-10-05 18:21:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076965096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066223013', 'Ashley Gillispie', NULL, 'Ashley called &amp; wanted to verify detials on her Planstin preventative Ob-gyn appt.  We went over everything.  This gal really seems to get it!    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-05 17:10:58', '2021-10-05 17:10:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076968026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '10-5-21 Kaylee was nice and reached Victoria who finally could see the problem with the APTC not showing as the $609.28 and her amt $163.34. Kaylee for permission from Victoria who is apparently a Supervisor to submit the TKT and backdate the plan as discussed previously. Newest TKT # is 211005-000899. She included that it''s imminent for a medical need and said to check back on Friday to see if any change has been made.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-05 17:10:46', '2021-10-05 17:10:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076965088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'Metzli, the Sedera ''need'' coordinator, replied to my e-mail saying Melissa understands she needs to submit all of the EOBs for the colonoscopy.  I''m here to say, Melissa does not.  Therefore, I sent an e-mail instructing Melissa to submit the EOBs to Metzli so they can do a coordination call.  Included all of Metzli''s contact info including the scheduling link.  CC''d Metzli Sanchez from Sedera.  BCC''d Jennifer Thorin-Savard as we are trying to make sure we aren''t duplicating efforts.    - CA

Melissa e-mailed back she did send the EOB & Metzli has it.  I suggested she use the scheduline link & make an appt with Metzli.  CC''d Metzli, BCC''d Jenn.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-05 15:57:21', '2021-10-05 16:21:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076963018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065580074', 'Carrie Todd', NULL, 'Carrie called and wanted to know how to present herself as a self-pay patient- went over. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-05 14:56:48', '2021-10-05 14:56:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076968021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '10-5-21 Nan is now very mad and blaming me for C4 and Anthem''s issues. I spoke with Victoria first and she says the account is showing the correct APTC of $609.28 and $163.34 her cost. But it only shows when I click in the Eligibility section not in Enrollments. She suggested I call Anthem Billing and Enrollments to make sure the information is accurate. If they push back then connect them with C4 in a 3-way call. Got hung up on when I told Victoria that I''m not seeing the same information on my end. Now talking with Shikira and put on hold as she looks into it. Plan should be new pmt amount is $163.34 and APTC is $609.28, Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO 5500 HMO/Silver.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-05 14:54:59', '2021-10-05 14:54:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076942026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, 'Debbie called regarding seeing a nutritionist, I explained that she would have to present herself as a self pay patient. She also asked that I look up an OBGYN she had in mind to verify if they were in the PHCS network and they were! -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-10-05 13:17:11', '2021-10-05 13:17:11'),
