  ('zcrm_1579374000076968008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061317', 'Patricia Barnett', NULL, '10-5-21 Patricia called to understand how to change her IUA due to possible future MRI need after casual discussion with chiropractor. She''s been going to the chiro for many, many years simply for preventative measures. She has a sensitivity that they are deciding whether or not to look into. She''s never had any problems, she''s super healthy and does body work for living. She just wants to take care of herself as best as possible. Upon annual renewal she wants to change from $2500 IUA to $1000. She also knows of the 60 day waiting period when changing the IUA. I also re-explained the pre-x clause in case there''s something in the records to deem it as pre-x since she''s seen chiro ongoing for many years. She was a bit frustrated with me but understood I was just trying to help her understand all the ramifications of her decisions and best ways to navigate the system. She will contact me closer to Nov. 20th to make the change for Dec. 1, her annual renewal.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-05 10:40:50', '2021-10-05 10:40:50'),
