  ('zcrm_1579374000076953018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'Melissa called me again during the later concierge shift.  I think I''ve gotten it past the RCI thing.  Melissa is totally confused on the different companies and what to do.  I sent the following to Jennifer Thorin-Savard so we can maybe stop chasing our tails:  

[4:46 PM] Cari A.
Hi Jennifer, Melissa Lagassi called me again Monday afternoon...

Re:  RCI/APEX:  I never heard back for Heather Neideffer after leaving both a detailed message and sending 2 details e-mails. 
        HOWEVER, I think this should be a SEDERA need.  It''s not preventative.  According to Melissa, they removed polyps, so it moved from screening to diagnostic. 

Re:  SEDERA:  Melissa got a Sedera need setup.  Juan from Sedera called to schedule an appt with Melissa''s ''Sedera Need Coordinator'' Metzli Sanchez, but Melissa told him she was at work and couldn''t talk then.  Then claimed no one called to help her.  Yet, at some point Melissa has talked with Metzli, so I''m not sure what she''s expecting when she says she hasn''t heard from anyone.I think getting the items submitted to Sedera properly is out next step. Melissa may or may not have gotten them uploaded to Sedera.  Last week I e-mailed Metzli to find out because Melissa is sooo confused.  Yet, no reply to me from Metzli.  I e-mailed Metzli again tonight (& cc’d Melissa and bcc''d you), asking if she wants to talk during my hours tomorrow to help clarify what I believe is happening. 

Melissa does not understand the different entites and does not seem able to hear what needs to happen next.  She’s predetermined this is going to be an issue because a guy she works with told her it would be.  No matter how decisively I guide her, she does not follow instructions!

Melissa received a detailed ‘Explanation of Benefits’ from Manchester Hospital today.  That''s something she says she will e-mail to Metzli because she says anything she submits, they do not receive. I hope this helps!!! 

Please call me tomorrow before you are off, or after 11:00am your time (9:00am mine), and maybe that will help us all get onto the same page?', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-04 16:50:02', '2021-10-04 16:50:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076953013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066677099', 'Marcelee Cognito', NULL, 'Marcelee''s husband Larry called.  They need to update pymt info.  Sent Patti''s pymt update template.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-04 16:44:11', '2021-10-04 16:44:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076953008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257159', 'Michele Schwadron', NULL, 'Michele called needing PHCS mammogram locations near her 80304 zip.  Sent her a list off the PHCS search site via e-mail.  Went over what to say &amp; how to handle it since she''s on Planstin.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-04 16:29:13', '2021-10-04 16:29:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076953003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, 'Diana is having her hearing checked.  She wondered if it''s something that would be covered.  She said it''s a life long issue, so we discussed pre-x, the waiting period, her 1k IUA, etc.  She''s going to let them know she''s a ''cash pay'' pt &amp; will worry about the waiting period, etc, if she needs to down the road.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-10-04 16:27:28', '2021-10-04 16:27:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076942016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003546005', 'Teresa Fox', NULL, '10-4-21 Dr. Terri Fox is interested in moving to SECURE. She saw her price increase with LHS to $359+$50. She never uses it. She has Hashimotos - thyroid issue which she treats herself doing blood draws in her office. She also has migraines and treats herself. Does not believe there''s any major issue since it''s been going on a while and no change. She has medications and treats it herself. She chooses integrative and functional medicine.  I explained the need to pre-approve for that with a licensed professional to alternative medicine.  She wants to switch to SECURE for Nov. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-04 15:06:17', '2021-10-04 15:06:17'),
