  ('zcrm_1579374000076942008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077830004', 'Angela Coy', NULL, '10-4-21 Angela is turning 26 in Oct, actually yesterday. Don her dad is trying to help her but he''s very confused. Her income looks to be $10K in 2021 and 2022 they think. She might get onto her company''s insurance plan if she gets enough hours in the future. But, right now she''s part-time.  She has some meds and does annual gyn visit.  But, she''s W2 employee and no self-employment so CARE+ is only option. Also regular ins starts at $171.12 for 2021 with $8550 ded and mop. So ER visit may cost her $8550! He was worried about it costing her $1000 no less $8550.  She could be on Medicaid which they aren''t excited about.  Don will watch the video again and share it with Angela and his wife Linda. He now realizes Angela really needs to be involved in this process! He didn''t know her doctors name but goes to Park Ridge Family. She also needs eye with VSP. I''ll send that over.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-04 11:53:58', '2021-10-04 11:53:58'),
