  ('zcrm_1579374000076869028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076872016', 'Anthony Clark', NULL, 'Propsect called in Engaged with Jennifer via phone.    Prospect called in again, spoke to Julia who answered most of his questions.  There were specific questions he had regarding pre-ex and so forth.  Spoke to Anthony, answered his questions.  Compared pricing and benefits for OPD with ACA plan.  Ozempic  (World Meds - 390/mo)  price of OPD plus med  is 689.  Cheapest ACA plan (ambetter) is 750.  Sent comparison via email.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2021-10-01 14:48:17', '2021-10-01 14:48:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076809038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509046', 'Greg Jenkins', NULL, 'Sheila called for help finding doctor''s in the PHCS network as well as a list of Podiatrists.  She wanted the search for Steamboat Springs CO, but that area is too remote and came up with nothing.  I emailed her this and offered to run another search in another zip code, I also sent a list of Podiatrists off of HCBB. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-01 13:54:32', '2021-10-01 13:54:32'),
