  ('zcrm_1579374000076809021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042857185', 'Molly Palmer', NULL, 'Molly called because she wanted to know if Covid testing was a covered expense, I told her that Sedera does cover the cost partially and that she needed to submit her bill to Sedera.  I sent her instructions on how to submit a need. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-01 12:55:15', '2021-10-01 12:55:15'),
