  ('zcrm_1579374000076809013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530137', 'Sarah Pak', NULL, '10-1-21 They were with us and Sedera then Sarah got a job and benefits with Kaiser. Then during covid she lost her job and they really just want access to colonoscopy and mammograms and catastrophic solutions. He''s not interested in telehealth since he can do all of that himself. He''s leaning towards the $5000 IUA and potentially DIRECT if he''s allowed to be considered his own DPC for the discount. He won''t pay another doctor since he can do that. Waiting for a response from Tim Hirsch. They are also dragging their feet about life insurance. Health ins protection is his primary need now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-01 11:24:52', '2021-10-01 11:25:32'),
