  ('zcrm_1579374000076796008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005654211', 'Hans Erickson', NULL, 'Hans wanted to know if an annual physical was included in his plan- I explained that it wasn''t and went over with him how his plan works.  He thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-01 10:25:08', '2021-10-01 10:25:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076796003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049054126', 'Santiago Mussi Tiscornia', NULL, '10-1-21 Santi and Maggie are enrolling in SECURE $1000/$685. I had them waive the $100 fee since Santi is already a member. They understand they will not get the $100 referral fee now. She''s interested in maternity and understands the 60 day wait.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-10-01 10:13:24', '2021-10-01 10:13:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076784008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132121', 'Inga Hughes', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-01 10:02:21', '2021-10-01 10:02:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076787018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076741040', 'Financial Officer', NULL, '10/1 not qualified - university', 'Traci McCoid', 'Traci McCoid', '2021-10-01 09:49:54', '2021-10-01 09:49:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076784003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070569025', 'Robert Pederson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with wife Allison. Putting in request to Kelly F to send out replacement QR Life Code Cards for Robert and Allison. Verified address as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-01 09:23:40', '2021-10-01 09:23:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076674044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075870023', 'Rashid Finegold', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-10-01 08:49:47', '2021-10-01 08:49:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076677023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075870402', 'Nydia Cuevas', NULL, 'Member changed mind and decided to enroll on ACA plan. KG', 'Accounting Office', 'Accounting Office', '2021-10-01 08:22:26', '2021-10-01 08:22:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076723008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005271109', 'Bryan Strazinsky', NULL, 'Heather called and wanted to know if we still help with Liberty billing- I told her no.  She asked me to transfer her to Liberty, she had been having a very hard time getting a hold of anyone there. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-10-01 07:54:42', '2021-10-01 07:54:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076677018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005929297', 'Lana Meell', NULL, 'Member emailed in with a change of address.  I will email Cognito form to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-10-01 07:06:13', '2021-10-01 07:06:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076674036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076800004', 'Leslie Pearson', NULL, '9-30-21 Leslie is on Cobra now and can continue for Oct. for $550. She''s not using it and doesn''t want to pay that much! Her health issues are an old rotator cuff repair bothers her on occasion. She just got a cortisone shot and paid cash $300. Only allowed to do that once per year and she''s fine paying cash. She also pays cash for compounded hormones and adderall meds. She understands the pre-x clause, especially for her shoulder. Otherwise, she never goes to the doctor, never gets sick. She is happy to pay $275 for the SECURE membership. She doesn''t have a gyn and will find one in network. Her Dr. is Gary Hoss who is in the PHCS network, but irrelevant since she doesn''t see him for wellness, sees him for meds. She might be able to get meds through CirrusMD. Completed enrollment in 1st call with me. Watched the video too.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-30 16:27:03', '2021-09-30 16:50:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076723003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005173116', 'Brian Johnson', NULL, 'Vicky called.  She had questions about CirrusMD (we got her signed-up &amp; Brian was registered using her e-mail when she tried signing herself up, so she used a diff one).  She''ll get the app on their phones.  Discussed RX help thru the concierge (no maint, just for curr illness).  Walgreens somehow gave her a Zion discount &amp; had her Zion # on file (told her that shouldn''t be part of her plan as far as I know.) QR  Codes.  Resent her the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail from 5/5/21.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-30 16:07:02', '2021-09-30 16:07:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076674028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076713079', 'Staci Wiley', NULL, '9-29-21 Staci enrolled with my assistance directly into the Big E Commerce Group through Dave Abajian. Dania and Elizabeth sent me the instructions to add her to their group. I didn''t have much of a conversation with her since was in Maine. But, made sure she knows she also has to sign up with DPC Appleton Clinics as well. She understood. Her membership is active and ready to go for Oct. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-30 15:26:45', '2021-09-30 15:31:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076674023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, '9-30-21 David was planning to get his colonoscopy done today or tomorrow but the person who was going to drive him now has covid and can''t help him. He had to cancel everything including his hotel room which he can''t get the money back. I encouraged him to complete the colonoscopy before we make a change since he will then be limited to a doctor network. He''s also already gotten part way through the process with Redirect making the payments for the different parts of the visit like the medication, etc. He had already fasted as well. Such a bummer. He doesn''t have any health issues at all. So moving away from Redirect shouldn''t be a downfall for him. He will just save a bunch of money on his monthly fee after he gets the colonoscopy done and we can move him to SECURE. Lives in Salida and was going to Cherry Creek in Denver for colonoscopy. He''s turning 60.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-30 15:20:43', '2021-09-30 15:20:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076674018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049054126', 'Santiago Mussi Tiscornia', NULL, '9-30-21 Maggie and Santi are ready to move forward but Maggie was too busy today and off tomorrow. We will connect tomorrow to complete the enrollment and cancellation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-30 15:15:04', '2021-09-30 15:15:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076674013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077322076', 'Colin McCarthy', NULL, '9-30-21 Colin is 32 and came to me via his dad Tom McCarthy. Colin left his job with Ernst and Young to start a partnership with his dad. He watched the video and had many great questions. He''s young, healthy, no meds, no tobacco. He saw a PT for knee and shoulder check with which they said his ligaments and joints were good. Told him to get a clean bill of health from them to be safe. No other issues! He''s a skier, mountaineer, etc. He also has background in Property and Casualty Ins. so he understands some of this well. He''d learned about Referenced Based Pricing and asked about that as well.  He can stay on Cobra for Oct. and we have an appt for next Friday to possibly enroll in SECURE $1000/$275. He''s risk averse and wants the best membership. I also encouraged him to fund his HSA for the tax benefits. Explained HMA but it felt complicated and he doesn''t really have a need for it since no other expenses.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-30 15:02:37', '2021-09-30 15:02:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076698008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271228', 'Barbara Henderson', NULL, 'Member emailed in and said that she keeps being billed by her lab for blood work and has gotten confirmation from RCI that this has been paid.  I told her to get check# and date of clearance from RCI in case she gets billed again to have as proof.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-30 14:58:01', '2021-09-30 14:58:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076688013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862096', 'Edward Christopher Wiencek', NULL, 'Edward called because he was unable to find a provider that offered a flu or shingles vaccine, I sent him a new list of pharmacies from the PHCS network he can call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-30 14:36:58', '2021-09-30 14:36:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076688008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073555182', 'Bradley Cook', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-30 14:14:26', '2021-09-30 14:14:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076677013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921360', 'Maria Lorences-Cruz', NULL, 'Maria called regarding a screening colonoscopy. I explained the self pay patient process and sent her fair pricing in her area from HCBB. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-30 13:06:15', '2021-09-30 13:06:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076698003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974121', 'Maria Crompton', NULL, 'Robin emailed me proof of Contractor Status for this member. I uploaded the the Document section of A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-30 12:55:10', '2021-09-30 12:55:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076674008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740100', 'Rossana Johnston', NULL, '9-30-21 Rossana wants to switch bc she says Sedera isn''t working for her. She had a shoulder issue which she paid her original $500 IUA bc it started before the switch to the $1000 IUA. She wanted Sedera bc open to alternative therapy. She did Needling and PRP therapy for her should and wound up paying $3000 on her own since Sedera wouldn''t pay for it. She thought SHE had to prove it''s benefit. She didn''t understand the doctor was supposed to do so.  She might want to get back into Kaiser. They are downsizing their life and might only earn $30K income but also may sell house. She will ask accountant how that applies to C4 APTC''s. She''s more interested in CARE+ since not sure she wants to do annual wellness visits. That part was a challenge for her in the past with the billing.  Both are self-employed and working towards retiring in 2022 slowly and may take on some accounts but not many. So, a lot is up in the air.  She''s a bit hesitant about her shoulder being 100% healed. She believes so, but you never know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-30 12:45:36', '2021-09-30 12:45:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076677008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862096', 'Edward Christopher Wiencek', NULL, 'Edward called regarding his shingles vaccine and his flu vaccine. He was wondering if he could have them done at a CVS, Walgreen''s, etc. I explained that in order for Planstin to cover these vaccines he would have to go to an in-network provider. He was not happy with this because that means that he has to make an appointment and go through all of the hulabaloo. But he did finally accept that and asked for a list of PHCS network docs. I emailed him the list and instructions on how to search the PHCS network. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-30 12:14:39', '2021-09-30 12:14:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076688003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712116', 'Dorcas Mella', NULL, 'I helped Dorcas with some script quotes and emailed the coupons to her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-30 12:12:51', '2021-09-30 12:12:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076677003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899178', 'Daniel Klein', NULL, 'Member''s wife, Carmen, called in regarding their plan. It appears she had no idea that they were switched from Sedera to Zion and was very confused about her cards. I informed her that I would request her new cards for her from Planstin. She did have a question for Zion but stated that she was too busy to talk to them and would call them another time. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-30 11:51:19', '2021-09-30 11:51:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076674003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521288', 'Robert Glowczewsky', NULL, '9-30-21 Rob and wife both had same exact physical for past 3 years but this year doctor coded 2 portions as diagnostic and are unwilling to change it to wellness. He''s being charged for them at $200 for him and $200 for Cindy. He talked with Planstin and they were super helpful and found the 2 line items to dispute. He will dispute it with the doctor''s office again bc it should fall within the wellness portion as it has in the past.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-30 11:41:38', '2021-09-30 11:41:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076623013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063804100', 'Roger Gaudreau', NULL, 'Amy wanted to know how to start using her preventative care benefits, I sent both preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-30 11:28:22', '2021-09-30 11:28:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076649003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064172023', 'Brandon Orellana', NULL, 'Received from Delta Shipping , member is no longer employed. KG', 'Accounting Office', 'Accounting Office', '2021-09-30 09:52:04', '2021-09-30 09:52:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076623008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191450', 'Terese McGroarty', NULL, 'Terese called to ask how her IUA works- I explained, she also wanted to know if Zion would help pay for a nutritionist for her husband who has just been diagnosed with diabetes.  I transferred her to Zion for that answer. I also sent her both preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-30 09:46:49', '2021-09-30 09:46:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076633023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075243068', 'Aaron Malusky', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-09-30 09:30:53', '2021-09-30 09:30:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076633018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132226', 'Maria Borden', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-09-30 09:27:19', '2021-09-30 09:27:19'),
