  ('zcrm_1579374000076633008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947205', 'Catherine Broad', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-09-30 09:19:03', '2021-09-30 09:19:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076633003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947115', 'Holli Sollenbarger', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call after start date of October 1, 2021. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-09-30 09:14:53', '2021-09-30 09:14:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076629003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002638010', 'Elyse Larkin', NULL, 'Elyse called to inquire about her plan. Since she is a Liberty member, I transferred her straight to Liberty. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-30 09:08:44', '2021-09-30 09:08:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076628003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'Member submitted Pmt update form I will update in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-30 09:07:44', '2021-09-30 09:07:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076623003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, 'James called and needed some help in understanding his preventative care benefits.  I ran a PHCS search for his primary doctor and told him to confirm with the provider that they are currently participating in the PHCS network. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-09-30 08:28:26', '2021-09-30 08:28:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076576096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672299', 'Melissa Lagassie', NULL, 'Still have not heard back from Heather Neideffer at RCI & LM yesterday on top of the e-mails.  Melissa called again tonight to complain no one has gotten with her.  She says Juan from Sedera called, but she was at work & could not talk.  Per Melissa, Metzli acknowledged receiving her receipts (which she cannot see on the portal) & asked the same question she asked when they setup the need, saying they cannot move fwd on pymt w/out the answer.  She''s very frustrated & says her co-worker has also had these type of issues.  I sent Metzli an e-mail (& cc''d Melissa) requesting she contact Melissa right away.  Melissa is very concerned about how long this is taking (she''s worried about being sent to collections & the impact on her credit).  Plus, her father had a stroke and I think that''s weighing on her as well.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-29 17:05:43', '2021-09-29 17:07:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076576091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061317', 'Patricia Barnett', NULL, 'Patricia called.  She''s trying to sort out a declination from Planstin &amp; realized it wasn''t a prev item.  (Urgent Care Visit for a COVID test.)  She also needed a 1095A form for the IRS (I transfered her to Zion to see if they can help with that).  We went over the layers/diff companies again to help her understand.  I suggested she get her QR Code setup online and requested a Zion Memb Card copy on Slack for her.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-29 16:40:08', '2021-09-29 16:40:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076533053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change form to add back daughter Kiara previously removed eff 11/1/2019.  I submitted to RCI and Sedera and added into Admin 123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-29 14:53:44', '2021-09-29 14:53:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076533048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530365', 'Steven Robinson', NULL, 'In the transition to Admin 123 billing old acct was pulled.  I changed back to personal acct.  Notified of this by Heather Braeutigam (employer).', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-29 14:15:32', '2021-09-29 14:15:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076533043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'Member called in to change Payment acct.  Sent the email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-29 14:10:28', '2021-09-29 14:10:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076553136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038124', 'Isabelle Laak', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Cari', 'Visit ID : 990 
Question : Hello,', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2021-09-29 14:10:02', '2021-09-29 14:10:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076521028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004997077', 'David Whiley', NULL, 'David called regarding using his CirrusMD services. I explained that this service is included in his membership and tried to send him an invite. Upon looking into his profile, it appears his physical address is correct in Admin123 but not in the CRM. I verified the correct address with David and made the necessary changes to the CRM. He also successfully received his CirrusMD invite. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-29 13:56:27', '2021-09-29 13:56:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076521023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, 'Steven called in very frustrated that he could not get his 2 oldest children going on CirrusMD today.  I requested Kiara and Kendra''s email addresses so that I could update Admin123 and get their CirrusMD invites sent out tomorrow after the file transfers over tonight. Upon looking into Stevens Admin123 profile, I realized that Kiara had been removed from his plan in 2019, but he did request the form to re-add her to his plan in 2021 but we never received the form via email. I informed Steven of this and resent the member plan change form to him via email. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-29 13:42:40', '2021-09-29 13:42:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076576008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076868001', 'Francisco Gonzalez', NULL, 'Replied to Unsubscribe.  Update CRM to reflect = Cold Lead, released.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2021-09-29 13:33:04', '2021-09-29 13:33:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076533038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076535957', 'Ryan Koehler', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-29 13:31:08', '2021-09-29 13:31:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076521018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297467', 'Sheila Sewell', NULL, 'Sheila called regarding a woman''s wellness visit. I explained to Sheila that with her plan it will be an out of pocket expense. I explained the cash pay process and Sheila seemed to understand it very well. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-29 13:27:32', '2021-09-29 13:27:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076533033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076535942', 'Luanne Werstler', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-29 13:24:11', '2021-09-29 13:24:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076533028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438095', 'Charlene Buffington', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will notify Sedera &amp; RCI and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-09-29 12:56:51', '2021-09-29 12:56:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076521013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438095', 'Charlene Buffington', NULL, 'Member called to cancel due to receiving benefits through her employer. Sent member the cancellation link email and advised her to fill out and submit before October 20th. -JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2021-09-29 11:59:39', '2021-09-29 11:59:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076577009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076535957', 'Ryan Koehler', NULL, '09.29.21:  Called Megan to enroll.  Not available - l/m to c/b.  Megan called back and I helped her enroll.  Emailed them to thank them for enrolling.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-09-29 11:26:04', '2021-09-29 15:09:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076576003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049054126', 'Santiago Mussi Tiscornia', NULL, '9-29-21 Maggie and Mussi want to join SECURE for the wellness and HSA ability and for the entire family. Maggie can get off her company''s health insurance at any time now. I explained they need to make sure to stay in network for wellness and they aren''t really tied to a doctor now except Pediatrician which is not in network. Open to finding new one.  Santi is self-employed so SECURE at $1000/$685. I can have them either waive $100 or give it to Santi for referring Maggie. They want the referral $100.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-09-29 11:23:15', '2021-09-29 11:23:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076525013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075870059', 'Vanessa Lavoie', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-09-29 11:22:21', '2021-09-29 11:22:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000076566033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, 'Steve called and said he is trying to add Kendra onto CirrusMD but it is saying they don''t recognize her and he thinks it is because he is using a different zip code that is his daughters zip code where she lives and it is not the same zip code as his which is what is on file. I gave him CirrusMD''s phone number to call because he said the support chat said it could take up to 24hrs and he can''t wait that long he needs to do it today. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-09-29 11:11:43', '2021-09-29 11:11:43');
